\par\par \b \uc2 Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ): The Sleeping Giant About to Awaken?\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 734 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 November 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Prediction\par \par \uc2 * Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The crypto market is currently abuzz with developments surrounding Bitcoin ETFs, a saga reaching a crucial 'pattern break' stage. The influx of amendments to \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  proposals by various fund issuers signals a growing optimism for approval. The \uc2 US Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 , historically resistant to allowing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/tag/bitcoin-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spot Bitcoin ETFs}}}\uc2 , is witnessing a shift in its interaction with fund groups. This change is evident in the recent amendments, including those from \uc2 21Shares\uc2  and Ark Invest, which re-filed their proposal for a \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 . These updates, providing more clarity on the proposed products, are considered positive signs of potential market evolution. The amendments even detail a sponsor fee of 0.80%, hinting at the costs for investors. With the largest crypto ETF in the US, the \uc2 ProShares Bitcoin Strategy ETF\uc2  (BITO), showing net inflows of $207 million in November, the stage seems set for heightened interest in spot Bitcoin funds, spurred by advancements in underlying technology and market dynamics.\par \par \uc2 In this arena, coins like Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) don't just rise and fall; they tell stories of human ingenuity, ambition, and the relentless pursuit of progress. It's not just another coin in the cryptoverse; it's a testament to the power of a scientific approach in a market often driven by sentiment. To truly grasp what the future holds for Cardano, one must dive deep into the insights provided by a compelling {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stealthex.io/blog/cardano-price-prediction/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price prediction}}}\uc2 . This prediction doesn't just skim the surface with general trends; it delves into the specifics, offering a narrative that's as insightful as it is grounded in technical analysis.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/is-cardano-ada-poised-for-unprecedented-growth-with-community-takeover"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price}}}\uc2  chart is a canvas, painting a story of struggle and resilience. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price movement oscillates with market moods, drawing patterns that technical analysts read like tea leaves. The immediate support/resistance levels paint a picture of a coin poised on the brink, ready to tip into new territories.\par \par \uc2 With a 10-day Simple Moving Average acting as a short-term litmus test and the 200-day Simple Moving Average providing a broader perspective, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  dance on the charts is a complex ballet of numbers and expectations. The technical indicators for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/3-cryptos-set-to-explode-after-ethereum-etf-approval-dogecoin-doge-cardano-ada-and-solana-sol"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  depict a scenario of gradual growth and strengthening momentum. The 10-day SMA at $0.3829 surpassing the 200-day SMA at $0.3756 indicates a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend in the short term. However, the Relative Strength Index (RSI) of 42.12 suggests that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is neither overbought nor oversold, providing a stable ground for potential growth or correction.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Prediction\par \par \uc2 Given the current upward trend and the crossing of the 10-day SMA over the 200-day SMA, a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario could see Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) continuing its upward trajectory, targeting first the 1-month high of $0.4086, and potentially testing the 52-week high of $0.4595, especially if it overcomes the 14-Day RSI at 80% mark at $0.4409.\par \par \uc2 In a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario, the initial support point to watch is $0.34772. A sustained \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend might push the price towards the next significant support at $0.3113. In a more pronounced downtrend, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could potentially reach the lower support at $0.2440, marking a considerable retreat from current levels. This scenario would represent a significant correction, reflecting broader market sentiment and specific challenges faced by the Cardano ecosystem. As a final point, a significant \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  turn could see it approaching the 52-week low of $0.2357, particularly if external market factors apply downward pressure.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 As the curtain falls on our exploration of potential futures of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), remember that the crypto market is a stage where drama unfolds in real-time. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  sits at the heart of this drama, a protagonist with an unpredictable path. For those looking to play a part in the Cardano journey, the opportunity to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stealthex.io/exchange-pairs/tether-trc20-to-cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 exchange USDT to \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  is just a click away \u8211\'20\'13 an action that could either join you with the ranks of the visionary or serve as a lesson in the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  of hope.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231121ejbl0012x\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 markets\par \b \uc2 Why is Solana (SOL) price down today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 608 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Solana's overbought correction has picked momentum after its mention in the SEC's latest lawsuit against Kraken. Is the \uc2 SOL\uc2  bull run finally over?\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is seeing a price correction after rallying nearly 300% in recent months.\par \par \uc2 Why is Solana price down today?\par \par \uc2 As of Nov. 21, \uc2 SOL\uc2 's price was trading for $55, down 20% when measured from its local high of $60.50 established just five days prior. The decline mirrors similar moves elsewhere in the crypto market, with top coins, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), also down 2.2% and 5.5% from their local highs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/4fc556be-435f-4fb2-a308-a0ddf3f73d5a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USD versus BTC/USD and ETH/USD year-to-date performance. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Let's discuss the major reasons behind Solana's slump.\par \par \uc2 SEC labels \uc2 SOL\uc2  a "security"\par \par \uc2 Solana's price decline coincides with the \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 's (SEC) latest {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-sues-kraken-for-securities-laws-violations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lawsuit}}}\uc2  against the Kraken crypto exchange. In its filings on Nov. 20, the watchdog accused Kraken of breaking securities laws.\par \par \uc2 While doing so, the SEC labeled a bunch of cryptocurrencies as securities, including Solana. \uc2 SOL\uc2 's price has declined 10.25% since.\par \par \uc2 Other tokens named in the SEC lawsuit fell similarly, including {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , whose price decreased 5.5% after the Kraken news.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/09fffbc8-5e25-46e3-9fb8-83428fb3489f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 4H price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The SEC's potential designation of \uc2 SOL\uc2  as a security may affect its availability on U.S. cryptocurrency exchanges, similar to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-falls-24-in-24-hours-as-exchanges-begin-delisting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 impact}}}\uc2  seen with XRP.\par \par \uc2 Overbought correction\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  today is part of an overbought correction that began after its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-3-ways-the-relative-strength-index-rsi-can-be-used-as-a-sell-signal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 daily relative strength index (RSI)}}}\uc2  jumped above 70.\par \par \uc2 In addition, Solana's correction came after a period of growing divergence between its rising prices and falling RSI, indicating \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  exhaustion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/c25f7bca-ef30-4089-b877-4269b1ea0530.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USD daily price chart ft. \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Over $6.5 million worth of longs liquidated\par \par \uc2 Solana's decline further coincides with $6.5 million worth of long liquidations across its derivative markets since Nov. 20. In comparison, nearly $2 million worth of shorts were liquidated.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/32efb6c6-b371-4426-9b08-2ae10aa35ff0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2  total liquidations daily chart. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 When a long position is liquidated, the trader is compelled to sell, leading to increased selling pressure.\par \par \uc2 Is the Solana bull market over?\par \par \uc2 Price chart technicals suggest that Solana's price correction has begun near a key Fibonacci retracement level, which limits its upside bias in the coming months.\par \par \uc2 The 0.236 Fib line is near $67.40, which has acted as resistance since summer 2022.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/aea30476-f312-4c44-902b-a966dea8233e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USD weekly price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The combination of these \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  factors raises \uc2 SOL\uc2 's potential of extending its correction in the coming days or weeks. That begins with a decline toward $47.50, a flipped-support level, followed by an extended selloff toward $30, if the former level breaks.\par \par \uc2 The $30-level, down 50% from current prices, coincides with Solana's 50-week exponential moving average (50-week EMA; the red wave) and the upper trendline of its previous ascending channel pattern.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-community-responds-kraken-lawsuit-deaton-slams-dishonorable-gensler"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto community responds to Kraken lawsuit, Deaton slams \u8216\'20\'18dishonorable\u8217\'20\'19 Gensler}}}\par \par \uc2 Conversely, \uc2 SOL\uc2 's price could rebound ahead or after testing $47.50 to its year-to-date high near $68.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/a909ccaf-9947-4a44-a64d-c9bfd8354210.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231121ejbl0008g\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 sec kraken\par \b \uc2 SEC sues Kraken alleging it\u8217\'20\'19s an unregistered exchange, mixes user funds\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Tom Mitchelhill \par \uc2 576 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The SEC has sued Kraken, alleging it violated multiple U.S. securities laws, including operating an unregistered exchange.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) has sued Kraken, alleging it commingled customer funds and failed to register with the regulator as a securities exchange, broker, dealer and clearing agency.\par \par \uc2 In a Nov. 20 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.courtlistener.com/docket/68023155/1/securities-and-exchange-commission-v-payward-inc/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 complaint}}}\uc2  filed in a San Francisco federal court, the SEC claimed that Kraken has been operating a platform that unlawfully facilitated the buying and selling of cryptocurrencies since 2018.\par \par \uc2 A Kraken spokesperson told Cointelegraph it disagrees with the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s complaint and plans to defend itself in court.\par \par \uc2 The lawsuit marks the latest push from the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/top-people-in-crypto-and-blockchain-2023/gary-gensler"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Gary Gensler}}}\uc2  -led agency to bring crypto under its purview, claiming that crypto assets are securities contracts under U.S. law.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWithout registering with the SEC in any capacity, Kraken has simultaneously acted as a broker, dealer, exchange, and clearing agency with respect to these crypto asset securities.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Additionally, the SEC alleged Kraken\u8217\'20\'19s business practices and \u8220\'20\'1Cdeficient\u8221\'20\'1D internal controls saw the exchange commingle up to $33 billion worth of customer assets with its own. The SEC said this resulted in a \u8220\'20\'1Csignificant risk of loss\u8221\'20\'1D for its clients.\par \par \uc2 The complaint claimed Kraken paid for operational expenses directly from accounts containing customer assets, citing the exchange\u8217\'20\'19s independent auditor.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe allege that Kraken made a business decision to reap hundreds of millions of dollars from investors rather than coming into compliance with the securities laws,\u8221\'20\'1D SEC enforcement division director \uc2 Gurbir Grewal\uc2  said in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sec.gov/news/press-release/2023-237"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CThat decision resulted in a business model rife with conflicts of interest that placed investors\u8217\'20\'19 funds at risk.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Kraken pushed back against the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s accusations with a spokesperson saying the exchange never listed unregistered securities.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe disagree with the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s complaint against Kraken, stand firm in our view that we do not list securities and plan to vigorously defend our position.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt is disappointing to see the SEC continue down its path of \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  by enforcement, which harms American consumers, stunts innovation and damages U.S. competitiveness globally,\u8221\'20\'1D the spokesperson said.\par \par \uc2 In a follow-up Nov. 20 blog {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blog.kraken.com/news/kraken-continues-to-fight-for-its-mission-and-crypto-innovation-in-the-united-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post}}}\uc2 , Kraken said the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s commingling accusations were \u8220\'20\'1Cno more than Kraken spending fees it has already earned,\u8221\'20\'1D and the regulator doesn\u8217\'20\'19t allege any user funds are missing.\par \par \uc2 In the complaint, the SEC listed 16 cryptocurrencies it considered securities, including Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Algorand ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/algorand-algo-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ALGO}}}\uc2  ), Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) and Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/ad87dfea-cabe-48cf-8432-21fb11fa76e9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The SEC\u8217\'20\'19s complaint against Kraken listed 16 cryptocurrencies as securities. Source: CourtListener\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kraken-share-data-42-000-users-irs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kraken will share data of 42,000 users with IRS}}}\par \par \uc2 The SEC\u8217\'20\'19s complaint alleges Kraken violated the registration provisions of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934. It wants Kraken to pay penalties and injunctive relief and requests the exchange return its \u8220\'20\'1Cill-gotten gains.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The accusations that Kraken operated as an unregistered broker for crypto assets echo those made in respective {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-lawsuit-binance-coinbase-crypto-industry-comments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lawsuits against Coinbase and Binance}}}\uc2  in June.\par \par \uc2 On Feb. 9, Kraken {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kraken-reaches-30m-settlement-with-sec-over-staking"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reached a $30 million settlement}}}\uc2  with the regulator, where it agreed to cease offering crypto staking products and services to U.S. customers.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/breaking-into-liberland-dodging-guards-decoys-and-diplomats/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Breaking into Liberland \u8212\'20\'14 Dodging guards with inner-tubes, decoys and diplomats}}}\par \par \uc2 Update (Nov. 21, 12:45 am UTC): This article has been updated to include comments from a Kraken spokesperson.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/2c073549-6ce1-49cd-a3f0-22c394bd533b.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL00