 with its own. The SEC said this resulted in a \u8220\'20\'1Csignificant risk of loss\u8221\'20\'1D for its clients.\par \par \uc2 The complaint claimed Kraken paid for operational expenses directly from accounts containing customer assets, citing the exchange\u8217\'20\'19s independent auditor.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe allege that Kraken made a business decision to reap hundreds of millions of dollars from investors rather than coming into compliance with the securities laws,\u8221\'20\'1D SEC enforcement division director \uc2 Gurbir Grewal\uc2  said in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sec.gov/news/press-release/2023-237"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CThat decision resulted in a business model rife with conflicts of interest that placed investors\u8217\'20\'19 funds at risk.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Kraken pushed back against the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s accusations with a spokesperson saying the exchange never listed unregistered securities.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe disagree with the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s complaint against Kraken, stand firm in our view that we do not list securities and plan to vigorously defend our position.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt is disappointing to see the SEC continue down its path of \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  by enforcement, which harms American consumers, stunts innovation and damages U.S. competitiveness globally,\u8221\'20\'1D the spokesperson said.\par \par \uc2 In a follow-up Nov. 20 blog {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blog.kraken.com/news/kraken-continues-to-fight-for-its-mission-and-crypto-innovation-in-the-united-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post}}}\uc2 , Kraken said the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s commingling accusations were \u8220\'20\'1Cno more than Kraken spending fees it has already earned,\u8221\'20\'1D and the regulator doesn\u8217\'20\'19t allege any user funds are missing.\par \par \uc2 In the complaint, the SEC listed 16 cryptocurrencies it considered securities, including Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Algorand ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/algorand-algo-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ALGO}}}\uc2  ), Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) and Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/ad87dfea-cabe-48cf-8432-21fb11fa76e9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SEC's complaint against Kraken listed 16 cryptocurrencies as securities. Source: CourtListener\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kraken-share-data-42-000-users-irs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kraken will share data of 42,000 users with IRS}}}\par \par \uc2 The SEC\u8217\'20\'19s complaint alleges Kraken violated the registration provisions of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934. It\u8217\'20\'19s seeking Kraken pay penalties, injunctive relief and requests the exchange return its \u8220\'20\'1Cill-gotten gains.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The accusations that Kraken operated as an unregistered broker for crypto assets echo those made in respective {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-lawsuit-binance-coinbase-crypto-industry-comments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lawsuits against Coinbase and Binance}}}\uc2  in June.\par \par \uc2 On Feb. 9, Kraken {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kraken-reaches-30m-settlement-with-sec-over-staking"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reached a $30 million settlement}}}\uc2  with the regulator, where it agreed to cease offering crypto-staking products and services to U.S. customers.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/breaking-into-liberland-dodging-guards-decoys-and-diplomats/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Breaking into Liberland \u8212\'20\'14 Dodging guards with inner-tubes, decoys and diplomats}}}\par \par \uc2 Update (Nov. 21, 12:45 am UTC): This article has been updated to include comments from a Kraken spokesperson.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/2c073549-6ce1-49cd-a3f0-22c394bd533b.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231121ejbk00007\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/20: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,702 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar is losing strength, and Bitcoin and select altcoins look ready to lift off.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) rose 2.24% last week, its third consecutive weekly gain. In comparison, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) managed a minuscule gain of 0.8%, indicating consolidation below $38,000. The prospects for risky assets remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the U.S. Dollar Index has started to turn down.\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency investors have not parted with their Bitcoin holdings, even after the 125% rally in 2023, indicating their long-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view. Reflexivity co-founder William Clemente posted a chart sourced from Glassnode to X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ), which showed that 70% of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/70-btc-dormant-year-5-things-know-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin in circulation has not been sold}}}\uc2  or transferred in the past year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/e5272efb-1327-4adc-bae7-dbf184ca3d11.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Investors have also increased exposure to global cryptocurrency exchange-traded products (ETPs) in 2023, according to a report by the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  platform Fineqia, which was seen by Cointelegraph. \uc2 Fineqia\uc2  reported that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-etp-surge-91-outpace-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto ETP assets under management ballooned by 91%}}}\uc2  from Jan. 1 to Oct. 31, 2023.\par \par \uc2 If Bitcoin fails to break above its resistance, will it start a deeper correction? Will altcoins also turn lower, or could they buck the trend? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index surged above the downtrend line on Nov. 14, signaling an end of the corrective phase.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/95ef1f0a-cf4b-484f-b372-90fb9eb117b2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the overbought territory, indicating that bulls are in command. There is a minor resistance in the 4,512\u8211\'20\'134,541 zone, which may result in a pullback.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) (4,395) is likely to act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that the trend has turned positive. That will enhance the prospects of a rally to 4,650.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the 20-day EMA gives way, the index may drop to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) (4,340). Sellers will have to yank the price below this support to indicate strength.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index turned down from the 20-day EMA (105) on Nov. 14 and plunged below the descending channel pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/687e081c-56c6-4396-b2b2-28a0b1b99d3e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 That started a correction, which has reached the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of 103.46. The 20-day EMA has started to turn down, and the RSI is near the oversold zone, indicating that bears are in command.\par \par \uc2 If the 103.46 level cracks, the decline may extend to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of 102.55. Buyers are likely to defend the zone between 103.46 and 102.55 with vigor. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 After finding support at the 20-day EMA ($35,925), Bitcoin has been gradually moving up toward the vital resistance at $38,000. The bears have guarded this level twice in the past; hence, they will try to do the same once again.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/693f3664-5382-4410-88e9-f877a7d9379a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it may trigger the stops of several short-term traders. That may start a correction in the BTC/USDT pair, which could reach $34,000 and subsequently $32,400.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if bulls pierce the $38,000 resistance, it will indicate the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The pair may travel to $40,000, which is again likely to behave as a significant resistance. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been forming a large ascending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close above $2,200. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $3,400.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/97a2cc5e-5471-4e51-bdcc-a1566183b225.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are buying the dips to the 20-day EMA ($1,949), indicating that lower levels continue to attract buyers. If the price sustains above the psychological level of $2,000, the ETH/USDT pair could attempt a rally to $2,090 and then to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bears are attempting a comeback in the near term. The pair may then drop to the 50-day SMA ($1,779).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have successfully held BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($242) for the past few days, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/01968042-d61b-4c6b-b835-9f2d514ba7e7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will next try to push the price above $258 and retest the formidable resistance at $265. A break and close above this level will complete a rounding bottom pattern. The BNB/USDT pair may then ascend to $305, as there is no major resistance level in between.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair could drop to the immediate support at $235. This level is likely to act as solid support, but if it breaks down, the correction could stretch to the 50-day SMA ($227).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) fell below the 20-day EMA ($0.62) on Nov. 16, but the bears have failed to pull the price to the next support at $0.56. This suggests that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/013b279c-934a-4cf8-a738-c897778b6ea2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair is stuck between $0.74 and $0.56. If buyers push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that a relief rally has begun. The pair may then climb to $0.67 and later to $0.74. The price action inside the range is likely to remain random and volatile.\par \par \uc2 A break above $0.74 or a collapse below $0.56 could start a trending move. If the price sustains above $0.74, the pair may jump to $0.85. On the other hand, a slump below $0.56 could sink the pair to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers are struggling to sustain Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above $59, indicating that the bears remain active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/448438fe-5102-4618-925c-de04515a294b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not ceded much ground to the bears. This suggests that the buyers are not dumping their positions in a hurry, as they anticipate the uptrend to continue. On the upside, a break and close above $68.20 could clear the path for a rally to $77.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and skids below the 20-day EMA ($51.39). The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could then fall to the crucial support at $48.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cathie-wood-ark-spot-bitcoin-etf-amend"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ARK, 21Shares update spot Bitcoin ETF application as next SEC deadline looms}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the $0.38 level for the past several days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/82a205f2-cb1b-49f5-8cb1-3ed864c3e7d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the overbought zone indicate that the bulls are at an advantage. If the price stays above the $0.38\u8211\'20\'13$0.40 resistance zone, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the upside, they will have to quickly drag the price back below the 20-day EMA ($0.35). If that happens, several short-term bulls may book profits, and the pair could slide to the 50-day SMA ($0.30).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually moving higher in the past few days. The bulls drove the price above $0.08 on Nov. 17 but could not sustain the breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/7da8c5b7-ced6-4b97-9db6-46c0939f03d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down on Nov. 18 and dipped to $0.08. A positive sign is that the bulls are trying to defend the $0.08 level. If they manage to do that, it will signal that $0.08 has flipped into support. That will improve the prospects of the resumption of the uptrend. The DOGE/USDT pair could then reach $0.10.\par \par \uc2 The RSI is showing signs of forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, indicating that the momentum may be slowing down. Sellers will have to pull and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.07) to seize control.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Sellers tried to sink Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s LINK ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($13.64) on Nov. 17 and 18, but the long tail on the candlestick indicates solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/2f54ac89-0cfd-4229-ac43-b0ffcebeb236.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is a minor resistance at $15.40, but if this level is scaled, the LINK/USDT pair could retest the local high at $16.60. Sellers are again expected to mount a vigorous defense at this level, but if the bulls do not give up much ground, it will increase the likelihood of a break above $16.60.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from $15.40, it will suggest that bears are selling at higher levels. The trend will shift in favor of the bears if they can sink and sustain the price below the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $12.83.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/ece49420-f60f-4e34-b925-d2750f103089.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231120ejbk000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
