\par\par \b \uc2 Are Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) Pre-Christmas Gains Against Bitcoin a Hint of Higher Rallies?\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 1,665 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 November 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * Embark on a Journey of Crypto Excellence with ScapesMania\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Hoskinson's Call to Altman Sparks Investor Curiosity\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Forecast\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC): A Strong Case for \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Market Sentiment?\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) Price Forecast\par \par \uc2 * Bottomline\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market is buzzing with activity this Monday, November 20, as prices take an optimistic turn upwards. Investors are back in the game, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/will-bitcoin-btc-and-ethereum-eth-ride-the-institutional-wave-to-new-peaks-by-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 driven by a hopeful outlook}}}\uc2  and the excitement around a possible Bitcoin Spot \b \highlight22\uc2 ETF approval\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But the landscape isn't all smooth sailing. Just last week, the market took a step back, as traders hit the brakes amidst growing uncertainty. This cautious mood has been further stirred by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/sec-delays-decision-on-hashdex-and-grayscale-etf-applications"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC dragging its feet on decisions regarding ETFs}}}\uc2 , including {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/blackrock-officially-files-for-spot-ethereum-etf-with-the-sec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BlackRock}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/fidelity-follows-blackrocks-lead-files-for-spot-ethereum-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fidelity}}}\uc2  's recent Ethereum ETF proposal. All eyes are now on the upcoming FOMC minutes, expected to drop some hints about where the economy stands and what moves the Fed might make next.\par \par \uc2 Focusing on individual cryptocurrencies, Bitcoin has shown resilience by climbing back above the $37,000 mark, bolstered by a 20% increase in trading volume. Ethereum isn't far behind, crossing the $2,000 threshold again. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) are also making moves, with \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  seeing a 3% rise even as its trading volume dips 10%, and LTC inching up more than 1%, albeit with a 46% drop in trading activity. The market's mood, gauged by the fear and greed index, is leaning heavily towards greed at a score of 72, hinting at the high stakes and high hopes in the crypto world.\par \par \uc2 Amidst these giants, there's a newcomer catching the eye: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://scapesmania.io/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mmedia&utm_campaign=ADALTC"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ScapesMania}}}\uc2  (MANIA). This fresh face in the crypto scene is turning heads with its unique approach. It's not just another coin; this presale project is building a whole gaming ecosystem, powered by DAO governance. With a team that's not afraid to show their faces and a strategy that promises to reward its community generously, MANIA could very well be the next big hit in the crypto universe.\par \par \uc2 Embark on a Journey of Crypto Excellence with ScapesMania\par \par \uc2 While some are facing an uncertain future, the trajectory of a presale project is far easier to predict. ScapesMania (MANIA) is a well-balanced, meticulo