evels are set at $1047 and $1390, indicating strong buyer interest at these points. Conversely, resistance levels at $2077 and $2421 mark potential upper limits in the current market scenario.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) price may see upward mobility, potentially testing the higher resistance level of $2421, especially if institutional acceptance continues.\par \par \uc2 Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ): Balancing Growth and \b \highlight22\uc2 Regulation\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 The dramatic increase in Solana (SOL) value commenced around July 10, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/07/solana-and-ripple-xrp-surge-over-50-while-tradecurve-eyes-50x-presale-pump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 coinciding with the SEC's crackdown}}}\uc2  on various cryptocurrency exchanges for alleged security law violations. During this period, Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), along with \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , MATIC, and others, were classified as unregistered securities. This stance was echoed by the Cardano and Polygon ecosystems, though the SEC maintained its position.\par \par \uc2 Currently, Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) price fluctuates between $26.75 and $44.35. The 10-day moving average stands at an impressive $54.8, while the 100-day moving average is $27.23, indicating a robust upward trend. The absence of a lower support level and the establishment of upper resistance levels at $50.27 and $67.87 suggest strong market optimism towards Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ).\par \par \uc2 In projecting Solana (SOL) future, its rapid ascent in the wake of regulatory challenges and its growing adoption as a Layer 1 solution bode well for its price. However, ongoing regulatory uncertainties and market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  could temper these gains, making a cautious approach prudent in predicting Solana (SOL) price future.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP): Navigating Through Turbulence\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) recently experienced a 5.66% slide, influenced by a broad-based crypto market sell-off and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/the-fair-price-of-ripple-xrp-should-be-much-higher-researchers-said"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ongoing legal challenges}}}\uc2  with the SEC. \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) defense against the SEC's characterization of \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) and the broader market trends have created a complex environment for \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) market performance.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) price has been fluctuating within the $0.509 to $0.655 range. The 10-day and 100-day moving averages at $0.651 and $0.545, respectively, along with support levels at $0.272 and $0.418 as well as resistance levels at $0.710 and $0.857, paint a picture of a cryptocurrency grappling with market uncertainties and regulatory challenges.\par \par \uc2 The future price trajectory for \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) is likely to be heavily influenced by the outcome of its legal battle with the SEC and broader market sentiments. Positive developments in the legal case or broader market trends could see \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) testing higher resistance levels. However, continued regulatory challenges and market instability might see \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) price hovering around or even testing lower support levels.\par \par \uc2 VeChain (VET): Strategic Moves in a Competitive Arena\par \par \uc2 VeChain (VET) has recently partnered with \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  to launch an educational program, aiming to attract up to 1 million users. This strategic initiative \u8211\'20\'13 alongside the notable VORJ upgrade and acquisition of a payments patent \u8211\'20\'13 highlights VeChain (VET) commitment towards expanding its user base, concurrently enhancing its technology remains another primary objective.\par \par \uc2 VeChain (VET) price has been hovering between $0.0165 and $0.0203, with a 10-day moving average of $0.0217 and a 100-day moving average of $0.0175. The support levels at $0.0106 and $0.0143, as well as