\par\par \b \uc2 Is Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) Poised for Unprecedented Growth with Community Takeover?\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 1,204 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 November 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 In a world where digital currencies are revolutionizing finance, the crypto market is energized with an electrifying energy that is hard to ignore. \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 's foray into a spot Ethereum ETF stokes the embers of a market primed for innovation and investor enthusiasm.\par \par \uc2 CoinGlass data shows Bitcoin's funding rate at a notably high 10.68% on November 17, 2023, indicating a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment among traders willing to pay a premium for long positions.\par \par \uc2 The crypto winter seems to be thawing, paving the way for pioneering currencies like Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) to emerge from the shadows and command the stage. For those eager to catch the pulse of this market transformation, a fascinating narrative on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stealthex.io/blog/cardano-price-prediction/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) price prediction}}}\uc2  unfolds here, teasing the intellect with forecasts ripe for the savvy investor\u8217\'20\'19s perusal.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Fundamental Analysis: Entering the Voltaire Era with Market-Wide Bullishness\par \par \uc2 As the sun sets on the era of centralized authority in cryptocurrency, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/tag/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  approaches the final stage of its development roadmap, known as Voltaire. In a recent live stream, \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2  illuminated the path ahead with the announcement of Midnight, a new sidechain that enhances Cardano's privacy capabilities.\par \par \uc2 This development underscores Cardano's commitment to creating a more robust, versatile, and user-centric ecosystem. As Cardano forges ahead with Voltaire, it moves towards a fully decentralized governance model, with all repositories transitioning to a community-run project dubbed Intersect. This pivotal shift is not just a technical update but a reinvention of Cardano's governance, positioning the network at the forefront of decentralized blockchain operations.\par \par \uc2 In this new era, Cardano's network will be complemented by "partnerchains," specialized blockchains with unique tokenomics and consensus mechanisms that offer specialized services and features. Among them, Midnight stands out as a privacy-centric chain that enables confidential smart contracts and transactions, providing a stark contrast to the public ledger of Cardano. Pool operators and the community have expressed \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiments over these announcements, particularly due to the potential for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  stakers to earn fees from these partnerchains. They could significantly broaden the utility and appeal of the Cardano ecosystem, setting a new standard for blockchain functionality and governance.\par \par \uc2 The CoinGlass Funding Rate Heatmap shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/is-cardano-ada-severely-undervalued-analysts-weigh-in"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  (Cardano)}}}\uc2  had a funding rate of 10.75% on November 17, 2023, which is comparable to Bitcoin's high funding rate of 10.68% at the same time.\par \par \uc2 Source: CoinGlass Funding Rate Heatmap\par \par \uc2 This suggests a similar \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment among traders for both cryptocurrencies, as they are both commanding high premiums for long positions.