ph.com/news/48k-bitcoin-price-target-filbfilb-interview"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drawdown could come before the rally}}}\uc2  leading into Bitcoin halving in April 2024. Filbfilb believes Bitcoin could pick up pace after that and reach $46,000 to $48,000 by the halving.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and the select altcoins resume their uptrend, or will higher levels attract solid selling by the bears?\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin reentered the ascending channel pattern on Nov. 13, which may have trapped the aggressive bulls. That started a liquidation, which pulled the price to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line on Nov. 14.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/a6ec9445-4968-4d50-91e9-5ec44251fea1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The strong bounce off the support line suggests that lower levels continue to attract buyers. The bulls will try to push the BTC/USDT pair above the resistance line but may encounter strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below the channel, it will suggest that traders are rushing to the exit. That may yank the price to the $32,400\u8211\'20\'13$31,000 support zone. The bulls are expected to aggressively buy at lower levels. The bulls will be back in control after they shove the price above $38,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned up on Nov. 13, but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests selling at higher levels. The selling continued on Nov. 14, and the price slipped below the psychological level of $2,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/5b97eb63-2226-4b69-90e1-38ce8f9bacd1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to flip the $2,000 level into support is a negative sign, but a solace is that buyers held the 20-day exponential moving average ($1,921) on the downside. If buyers retain the price above $2,000, it will indicate vigorous buying at lower levels. The ETH/USDT pair may then retest the overhead zone between $2,137 and $2,200.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA), it will signal that the bears are back in the game. That could clear the path for a decline to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($1,745).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($239) on Nov. 14 but snapped back from the solid support at $235. This suggests robust buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/cff5b2f6-8669-42b4-9031-dccc53ec8ed5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory suggest that bulls have a slight edge. Buyers will try to push the price to the $258\u8211\'20\'13$265 overhead resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Sellers are expected to protect this zone with vigor. If the price turns down sharply from $265, the BNB/USDT pair may drop to $235 and oscillate between these two levels for some time.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) pierced the $0.74 resistance on Nov. 13 and then turned down quickly, indicating aggressive selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/c57ebfdf-9ffd-4487-b1f0-1307c25004c8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling continued on Nov. 14, pulling the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.62). This level is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. If the price maintains below the 20-day EMA, the next stop could be the 50-day SMA ($0.56). Such a move suggests that the XRP/USDT pair may swing between $0.56 and $0.74 for a while.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat after they propel the price above the overhead resistance at $0.74. The pair may then climb to $0.85 and later to $1.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to start a correction in Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) on Nov. 13, but the bulls stepped in and arrested the decline at $51 on Nov. 14.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/2d57dade-e9c1-420a-a761-95f22adb4470.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buying continued on Nov. 15, and the bulls are trying to overcome the barrier at $64. If they manage to do that, the SOL/USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend. The pair may then rally to $77 and subsequently to $95.\par \par \uc2 The risk to the upside move is that the RSI has been in overbought territory for the past several days. That suggests the rally is overextended in the near term and may witness a correction or consolidation.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) remained above $0.38 from Nov. 10 to 12, but the bulls could not build upon the next leg of the uptrend. That may have tempted short-term traders to book profits, pulling the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.34) on Nov. 14.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/3c4ac2f0-64ec-4a52-9ca2-b631ff156a8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair rebounded sharply off the 20-day EMA, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. Buyers will try to propel the price to the $0.38\u8211\'20\'13$0.39 resistance zone. If bulls overcome this obstacle, the pair could rally to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down and plunges below the 20-day EMA, it will open the doors for a possible decline to $0.32. Such a move will indicate that the pair may consolidate between $0.24 and $0.38 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) failed to sustain above $0.08 on Nov. 11 and 12, resulting in a correction to the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on Nov. 14.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/f5a89be5-4982-4da1-810d-0d118b3e627b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the 20-day EMA, but the long wick on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels. The bulls will again try to push the price to $0.08, where they are likely to encounter strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.08 and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the DOGE/USDT pair may stay range-bound for a while. Contrarily, a break and close above $0.08 will signal the start of the next leg of the up-move to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-37k-resistance-failed-to-break"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3 reasons why Bitcoin price failed to break $37K}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) witnessed huge \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Nov. 13 and 14, as seen from the large intraday ranges. This indicates an intense battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/27e1f42a-6d7a-4851-8cd4-e41aa1e1ce81.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to sustain the price below the $0.89 level suggests that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support. The bulls may again face stiff opposition from the bears at the psychological level of $1.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level but does not slip below $0.89, it will increase the likelihood of the resumption of the uptrend. Above $1, the MATIC/USDT pair could reach $1.20. On the contrary, a fall below $0.84 could start a correction to the 20-day EMA ($0.77).\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s LINK ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) is correcting in a strong uptrend. The price dipped to the 20-day EMA ($13.16) on Nov. 14, which is likely to act as a formidable support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/f006be6a-51b7-48a5-8f67-7f6791f618ac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the bounce off the 20-day EMA sustains, the bulls will try to push the price to the local high of $16.60. This is a critical level to watch out for because a break above it will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The LINK/USDT pair could next rally to $20.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $16.60, it will suggest that the bears remain active at higher levels. That could keep the pair stuck between $16.60 and the 20-day EMA for some time.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) found support at $2.31 on Nov. 12, but the rebound was short-lived. The price turned down and plummeted below $2.31 on Nov. 14.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/90b900b7-d92b-45da-8c3d-ca87fb2f06e9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to defend the 20-day EMA ($2.31) suggests that the positive momentum is weakening. Both moving averages have flattened out, and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating a range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, if the 50-day SMA cracks, the TON/USDT pair could fall to $2 and thereafter to $1.89. Buyers are expected to guard this level with vigor. The bulls will have to propel the price above $2.77 to indicate the start of the next leg of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/c2b30e27-ce7c-47ad-96ec-ac47fe110634.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231115ejbf000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\p