\par\par \b \uc2 Are \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) and Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) Gearing Up for the Christmas Bull Run Amidst Crypto Dip?\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 1,395 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 November 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * ScapesMania: Invest Smart, Grow Big\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP): ETF Fiasco and Whale Activity Spike\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Next Price Action\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Riding the Wave of Strategic Partnerships\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Next Price Action\par \par \uc2 * Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The crypto market has been on a wild ride lately, with the latest twist coming from October's Consumer Price Index (CPI) release. This bit of economic news sent the market into a bit of a tailspin, dropping by 1.5%. Even Bitcoin, usually the steady hand in the crypto world, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/as-economic-currents-shift-bitcoin-btc-and-ethereum-eth-locked-in-a-close-battle"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 felt the heat}}}\uc2 , slipping 4% from its comfy $37,000 perch.\par \par \uc2 In the midst of this seesaw market, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) had its own drama, soaring on some false news only to come crashing back down, ending over 6% lower. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), on the other hand, showed some grit. After a brief stumble, it managed to claw back up, posting a 2.5% gain in 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 But here's where it gets interesting: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://scapesmania.io/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mmedia&utm_campaign=XRPADA"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ScapesMania}}}\uc2  (MANIA). In a market that's as hard to predict as tomorrow's weather, MANIA is turning heads. It's not just another crypto project; it's a gaming ecosystem with its own rules, backed by a DAO that lets its community call the shots. It's a mix of innovation, solid game plan, and a knack for keeping its community happy that makes ScapesMania (MANIA) stand out, promising more stability and potential in a market that's anything but.\par \par \uc2 ScapesMania: Invest Smart, Grow Big\par \par \uc2 While some are facing an uncertain future, the trajectory of a presale project is far easier to predict. ScapesMania (MANIA) is a well-balanced, meticulously designed project that acts as a gaming ecosystem. Through DAO governance, backers will be able to influence and benefit from a multi-billion-dollar industry. A wide range of features paired with the best technology, a professional team, and a long-term, highly ambitious vision can make ScapesMania the next big thing in crypto. Presale discounts and stage bonuses only add to the project's appeal.\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live Now - Join Now for a Chance to Benefit with MANIA\par \par \uc2 Backed by an award-winning developer crew, ScapesMania stands for transparency: every member\u8217\'20\'19s social media profile is public. The project can achieve this not just by bringing big innovation to the game, but by putting its community front and center. Driving customer engagement and making sure that everyone benefits through great tokenomics and generous rewards is what makes ScapesMania the project with a bright future ahead.\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live, Learn More About Major Benefits\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP): ETF Fiasco and Whale Activity Spike\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) has been on a rollercoaster ride recently, highlighted by its dramatic response to the unfounded news of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/ripple-xrp-and-polygon-matic-expect-significant-turnaround-ahead-of-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Blackrock's supposed XRP ETF filing}}}\uc2 . This misinformation propelled the asset to a four-month high, only to see it plummet back to reality, dropping to $0.61 before regaining some ground to stabilize above $0.63.\par \par \uc2 Adding to the intrigue, there's been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/whale_alert/status/1723380615867687063?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1723380615867687063%7Ctwgr%5Ed9d0b80166c815457c6380ab13321aee30cbc832%7Ctwcon%5Es1_c10&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fu.today%2Falmost-900-million-xrp-moved-by-unknown-wallets-as-xrp-price-gears-up-for-new-rise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a notable increase in activity}}}\uc2  among XRP whales. Over a single weekend, almost 900 million XRP tokens were shuffled between anonymous addresses, totaling a staggering $569 million. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/whale_alert/status/1723740751572390382?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1723740751572390382%7Ctwgr%5Ed9d0b80166c815457c6380ab13321aee30cbc832%7Ctwcon%5Es1_c10&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fu.today%2Falmost-900-million-xrp-moved-by-unknown-wallets-as-xrp-price-gears-up-for-new-rise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 This massive movement of funds}}}\uc2  by major holders indicates significant interest and potential strategic positioning within the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 Technically, XRP is currently trading between its first support and resistance points, marked at $0.5945 and $0.6685 respectively. This narrow band is critical for determining the short-term trajectory of \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP). The coin has recently crossed its 9-day moving average at $0.6085 and is hovering above the $0.6161 mark, where it crosses the 18-day moving average. These indicators suggest a potential uptick in momentum.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/3rzIBxxK/?symbol=BITSTAMP%3AXRPUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the MACD indicators are showing mixed signals, with the 3-10-16 day MACD stalling at both the $0.7644 resistance and $0.6325 support levels. This could imply a phase of consolidation or indecision in the market.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Next Price Action\par \par \uc2 In a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario, if XRP maintains its momentum and breaks through the first resistance at $0.6685, it could target the second resistance level at $0.7099. A sustained move above this point may see it approach the 1-month and 13-week highs near $0.7479.\par \par \uc2 On the flip side, a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  turn could see the token sliding back towards its first support at $0.5945. If this level fails to hold, the next critical support lies at $0.5618, with a further downside potentially leading to the third support at $0.5205.\par \par \uc2 Traders will be watching these levels closely, as breaking either side could signal a more definitive trend for \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) in the coming days.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Riding the Wave of Strategic Partnerships\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is really shaking things up in the crypto world lately. It's all about its latest power moves \u8211\'20\'13 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/cardano-to-leverage-polkadots-substrate-for-partner-chains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 teaming up with Polkadot}}}\uc2  is a big deal, especially since they're diving into using the Substrate framework for this cool "partner chain" project. And let's not forget \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , the brains behind Cardano, who's now {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/cardano-founder-charles-hoskinson-eyes-partnership-with-kraken"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eyeing a partnership with Kraken}}}\uc2  to roll out a Layer-2 network. This buzz of activity is hinting at some serious growth and more people jumping on the Cardano bandwagon, even as the crypto market as a whole goes through some consolidation. With all this action, it's no surprise that the word on the street is that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be on its way to hitting $0.43 by the end of 2023.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 Technically, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is currently trading between its first support and resistance levels, which stand at $0.3437, and $0.371, respectively. This range becomes crucial for determining the altcoin's short-term trajectory. The recent crossing of the 9-day moving average at $0.3572 adds to the complexity, hinting at potential upward momentum.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/3rzIBxxK/?symbol=COINBASE%3AADAUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the stalling of the 3-10-16 day MACD moving average at $0.3715 and the 3-10 day MACD oscillator at $0.371 indicates a possible slowing down of this momentum.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Next Price Action\par \par \uc2 In a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario, if \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  successfully breaks above its first resistance at $0.371, it could target the second resistance level at $0.3849, and potentially aim for the $0.3982 level, aligning with the 1-month and 13-week highs. This upward movement could be fueled by the positive developments in its partnerships and network enhancements.\par \par \uc2 Conversly, in a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario, if the token fails to maintain its position above the first support level at $0.3437, it could see a downward trend towards the second support at $0.3304, and possibly test the third support at $0.3165. This downward pressure might be influenced by broader market sentiments or delays in the anticipated Cardano initiatives.\par \par \uc2 The key for traders will be to monitor the response of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  to these support and resistance levels closely, alongside the evolving news from its partnerships and network developments.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) are really making waves in the crypto sea, each riding their own unique currents. The recent rollercoaster of XRP \u8211\'20\'13 skyrocketing on some ETF buzz that turned out to be hot air, then tumbling down \u8211\'20\'13 has everyone on their toes. It's not every day you see whales moving around chunks of XRP worth hundreds of millions, signaling some big moves and serious interest in the asset\u8217\'20\'19s future.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , on the flip side, is surfing on a wave of exciting partnerships and network upgrades. Teaming up with heavy hitters like Polkadot and Kraken, the token is buzzing with potential and drawing more eyes its way. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is walking a tightrope between key price levels, and its next move could be a leap upward or a dip, depending on how these partnerships pan out.\par \par \uc2 For both these crypto contenders, the next few days are like a high-stakes poker game, and the crypto world is holding its breath to see their next play.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231115ejbf000xd\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/13: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,689 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price is beginning to weaken as traders set their eyes on the $35,000 level, but altcoins continue to show strength.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has risen more than 120% year-to-date, indicating that the crypto sentiment has improved significantly. Solid buying has resulted in a sharp increase in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-millionaire-wallets-triple-this-year"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto wallets holding more than $1 million}}}\uc2  in Bitcoin this year from 23,795 on Jan. 1 to 81,925 currently, according to BitInfoCharts data.\par \par \uc2 After the substantial rally, Bitcoin could face headwinds in the near term as investors digest the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/funding-rates-69k-btc-price-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 macroeconomic data and events due this week}}}\uc2 . The Consumer Price Index data is set to be released on Nov. 14, followed by the Producer Price Index data on Nov. 15, and the Nov. 17 deadline to avoid a partial \uc2 United States government\uc2  shutdown could give rise to short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/a3914051-6f6a-482e-b22d-e1da5b03daf3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 A short-term pullback is healthy for the long-term trend of the market. It is also likely to be viewed as a buying opportunity by traders as most analysts anticipate Bitcoin to rally in 2024, buoyed by the expectations of a spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund finally receiving regulatory approval.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and select altcoins start a short-term correction, or will the bulls maintain their buy pressure and clear the respective overhead resistance levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) snapped back from the neckline on Nov. 9, indicating that the bulls are buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/8456c933-db55-460d-a4d3-1ca174d680eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (4,319) has started to turn up, and the relative strength index (RSI) has risen into the positive zone, indicating that the bulls are in command. A break and close above the downtrend line will clear the path for a rally to 4,512.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to fiercely protect the downtrend line and drag the price below the neckline. If they do that, the index may drop to the 20-day EMA. Sellers will have to sink the price below the 20-day EMA to come out on top.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) tumbled below the descending channel pattern on Nov. 3, but the bears could not build upon this advantage and start a deeper correction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/7b8e3b91-cb5a-4f8a-9b33-338f0aed3a74.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 That started a recovery, which has reached the 20-day EMA (105.92). If the price turns down sharply from the current level, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling at the 20-day EMA. That could pull the price down to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of 104.38.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bulls propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the index could rise to the resistance line of the descending channel pattern.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been holding near the channel\u8217\'20\'19s resistance line for the past four days, but the bulls have failed to start the next leg of the uptrend. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/5f29d0f0-fbdc-4aac-b99b-57ead4796864.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price re-enters inside the channel, it will suggest that the breakout on Nov. 9 may have been a bull trap. Short-term traders may book profits, pulling the price toward the 20-day EMA ($34,961).\par \par \uc2 The overbought level on the RSI also warns of a possible correction or consolidation in the near term. The correction may extend to $32,400 and eventually to $31,000 if the bears yank the BTC/USDT pai below the channel.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up sharply and ascends above $38,000, it will indicate the start of a rally to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the psychological level at $2,000 on Nov. 12, indicating that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/f0364d78-1c0a-43a8-9ef0-6824a5909264.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will make one more attempt to overcome the obstacle at $2,200. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could pick up momentum and soar toward $3,000, as there is no major resistance level in between.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They are likely to mount a vigorous defense at $2,200. If the price turns down from this level, the pair may consolidate between $2,000 and $2,200 for a few days. The short-term trend will turn negative if the price breaks and sustains below $2,000. The pair may then collapse to the 20-day EMA ($1,908).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $240 and $258 for the past few days. This has pulled the RSI down from the overbought zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/e67d7498-224d-4af3-87ae-36fb5f63d21b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($238) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate an advantage to buyers. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to propel the BNB/USDT pair to $265. This level may again witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears, but if cleared, the pair may surge to $285.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the bears will have to yank the price below $235 to indicate the start of a deeper connection to the 50-day SMA ($222).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below $0.67 for the past few days, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to skid below the 20-day EMA ($0.62).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/a94de340-6f7b-4bb7-8208-497d98722060.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The tight consolidation near $0.67 enhances the prospects of a break above it. If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair could jump to $0.74. This level may pose a challenge, but it is likely to be crossed. That could start a rally toward $0.85.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls have given up. That could sink the pair toward the next significant support at $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) skyrocketed above the $48 resistance on Nov. 10 and ascended the $59 level on Nov. 11, but the bulls are facing stiff opposition from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/42869e59-11cc-4b3d-a575-0642ecaaf614.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rally of the past few days pushed the RSI above 88, indicating that the rally is overextended and a correction or consolidation may be around the corner. If the price turns down from the current level, the SOL/USDT pair could slide to $48. This level is likely to attract buyers who will try to flip $48 into support.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the $48 level gives way, it will suggest that the traders are rushing to the exit. The pair may then decline to the 20-day EMA ($43).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-institutional-inflows-1b-2023-btc-supply-squeeze"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin institutional inflows top $1B in 2023 amid BTC supply squeeze}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) pushed through the barrier at $0.38 on Nov. 10, but the bulls failed to build upon the recovery. This indicates that the bears are fiercely defending the $0.38 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/17c60f5a-59b6-434e-b720-e962924bb125.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to tug the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.34). If bulls want to maintain their hold, they will have to guard the 20-day EMA with vigor. A strong rebound off this level will increase the likelihood of a rally above $0.38. The pair may first rise to $0.42 and subsequently to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price continues lower and plummets below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may spend some time inside the large range between $0.24 and $0.38.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rose above $0.08 on Nov. 11, but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/6ddc1f39-2200-4955-9775-70eb020a012f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure to maintain above the overhead hurdle has started a pullback toward the 20-day EMA ($0.07). Buyers will try to defend this level and start a rebound off it. If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to $0.08. This is an important level to watch out for because a break above it could open the doors for a rally to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break and close below the 20-day EMA will signal that the pair may stay range-bound between $0.06 and $0.08 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) solid rally of the past few days pushed the RSI above 86, indicating that the rally was overextended in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/66d257ec-c84a-414c-bf5d-0e3a805c603c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 That may have tempted short-term traders to book profits near $16.60 on Nov. 12. The LINK/USDT pair could pullback to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $14.27 and then to the 50% retracement level of $13.55.\par \par \uc2 The real test will be at the 20-day EMA ($13). A strong rebound off this level will suggest that buyers continue viewing the dips as a buying opportunity. That may push the price toward $16.60. If this level is scaled, the pair may reach $18. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated in the near term if the price slips and maintains below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/27055707-309c-41ba-9bf2-6f2741020b69.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231113ejbd000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/10: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, LINK, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,599 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are trying to continue their upward march, but the possibility of a short-term correction looms.\par \par \uc2 News of \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  registering the iShares Ethereum Trust increased expectations that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/black-rock-ether-etf-eth-price-btc-etf-done-deal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 asset manager may eventually apply}}}\uc2  for an Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) spot exchange-traded fund. This is a positive sign as it shows that \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s cryptocurrency aspirations are not limited to Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 Market observers are increasingly optimistic that spot Bitcoin ETFs will be greenlighted by the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  in 2024. Bloomberg Intelligence research analyst James Seyffart said on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) that there is still a 90% possibility that the regulator {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-approval-window-sec-bloomberg-analysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 will approve a spot Bitcoin ETF}}}\uc2  by Jan. 10 of the next year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/a692ec1a-5c0c-44e9-94c1-b1cfd4798ace.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Galaxy Digital\uc2  founder \uc2 Mike Novogratz\uc2  believes that the approval of the \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 , followed by the \uc2 Ether ETF\uc2 , will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-will-drive-adoption-in-2024-mike-novogratz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 boost institutional adoption in 2024}}}\uc2 . During \uc2 Galaxy Digital\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s third-quarter earnings call on Nov. 9, Novogratz exhibited confidence that approval for ETFs \u8220\'20\'1Cis now not a matter of if but when.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could the expectations regarding ETF approvals sustain the rally in Bitcoin and select altcoins, or will profit-booking set in?\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin shot up above the ascending channel pattern on Nov. 9, but the higher levels witnessed profit-booking as seen from the long wick on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/af9bde9b-37b2-4289-83e8-c6ad6c08c7ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has been trading in the overbought territory for the past several days, indicating that the bulls have maintained the buying pressure. If the current rebound sustains, the buyers will try to propel the BTC/USDT pair to $40,000 again.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price dips back into the channel, it will indicate that markets have rejected the higher levels. That could pull the price down to the 20-day exponential moving average ($34,240), an important level to watch out for. A break below this level will tilt the short-term advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether skyrocketed above the psychological resistance of $2,000 on Nov. 9, indicating aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/4ee6cc12-3d53-4831-aeff-6c43620a192b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The recent rally has propelled the RSI into the overbought territory, suggesting a consolidation or correction may be around the corner. Sellers will try to halt the up-move at $2,200, but if they want to weaken the momentum, they will have to yank the price back below $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the ETH/USDT pair surges above $2,200, it will open the doors for a potential rise to $2,950 as there is no significant resistance in between.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip in BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) on Nov. 9, indicating that the lower levels continue attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/0f035d06-7b68-49b4-9e33-4f791f46de86.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to drive the price above the overhead resistance at $265. If they can pull it off, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to $285 and thereafter attempt a rally to $310. This level is likely to pose a strong challenge for the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The crucial support on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($235). Sellers will have to tug the price below this level to gain the upper hand. The pair could then collapse to the 50-day SMA ($220).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $0.74 on Nov. 6 and broke below the immediate support at $0.67 on Nov. 9. This suggests profit-booking by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/f599aa35-527a-4039-9efe-a3f95706b579.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($0.61) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the price snaps back from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders view the dips as a buying opportunity. That improves the prospects of a break above $0.74. The XRP/USDT pair could then climb to $0.85.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, a break below the 20-day EMA could deepen the correction to the next support at $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) nudged above the overhead resistance of $48 on Nov. 9 and followed that up with a sharp move above the overhead resistance on Nov. 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/1d9156cf-e23d-4010-a9e6-60711b203a16.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the SOL/USDT pair maintains above $48, it will signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The pair may then ascend to $60.\par \par \uc2 The risk to the up-move is from the overbought level on the RSI. This suggests that the rally is overextended in the near term and ripe for a correction or consolidation. The longer the price remains in the overbought territory, the greater the possibility of a sharp pullback. A slump below $48 will be the first sign that the bulls may lose their grip.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) pierced the overhead resistance at $0.38 on Nov. 9, but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the markets rejected the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/d777cbb6-d5d3-4532-a5a7-b8d1b3050a04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again try to shove and sustain the price above the overhead resistance. If they are successful, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could jump to $0.42 and subsequently to $0.46. Buyers may face a formidable resistance at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from $0.38, it could slide to the 20-day EMA ($0.32). This remains the critical level to watch for on the downside. A strong rebound off it could keep the advantage with the buyers, while a break below it may indicate a range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) swung wildly on Nov. 9, as seen from the long wick and tail on the candlestick. This suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/1a574d97-8b47-47e3-a51c-87920bdb9fdb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor positive is that the bulls have not ceded much ground to the bears. This suggests that the bulls expect the recovery to continue. There is a stiff hurdle at $0.08, but if that is crossed, the DOGE/USDT pair may reach $0.10.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to make a comeback, they will have to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA ($0.07). The breakdown will suggest that the pair may consolidate inside a large range between $0.08 and $0.06 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-terminal-price-next-btc-all-time-high-at-least-110k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin 'Terminal Price' hints next BTC all-time high is at least $110K}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) closed above $2.59 on Nov. 8, but the bulls could not maintain the higher levels. The price turned down sharply and slipped back below $2.59 on Nov. 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/1cde873d-6627-4678-9de1-0dca2ff65a8d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A slight advantage in favor of the bulls is that the 20-day EMA ($2.29) support held on the downside. The bulls will again try to propel the price above the overhead resistance zone between $2.59 and $2.77. If they manage to do that, the TON/USDT pair could pick up momentum and travel toward the pattern target of $4.03.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated in the near term if the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA. The pair may then slump to $2.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) reached $15 on Nov. 8, and the bulls tried to extend the rally on Nov. 9 but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/b7f630e4-7317-4bf8-be9b-50272a53d860.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LINK/USDT pair could slide to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $13.24. If the price rebounds off this level with force, the bulls will again try to overcome the obstacle at $15. If they succeed, the pair may surge to $18.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, if the price tumbles below $13.24, it will suggest that the traders are rushing to the exit. That could open the doors for a possible decline to the 20-day EMA ($11.94). This level is again expected to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) rally picked up pace after it broke above $0.70, but the up-move is facing selling near the overhead resistance at $0.89.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/d4fda02a-4338-4e64-8a30-5b801015989a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price could dip to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.76. If the price rebounds off this level, it will enhance the prospects of a rally above $0.89. If that happens, the MATIC/USDT pair will complete a double bottom pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $1.29.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below $0.76, the next stop could be $0.70. Such a deep correction will suggest that the pair may continue oscillating inside the large range between $0.49 and $0.89 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/aacc6baf-7ce4-4e61-8481-dd698c3d3130.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231110ejba000ba\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Is it altseason? Altcoin 30-day performance and total market cap flash  \highlight22\uc2 bullish \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Kyle White \par \uc2 649 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The total crypto market capitalization recently rose to a 14-month high, and altcoins\u8217\'20\'19 performance over the last 60 days could be signs of an impending altcoin season.\par \par \uc2 A wave of green has washed across the entire crypto market, and it won\u8217\'20\'19t be long before traders on X (formerly known as \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) begin to explain that a new altcoin season has arrived.\par \par \uc2 Altcoin season \u8212\'20\'14 or \u8220\'20\'1Caltseason,\u8221\'20\'1D as the crypto bros say \u8212\'20\'14 typically measures the rallying of altcoins and a positive increase in the total market capitalization of altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s take a look at some key indicators that market participants use to determine whether or not an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-an-altcoin-a-beginners-guide-to-cryptocurrencies-beyond-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 altcoin}}}\uc2  season has emerged.\par \par \uc2 Total crypto market capitalization hits a 14-month high\par \par \uc2 The total market cap of crypto recently hit a 14-month high, clearly reflecting the current \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 Crypto total market cap broke out to its highest levels in over 14 months. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/0c6CPxDSfQ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/0c6CPxDSfQ}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 TradingView (@tradingview) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/tradingview/status/1721601276717277599?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 6, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Similar strength is seen in the altcoin total market cap chart seen below. The metric measures the crypto market cap minus Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/2a5d12d3-33a1-425f-b051-330bffc46f1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total crypto market cap minus Bitcoin. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Since Sept. 8, the metric has springboarded from $526 billion to $622 billion on Nov. 9. The change shows traders\u8217\'20\'19 growing interest and investment interest in altcoins, along with an increase in the prices of altcoins within the metric.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/interview-2-years-after-john-mcafee-death-wife-janice-broke-still-grieving/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Exclusive: 2 years after John McAfee\u8217\'20\'19s death, widow Janice is broke and needs answers}}}\par \par \uc2 Large-cap altcoins display multiweek strength\par \par \uc2 Data from CoinMarketCap shows the top 13 altcoins by market cap (excluding stablecoins) reflecting double-digit gains within the last 30 to 60 days.\par \par \uc2 In particular, \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), which has won a host of legal battles {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-legal-chief-questions-sec-case-losses-gensler"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 against the Securities and Exchange Commission}}}\uc2 , has witnessed 45% gains in the past 60 days. On top of the legal victories that helped to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-xrp-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 boost \b  \highlight22investor sentiment\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , it is rumored that \uc2 Ripple\uc2  will be announcing an initial public offering (IPO) on Nov. 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/1acb38ab-d09b-41bd-abba-a0a1fa5c9502.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top altcoin performers. Source: CoinMarketCap\par \par \uc2 For the past three months, Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has rallied significantly and started to lose its \u8220\'20\'1CSam coin\u8221\'20\'1D moniker. Sam coins are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/not-just-ftx-token-solana-price-nukes-40-along-with-other-sam-coins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cryptocurrencies with exposure}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/not-just-ftx-token-solana-price-nukes-40-along-with-other-sam-coins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/not-just-ftx-token-solana-price-nukes-40-along-with-other-sam-coins}}}\uc2  to \uc2 Alameda Research\uc2 , \uc2 FTX\uc2  and \uc2 Sam Bankman-Fried\uc2 . \uc2 SOL\uc2  price has gained over 107% in the past 60 days as the project continues to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-ceo-says-ftx-fallout-hurt-ecosystem-startups"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rebuild and gain}}}\uc2  users in the aftermath of the \uc2 FTX\uc2  collapse. BitMEX exchange co-founder {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bought-sol-arthur-hayes-solana-price-rebounds-500"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/bought-sol-arthur-hayes-solana-price-rebounds-500}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bought-sol-arthur-hayes-solana-price-rebounds-500"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Arthur Hayes recently joined the Solana train}}}\uc2 , announcing that he purchased the altcoin on Nov. 2.\par \par \uc2 Similar to \uc2 SOL\uc2 , Chainlink\u8217\'20\'19s LINK ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has seen massive 60-day returns of over 100% due to consistent building and usage. LINK also has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/chainlink-pumps-26-in-6-days-is-there-room-for-more"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted 26% returns}}}\uc2  in six days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-btc-price-levels-bitcoin-avoids-36k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 New BTC price levels to watch as Bitcoin avoids $36K}}}\par \par \uc2 Other notable performances came from BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Tron\u8217\'20\'19s TRX ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tron-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRX}}}\uc2  ) and Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ), which also produced double-digit gains in a 60-day period.\par \par \uc2 The altcoin market performance seemingly coincides with an improvement in \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2 . One gauge of market sentiment is the Crypto Fear & Greed Index. Since starting September as fearful, the market turned to greed on Oct. 23 and has not reversed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/26784e8d-d273-414b-874a-855f1ee82b94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index. Source: Newhedge\par \par \uc2 Whether it is truly altseason or not, it is clear that excitement is returning to the crypto market.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/bd0b4d79-2a7b-4a7c-b51f-36629df7dada.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231109ejb9000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/8: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, LINK, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,672 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin encounters a hurdle at $36,000, but will the resistance level be strong enough to trigger a correction in altcoins?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rally stalled near $36,000, but the bulls have not hurried to book profits. According to Glassnode analysis, the Long-Term Holder metric, which are addresses holding Bitcoin for at least 155 days, supply is near an all-time high, while the Short-Term Holder, addresses holding coins for less than 155 days, supply is near an all-time low, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-supply-held-long-term-holders-hits-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 indicating tightening Bitcoin supply}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Although the long-term looks positive, there could be fireworks in the short term. Bitcoin derivatives markets have seen a huge build-up of open interest, rising above $16 billion at the time of writing, per CoinGlass {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/BitcoinOpenInterest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data}}}\uc2 . J. A. Maartunn, a contributor to on-chain analytics platform CryptoQuant, highlighted on X (previously \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) that increases in open interest above $12.2 billion have previously {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-open-interest-15b-analyst-warns-20-btc-price-dip"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 resulted in a minimum dip of 20%}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/08832f08-fd69-4637-996a-36c891ffc583.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin risks a decline in the near term, traders have started accumulating select altcoins. That has resulted in solid rallies in several altcoins, which have broken out of long basing patterns and are showing signs of starting a new uptrend. Altcoins may witness bouts of profit-booking but are likely to remain in focus as long as Bitcoin does not crumble below $30,000.\par \par \uc2 What are the critical support levels in Bitcoin that need to hold for the uptrend to continue? Will the altcoin rally sustIain, or is it time to book profits?\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin continues to trade inside a narrow ascending channel pattern, indicating that buyers are cautious at the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/e247f37f-28f8-4554-b1b6-72cd630cb038.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($33,612) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the overbought zone indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers propel the price above the channel, it will suggest that the bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. That could clear the path for a potential rally to $40,000. This level is likely to attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and plunges below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are booking profits. The BTC/USDT pair could then drop to $32,400 and eventually to $31,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been slowly moving higher toward the significant resistance at $2,000. This is an important level to watch out for as the bears stalled the up-move at $2,000 on two previous occasions in May and July.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/375d37e0-df47-48b7-b264-e6bd8d98d7cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the ETH/USDT pair does not give up much ground from $2,000, it will suggest that the bulls are holding on to their positions as they anticipate another leg higher. There is a minor resistance at $2,200, but if this level is scaled, the up-move may pick up momentum and skyrocket toward $3,500.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($1,800), the next stop is likely to be $1,746.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been in a recovery phase for several days. The price reached $256 on Nov. 6, where the bears stepped in to stall the up-move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/72f74c25-d61f-4975-938d-0fc96f2d018e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($232), which is a necessary level to keep an eye on.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level with strength, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity. The BNB/USDT pair could then travel to $265, where the bears may again pose a substantial challenge.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bears are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) climbed above the $0.67 resistance on Nov. 6, but the bulls could not surmount the next barrier at $0.74.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/499b26db-eaca-40bd-9924-0d43d1fbd442.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 That may have tempted short-term bulls to book profits, which pulled the price below $0.67 on Nov. 7. The long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that lower levels continue to attract buyers. If the price remains above $0.63, it will improve the prospects of a retest of $0.74. Above this level, the XRP/USDT pair may rise to $0.85 and then to $1.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below $0.63, it will signal that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The pair could then slip to the 20-day EMA ($0.60).\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating in an uptrend. The price is stuck between the overhead resistance at $48 and the support at $38.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/85ad69bf-75ac-48ab-967d-594a831f5a0f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up, and the RSI is in the overbought zone, indicating that the bulls have the upper hand. The price could climb to $48, which may witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. If bulls overcome this obstacle, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could jump to $60.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to make a comeback, they will have to sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($36.30). That could start a deeper correction to the 50-day SMA ($27.35).\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong uptrend for the past few days. The price reached $0.38 on Nov. 6, where the bulls are likely to face solid resistance from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/054293c6-705e-4c8b-b13f-d8d150d94559.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price pulled back on Nov. 7, but a minor positive is that the bulls purchased at lower levels, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. Buying indicates that the bulls expect the overhead resistance to be scaled.\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive and sustain the price above $0.38, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend to $0.42 and subsequently to $0.46. This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the price breaks below $0.33.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to shove Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above $0.08. The previous attempt in July had fizzled out at this level; hence, the bears will again try to guard $0.08 with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/3e76fc4a-4935-41eb-80cb-65f48d2f3eb0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.07) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls have the edge. If buyers do not give up much ground from $0.08, it will increase the likelihood of a break above it. The DOGE/USDT pair could then surge toward the psychologically crucial level of $0.10.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the up-move, they will have to swiftly yank the price back below the 20-day EMA. That could signal a range-bound action between $0.06 and $0.08 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/toncoin-ton-price-11-month-high-telegram-giveaways"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Toncoin (TON) price skyrockets to 11-month high after Telegram launches 'Giveaways'}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) surged above the overhead resistance of $2.59 on Nov. 8, indicating that bulls are in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/1bc5b8e5-f095-4a9f-b51f-b891c89fc615.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few months resulted in a cup and handle formation, which completed on a break and close above $2.59. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $4.03.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to tug and sustain the price below the breakout level of $2.59. If they manage to do that quickly, it may trap several aggressive bulls who could rush to the exit. The TON/USDT pair could then start a sharp correction to $2.31.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has been in an uptrend for the past few days. After a brief consolidation, the bulls asserted their supremacy and resumed the up-move on Nov. 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/c2a275fd-71db-4872-878b-e2bbe8be5bf9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rally has reached the resistance at $13.50, which may act as a temporary roadblock. If buyers bulldoze their way through, the LINK/USDT pair may jump to $15 and thereafter to $18. The bears are expected to fiercely defend this level.\par \par \uc2 The vital support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($11.18). A break and close below this support will indicate that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be reducing.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) pierced the overhead resistance at $0.70 on Nov. 6, indicating that the bulls are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/d35e8556-e21a-43f1-b3c2-1bffcfdde345.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull the price back below the breakout level of $0.70 on Nov. 7, but the bulls held their ground. This suggests that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That started the next leg of the uptrend toward $0.80. This level may act as a minor hurdle, but if crossed, the MATIC/USDT pair could reach $0.90.\par \par \uc2 The rally of the past few days has pushed the RSI into the overbought territory, cautioning of a possible consolidation or correction in the near term. The pair may then drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.66).\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/d0beb4cf-1cb6-436f-ae21-f462ae7f7c3f.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231108ejb8000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
