\par\par \b \uc2 Are \uc2 Ripple\uc2  and Cardano Market Moves Indicative of a Larger Seasonal Shift?\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 1,532 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 November 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * ScapesMania Unveiled: A New Crypto Powerhouse Emerges\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP): Swell-Boosted Market Momentum\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Price Forecast\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): From Sideways to Skywards After Dubai Summit\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Forecast\par \par \uc2 * Closing Thoughts: Seasonal Surge or Market Maturation?\par \par \uc2 November has a rep for being kind to crypto investors, a kind of lucky charm for digital wallets everywhere. And this year seems no different; the whole scene is picking up steam. While Bitcoin often basks in the glow of this autumn rally, it's not the only one soaking up the rays this season. \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) is having a moment, boasting a solid 13% jump in just a week. And let\u8217\'20\'19s not forget Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), which is riding a 23% wave, lifting spirits as it climbs past the $0.35 benchmark. Investors are all eyes, wondering if \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has got the juice to soar back to its yearly high.\par \par \uc2 In this climate of cautious optimism, a new contender has emerged, stirring the pot with its presale allure: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://scapesmania.io/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mmedia&utm_campaign=XRPADA"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ScapesMania}}}\uc2  (MANIA). Amidst seasoned cryptos flexing their newfound strengths, this asset taps into the traders' zeitgeist, offering what many seek \u8211\'20\'13 predictability and the promise of high returns. Yet, the hint of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  runs and \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  tumbles exists in the near horizon for all, including XRP, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and even MANIA.\par \par \uc2 ScapesMania Unveiled: A New Crypto Powerhouse Emerges\par \par \uc2 While some are facing an uncertain future, the trajectory of a presale project is far easier to predict. ScapesMania (MANIA) is a well-balanced, meticulously designed project that acts as a gaming ecosystem. Through DAO governance, backers will be able to influence and benefit from a multi-billion-dollar industry. A wide range of features paired with the best technology, a professional team, and a long-term, highly ambitious vision can make ScapesMania the next big thing in crypto. Presale discounts and stage bonuses only add to the project's appeal.\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live Now - Join Now for a Chance to Benefit with MANIA\par \par \uc2 Backed by an award-winning developer crew, ScapesMania stands for transparency: every member\u8217\'20\'19s social media profile is public. The project can achieve this not just by bringing big innovation to the game, but by putting its community front and center. Driving customer engagement and making sure that everyone benefits through great tokenomics and generous rewards is what makes ScapesMania the project with a bright future ahead.\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live, Learn More About Major Benefits\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP): Swell-Boosted Market Momentum\par \par \uc2 The current market narrative of \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) is a fascinating blend of community-driven hype and strong whale activity. As Ripple Swell 2023 takes center stage, investors are on high alert, considering the event's historical propensity to act as a tailwind for the XRP price\u8217\'20\'19s action. The spotlight also shines on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/santimentfeed/status/1721360317564010910"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the massive whale accumulation}}}\uc2  this year, which has seen almost half of the token\u8217\'20\'19s supply coalesce into the vaults of large holders.\par \par \uc2 This, along with the crescendo in social dominance and the ascent above crucial moving averages, paints a picture of burgeoning confidence. The recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/ripple-xrp-price-analysis-xrp-gets-dfsa-approval-how-bullish-is-this"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 clearing of regulatory clouds}}}\uc2  with the SEC and the warm embrace by Dubai regulators only amplify the potential for an upward trajectory of \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP).\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 Diving into the technicals, XRP is threading a path between pivotal markers. It\u8217\'20\'19s trading shy of the first resistance pivot at $0.7232, eyeing the next bulwark at $0.7574, with the peak resistance for this setup at $0.7905. A glance at the MACD indicates some hesitation near $0.7502, hinting at possible resistance convergence.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/3rzIBxxK/?symbol=BITSTAMP%3AETHUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Bulls aiming for a leg up would need to overpower these barriers to cement a new support base, potentially converting the $0.7306 zone, which matches the 1-month and 13-week highs, into a springboard for further ascents. Meanwhile, the downside is cushioned by the first support pivot at $0.656, closely trailed by the $0.6229 marker, which beckons as a critical hold point. With the MACD's sign of stalling, the bears could leverage this to push for tests of lower resilience, potentially eyeing the $0.5887 third support pivot as a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  target.\par \par \uc2 The narrative for \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) oscillates with these technical levels setting the stage.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Price Forecast\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenarios might see the token breezing past the immediate resistance, using the Swell conference's tailwinds to perhaps challenge the $0.7905 high.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears aren't without their cards to play. A slip below $0.656 could embolden them to nudge XRP down to more humble territories, with the $0.5887 third support pivot as a potential pitstop.\par \par \uc2 In the dance of digits and charts, an immediate future of \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) hinges on its ability to charm the bulls while warding off the bears \u8211\'20\'13 a delicate balance where numbers whisper the tales of potential triumphs and pitfalls.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): From Sideways to Skywards After Dubai Summit\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has been painting the crypto news town red following a string of positive developments that have ignited investor interest. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/cardano-ada-price-analysis-ada-surges-10-in-two-days-as-bulls-look-to-push-to-035"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The buzz began with the Cardano Summit 2023 in Dubai}}}\uc2 , which served as a catalyst for the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price\u8217\'20\'19s eruption. The digital currency has finally shaken off the dust from its previous sideways amble between August and October, charting an upward trajectory that could make any investor's heart race.\par \par \uc2 This newfound vigor is backed by hefty whale movements, with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/santimentfeed/status/1720160495762915827?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1720160495762915827%7Ctwgr%5E850b4d7650a5e2db8dd930f9861a8f6a1be8c016%7Ctwcon%5Es1_c10&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fzycrypto.com%2Fcardano-whales-bank-on-a-massive-bull-run-as-full-blown-mega-rally-nears-for-ripples-xrp-and-solana%2F"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Santiment's ledger}}}\uc2  revealing a gobsmacking addition of 80 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  to wallets holding over a million of the token, painting a picture of confidence worth around $28 million. Adding to the euphoria, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://hat.openai.com/?model=text-davinci-002-render-sha"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the DeFi ecosystem of Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) is thriving}}}\uc2 , as evidenced by a notable hike in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  staked, catapulting the Total Value Locked (TVL) to a handsome $240 million. The cherry on top? A flurry of development activity with over 500 \uc2 GitHub\uc2  commits, earning \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  the top spot in development activity this month.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 Technically speaking, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is currently threading through a narrow pathway, snugly nestled between $0.336 and $0.3692, which suggests a cautious tussle between the bulls and bears. The technical indicators offer a mixed bag: the MACD, showing a bit of hesitation, has stalled around the $0.3803 mark, hinting at a possible pause in momentum.\par \par \uc2 Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 On the flip side, a potential catalyst for upward motion is the crossing of the 9-day moving average at $0.3191, which could signal a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  undertow if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price maintains above this dynamic line.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Forecast\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario for Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) rests on a solid foundation: the accumulation by whales and a flurry of development activity. Should \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  decisively breach the $0.3692 resistance, the pathway could lead to a test of the second and third resistance points at $0.3855 and $0.4025, respectively. The prospect of riding the wave of positive sentiment from the Cardano Summit and increased network activity could embolden buyers to aim for these new heights.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  case would see the asset lose its footing at the $0.336 support level, potentially sliding towards the second support at $0.3189, and if the bears persist, reaching for the third support at $0.3027. This could reflect a short-term cooling off period after the recent rally or reaction to broader market sentiment.\par \par \uc2 As traders and investors alike monitor these technical levels, the stage is set for the next significant move of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), guided by a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/cardano-to-leverage-polkadots-substrate-for-partner-chains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 blend of technical setups}}}\uc2  and underlying fundamental zeal.\par \par \uc2 Closing Thoughts: Seasonal Surge or Market Maturation?\par \par \uc2 As the leaves turn and November claims its throne, it\u8217\'20\'19s not just the foliage that\u8217\'20\'19s changing \u8211\'20\'13 cryptocurrency markets are stirring, too. \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP), with its recent double-digit percentage rise, is creating ripples that could swell into a wave of investor enthusiasm. Meanwhile, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), not to be outdone, has surged impressively, bringing a warm front to the previously cool market sentiments.\par \par \uc2 These upticks in the market are far from mere autumnal whims; they're fueled by substantial developments and strategic plays by crypto whales. XRP, buoyed by significant accumulation by sizeable holders, hints at a shift in market dynamics, while the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token's leap is anchored by the tangible advancements and enhanced activity within its ecosystem. Both are traversing the tightrope of market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , their price points etching patterns that traders watch with bated breath.\par \par \uc2 In this dance of digits and diagrams, both assets stand out with their vibrant market moves. They remind us that, even as the trees shed their leaves, the cryptocurrency market is very much alive \u8211\'20\'13 growing, evolving, and full of potential surprises. The narrative is captivating, and the next chapter in their market movement is one to watch closely, as both coins juggle the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenarios painted by their technicals and fundamentals.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231108ejb80012x\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 3 reasons why Ethereum price is underperforming altcoins\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 800 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ethereum price is underperforming the top altcoins. Cointelegraph explores why.\par \par \uc2 The price of Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) surged by 6.2% from Nov. 3 to Nov. 5, but the altcoin is facing difficulty breaking the $1,900 resistance. Despite the current \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend, Ether\u8217\'20\'19s 17% return over the last 30 days falls short of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) impressive 27% gain during the same period.\par \par \uc2 Regulatory hurdles and ecosystem centralization critiques linger\par \par \uc2 Analysts attribute some of Ether\u8217\'20\'19s underperformance to uncertainty surrounding \uc2 Consensys\uc2 , a key player in the Ethereum ecosystem. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/consensys-founder-joseph-lubin-former-employee-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Former employees have filed a lawsuit}}}\uc2  against the company and its co-founder \uc2 Joseph Lubin\uc2 . Over two dozen shareholders of the Swiss holding company, Consensys AG, claim that Lubin, who is also a co-founder of Ethereum, violated a \u8220\'20\'1Cno-dilution promise\u8221\'20\'1D made in 2015.\par \par \uc2 Consensys\uc2  is responsible for developing and hosting infrastructure projects crucial to the Ethereum network. It was founded in October 2014, about nine months before the Ethereum blockchain launched in mid-2015. Furthermore, the High Court of Zug in Switzerland ruled in favor of the plaintiffs, exacerbating the current uncertainty.\par \par \uc2 Regulatory challenges have hampered the growth of the Ethereum ecosystem. The latest concern centers around \uc2 PayPal\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s U.S. dollar-pegged stablecoin, PYUSD, which operates on the Ethereum network. This token is designed for digital payments and \uc2 Web3\uc2  applications. On Nov. 2, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/chainlink-garners-criticism-after-quiet-change-multisig"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PayPal disclosed a subpoena it received}}}\uc2  from the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In addition to regulatory pressures, there has been notable criticism of the decentralization of financial applications within the Ethereum network. Chainlink, a preferred solution for oracle services, quietly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/chainlink-garners-criticism-after-quiet-change-multisig"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reduced the number of participants in its multisignature wallet}}}\uc2  from four out of nine to four out of eight. Analysts have highlighted the lack of governance by regular users as a significant issue.\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s underperformance to altcoins is evidence of other issues\par \par \uc2 Several major altcoins \u8212\'20\'14 including Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) \u8212\'20\'14 have outperformed Ether, with returns of 75.5%, 37% and 35% in the last 30 days, respectively. This discrepancy suggests that the factors holding back ETH are not solely related to regulatory pressure or reduced demand for the decentralized finance and nonfungible token markets.\par \par \uc2 One pressing issue for the Ethereum network is the high gas fees associated with transactions, including those executed by smart contracts. The latest seven-day average transaction fee was $4.90, negatively impacting the usage of decentralized applications (DApps).\par \par \uc2 Moreover, the total deposits on the Ethereum network, measured in Ether, have dropped to their lowest levels since August 2020. It\u8217\'20\'19s essential to note that this analysis does not consider the effects of native Ethereum staking.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/0bd52feb-9b80-464d-9c29-4fbd71ec8539.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Ethereum network applications' total deposits in ETH. Source: DefiLlama\par \par \uc2 According to DefiLlama data, Ethereum DApps had a total value locked (TVL) of 12.7 million ETH on Nov. 5, down 4% from the 13.2 million ETH two months earlier. In comparison, the TVL on the Tron network increased by 13% during the same period, while Arbitrum deposits remained at 1 million ETH. Data on DApp activity on the Ethereum network supports the notion of reduced activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/97ca667b-233e-4215-ae99-894ff16df84f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Ethereum network top DApps, 30-day active addresses. Source: DappRadar\par \par \uc2 Even excluding the significant 60% decline in the Uniswap NFT Aggregator, the average number of active addresses across the top Ethereum network DApps decreased by 3% compared with the previous month. In contrast, Solana\u8217\'20\'19s top applications saw an average 18% increase in active users during the same period, according to DappRadar data.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/aave-pauses-several-markets-feature-issue"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Aave pauses several markets after reports of feature issue}}}\par \par \uc2 Finally, on-chain activity indicates increased user deposits of ETH at exchanges. While this data doesn\u8217\'20\'19t necessarily signal short-term selling, the mere availability of coins is typically viewed as a precautionary measure by analysts.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/3c294bf6-7cab-4fbc-8a95-ae073043cc99.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Average 7-day daily ETH deposits at exchanges, ETH thousands. Source: \uc2 Coin Metrics\par \par \uc2 The present daily ETH deposit average of 255,614 represents a 30% increase from two weeks earlier, indicating that holders are more inclined to sell as Ether\u8217\'20\'19s price approaches $1,900.\par \par \uc2 The data suggests that reduced TVL, declining DApps activity and a higher rate of ETH exchange deposits are negatively impacting the likelihood of Ether breaking the $1,900 resistance. The price level could be more challenging than initially expected, and for now, Ether bears can take a breath.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/5e0eab52-1988-4148-953e-625307fef557.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231106ejb6000bc\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/6: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,658 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders\u8217\'20\'19 sentiment remains positive as Bitcoin holds the $35,000 level and altcoins begin to flash \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signs.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) marginal rise of about 1.5% last week suggests that traders are cautious at higher levels but they are not rushing to the exit. The bears have been in hibernation for the past few days but if the rally fails to resume, sellers may try to make a comeback.\par \par \uc2 However, in an uptrend, dips are usually viewed as an opportunity for long-term investors to accumulate. The positive sentiment among traders can be gauged by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/exchange-flow-gap-10k-btc-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increase in Bitcoin withdrawals from exchanges}}}\uc2  which reached 61,000 Bitcoin, a strong improvement over the year-to-date low of nearly 43,000 Bitcoin, according to CryptoSlate analyst Van Straten.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/956a5f14-6d3e-4b02-8ef2-3fbcc0b9d1b7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 A large part of the accumulation is taking place in Bitcoin in the hopes that the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  will eventually approve a spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund. The enthusiasm of the traders increased further on the news that the Hong Kong government {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/hong-kong-spot-bitcoin-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 may consider proposals for a spot Bitcoin ETF}}}\uc2 . BitMEX co-founder \uc2 Arthur Hayes\uc2  said on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) that the competition between the United States and China is good for Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Are Bitcoin and altcoins ready to extend their up-move or is it time for a short-term correction? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) has been on a tear for the past few days. The bulls pushed the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (4,275) on Nov. 2 and followed it up a break above the 50-day simple moving average (4,346) on Nov. 3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/43b0813f-2121-48e7-a273-00395a8dae3a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has risen into the positive territory and the 20-day EMA has started to turn up. This indicates that the downtrend may be over but it does not guarantee the start of a new uptrend. The bears are expected to fiercely defend the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 In the same way, the buyers are unlikely to give up their advantage without a fight. They are likely to buy the dips to the 20-day EMA. A strong rebound off this level will increase the possibility of a break above the downtrend line. If bears want to gain the upper hand, they will have to yank the price back below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index (DXY) plunged below the moving averages on Nov. 3, indicating the start of a deeper correction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/fb1864a5-e14f-434c-905b-05bac43ed83f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of 104.38. If the price rebounds off this level, the index could reach the 20-day EMA. Buyers will have to pierce this resistance to set up a retest of 107.35.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price continues lower and breaks below 104.38, it will signal that the bulls are rushing to the exit. That could open the gates for a further decline to the 50% retracement level of 103.46.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been gradually rising inside the ascending channel pattern. This suggests that the bulls have the edge but the momentum is slowing down.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/a98e2b89-2374-45f8-a820-d6814cbc7328.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI remains inside the overbought territory, indicating that the BTC/USDT pair may extend its consolidation or enter a corrective phase in the next few days. If the price skids below the channel, it may tempt short-term traders to book profits. There is strong support at the 20-day EMA ($33,238) but if this level gives way, the pair may plummet to $31,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up and breaks above the channel, it will suggest the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The pair may then soar to the next major obstacle at $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the nearby resistance of $1,885 on Nov. 5, indicating the start of the next leg of the upward journey toward $2,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/d9d06057-01f8-4248-a288-6af96b69e644.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are expected to defend the zone between $2,000 to $2,200 with all their might because if this resistance gives way, it will clear the path for a possible rally to $3,500 as there are no major resistances in between.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($1,780). The ETH/USDT pair may then tumble toward the 50-day SMA ($1,671).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the resistance of the range at $235 on Nov. 4, indicating that demand exceeds supply.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/93c9e00a-9ebd-4519-a62b-ceac9f1c66ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 There is a minor resistance at $250 but if buyers bulldoze their way through, the BNB/USDT pair may reach the major hurdle at $265. This level may prove to be a formidable resistance for the bulls to cross.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the first important support to keep an eye on is $235. If the price dips below this level, it will signal that bears remain active at higher levels. The pair may then slide to the 20-day EMA ($227).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke above the stiff overhead resistance of $0.67 on Nov. 6, indicating that the bulls are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/2370a85b-4c0f-4917-8727-f346ea928840.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 There is a minor resistance at $0.74 but if bulls clear this hurdle, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to $0.85 and subsequently to $1.\par \par \uc2 A risk to the current up-move is that the RSI has entered overbought territory. This suggests that the rally is overheated in the short term. That could result in a correction or a consolidation for a few days. The important level to watch on the downside is $0.67. If this level gives way, it could start a deeper correction to the 20-day EMA ($0.58).\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the crucial support of $38.79 on Nov. 3 but the bulls are struggling to sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/4bcc09ac-b930-4a09-8852-eff61df32e4c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to build upon their advantage and sink the price below $38.79. If they manage to do that, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could slump to the 20-day EMA ($34.67). This level is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to drive the price above $42.50 and challenge the stiff resistance at $48. Conversely, if the 20-day EMA cracks, the pair may tumble to $31 and later to $27.12.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-xrp-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is XRP price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong recovery for the past few days. The momentum picked up further after buyers pushed the price above $0.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/fa463da0-81b9-456e-9674-6ed1f0535bba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The strong rally has pushed the RSI into the overbought zone, suggesting that a minor consolidation or correction may be around the corner. If the price stays above $0.32, it will increase the likelihood of a rally to $0.38.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $0.32, it will suggest that traders may be booking profits. That could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($0.30). This remains the key level for the bulls to defend to keep the up-move intact.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the strong support at the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on Feb. 3, indicating a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/6145b6f7-9ac0-4ab3-a984-e703b2db1f71.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to maintain the price above $0.07 and if they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could pick up momentum and surge to $0.08. This level may pose a strong challenge but if cleared, the pair may sprint toward the psychological level of $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to stall the up-move and pull the price back below the 20-day EMA. This could clear the path for a potential fall to the $0.06 support.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has been trading above the moving averages for the past few days, indicating demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/70494957-8008-4894-bedf-9b51fa931ff3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3ATONUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above $2.31 on Nov. 6 but the long wick shows selling at higher levels. If buyers maintain the price above $2.31, it will open the doors for a rise to $2.59. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level, the moving averages are likely to act as the first line of support. If these give way, the TON/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $1.89. Such a move will suggest that the pair may oscillate between $1.89 and $2.31 for some time.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/eb7f9fcb-a39b-4e04-8fca-4767549315cd.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231106ejb6000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 3 reasons why Ethereum price is underperforming altcoins\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 793 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ethereum price is underperforming the top altcoins. Cointelegraph explores why.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) price surged by 6.2% from Nov. 3 to Nov. 5, but the altcoin faces difficulty in breaking the $1,900 resistance. Despite the current \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend, Ether's 17% return over the last 30 days falls short of Bitcoin's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) impressive 27% gain during the same period.\par \par \uc2 Regulatory hurdles and ecosystem centralization critiques linger\par \par \uc2 Analysts attribute some of Ether\u8217\'20\'19s underperformance to uncertainty surrounding \uc2 Consensys\uc2 , a key player in the Ethereum ecosystem. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/consensys-founder-joseph-lubin-former-employee-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Former employees have filed a lawsuit}}}\uc2  against the company and its co-founder, \uc2 Joseph Lubin\uc2 . Over two dozen shareholders of the Swiss-based holding company, Consensys AG, claim that Lubin, who is also a co-founder of Ethereum, violated a "no-dilution promise" made in 2015.\par \par \uc2 Consensys\uc2  is responsible for developing and hosting infrastructure projects crucial to the Ethereum network. It was founded in October 2014, about nine months before the Ethereum blockchain launched in mid-2015. Furthermore, the High Court of Zug in Switzerland ruled in favor of the plaintiffs, exacerbating the current uncertainty.\par \par \uc2 Regulatory challenges have hampered the growth of the Ethereum ecosystem. The latest concern centers around \uc2 PayPal\uc2 's U.S. dollar-pegged stablecoin, PYUSD, which operates on the Ethereum network. This token is designed for digital payments and \uc2 Web3\uc2  applications. On November 2, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/chainlink-garners-criticism-after-quiet-change-multisig"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PayPal disclosed a subpoena it received}}}\uc2  from the \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC).\par \par \uc2 In addition to regulatory pressures, there has been notable criticism of the decentralization of financial applications (DeFi) within the Ethereum network. Chainlink, a preferred solution for oracle services, quietly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/chainlink-garners-criticism-after-quiet-change-multisig"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reduced the number of participants in its multi-signature wallet}}}\uc2  from 4-out-of-9 to 4-out-of-8. Analysts have highlighted the lack of governance by regular users as a significant issue.\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s underperformance to altcoins is an evidence of other issues\par \par \uc2 Several major altcoins, including Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) have outperformed Ether with returns of 75.5%, 37%, and 35% in the last 30 days, respectively. This discrepancy suggests that the factors holding back ETH are not solely related to regulatory pressure or reduced demand for DeFi and NFT markets.\par \par \uc2 One pressing issue for the Ethereum network is the high gas fees associated with transactions, including those executed by smart contracts. The latest 7-day average transaction fee was $4.90, negatively impacting the usage of decentralized applications (DApps).\par \par \uc2 Moreover, the total deposits on the Ethereum network, measured in Ether, have dropped to their lowest levels since August 2020. It's essential to note that this analysis does not consider the effects of native Ethereum staking.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/0bd52feb-9b80-464d-9c29-4fbd71ec8539.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Ethereum network applications' total deposits in ETH. Source: DefiLlama\par \par \uc2 According to DefiLlama data, Ethereum DApps had a total value locked (TVL) of 12.7 million ETH on November 5, down 4% from the 13.2 million ETH two months earlier. In comparison, TVL on the Tron network increased by 13% during the same period, while Arbitrum deposits remained at 1 million ETH. Data on DApps activity on the Ethereum network supports the notion of reduced activity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/97ca667b-233e-4215-ae99-894ff16df84f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Ethereum network top DApps, 30-day active addresses. Source: DappRadar\par \par \uc2 Even excluding the significant 60% decline in the Uniswap NFT Aggregator, the average number of active addresses across the top Ethereum network DApps decreased by 3% compared to the previous month. In contrast, Solana's top applications saw an average 18% increase in active users during the same period, according to DappRadar data.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/aave-pauses-several-markets-feature-issue"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Aave pauses several markets after reports of feature issue}}}\par \par \uc2 Finally, on-chain activity indicates increased user deposits of ETH at exchanges. While this data doesn't necessarily signal short-term selling, the mere availability of coins is typically viewed as a precautionary measure by analysts.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/3c294bf6-7cab-4fbc-8a95-ae073043cc99.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Average 7-day daily ETH deposits at exchanges, ETH thousands. Source: CoinMetrics\par \par \uc2 The present daily ETH deposit average of 255,614 represents a 30% increase from two weeks earlier, indicating that holders are more inclined to sell as Ether's price approaches $1,900.\par \par \uc2 The data suggests that reduced TVL, declining DApps activity and a higher rate of ETH exchange deposits are negatively impacting the likelihood of Ether breaking the $1,900 resistance. The price level could be more challenging than initially expected and for now, Ether bears can take a breath.\par \par \uc2 This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice. The views, thoughts, and opinions expressed here are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect or represent the views and opinions of Cointelegraph.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/5e0eab52-1988-4148-953e-625307fef557.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231106ejb60005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 XRP price\par \b \uc2 Why is XRP price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 819 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 XRP's price is rising just days ahead of the commencement of \uc2 Ripple\uc2 's Swell conference in Dubai.\par \par \uc2 The price of XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is up, gaining over 10% on Nov. 6 reaching nearly $0.72, the highest levels in three months.\par \par \uc2 Why is XRP price up?\par \par \uc2 XRP's gains on Nov. 6 are part of a larger rebound trend that started Oct. 19 when New York investment firm Grayscale {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-new-spot-bitcoin-etf-nyse"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 refiled}}}\uc2  the application to convert its Bitcoin trust into a spot ETF with the \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC).\par \par \uc2 Since then, XRP's price has gained nearly 45%, replacing Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) to become the fourth-largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization as of Nov. 6.\par \par \uc2 In addition, XRP's \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has improved after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-ton-approval-dubai-international-financial-centre-free-trade-zone"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 winning}}}\uc2  regulatory approval in the Dubai International Financial Centre's free trade zone. In other words, financial institutions in the DIFC can now legally carry out transactions in XRP tokens.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/42bf47a9-a88e-469f-88fa-bc10f74c1823.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, gains in the XRP/USD pair come ahead of \uc2 Ripple\uc2 's Swell conference on Nov. 8-9 in Dubai \u8212\'20\'14 amid rumors that the blockchain payment firm may announce its Initial Public Offering (IPO) plans.\par \par \uc2 This year's SWELL may be very significant. Don't know what might be announced, but there are possibilities:\par \par \uc2 IPO\par \par \uc2 VARA license\par \par \uc2 CBDC\par \par \uc2 Stablecoin/tokenization\par \par \uc2 New users(!) - after a year of silence, we may gain more detail if {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Ripple?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Ripple}}}\uc2  still considers itself primarily a payment company.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 WrathofKahneman (@WKahneman) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WKahneman/status/1718034007877947630?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 October 27, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 The XRP market has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-pumps-and-dumps-amid-mysterious-51m-whale-transfers-what-s-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seen similar \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  reactions}}}\uc2  to the Swell event in the past.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  likely also received a boost last week from The \uc2 National Bank of Georgia\uc2 , which selected it for developing digital lari, its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-a-cbdc-why-central-banks-want-to-get-into-digital-currencies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 central bank digital currency (CBDC}}}\uc2  ) project.\par \par \uc2 XRP whale accumulation\par \par \uc2 XRP's price rally on Nov. 6 also comes on the backdrop of a strong accumulation behavior among its richest investors.\par \par \uc2 Notably, the supply held by addresses with a balance between 100,000 and 1 billion XRP tokens reached its highest level in November 2023, according to data resource Santiment.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/623dad53-e8e7-4fa5-a939-940b6209722d.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP whale accumulation in recent months (the yellow wave). Source: Santiment\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, XRP's social dominance, measuring its mentions across the crypto-oriented social media vs. top-50 cryptocurrencies, has risen to its highest levels since July 2023.\par \par \uc2 XRP open interest jumps 13.5%\par \par \uc2 XRP's climb accompanied modest gains in its derivative market.\par \par \uc2 For instance, the cryptocurrency's open interest (OI) \u8212\'20\'14 representing the aggregate notional of contracts still in play \u8212\'20\'14 jumped nearly 13.5% in the past 24 hours to $751.75 million. That is still lower than the $1.19 billion OI that tailed the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-wins-case-against-sec-as-judge-rules-xrp-is-not-a-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC vs. Ripple court decision}}}\uc2  in July.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/5e4beb4e-5ac3-4d0f-a50f-42f1ba263849.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP Futures OI (USD). Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, XRP's OI-weighted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/funding-rate-of-digital-assets-how-to-avoid-being-misled"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 funding rate}}}\uc2  has dropped to 0.01% every eight hours on Nov. 6 versus 0.03% yesterday. That equals 0.2% per week, indicating long positions are covering the leverage cost. However, note that funding rates below 1% per week are not considered expensive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/91c3902d-1aac-4eed-905e-02bc2e27be19.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP futures open-interest weighted funding rate, 8-hour. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Considering the lack of demand for leverage through futures contracts, it's reasonable to doubt whether the hype around Ripple's Swell has convinced derivative traders about more XRP price upside.\par \par \uc2 XRP technical analysis sees a 25% upside, nonetheless\par \par \uc2 From a technical perspective, XRP price is well-positioned for one last push upward before entering a possible correction period. Thus, the bulls will be eyeing $0.90 level into 2024.\par \par \uc2 The $0.90-target coincides with a resistance confluence comprising a multi-month ascending trendline (purple), a multi-year descending trendline (black), and the December 2021-April 2022 resistance range (red).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/982d8b93-a8c8-4aae-852e-eaa480a62623.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD weekly price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, this potential push toward $0.90 will place XRP's weekly relative strength index above 70, an overbought zone, heightening the risk of a correction. For example, XRP's price dropped over 50% after its RSI crossed above 70 in July 2023.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/4130a5ec-9e25-419e-8e59-692488b1b648.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD weekly price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downside target in this correction scenario appears near $0.55, down 20% from current price levels. This level coincides with XRP's resistance during the October 2022 and March-June 2023 sessions.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-lawyer-says-20m-settlement-is-win-for-ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto lawyer says $20M settlement is 99.9% win for Ripple}}}\par \par \uc2 Another reason to watch the $0.55 level is because it's the multi-month ascending trendline support for XRP/USD and its 50-week (red) and 200-week (blue) exponential moving averages (EMAs).\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-03/27adace7-91b4-4f1e-a47f-00f5c1e7cf7c.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231106ejb60002v\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/3: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, LINK, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,699 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s fall below $35,000 has pulled select altcoins lower, but charts suggest dip buyers are excitedly waiting.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) soared above $35,000 on Nov. 2 and that may have sucked in the aggressive bulls who speculated that the next leg of the up-move was beginning. However, the price quickly turned around and fell back below $35,000 signaling that the breakout may have been a fake move.\par \par \uc2 A mild correction during an uptrend does not signal a trend change. It is generally a healthy sign as it shakes out weak hands. When markets are trending higher, dips are viewed as a buying opportunity, but it is better to wait for the price to find a bottom before buying. Strong support levels could be watched as potential places where buyers step in to arrest the decline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/47a40723-d115-46f4-946e-fe637e497f7d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  founder and executive chairman \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  said in an interview with CNBC that if {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-cools-off-but-you-can-never-have-too-much-bitcoin-says-saylor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 traders hold a 12-month to 48-month time horizon}}}\uc2 , the current level is \u8220\'20\'1Ca pretty ideal entry point into the asset.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s weakness has pulled several altcoins lower. What are the important support levels where the decline could end?\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin surged above $35,280 on Nov. 1 and tried to build upon this rally on Nov. 2 but the bears had other plans. Sellers stalled the up-move at $35,985 and are trying to sustain the price below $35,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/40a8ab55-8c44-4351-9b8b-c461b8d5e267.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If they do that, the BTC/USDT pair may skid to $33,390. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if $33,390 cracks, the pair may fall to the 20-day exponential moving average ($32,611).\par \par \uc2 Generally, in an uptrend, the bulls fiercely defend the 20-day EMA. If the level holds, it will indicate that the trend remains positive. The bulls will then make one more attempt to kick the price to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that the bulls may be losing their grip. The pair may then tumble to $31,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls nudged Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the immediate resistance at $1,865 on Nov. 2 but the bears pulled the price back below the level, indicating strong selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/1e70b1de-02aa-4661-951b-75d4c309e021.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price to the strong support at $1,746. This remains the key level to keep an eye on because a break and close below it will signal that the bears are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bulls are likely to have other plans. They will try to buy the dips and again attempt to overcome the obstacle at $1,865. If they can pull it off, the ETH/USDT pair could start a rally to the psychologically critical level of $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the breakout level of $223 on Nov. 1, indicating that the bulls are fiercely defending this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/3d841416-982d-4166-adbc-ca92173d70d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to thrust the price above the $235 resistance on Nov. 2 but the bears held their ground. This suggests that the BNB/USDT pair is stuck between $223 and $235 for some time.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($223) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside. If bulls kick the price above $235, the pair may jump to $250 and eventually to $265. Conversely, the trend will shift in favor of the bears if they sink and sustain the price below $223.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is facing resistance near $0.61 but a positive sign is that the bulls have not lost ground to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/f1b6e7db-a78c-48f3-b6ec-4296a0e9e700.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buyers will try to drive the price to the overhead resistance at $0.67. This level may again pose a strong challenge to the buyers but if they bulldoze their way through, the rally could extend to $0.75 and subsequently to $0.85. The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.56) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to make a comeback, they will have to yank the price back below $0.56. The XRP/USDT pair may then collapse to the 50-day SMA ($0.52).\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) climbed above $38.79 on Nov. 1 and reached near the target objective at $48 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that traders aggressively booked profits at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/18d048e8-0aa6-4a2d-950a-d6b18a3d8224.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price rebounded off $38.79 on Nov. 2 but the bulls could not sustain the intraday highs, suggesting that every rally is being sold into. The bears will try to build upon their advantage and sink the SOL/USDT pair below $38.79.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it could start a downward move toward the 20-day EMA ($32.41). Such a deep correction will suggest an end to the up-move in the near term. The pair may then enter a consolidation phase for a few days.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to maintain their advantage, they will have to defend the $38.79 support. If the price turns up from this level with strength, the pair may retest the overhead resistance at $48.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) snapped back from the 20-day EMA ($0.28) on Nov. 1 and rose above $0.30, indicating that the bulls are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/b750d838-e959-442c-a40e-00034fb0e483.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price turned down from $0.33 on Nov. 2 but the bulls did not cede ground to the bears. This is a positive sign as it shows that the bulls are holding on to their positions as they anticipate the up-move to continue. The target on the upside is $0.38.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns lower and breaks below $0.30, it will indicate that the markets have rejected the higher levels. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then slump to the 20-day EMA ($0.28).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($0.06) on Nov. 1 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/fc07ec60-8f71-4a72-ae72-21cd55301d7d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price returned to the 20-day EMA on Nov. 3 but the long tail on the candlestick shows that the bulls are fiercely defending the level. Buyers are again attempting to propel the price above $0.07. If they are successful, the DOGE/USDT pair will attempt a rally to $0.08. This level may again witness strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price once again turns down from $0.07, it will signal that bears are selling on rallies. A break and close below the 20-day EMA will indicate that the bears are back in the game. The pair may then tumble to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-disappoints-while-markets-pro-delivers-88-gains-in-29-hours"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin disappoints while Markets Pro delivers 88% gains in 29 hours}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) rose to the overhead resistance of $2.31 on Nov. 2 but the bulls could not overcome the obstacle. This suggests that the bears are defending the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/264cfae7-df58-47a8-a2a8-0d5919094ac1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate that the bulls have a slight edge. A strong rebound off the moving averages will improve the prospects of a rally above $2.31. If this level is scaled, the TON/USDT pair could start its journey toward $2.59.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may swing between $1.89 and $2.31 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has been facing resistance near $11.50, indicating that the bears have not given up and continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/4ea0ec1f-a784-4152-9c7a-7383a78818db.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure to sustain the higher levels may have tempted short-term traders to book profits on Nov. 2. That pulled the price back toward the 20-day EMA ($10.11). This remains the key level to watch out for on the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the rebound off the 20-day EMA sustains, it will suggest strong demand at lower levels. The bulls will then make one more attempt to rise above $11.50. If they succeed, the LINK/USDT pair may surge to $13.50 and subsequently to $15. Contrarily, a slide below the 20-day EMA may result in a retest of $9.50.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been moving up gradually but the rally lacks momentum. This shows hesitation among the bulls to continue buying at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/c74ae06e-9fda-4b56-8a5d-7c078bfb7fcf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI near the overbought zone indicate that bulls have the upper hand. If bulls clear the overhead hurdle at $0.70, the MATIC/USDT pair could rally to $0.74 and then to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 The bears are currently posing a strong challenge near the overhead resistance at $0.70 but they will have to sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.61) to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. The pair may then oscillate inside the large range between $0.50 and $0.70 for a while.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTEvNWJmNjI3ZGEtY2Y4ZC00MDFmLTk5NWEtYjQzMzdkMzZmODI0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240105ejb30002y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
