\par\par \b \uc2 Are Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) and Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) On Track to Upstage Bitcoin?\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 1,173 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 November 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * ScapesMania: A Bold New Contender in Crypto\par \par \uc2 * Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ): Between Soaring Gains and \uc2 FTX\uc2 's Sell-Off Signals\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Technicals Suggest a Testing Time Ahead\par \par \uc2 * Conclusion: Investor Confidence Swells\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market recently experienced a ripple of excitement as Bitcoin confidently crossed the $35,000 mark, spurred by the Federal Reserve's unwavering stance on inflation. This upward trajectory has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/solana-sol-and-ethereum-eth-reach-local-tops-bitcoins-btc-turn-again"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mirrored by a sharp altcoin rally}}}\uc2 , led by Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), which witnessed a notable surge, reaching a 14-month high on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) also caught the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  wave, climbing significantly. Amidst this surge, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://scapesmania.io/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mmedia&utm_campaign=SOLADA"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ScapesMania}}}\uc2  (MANIA) is emerging as a presale project to watch, promising high returns with seemingly predictable patterns, standing out in the volatile crypto landscape.\par \par \uc2 Yet, the inherent \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the market casts a shadow of unpredictability. While \uc2 SOL\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  bask in their current gains, and MANIA draws speculative interest, each coin faces the reality of potential shifts, both \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 ScapesMania: A Bold New Contender in Crypto\par \par \uc2 While some are facing an uncertain future, the trajectory of a presale project is far easier to predict. ScapesMania ($MANIA) is a well-balanced, meticulously designed project that acts as a gaming ecosystem. Through DAO governance, backers will be able to influence and benefit from a multi-billion-dollar industry. A wide range of features paired with the best technology, a professional team, and a long-term, highly ambitious vision can make ScapesMania the next big thing in crypto. Presale discounts and stage bonuses only add to the project's appeal.\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live Now - Join Now for a Chance to Benefit with MANIA\par \par \uc2 Backed by an award-winning developer crew, ScapesMania stands for transparency: every member\u8217\'20\'19s social media profile is public. The project can achieve this not just by bringing big innovation to the game, but by putting its community front and center. Driving customer engagement and making sure that everyone benefits through great tokenomics and generous rewards is what makes ScapesMania the project with a bright future ahead.\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live, Learn More About Major Benefits\par \par \uc2 Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ): Between Soaring Gains and \uc2 FTX\uc2 's Sell-Off Signals\par \par \uc2 Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) is currently navigating the waters between $36.79 and $51.64, trading with an eye towards the next resistance point at $56.71. The cryptocurrency market has seen \uc2 SOL\uc2  carve out a 14-month high, showcasing a surge in \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  energy punctuated by an impressive 17% jump in value. This surge tops at $46, which is not just a 1-month and 13-week high but also aligns with the 52-week pinnacle.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/solana/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarketCap}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the rally of Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) is not without its cautionary tales. The technical landscape suggests that the 3-10 day MACD oscillator has stalled at $47.06, hinting at a possible deceleration in buying pressure, which could see \uc2 SOL\uc2  taking a breather before attempting any further ascents.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/3rzIBxxK/?symbol=COINBASE%3ABCHUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 On the flip side, potential \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressures loom as market whispers indicate possible sell-offs from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WuBlockchain/status/1719317003276820811?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FTX's recent moves}}}\uc2 . \uc2 FTX\uc2 's unstacking of million worth of tokens and the transfer of millions of \uc2 SOL\uc2  to exchanges could foreshadow a selling spree.\par \par \uc2 If this were to happen, Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) could see a retracement towards its first support point at $36.79. A breach below this level might intensify selling pressure, pushing prices towards the second support level at $31.72 or even lower. Key technicals to watch in this scenario include the price crossings of the 9 and 18-day moving averages, which are currently stalled, potentially flagging a slowdown in the momentum.\par \par \uc2 The seesaw between \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenarios for the altcoin is further complicated by contrasting market signals. While the recent tech upgrade and heightened blockchain activity have fueled its impressive run, up by nearly 350% this year, the shadow of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2022/12/ftx-co-founders-plead-guilty-to-fraud-charges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FTX and Alameda Research's collapse}}}\uc2  and the potential sell-off of their \uc2 SOL\uc2  holdings could cap this growth.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Technicals Suggest a Testing Time Ahead\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) teeters at a crucial juncture, currently nestled between the pivotal $0.291 support and eyeing the $0.319 second resistance point. The price's recent ascent past the $0.3 threshold could signal a push towards the $0.333 third resistance level, an area that marks a significant \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  target.\par \par \uc2 Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Technical indicators lend weight to this scenario, with the surge of altcoin aligning with a growing legion of long-term holders, now accounting for a substantial portion of the 2.7 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  addresses.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://app.intotheblock.com/coin/ADA/deep-dive?group=ownership&chart=timeHeld"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 IntoTheBlock}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the asset faces immediate headwinds at the $0.32 mark, where the MACD's hesitation could signal a loss of momentum.\par \par \uc2 A downturn would see Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) contending with various levels of moving average supports that have historically acted as staging grounds for rebounds, including the critical junctures at $0.287 where the price intersects with the 9-day moving average, and further down at the $0.266 and $0.258 marks, closely watched by traders for potential reversals. These levels could pivot from support to resistance if \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  fails to maintain its current pace, particularly if the price action stalls as it did when it last crossed the 40-day moving average near the $0.256 level.\par \par \uc2 The robust {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/IOHK_Charles/status/1719826983415156970"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 development activities led by Charles Hoskinson and IOG}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s drive to innovate within the Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) ecosystem could serve as a counterbalance to the short-term technical pressures. As the community anticipates the rollout of enhancements like CIP 1694 and IOG's strategic focus on broadening the asset's appeal to the wider crypto audience, the price of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could reflect the optimism of these fundamental developments.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion: Investor Confidence Swells\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market's pulse quickened as Bitcoin confidently claimed the $35,000 territory, igniting a rally across the board. Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) took the cue, notching significant gains. While the sharp incline of \uc2 SOL\uc2  has painted a 14-month peak, the price of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  swell aligns with a rising tide of long-term investor confidence. Yet, beneath the surface of these climbs, the ever-present market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  casts both shadow and light, hinting at the delicate balance of forces at play.\par \par \uc2 Amidst its commendable rally, Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) is at a critical juncture, with market dynamics hinting at a possible inflection point in its momentum. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , too, stands at a crossroads, with its push past the $0.3 mark suggesting a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascent could be in the cards, but not without the resistance of a skeptical MACD looming overhead.\par \par \uc2 As the community gazes ahead, the paths SOL and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  will tread represent not only the caprices of the market but also the enduring story of technological adoption, community engagement, and the intricate ballet of market forces.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231102ejb2000rt\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, LINK, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,635 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins could retest their respective support levels as bears try to make a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) skyrocketed 28.5% in October, its second-best monthly gain of the year behind the 40% rally in January. After the strong showing in October, the next question on investors\u8217\'20\'19 minds is, could the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum continue and Bitcoin extend its recovery going forward?\par \par \uc2 Bernstein said in a note on Oct. 31 that Bitcoin could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/10/31/bitcoin-could-hit-150000-by-2025-predicts-bernstein.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rally}}}\uc2  to $150,000 by 2025. The firm believes that the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  will approve a spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund by the first quarter of 2024 and the ETFs may attract up to 10% of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s circulating supply.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/0d7c2983-7571-49c2-bcae-ddeb006df89a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While the long-term looks \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  may pick up in the near term. On-chain monitoring resource Material Indicators believes that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-36k-fomc-target-bitcoin-uptober"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  momentum is weakening}}}\uc2  and may result in a retest of $33,000 but before that, they anticipate an attempt at $36,000.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin break above or below the current range? Could altcoins rally when Bitcoin consolidates?\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to propel Bitcoin above $35,280 on Nov. 1 but the bears did not relent. This suggests profit-booking at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/687817d4-28c5-45c0-a73d-228688b8cec5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is still in the overbought zone, indicating that the consolidation may extend for a few more days. The important level to watch on the upside is $35,280 and on the downside is $33,390.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the support, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day exponential moving average ($32,012). This level may witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the overhead resistance of $35,280 will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The pair may then climb to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been holding above the breakout level of $1,746 but the bulls are struggling to start the next leg of the uptrend. This suggests that the bears are trying to get back in the game.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/8be71791-7fdb-4589-802f-b9f5d5b84013.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The crucial level to watch on the downside is $1,746. If bulls flip this level into support, it will indicate that the sentiment has turned positive. That will enhance the prospects of a break above $1,865. The ETH/USDT pair may then surge to $2,000. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to gain the upper hand, they will have to tug the price back below the 20-day EMA ($1,723). That may catch the aggressive bulls on the wrong foot, leading to long liquidation. The pair may then slump to the 50-day SMA ($1,648).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are finding it difficult to maintain BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above $230, indicating that buying dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/9c2983ad-d4b0-4748-8eaa-8877aab745ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair has turned down and reached the breakout level of $223. Buyers are likely to defend the zone between $223 and the 20-day EMA ($220). If the price rebounds off this zone, the bulls will again attempt to kick the pair toward the overhead resistance of $235.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are back in control. The pair may then tumble to the 50-day SMA ($214).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the overhead resistance of $0.56 on Oct. 30. This indicates the start of a new up-move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/4cd72fa6-3696-49af-bbea-4c651155d3c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.54) has turned up and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the overbought zone, indicating that the bulls have a slight edge. Buyers will try to build upon the advantage and push the price to $0.67.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, the bears will try to pull the price back below the breakout level of $0.56 and the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the XRP/USDT pair may fall to the 50-day SMA ($0.52).\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong recovery. After hesitating for a few days near $34, the bulls asserted their supremacy and rose above the resistance on Oct. 30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/f889a6eb-98e7-4b53-bc5e-c9c647f5508c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The buying continued and the bulls overcame the obstacle at the overhead resistance at $38.79 on Nov. 1. If buyers maintain the price above $38.79, the SOL/USDT pair could next attempt a rally to $48.\par \par \uc2 While the trend remains up, the overbought levels on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  suggest that the rally is overheated in the near term. That may make it difficult for the bulls to continue the up-move. A break and close below $38.79 may tempt short-term traders to book profits. That may sink the pair to $34.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the minor resistance at $0.30 on Oct. 31, indicating that the short-term traders are booking profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/eb064f23-b29e-414b-9da8-39ff56e0ed70.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The nearby support on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($0.28). Buyers are expected to defend this level with vigor. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying at lower levels. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then once again reach $0.30.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the price continues lower and plummets below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that the pair may oscillate between $0.24 and $0.30 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been struggling to sustain Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the $0.07 resistance, suggesting that higher levels are attracting sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/7ceaf3b2-65e8-4936-a0b0-9a2eb82938df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls bought the dip to the 20-day EMA ($0.06) on Oct. 31 as seen from the long tail on the candlestick but they could not build upon this strength. Sellers are again trying to yank the price back below the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it will suggest that bulls are losing their grip. The DOGE/USDT pair may then slump toward $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price once again rebounds off the 20-day EMA with strength, it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.07 and start the up-move to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-crash-stablecoin-2019-top-warning"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin crash pre-halving? Stablecoin metric that marked 2019 top flashes warning}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has formed a range between $1.89 and $2.31 for the past few days. The price turned down from $2.27 on Oct. 31 indicating that the bears continue to sell near the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/24825c1a-19d7-41b8-9a91-c04b07438b92.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The TON/USDT pair has slipped to the immediate support at the moving averages. If the price rebounds off this level with force, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity. That will improve the prospects of a rally above the overhead resistance at $2.31. The pair may then surge to $2.59.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price continues lower and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been attempting to propel and sustain Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $11.50 but the long wick on the candlesticks shows that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/c419685c-c176-4874-b2e2-186d26343152.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The drop on Nov. 1, indicates that the bears are trying to pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($9.80), which is an important level to watch out for. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to push the LINK/USDT pair above $11.50. If they do that, the pair may rise to $13.50 and then to $15.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, sellers will be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat if they sink and sustain the price below $9.50. That may open the doors for a further fall to the 50-day SMA ($8.06).\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to propel Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $0.66 on Oct. 31 but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/d9b5d712-3d72-4d4a-8049-f0972f901156.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the MATIC/USDT pair could consolidate in a tight range between $0.60 and $0.66 for some time. The rising moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 If buyers shove the price above $0.66, the pair could start the next leg of the relief rally toward $0.77. However, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to sink the price back below $0.60 and trap the aggressive bulls.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTEvNTdiYjVmM2MtODcxZi00YTE0LThlZGEtOWUwMDc4MWI1MjNlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240105ejb10004w\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,681 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 October 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 After a brief correction, Bitcoin and altcoins are trying to resume their respective uptrends, indicating that bulls remain in control.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price climbed by 15% last week and 10.45% the week before. The S&P 500 Index dropped 2.53% last week and 2.39% the week before. This shows that Bitcoin has decoupled from the S&P 500 Index in the short term and may chart its own course.\par \par \uc2 However, the path higher may not be easy. The Federal Open Market Committee\u8217\'20\'19s meeting on Nov. 1 may cause some \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but it will li be short-lived as no surprises are expected. \uc2 CME\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s FedWatch Tool projects a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/uptober-40k-btc-price-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 98% probability that rates will remain unchanged}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/0c744498-aedc-47d4-a10d-30b8cf9f254a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 A large part of the gains in Bitcoin have been fuelled by expectations that the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  will approve a spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund in the near future. Any adverse news in this regard may prove to be a major setback for the bulls. When traders start chasing prices higher, it increases the risk of a short-term pullback.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels on Bitcoin and altcoins that need to hold for the sentiment to remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 ? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) remains in a strong downtrend. The price is close to the strong support zone between 4,050 and 4,100.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/df65ffed-a403-4f13-8f02-368aefd1d245.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sharp fall of the past few days pushed the relative strength index (RSI) into the oversold territory, suggesting that a pullback may be possible. On the upside, the bears are expected to sell near the 20-day exponential moving average (4,255).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then again try to sink the price below the support zone. If they succeed, the index could plummet toward 3,800. This negative view will invalidate in the near term if the price rises and sustains above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index (DXY) rebounded off the 50-day simple moving average (105) on Oct. 24, indicating that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/10661b38-f87d-45f1-a847-c7d6593e5ffa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages indicate advantage to buyers but the negative divergence on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. That could keep the index range-bound between 105.36 and 107.35 for some time.\par \par \uc2 If buyers maintain the price above the 20-day EMA (106.23), the bulls will attempt to drive the index above 107.35. If they succeed, the index may surge toward 111. If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to drag and sustain the price back below 105.36. The index may then fall to 104.50.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 After the sharp rally, Bitcoin has entered a consolidation phase between $33,390 and $35,380. This is a positive sign as it suggests that the bulls are in no urgency to book profits aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/3332cc1a-ebf7-4a3b-b88f-4b39057aaa35.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the overbought levels on the RSI warrant caution, the rising moving averages suggest that bulls remain in charge. If buyers drive the price above $35,280, the BTC/USDT pair could surge toward $40,000. This level is likely to act as a formidable resistance.\par \par \uc2 On the way down, if bears sink the price below $33,390, the pair risks a drop to $32,400 and then to $31,000. This zone is likely to witness solid buying by the bulls because if it cracks, the selling could intensify and the pair may plummet to $28,143.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been maintaining above the breakout level of $1,746 but the bulls have failed to extend the recovery. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/9b2219c3-3e54-4866-bfa0-190611c99e90.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair may stay range-bound between $1,746 and $1,865 for a few days. The rising moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought territory indicate that the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If buyers kick the price above $1,865, the pair could rally to $2,000. The bears are likely to guard this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 The important support on the downside is $1,746 and then the 20-day EMA ($1,705). Sellers will be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat if they sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck inside a large range between $235 and $203 for the past several days. The rising 20-day EMA ($219) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate that bulls have a slight edge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/40b4efd2-88fd-44f2-b631-7167601bab75.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains the rebound off $223, the bulls will again try to shove the price above the overhead resistance at $235. If they can pull it off, it will indicate the start of a sustained recovery to $250 and eventually to $265.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to yank the price back below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that the BNB/USDT pair may extend its stay inside the range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 After staying in a tight range between $0.56 and the 20-day EMA ($0.53) for the past few days, XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) cleared the hurdle on Oct. 30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/676d53dc-d8f0-414f-9b0d-54708104bbcf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought zone indicate that the bulls are at an advantage. There is a minor resistance at $0.59. If bulls overcome this barrier, the XRP/USDT pair is likely to climb to $0.66.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, it may trap several aggressive bulls. The pair may then remain stuck between $0.46 and $0.56 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 In an uptrend, the corrections are shallow and short-lived. That is what happened in Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ). After a minor pullback, the bulls have asserted their supremacy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/5553b247-1240-4651-84ec-d57aa86722cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair resumed its uptrend on Oct. 30 with a break above $33.90. The bulls will next try to push the price to $38.79. This level is expected to act as a major resistance but if buyers bulldoze their way through, the pair may reach $48.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is $31. If the pair slips below this level, it will suggest that the bulls may be dumping their positions in a hurry. That could pull the price down to the 20-day EMA ($28,73).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cme-second-largest-bitcoin-futures-exchange-open-interest-surges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CME becomes second-largest Bitcoin futures exchange as open interest surges}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the breakout level of $0.28 for the past few days but the bulls are finding it difficult to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/bf1c72fb-89fa-4415-a2be-4484736fe3f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Still, a positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground from the overhead resistance. This suggests that the buyers have kept up the pressure. If they overcome the roadblock at $0.30, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could start a rally to $0.32 and thereafter to $0.34.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from $0.30, it will suggest that the bears are aggressively defending the level. The pair may then swing between $0.28 and $0.30 for some time. A break and close below the 20-day EMA ($0.27) will tilt the advantage back in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the $0.07 mark.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/8069d831-2da4-47d2-9273-31a373e9ba3d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor positive is that the bulls are buying the dips below $0.07. This suggests that the sentiment has changed from selling on rallies to buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to overcome the obstacle at $0.07. If they can pull it off, the DOGE/USDT pair could start its northward march to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($0.06). If this support cracks, the pair could dive to the solid support at $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) broke below the moving averages on Oct. 27 but the bears could not build upon the advantage. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/e4553041-74d1-4524-8737-d720bba4cbbc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3ATONUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($2.07) has flattened out and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between buyers and sellers. If the price rises above the moving averages, the bulls will try to kick the TON/USDT pair above $2.31. If they do that, the pair may start its journey to $2.59.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are trying to gain the upper hand. A break below $2 could clear the path for a decline to $1.89.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTAvNTRlYzIyNWItZmU3NC00ZTkzLWFiMjctNDFkYzY5MzkxYzJhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240105ejau0006x\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/27: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, LINK, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,744 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 October 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin faces resistance at the $35,000 level, but charts indicate that bulls are not ready to throw in the towel.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading above $33,600 for the past two days, indicating that the bulls are not rushing to the exit. After a sharp rally, if the price does not give up much ground, it may cause FOMO and ignite another round of buying.\par \par \uc2 That could push the markets further into overbought territory. However, such rallies are rarely sustainable. They eventually turn down and retest the breakout levels. Hence, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s drop to $32,000 can not be ruled out.\par \par \uc2 The rally of the past few days pushed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dominance-hits-54-ahead-btc-halving"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance to 54%}}}\uc2 , its highest level in 30 months. The rise in market dominance shows that Bitcoin is leading the charge higher, which is a positive sign. This suggests that traders are favorably viewing the cryptocurrency space and select altcoins may join the party soon.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/7121b7ab-30cf-4bb4-b583-2776914df073.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Veteran trader Peter Brandt said in a post on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) on Oct. 26 that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s bottom is in but he warns that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-btc-price-peter-brandt-trader-all-time-high-chopfest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new all-time highs may not happen}}}\uc2  until the third quarter of 2024. Meanwhile, Brandt predicts Bitcoin to enter a \u8220\'20\'1Cchop fest.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin enter a corrective phase over the next few days or continue its upward march? Will altcoins join the party higher?\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is facing resistance at $35,000 but the bulls have not given up much ground. This suggests that the buyers may soon try to resume the up-move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/cfc3d0c6-9386-4f56-af0f-f4a5b2d18474.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The risk to a further rise is that the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) remains in the overbought area. This indicates the possibility of a minor correction or consolidation in the near term. If the price slides below $33,679, the BTC/USDT pair could retest $32,400 and then $31,000.\par \par \uc2 However, it is not certain that the overbought levels on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  will cause a correction. Sometimes, during a trend change from \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \uc2 RSI\uc2  tends to remain in overbought territory for a long time. That is because the smart buyers continue to accumulate on every intraday dip.\par \par \uc2 In this case, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $35,280, it will signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The pair may then skyrocket to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) long wick on the Oct. 26 candlestick shows that the bears are aggressively protecting the minor overhead resistance at $1,855.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/63dc5248-23b9-49a2-9609-698c0fc1f94d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($1,674) and the RSI near the overbought zone indicate that bulls have the upper hand. If the price turns up from $1,746, the bulls will again try to shove the ETH/USDT pair above $1,855. If this level is surmounted, the pair may skyrocket toward the psychologically important level of $2,000.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the up-move, they will have to quickly send the price back below the breakout level of $1,746. The pair may then tumble to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $235 on Oct. 24, indicating that the bears are active at this level. The sellers tried but failed to sustain the price below the strong support at $223.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/7898dc5e-80a9-47b5-9213-2c2e135c5bf9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This indicates that buyers are fiercely attempting to defend the support at $223. If the price rebounds off this level with strength, the BNB/USDT pair could once again try to rise above the overhead resistance at $235. If that happens, the pair may climb to $250 and subsequently to $265.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price once again turns down from $235, it will suggest that bears continue to sell at higher levels. A slide below $223 will tilt the advantage back in favor of the bears. The pair may then oscillate between $203 and $235 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the overhead resistance of $0.56.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/3cf211b3-cc7b-454c-a2ff-d67d1faf7a02.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.52) which is an important level to keep an eye on. If the price sharply rebounds off this level, it will suggest that every minor dip is being bought. The bulls will then again try to kick the price above $0.56.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will signal the start of a new up-move. The XRP/USDT pair could then soar to $0.71. This positive view will be negated in the near term if the price turns down and plunges below the 50-day SMA ($0.51). That will indicate a range-bound action between $0.46 and $0.56 in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the pattern target of $32.81 for the past few days. The bulls have not ceded ground to the bears, indicating that they anticipate another leg higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/4298b29b-cf6a-4c3a-91c1-ec813fb0c73d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 RSI\uc2  remains in the overbought zone, indicating that the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair may spend some more time in consolidation or witness a minor dip. If the price stays above $30, the possibility of a rally to $38.79 increases.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price skids below $30, the bears will attempt to yank the price to the 20-day EMA ($27.20). If this support gives way, it will signal that the sellers are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the $0.28 level for the past few days but the bulls haven\u8217\'20\'19t been able to start a strong relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/23a35743-815c-4df2-861b-4524f9d128ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to start a new up-move on Oct. 26 but the bears sold at higher levels as seen from the long wick on the candlestick. Encouraged by this, the sellers will try to tug the price back below the breakout level of $0.28. If they can pull it off, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may slump to the 20-day EMA ($0.26).\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up from $0.28 and rises above $0.30, it will signal that the bulls have flipped the level into support. The pair may then start its northward march toward $0.32. This level may act as a stiff barrier but if cleared, the next stop is likely to be $0.38.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong recovery for the past few days, indicating aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/f28b4068-0bff-4f56-bed7-83138e783bcf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed the price above the nearest resistance of $0.07 on Oct. 26 but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels. The bears are trying to pull the price back below $0.07 on Oct. 27. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could slide to the 20-day EMA ($0.06).\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from $0.07, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and every minor dip is being purchased. That could propel the price to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/floki-price-soars-140-memecoins-doge-pepe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FLOKI price soars 140% in a week \u8212\'20\'14 Are memecoins like DOGE, PEPE finally waking up?}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) found support at the moving averages in the past few days but the bulls failed to start a strong rebound off it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/009588f9-3ce5-4431-a050-2c7a9e8f0ef5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 That may have attracted selling by the bears who have dragged the price back below the moving averages on Oct. 27. The TON/USDT pair may slide to the crucial support at $1.89. Such a move will suggest that the pair may consolidate between $1.89 and $2.31 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up sharply from the current level, it will indicate that the bulls are buying on minor dips. That will improve the prospects of a break above $2.31. The pair may then surge to $2.59.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has been facing selling near the $11.50 mark as seen from the long wick on the candlesticks of the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/8380e80c-eef7-4971-a26a-97382046bf15.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor positive is that the bulls have not given up much ground. This suggests that the buyers are in no hurry to book profits as they anticipate the uptrend to continue. Sometimes, when an asset breaks out from a long consolidation, it may remain in the overbought zone for an extended period. That is a possibility with the LINK/USDT pair.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is $9.50 and then the 20-day EMA ($8.97). Buyers are expected to defend this zone with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the $0.60 resistance on Oct. 22 but the bulls are struggling to maintain the up-move. This suggests hesitation to continue buying at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/897fde5b-4d94-4df6-b39e-77cc34494bfb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The important level to watch on the downside is $0.60. If the price rebounds off this level with strength, it will signal that the bulls have flipped $0.60 into support. That will increase the likelihood of a break above $0.67. The MATIC/USDT pair may then soar to $0.77.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to sink the price back below the breakout level of $0.60. If they do that, several aggressive bulls may get trapped and the pair may plummet to the 20-day EMA ($0.57).\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTAvOGEyYzYxZjAtNWFhMy00NTM3LTg4OWMtY2QzZTlkODhlZmRlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240105ejar00087\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, LINK, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,772 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 October 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price continues to push higher as several factors point to the emergence of a higher timeframe bull trend.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) easily soared above the $31,000 to $32,400 resistance zone on Oct. 23, which came as a suprise to many market participants. Usually, the price tends to consolidate or hesitate near stiff overhead resistance levels but that was not the case this time around.\par \par \uc2 Market participants are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  as they anticipate a Bitcoin spot exchange-traded fund to receive approval sooner rather than later. Bloomberg ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2  said in a post on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) on Oct. 23 that the listing of \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  on the \uc2 Depository Trust & Clearing Corporation\uc2  (DTCC) was \u8220\'20\'1Call part of the process\u8221\'20\'1D of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-spot-bitcoin-etf-nasdaq-clearing-firm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bringing the ETF to market}}}\uc2 . He added that it was \u8220\'20\'1Chard not to view this as them getting signal that approval is certain/imminent.\u8221\'20\'1D However, a DTCC spokesperson later said that the listing of the said ETF has been there since August and it being there {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/black-rock-fined-25m-sec-incorrect-investment-disclosure"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 does not signal any regulatory approval}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/560e8781-1def-429c-88d2-c73b99bee687.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The rush to buy Bitcoin before the consent for a spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  is received is because analysts expect the prices to surge after the green light is received. \uc2 Galaxy Digital\uc2  research associate Charles Yu said in a blog post that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/galaxy-digital-soaring-bitcoin-price-increase-after-etf-launch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price may rally by 74.1%}}}\uc2  in the first year after an ETF is launched in the United States.\par \par \uc2 Is the recent rally in Bitcoin the beginning of a sustained strong up-move, or is it time to book profits? How will altcoins behave as Bitcoin price shows strength?\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin skyrocketed above the stiff overhead barrier of $31,000 to $32,400 on Oct. 23. This indicates the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/124677a1-843a-42d7-b512-1914ec86b181.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sharp rally of the past few days has sent the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) deep into the overbought territory. Sometimes, in the initial stages of a new bull move, the \uc2 RSI\uc2  tends to stay in the overbought zone for a long time.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is $32,400 and then $31,000. Buyers are expected to defend this zone with vigor. If the price turns up from this support zone, the bulls will attempt to drive the BTC/USDT pair to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a fall below $31,000 will indicate that the recent breakout may have been a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) range resolved to the upside with a break above $1,746 on Oct. 23, indicating a potential start of a change in trend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/a35144ef-bcc5-40fd-86fb-5a82c1574f63.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to stretch the rally on Oct. 24 but the long wick on the candlestick shows strong selling at higher levels. The important level to watch on the downside is $1,746. If bulls hold this level during the retest, the ETH/USDT pair may jump above $1,855. That could open the doors for a rally to $1,900 and then to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to drag the price back below $1,746 and trap the aggressive bulls. The pair may then slump to the 20-day EMA ($1,648). Such a move will suggest that the pair may extend its consolidation for some more time.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rallied above the immediate resistance of $223 on Oct. 23 but the bulls could not maintain the momentum and clear the hurdle at $235.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/4487fcca-d007-4366-ad83-f6ab76ed625a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers are trying to pull the price back below $223. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the BNB/USDT pair may swing between $203 and $235 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($215) has started to turn up and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. If the price turns up from $223, it will suggest that the bulls are buying on dips. That will improve the prospects of a rally above $235. The pair may then start a rally to $250 and eventually to $265.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating inside the large range between $0.41 and $0.56 for the past several months. The bulls pushed the price above the resistance of the range on Oct. 24 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears are trying to guard the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/c754c331-efd4-4bb9-9fa0-2f8fbea217e0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 In a range, traders generally sell near the overhead resistance and that is what is seen in the XRP/USDT pair. If the price reaches the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may remain inside the $0.56 to $0.46 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $0.56, it will indicate the start of a new up-move. The pair may first rise to $0.66 and thereafter attempt a rally to $0.71.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) reached the pattern target of $32.81 on Oct. 23 where traders may have booked profits. That started a correction on Oct. 24 which was short-lived.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/4cd1a749-0950-4583-a857-a076b5b43c46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and every minor dip is being purchased. Buyers pushed the price above $32.81 on Oct. 25, indicating the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair may next skyrocket to $38.79.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 RSI\uc2  remains in the overbought territory, indicating that the pair is at risk of witnessing a minor correction or consolidation in the near term. If the price slips below $29.50, the pair may tumble to $27.12. This level is likely to witness strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) jumped above the $0.28 resistance on Oct. 24 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears are selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/cc123d54-49a8-404f-b305-5c6333bfcd61.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair is likely to witness a tough battle near the $0.28 mark. If the price slips and sustains below this level, it will indicate that the markets have rejected the breakout. That could keep the pair inside the $0.24 to $0.28 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $0.28 and rises above $0.30, it will suggest that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That could start a new up-move toward $0.32. If this level is taken out, the pair may start its march toward $0.38.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rally met with heavy selling at $0.07 on Oct. 24 as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/42c1ef17-21d7-4998-8b88-fd1b7786b6af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair may enter a period of correction or consolidation in the near term. During that time, if the pair does not give up much ground, it will suggest that the bulls are not closing their positions in a hurry. That will enhance the prospects of a break above $0.07. The pair may then surge to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover on the moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought territory shows that bulls are in command. This advantage will tilt in favor of the bears if they drag the price below $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-45000-year-end-matrixport-predicts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Matrixport doubles down on $45K Bitcoin year-end prediction}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) turned down from $2.26 on Oct. 24, indicating that the bears are defending the resistance at $2.31.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/d4007789-4e40-4d57-b295-cd9a00d6cd69.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is at the moving averages. If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that the sentiment is positive and traders are buying the dips. That will increase the likelihood of a break above $2.31. If that happens, the TON/USDT pair could retest the formidable resistance at $2.59.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may consolidate between $1.89 and $2.31 for some time. The bears will be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat if they sink the price below $1.89.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) broke out of a multi-month consolidation on Oct. 22 when buyers drove the price above the overhead resistance of $9.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/f403b1eb-e383-4203-af6a-75ef9ef0e214.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers tried to tug the price back below the breakout level of $9.50 on Oct. 24 but the long tail on the candlestick shows aggressive buying at lower levels. The buying resumed on Oct. 25 and the LINK/USDT pair has continued its journey higher. The pattern target of the breakout from $9.50 is $13.50 but if this level is crossed, the pair may reach $15.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to pull the price back below $9.50. The overbought levels on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  alert traders that a minor correction or consolidation is possible in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) surged above the $0.60 resistance on Oct. 22, indicating accumulation at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/d6f594d4-b6ba-4e25-993c-3fa16bcf4a1d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.56) has started to turn up and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the overbought territory, signaling a potential trend change. If buyers maintain the price above $0.60, it will suggest the start of a new up-move. The MATIC/USDT pair could rise to $0.70 and then to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 The important level to watch on the downside is $0.60. A break below this level will suggest that the rally above $0.60 may have been a fake-out. That could trap the aggressive bulls, resulting in a drop to the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTAvN2I2YWYyNmMtZDBiYi00NDY3LWEwNjItNTRhOWM1YmY3OWI4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240105ejap000a3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
