\par\par \b \uc2 Can Ethereum (ETH), Ripple (XRP) and Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) Reach New Yearly Highs After Exploding In The Last 5 days? Experts Are Optimistic\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 404 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 October 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * ScapesMania: Rising Phenomenon\par \par \uc2 * Ethereum (ETH): Challenges and Potential\par \par \uc2 * Ripple (XRP): Celebrations and Cautions\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Restructuring on the Horizon?\par \par \uc2 * Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market has been experiencing a whirlwind of activity lately. Following a fiery trading session, US crypto stocks saw a slight dip in their earlier gains. Bitcoin, the primary catalyst for these stock surges, experienced a dip from its $35,000 peak to around $33,800. Mining companies, despite the fluctuations in Bitcoin's price, managed to stay in the green. Amidst the market's ups and downs, Ethereum (ETH), Ripple (XRP), and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) maintain their presence, each contributing to the market's complex dynamics. The market's current dynamics suggest that while there are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  tendencies, caution is advised due to potential \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . In this vibrant scenario, ScapesMania (MANIA) is emerging as a notable force, adding a layer of excitement and anticipation among traders and market watchers alike.\par \par \uc2 Throughout 2023, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://scapesmania.io/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mmedia&utm_campaign=ethxrpada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ScapesMania (MANIA}}}\uc2  ) has been rising at an even more impressive rate than Ethereum (ETH), Ripple (XRP), and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), raising the question of whether traders should even try and hold these coins, hoping for them to potentially reach new yearly highs, someday. Let's examine the current indicators!\par \par \uc2 ScapesMania: Rising Phenomenon\par \par \uc2 Many crypto experts pick ScapesMania as the best new project of 2023 and beyond. It manages to separate itself from the competition by offering holders a multitude of revenue streams and high potential ROIs during presale.\par \par \uc2 Companies and individual crypto traders looking for fast potential gains should definitely look into ScapesMania's proposition. Once the presale finishes, the price will soar, securing possible returns in the range of 400-500%. Right now, there's an active discount of close to 85%, but it won't last forever - the clock is ticking and all interested in leveraging this offer need to act fast.\par \par \uc2 When dissecting the tokenomics and other features of ScapesMania, it becomes clear that it's the best altcoin to hold now. The innovative gaming-related core idea, impressive presale numbers, $150,000 giveaway, undying social media hype, and other positive aspects can guarantee that ScapesMania will continue on its winning journey, so it makes sense to get involved as soon as possible.\par \par \uc2 Join Presale at a Discount on the Official Site \par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231025ejap000xd\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin price\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price rockets to $35K as ETF excitement grows\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Tom Mitchelhill \par \uc2 627 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 October 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The price of Bitcoin has broken the $35,000 mark following a fresh wave of excitement over the potential approval of a spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  in the future.\par \par \uc2 The price of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke through the $35,000 mark for the first time since May 2022, marking a staggering gain in the past 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 The price of Bitcoin suddenly spiked upward on Oct. 23, with BTC gaining more than 10% from $31,000 to over $34,000.\par \par \uc2 Less than two hours after breaking $34,000, Bitcoin reached as high as $35,300, according to data from TradingView. Bitcoin is currently changing hands for a price of $34,550.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/ca72a4be-4861-422c-9cbc-18e50f59c3e3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The price of Bitcoin surged to as high as $35,300 on Oct. 24. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sudden uptick in price for Bitcoin comes amid a fresh wave of interest in upcoming spot exchange-traded fund (ETF) approvals and a significant increase in overall trading volumes across spot markets.\par \par \uc2 The surge also came amid developments relating to \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s proposed spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 On Oct. 23, an X (formerly known as \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) post from analyst Scott Johnson pointed to two new pieces of information that could hint that a spot \uc2 Bitcoin \b \highlight22\uc2 ETF\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2  approval\b0 \highlight\uc2  is getting closer for the investment giant.\par \par \uc2 Johnson {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SGJohnsson/status/1716477694261485980?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1716477694261485980%7Ctwgr%5E3d7f14f558d5bed3f87ce173f2d0ee9756eb2a63%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fcointelegraph.com%2Fnews%2Fbitcoin-price-near-31-k-pivot-point-can-btc-bulls-keep-the-volume"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pointed}}}\uc2  out that \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  had secured a specific \u8220\'20\'1CCUSIP\u8221\'20\'1D license and may soon begin the process of \u8220\'20\'1Cseeding\u8221\'20\'1D its spot ETF product with cash as early as this month.\par \par \uc2 In response to the post, senior Bloomberg ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2  noted that seeding an ETF is \u8220\'20\'1Ctypically not a lot of money\u8221\'20\'1D and would be just enough to get an ETF going; however, he admitted that it is overall a good sign and marks \u8220\'20\'1Canother step in the process of launching.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Note: Seeding is typically not a lot of money just enough to get ETF going. So I wouldn't read this as 'omg \uc2 Blackrock\uc2  is buying a ton of bitcoin' at all but more the fact they doing it and disclosing it shows another step in the process of launching.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2  (@EricBalchunas) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/EricBalchunas/status/1716491230316486872?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 October 23, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 The sudden surge in price also came with a significant growth in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s spot trading volume. At the time of publication, spot trading volume had surged to more than $35 billion over the past 24 hours, a gain of 241% in the same time period, according to data {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 from}}}\uc2  CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin enjoyed the largest price impulse, the general tide of upward price momentum lifted other boats as well, with Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s native currency, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), growing 7%, while Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) gained a whopping 11%. Additionally, Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) was up 8%, while Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) lagged slightly with a 5% gain.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-spot-bitcoin-etf-nasdaq-clearing-firm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BlackRock\u8217\'20\'19s spot Bitcoin ETF now listed on Nasdaq trade clearing firm \u8212\'20\'14 Bloomberg analyst}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market commentators and community members were seemingly left dumbfounded by the sudden move upward \u8212\'20\'14 with independent journalist Autism Capital asking their 237,000 followers, \u8220\'20\'1CWhat the heck just happened?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Wait, what the heck just happened? {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/JFX0pr9fFI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/JFX0pr9fFI}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Autism Capital (@AutismCapital) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/AutismCapital/status/1716586346532516182?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 October 23, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Zooming out from the immediate price action, there seemed to be a favorable setup for the sudden growth in the price of cryptocurrencies, with \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data showing that \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products saw a fourth consecutive week of inflows.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/0f81ccc9-9f36-48a5-92df-b765ae7388d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Weekly \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment inflows. Source: \uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 Update (Oct. 24, 3:44am UTC): This article has been updated to include Bitcoin reaching a price of $35,300 in the hours following the rise to $34,000.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/ai-killed-translation-industry-easytranslate-boss-change-human-jobs/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18AI has killed the industry\u8217\'20\'19 \u8212\'20\'14 EasyTranslate boss on adapting to change}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/2594d800-36bc-4c27-95dc-5bd5f7de9bb9.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231024ejao00005\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/23: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,729 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 October 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The weakness in the U.S. Dollar Index could support Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rise even as the S&P 500 Index struggles.\par \par \uc2 October is proving to be a solid month for Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), as its price is nearing the 2023 high at $31,805. Generally, major resistances are not cleared in the first instance, as the bears come out in full force to guard the level. Therefore, a minor dip is to be expected, but that should not be considered as the start of a negative sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Buyers regroup at lower levels and try to form a higher floor. That triggers further buying and starts a rally. This is a possibility in Bitcoin, but risks remain. While the cooling of the U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) is a positive sign, the weakness in the S&P 500 Index (SPX) is a negative sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/9bf1c5f5-7164-4438-806f-1ce598367e77.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another risk to the rising cryptocurrency markets could come from the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/10/22/stock-market-today-live-updates.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surging}}}\uc2  10-year Treasury yield, which once again rose above 5%. The rise in the yields shows that market participants are losing hope that the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  will cut rates in the near future.\par \par \uc2 Could the frustration from the U.S. equities markets drive investors to the cryptocurrency markets? Will Bitcoin decouple from the S&P 500 Index and extend its up-move? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears successfully held the retest of the neckline of the head-and-shoulders pattern in the S&P 500 Index. The failure to shove the price above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) (4,382) attracted aggressive selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/ce961364-e95d-4483-945e-35fd750c0856.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The index dropped below the crucial support at 4,216 on Oct. 23, but the bulls are trying to halt the decline. Any recovery attempt is likely to face strong selling at the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) (4,317) and then at the 50-day SMA. The bulls will have to thrust the price above 4,400 to signal that the correction may be over.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and maintains below 4,216, the selling may accelerate further, and the index could nosedive toward the pattern target of 4,088.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. The bulls tried to push the price toward the local high of 107.35, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/c1670fb9-1654-400c-a686-d3d5a2432377.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sellers are attempting to sustain the price below the breakout level of 106. If they manage to do that, the index may witness profit booking and tumble to the 50-day SMA ($105) and then to 104.50. This zone is likely to witness solid buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this zone, the bulls will again try to propel the index above 107.35. If they can pull it off, the index may surge to 108 and eventually to 111.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price slides below 104.50, it will indicate that the bears are back in the game. The index may then slump to 103.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 After struggling to sustain above $30,000 for the past three days, the bulls made a decisive move on Oct. 23 and pushed the price of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) to $31,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/b448d154-505b-43b7-907e-9ff35b9868ca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sharp rally of the past few days has pushed the relative strength index (RSI) into the overbought territory, indicating that a consolidation or correction is possible in the short term. On the way down, if bulls do not allow the price to slip below $30,000, it will suggest that every minor dip is being purchased. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the hurdle at $31,000.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to $32,400. The bears are expected to defend this level with all their might because if the $32,400 resistance is cleared, the pair may soar to $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down sharply and breaks below $30,000, it will suggest that traders are booking profits. That may sink the price to the 20-day EMA ($28,428).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the moving averages on Oct. 21, indicating that the bulls continue to buy the dips to the strong support at $1,531.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/3ee7ecdd-29db-4f6e-aa6b-9d5d934048a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1,608) has started to turn up, and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that the bears may be losing their grip. The ETH/USDT pair could rise to $1,746, where the bears will try to stall the up-move.\par \par \uc2 If bulls do not give up much ground from this level, the likelihood of a rally above $1,746 increases. The pair could then move up to $1,880. Instead, if the price turns down sharply from $1,746, it will indicate that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the downtrend line on Oct. 22, invalidating the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. The failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/8802ab14-e20a-43a0-a081-a24a4912b308.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair has reached the horizontal resistance at $223. If this obstacle is overcome, the pair could rally to $243 and thereafter to $250. The bears are expected to guard this zone with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly drag the price below the moving averages. That may open the doors for a retest of the vital support at $203. A slide below this level could start the next leg of the downtrend to $183.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose above the moving averages on Oct. 19, and the bulls have maintained the price above this level since then.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/0314e877-a0ad-4e48-857c-3f6fa9e56df2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price to the overhead resistance at $0.56. In a range, traders generally sell the rally to the resistance. If the price turns down sharply from $0.56, it will suggest that the XRP/USDT pair may extend its stay inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up gradually, and the RSI has risen into the positive territory, indicating that the bulls have the upper hand. If buyers kick the price above $0.56, the pair may start a rally to $0.66 and subsequently to $0.71.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to start a pullback in Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) on Oct. 22, but the bulls did not give up much ground. This suggests that the bulls are in no hurry to close their positions as they expect the up-move to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/1a6e9fb6-821a-46dc-9fca-ea76322af0cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buying resumed on Oct. 23, and the bulls started the upward journey toward the pattern target of $32.81, but the bears again sold at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 The sharp rally of the past few days has pushed the RSI into overbought territory, indicating that a minor correction or consolidation is possible in the near term. If the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair continues lower from the current level, the bulls will try to arrest the decline at $27.12 and then at the 20-day EMA ($24.56).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-must-break-31k-2023-bearish-fractal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price must break $31K to avoid 2023 '\b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22  fractal'}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned up sharply from $0.24 on Oct. 19 and rose above the moving averages on Oct. 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/625a8705-e66d-4910-af5c-139dd3514a98.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buying picked up further, and the bulls are trying to drive the price above the overhead zone between $0.27 and $0.28. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair will complete a triple-bottom pattern, signaling the start of a sustained recovery. The pair may rise to $0.32 and thereafter to $0.38.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent this up-move, they will have to tug the price back below the moving averages. The advantage will shift in favor of the bears on a break and close below $0.24.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "