\par\par \b \uc2 Solana (SOL) Is Up 30% Over The Past Week. Will Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) And Ripple (XRP) Be Next For The Pump?\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 495 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 October 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * Summary:\par \par \uc2 * ScapesMania (MANIA): Growth During Time of Change\par \par \uc2 * Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ): Critical Review For Rising Crypto\par \par \uc2 * Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Current Market Reality\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 * Ripple (XRP): Legal Hurdles\par \par \uc2 * Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 * Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The crypto market is on the cusp of change, with unconfirmed reports suggesting a potential SEC approval for a Bitcoin spot ETF, an event that market prices have yet to reflect. This development could catalyze a significant market movement, not just for Bitcoin but also for major players like Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), and Ripple (XRP). Industry leaders express optimism, forecasting that the approval could come as soon as 2023, signaling a major shift in the acceptance of cryptocurrencies as mainstream assets. The market's sensitivity to these developments indicates a readiness for a substantial \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  response upon official announcements. Amidst these market anticipations, new entrants like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://scapesmania.io/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mmedia&utm_campaign=nexpump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ScapesMania (MANIA)}}}\uc2  are also lining up, seeking to capitalize on the evolving landscape.\par \par \uc2 The price of Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) seems to have fully recovered after an astonishing 30% increase over the last week. Will Cordano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Ripple (XRP) be next in line, or will a new market participant overtake them? Let\u8217\'20\'19s find out!\par \par \uc2 Summary:\par \par \uc2 ScapesMania (MANIA) emerges as a novel force in the crypto arena, promising a unique blend of gaming integration and immediate token accessibility, setting the stage for its market ascent.\par \par \uc2 Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) faces a critical phase, with technical setbacks and market skepticism clouding its once-promising trajectory, necessitating urgent strategic reforms.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) confronts harsh market realities, with its profitability in question despite technological prowess, signaling a need for comprehensive internal reassessment.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) navigates through legal hurdles, with temporary relief from SEC charges offering only a momentary boost amidst ongoing judicial uncertainties impacting its market stance.\par \par \uc2 ScapesMania (MANIA): Growth During Time of Change\par \par \uc2 Many crypto experts pick ScapesMania as the best new project of 2023 and beyond. It manages to separate itself from the competition by offering holders a multitude of revenue streams and high potential ROIs during presale.\par \par \uc2 Companies and individual crypto traders looking for fast potential gains should definitely look into ScapesMania's proposition. Once the presale finishes, the price will soar, securing possible high returns. Right now, there's an active discount of close to 85%, but it won't last forever - the clock is ticking and all interested in leveraging this offer need to act fast.\par \par \uc2 When dissecting the tokenomics and other features of ScapesMania, it becomes clear that it's the best altcoin to hold now. The innovative gaming-related core idea, impressive presale numbers, $150,000 giveaway, undying social media hype, and other positive aspects can guarantee that ScapesMania will continue on its winning journey, so it makes sense to get involved as soon as possible.\par \par \uc2 Join Presale at a Discount on the Official Site \par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231023ejan000jh\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,690 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 October 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are gaining \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum, but are the trading volumes sustainable?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rose above $30,000 on Oct. 20, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-new-spot-bitcoin-etf-nyse"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Grayscale Investments filing a new application}}}\uc2  with the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  for a new spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund (ETF) may have acted as a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trigger.\par \par \uc2 In other positive news for the cryptocurrency space, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-dismiss-lawsuit-brad-garlinghouse-chris-larsen"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC sought to dismiss all claims}}}\uc2  against \uc2 Ripple\uc2  CEO \uc2 Brad Garlinghouse\uc2  and executive chair \uc2 Chris Larsen\uc2 . This will increase expectations that the regulator may slow down its attack on cryptocurrency entities following a string of recent setbacks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/78bf6d84-4b48-4dd0-9f4b-97578cc14ea1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 As the market sentiment improves, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s long-term holders have been increasing their stockpiles. Glassnode data shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-long-term-investors-own-76-percent-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 76.2% of the available Bitcoin is locked up}}}\uc2  in long-term storage. This will likely cause a supply crunch in the market, which is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin maintain its momentum and rise higher? Will the altcoins also follow? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the $28,143 resistance on Oct. 16, and the bulls held the level successfully during the retest on Oct. 17 and 18. This indicates that the buyers flipped the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/79705806-85c0-4647-8812-c3508ebddbbc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($27,769) has turned up, and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the overbought zone, indicating that the bulls have the upper hand. The buyers will try to sustain the price above $30,000 and challenge the stiff overhead resistance zone between $31,000 and $31,805. Sellers are expected to protect this zone with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to prevent the upside, they will have to quickly yank the price back below $28,143. If they do that, the BTC/USDT pair could plummet to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($26,882).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) once again bounced off the strong support near $1,531, as seen from the long tail on the Oct. 19 candlestick. This shows that the bulls are fiercely defending the $1,531 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/7e90382f-5cd5-4fea-8ee4-c4a7f3818768.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The repeated failure of the bears to break the $1,531 level is likely to attract buyers. The 50-day SMA ($1,613) may act as a hurdle, but if crossed, the ETH/USDT pair could pick up momentum and attempt a rally to $1,746.\par \par \uc2 Although the downsloping moving averages indicate an advantage to bears, the positive divergence on the RSI suggests that the negative momentum is reducing. The bears will be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat if they sink the price below $1,531.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the downtrend line on Oct. 16, but a positive sign is that the bulls did not allow the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($210). This indicates a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/ce80ddcd-24c7-4def-95f8-9d7249f5a821.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will once again try to drive and maintain the price above the downtrend line. If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could accelerate to $235 and thereafter extend the rally to $250. The bears are likely to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA, and the next is $203. A break and close below this level will open the doors for a possible decline to the next major support at $183.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the moving averages on Oct. 16, but the bears could not sink the price below the immediate support at $0.46. This suggests a lack of selling at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/28199404-18aa-4bdb-a632-24ab15caa627.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have flattened out, and the RSI is just above the midpoint. This suggests that the XRP/USDT pair may oscillate between $0.46 and $0.56 for some time. If the price stays above the moving averages, the pair may rally to the overhead resistance at $0.56.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price falls below the moving averages, it will increase the possibility of a drop to $0.46. The next trending move is likely to begin above $0.56 or below $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) soared and closed above the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders (H&S) pattern on Oct. 19, completing the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/44cfa45e-5cf0-4e5c-8467-5616ba56dd13.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buying continued on Oct. 20, and the bulls are trying to thrust the price above the immediate resistance at $27.12. If they can pull it off, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rise toward the pattern target of $32.81.\par \par \uc2 Usually, after breaking out of a major resistance, the price turns down and retests the breakout level. In this case, the price may return to test the neckline. If the price turns up from this level, the pair may start a new up-move. A break and close below $23 could shift the advantage back in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) once again slipped to the strong support at $0.24 on Oct. 19, but the bulls held the level successfully. The positive divergence on the RSI indicates that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/957889dd-44b1-4b2e-9eb2-1bc1cf6eed1f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the moving averages, which are likely to act as a strong hurdle. If bulls overcome this resistance, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could first rise to $0.27 and subsequently to $0.28. The bears are expected to fiercely guard this zone.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.28, it will signal that the pair may form a range for a few days. On the downside, the bears will have to tug the price below $0.24 to indicate the resumption of the downtrend. The next support is at $0.22 and then at $0.20.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) Oct. 19 candlestick shows that the bulls are aggressively buying in the zone between $0.055 and $0.06.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/97ef71d6-9240-4e60-94f1-42c6b03a7a7c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to shove the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.06) to indicate a comeback. That could clear the path for a potential rise to the overhead resistance at $0.07. This level may witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears, but if the buyers prevail, the DOGE/USDT pair could surge to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the moving averages, it will indicate that the bears remain active at higher levels. A tumble below $0.055 will signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-xrp-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is XRP price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) broke below the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $1.98 on Oct. 12, but the bears could not capitalize on this weakness. The bulls purchased the dip and pushed the price back above $1.98 on Oct. 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/93b1b515-0266-4140-b2e2-78ee3ca9834e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to halt the recovery at $2.20, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to slip back below the moving averages. This suggests that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying the dips.\par \par \uc2 If buyers kick the price above $2.20, the TON/USDT pair will complete a small inverted H&S pattern. The target objective of this setup is $2.47. This positive view will be invalidated if the price turns down and slumps below $1.89.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong downtrend. The bears tried to extend the decline on Oct. 19, but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/457713b0-d9cc-4985-a66c-7015cf9f606e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is likely to reach the breakdown level of $3.91, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense. If the price turns down from this level, it will indicate that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will again try to pull the price below $3.56 and start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price breaks above $3.91, it will suggest the start of a stronger recovery. The DOT/USDT pair could then climb to the downtrend line. A break above $4.33 will signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the moving averages for the past few days, but the bears have failed to break the support at $0.49. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/2ad4a749-09f4-4042-b1db-fd611795b4a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The positive divergence on the RSI also shows that the selling pressure could be reducing. If buyers catapult and sustain the price above the moving averages, the MATIC/USDT pair could surge to the overhead resistance at $0.60. This level may again attract selling by the bears. The pair is likely to swing between $0.49 and $0.60 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, $0.49 remains the key level to keep an eye on. If this level gives way, the pair may plummet to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/d49d4bfe-367e-4d63-9645-f1285507bb5b.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231020ejak000ba\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
