\par\par \b \uc2 Hot or Not? The Ultimate Price Prediction for Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), and Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 )\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 782 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 October 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * Bitcoin (BTC) \u8211\'20\'13 A \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Buzz in the Air\par \par \uc2 * The Ethereum (ETH) Equilibrium: Dueling Between Doldrums and Dynamism\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) \u8211\'20\'13 Navigating Between \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Breezes and \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Blasts\par \par \uc2 * Conclusion\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s hash rate skyrocketed, achieving a monumental increase in its computational power, as depicted by the surge from 261 EH/s to a whopping 455 EH/s within just a year. Not just that, luxury brands like Ferrari have stepped into the crypto space, allowing crypto enthusiasts to purchase their dream cars with digital currencies. Though crypto\u8217\'20\'19s inherent \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  has deterred many traditional companies from embracing it, its foothold in the market is undeniable.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin (BTC) \u8211\'20\'13 A \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Buzz in the Air\par \par \uc2 The Bitcoin ecosystem has been buzzing with exciting news. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/10/sec-garners-support-in-its-ongoing-lawsuit-against-coinbase"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The US SEC}}}\uc2  is rumored to have approved a spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 , stirring a rapid price surge for the pioneer cryptocurrency. Edward Snowden\u8217\'20\'19s recent statements during the 2023 Bitcoin Conference in Amsterdam emphasize Bitcoin's significance in the contemporary world \u8211\'20\'13 presenting it as a beacon against governmental oversight and fiat currency devaluation.\par \par \uc2 Despite the uncertainty surrounding the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/10/sec-doesnt-plan-to-appeal-grayscale-bitcoin-etf-decision"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETF news}}}\uc2 , BTC\u8217\'20\'19s price displayed a rapid increase. Its significance in the realm of privacy and its continual fight against government and institutional opposition has made it the talk of the town. However, a slight hiccup occurred when rumors regarding the \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 's approval were refuted by outlets like \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is currently trading above $28K. It stands above its 10-day Moving Average but slightly above its 200-day Moving Average, suggesting \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 Given the current traction and if it sustains above the resistance of $29,029.85, BTC might aim for the $31,600.32 mark. On the downside, if Bitcoin breaks below its support level of $23,888.91, it might further slump to $21,318.44.\par \par \uc2 The Ethereum (ETH) Equilibrium: Dueling Between Doldrums and Dynamism\par \par \uc2 Ethereum is gearing up for some transformative changes. Its founder, \uc2 Vitalik Buterin\uc2 , has proposed a novel two-tiered staking mechanism that could redefine Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s very essence, promoting efficiency and decentralization.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/09/ethereum-staking-pools-reach-consensus-on-22-ownership-limit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum's staking}}}\uc2  yield has witnessed a decline, dropping to 3.5% from over 5% in the past few months. However, the Ethereum validator queue's emptying signals a potential slowdown in mainnet activity, at least for the foreseeable future.\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, Ethereum is currently trading around $1,500K. It is situated below both its 10-day Moving Average of 1576.67 and its 200-day Moving Average of 1793.04, indicating potential \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure in the short term.\par \par \uc2 If Ethereum manages to surpass its first resistance level at $1,794.08, it could then target the next resistance at $1,955.98. On the contrary, should Ethereum dip below its primary support of $1,470.28, the next potential support is at $1,308.38.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) \u8211\'20\'13 Navigating Between \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Breezes and \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Blasts\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s founder, \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , recently addressed long-standing conspiracy theories linked with the XRP community and Ethereum's supposed sway over the SEC. While he dismissed the allegations, he emphasized the significance of relying on factual evidence over conjectures.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/tag/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  is currently trading between $0.2409 and $0.2630. It's situated just above its 10-day Moving Average at $0.2499, hinting at a mild \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum in the short-term. However, it's trading significantly below its 200-day Moving Average at $0.3135, which signals an overall \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend in the longer-term perspective.\par \par \uc2 If \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  manages to push beyond its first resistance level at $0.2721, there's potential for it to reach the next resistance at $0.2942. This would be more plausible if there are significant positive news or developments in the Cardano ecosystem. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Scenario: On the other hand, should \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  fall below its immediate support of $0.2279, it might aim for the second support level at $0.2058. A break below this level, especially coupled with adverse market news, could be a cause for concern among \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  holders.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The crypto space continues to be an environment of high \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and unpredictability. Each of the cryptocurrencies, be it Bitcoin, Ethereum, or Cardano, carries its own set of narratives and market dynamics. Staying updated, well-researched, and cautious in your approach to investing or trading in this space is crucial. Always use accurate data, understand the inherent risks, and if possible, seek professional advice when making decisions.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231017ejah000gp\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/16: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,731 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 October 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Stocks are up. Bitcoin is up. Altcoins are up. Cointelegraph digs into today's market breakout.\par \par \uc2 After two successive weeks of gains, the S&P 500 Index (SPX) started the week on a positive note. This suggests a risk-on sentiment which is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign. The \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/10/15/stock-futures-today-live-updates.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pick up}}}\uc2  as 11% of the S&P 500 companies are expected to report results this week.\par \par \uc2 The risk-on sentiment could boost buying interest in select cryptocurrencies. One area where \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  activity is seen is the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC). {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-gbtc-discount-falls-spot-bitcoin-etf-approval"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s legal victories have reduced the discount}}}\uc2  on the GBTC to its lowest level since 2021. This indicates that the investors are factoring in the possibility that the trust will finally convert into a spot Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) ETF.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/87f0cd9b-d8ae-469f-b28b-1dc89a49d15d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 When the price does not break below the support levels on bad news and rises above the overhead resistance on favorable news, it shows that the shorts are running low on confidence. This increases the likelihood of an up-move in the near term.\par \par \uc2 What are the important overhead resistance levels on Bitcoin and altcoins that need to be crossed to start an uptrend? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) turned down from the 50-day simple moving average (4,401) on Oct. 12, but the bears could not sink the price below the important level at 4,325.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/ac59a3b2-75cb-4c33-9a7a-ee844d67c06a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (4,341) is flattening out and the relative strength index (RSI) is just above the midpoint, suggesting that bulls have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to thrust the price above the overhead resistance zone between the 50-day SMA and the downtrend line. If this zone is surmounted, the index will signal the end of the corrective phase.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below 4,325, it will indicate that bears are fiercely defending the 50-day SMA. The index may then retest the pivotal support at 4,216.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index (DXY) corrected from 107.34 on Oct. 3 and dipped to the 20-day EMA ($106) on Oct. 10. In an uptrend, traders generally buy the dips to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/0f65d41a-a277-4b72-a56e-c6f7f5dd70fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Here too, the bulls bought the dip to the 20-day EMA, which started a rebound. The bulls will try to push the price above the 107.34 to 108 resistance zone. If they succeed, the index could start a strong rally toward 111.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to guard the overhead zone and tug the price below 105.50. If this support cracks, the index may dip to the 50-day SMA ($104.81). This is an important level for the bulls to defend if they want to keep the up-move intact. Below this level, the index could fall to 103.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 After trading between the moving averages for the past few days, Bitcoin made a decisive move on Oct. 16 when bulls kicked the price above the 20-day EMA ($27,224).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/e98bdcb7-4d0a-4eeb-a79d-a6106706b79f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The momentum picked up further and the BTC/USDT pair skyrocketed above the $28,143 resistance. However, the euphoria was short-lived as the bears aggressively sold at higher levels and yanked the price back below $28,143.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up and the RSI has jumped into positive territory, indicating that the bulls have a slight edge. If buyers achieve a close above $28,143, the pair may march toward $30,000 and then to $31,000.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below the 50-day SMA ($26,715) will tilt the advantage in favor of the bears. The pair may first plummet to $26,000 and then to $24,800.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating between $1,531 and $1,746 for the past several days. Generally, in a range, traders buy near the support and sell at the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/1356849b-b692-4df2-be06-02e69e588a3e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers purchased the dip to $1,521 on Oct. 12 which started a relief rally. The bulls attempted to drive the price above the moving averages on Oct. 16 but the long wick on the candlestick shows aggressive selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the bears will make one more attempt to sink and sustain the price below $1,521. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair may collapse to $1,368.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, the bulls will again attempt to push and sustain the price above the moving averages. If they can pull it off, the pair could jump to $1,746. This level is again likely to witness strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the strong support at $203 and nudged above the downtrend line on Oct. 16. However, the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/6b3f35de-ad8d-4a86-a8c7-2ed5521565e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($210) has flattened out and the RSI is above the midpoint, suggesting that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again try to take advantage of this situation and propel the price above the downtrend line. If they can maintain the higher levels, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. The BNB/USDT pair may then climb to $235 and later to $250.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the price turns down and plunges below the vital support at $203. The pair may then tumble to $183.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck inside the large range between $0.41 and $0.56 for the past several days. The bulls are trying to start a pullback, which is likely to face stiff resistance at the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/8c08efe6-fd94-4722-9d0d-d38bcc696a7e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that every minor relief rally is being sold into. That will increase the possibility of a drop to $0.46. If this level also fails to hold, the XRP/USDT pair may descend to $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if bulls thrust the price above the moving averages, it will indicate solid buying at lower levels. The pair will then attempt a rally to $0.56. The bears are expected to protect this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) surged above the near-term resistance of $22.50 on Oct. 16, indicating that the bulls are trying to take control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/1bcfe319-acf0-400b-bdd0-955a7b6d006e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price to the neckline of the inverse head and shoulders pattern but could not scale the level. This is an important resistance to keep an eye on because a close above it will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The SOL/USDT pair may then start an up-move to $27.12 and later to the pattern target of $32.81.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to quickly drag the price back below the 50-day SMA ($20.56). The pair may then dip to $18.50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-mining-difficulty-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mining BTC is harder than ever \u8212\'20\'14 5 things to know in Bitcoin this week}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the strong support near $0.24, indicating that the bulls are fiercely defending this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/2dbfd48a-2966-48f0-b03b-9d25ed007550.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The immediate resistance on the upside is from the moving averages. Buyers tried to overcome this obstacle on Oct. 16 but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels. If bulls do not give up much ground from the current level, it will improve the prospects of a rally above $0.28. This level may again behave as a resistance but if cleared, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could reach $0.30.\par \par \uc2 The important level to watch on the downside is $0.24. If the price turns down from the moving averages, it will increase the likelihood of a drop below $0.24. A break below this crucial support could sink the pair to $0.22 and subsequently to $0.20.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovered to the breakdown level of $0.06 on Oct. 14, indicating that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/7360d100-32a0-4998-8db8-c90b2532e4a9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.06) is flattening out and the RSI is near the midpoint, signaling that the selling pressure could be reducing. If buyers drive and maintain the price above the moving averages, it will suggest the start of a new up-move to $0.07. This level may again act as a stiff hurdle but if cleared, the DOGE/USDT pair could reach $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the $0.055 to $0.06 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has been trading below the moving averages since October 12 but a positive sign is that the bears have not been able to capitalize on this weakness. This indicates a lack of selling at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/1a24da99-94cb-44f8-8b28-c3032e15ba09.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3ATONUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price back above the moving averages but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears are in no mood to relent. Sellers will again try to sink the price below $1.89 and start a deeper correction. The next support on the downside is at $1.80 and then $1.60.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to signal a comeback, they will have to push and sustain the price above the moving averages. The TON/USDT pair could first rise to $2.20 and then to $2.31.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/7c9533f3-fb57-4742-a4e8-46b6832439d9.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231016ejag000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
