\par\par \b \uc2 Massive Gains or Total Collapse? See Where LINK, MATIC, and XRP Stand\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 2,675 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 October 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * Chainlink (LINK): The \uc2 Oracle\uc2 's Play in Tokenized Real-World Assets\par \par \uc2 * Polygon (MATIC): The Hardfork and What Lies Ahead\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): The Blockchain's Quest for Decentralization and Profitability\par \par \uc2 * \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP): The Underlying Waves of the Financial System\par \par \uc2 * Polkadot (DOT): Navigating Through Decentralization and Organizational Transformations\par \par \uc2 * Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The US Oversight and Accountability Committee has issued a warning to \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2  for not disclosing documents pertaining to the SEC's role in European social engineering initiatives. The committee's growing frustration stems from a four-month-long wait for the requested information.\par \par \uc2 Since Gensler's appointment to the SEC, he has displayed a cautious stance towards cryptocurrencies, equating them to "poker chips". Following the collapse of the \uc2 FTX\uc2  cryptocurrency exchange, Gensler intensified regulatory scrutiny, resulting in lawsuits against major industry entities like \uc2 Binance\uc2  and \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 . It's also noteworthy that while Gensler's crypto regulatory approach has garnered attention, he has been proactive in introducing rules to the traditional financial sector, surpassing efforts made by his predecessors since the 2008 financial crisis.\par \par \uc2 The macroeconomic picture appears to be centered on relaxing financial conditions. Recent US Consumer Price Index (CPI) figures revealed unexpectedly high inflation, exceeding analysts' projections. With the ongoing debate surrounding potential interest rate hikes by the \uc2 US Federal Reserve\uc2 , predictions remain divided. Historically, Bitcoin's valuation has appreciated significantly during the period in which the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  indicated interest rates would stagnate, coinciding with a decrease in interest rates. For cryptocurrency market enthusiasts, this might translate to some noteworthy developments.\par \par \uc2 Indications of an impending Bitcoin halving, coupled with potential approvals of numerous spot Bitcoin ETFs in the US, suggest potential upward momentum for Bitcoin. Major institutions, including \uc2 Fidelity\uc2 , \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 , and others, could soon receive approval to acquire significant quantities of Bitcoin, potentially reducing its general circulation to support their respective ETF products. Historical patterns also suggest that when Bitcoin's valuation increases, the broader altcoin market typically witnesses even more substantial gains. As a reference, during a prior surge where Bitcoin appreciated from $30k to $50k, the altcoin market capitalization expanded from approximately $250B to an impressive $1.5T.\par \par \uc2 Considering these possibilities, let's take a look at where popular altcoins like Chainlink (LINK), Polygon (MATIC), Polkadot (DOT), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), and \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) may be headed. But before diving into short-term prospects for these coins, you might want to delve into their longer-term outlook. For instance, in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stealthex.io/blog/ripple-xrp-price-prediction/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 StealthEX Ripple (XRP) price prediction}}}\uc2 , you can explore the fundamental aspects of XRP and a detailed price forecast extending up to 2025, a forecast that has shown a history of accuracy.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink (LINK): The \uc2 Oracle\uc2 's Play in Tokenized Real-World Assets\par \par \uc2 In an era of increasingly popular tokenized real-world assets (RWAs) and influential global banks engaging in blockchain-based collateral settlement transactions, the position of Chainlink (LINK) in the crypto community has solidified. A growing RWA narrative indicates that LINK is in a good position to benefit from this development.\par \par \uc2 With {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/09/chainlinks-ccip-protocol-launches-on-base-l2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the integration}}}\uc2  of its Cross-Chain Interoperability Protocol (CCIP) with \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 's Base L2, the crypto space anticipates advanced capabilities for the design and execution of cross-chain applications. For instance, \uc2 Google\uc2  engineer Deep Chenna recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/ChainLinkGod/status/1712636253542527081?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 demonstrated}}}\uc2  that Chainlink Functions can connect smart contracts to Google Cloud's \uc2 Vertex\uc2  AI Imagen model to generate exclusive artwork for dynamic NFTs.\par \par \uc2 On-chain data shows that, in the Chainlink ecosystem, as of October 12, 2023, whale holdings constitute a dominant 55.84%, translating to approximately 514.95M LINK tokens. In contrast, retail participants hold a significant 313.65M LINK, while other investors account for 171.42M LINK, making up 44.16% combined of the total holdings. The significant concentration of Chainlink (LINK) in whale holdings suggests a potential centralization of asset ownership, which could influence price \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and market dynamics.\par \par \uc2 Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 LINK has recently been trading within a range of $6.52 to $9.05, slightly above its 200-day moving average of $6.76, indicating a potential upward momentum. If the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment continues and LINK surpasses its immediate resistance at $9.91, it could aim for the next resistance level at $12.44.\par \par \uc2 Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, if selling pressure mounts, breaking below the 10-day moving average of $7.40 might send LINK towards its first support level at $4.87, and in a more \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario, even down to $2.35.\par \par \uc2 Fundamentally, LINK's future seems promising with its standing as a network linking blockchains to the real world and a current trend towards tokenization.\par \par \uc2 Polygon (MATIC): The Hardfork and What Lies Ahead\par \par \uc2 Polygon is undergoing a major hardfork, bringing with it the "Milestones'' feature, which aims to achieve faster deterministic finality. This new addition promises quicker settlement times and a more certain transaction environment.\par \par \uc2 Despite Polygon's early entrance into the Ethereum layer-2 solutions, newer entrants like Optimism and Base are now proving to be staunch competitors. The unexpected departure of key members from the Polygon team has raised eyebrows and concerns among investors.\par \par \uc2 According to IntoTheBlock data, whale holdings constitute a significant portion of Polygon's (MATIC) total ownership, accounting for 68.75%, while other investors, including retail, make up the remaining 31.25%.\par \par \uc2 Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 The breakdown showcases that whales hold 6.86B MATIC, investors possess 1.65B, and retail investors have 1.48B. The dominant position of whales in MATIC's distribution suggests that the asset's price could be influenced significantly by large holder movements, potentially leading to higher \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market.\par \par \uc2 A look at Polygon's (MATIC) current trading range indicates that it is currently trading between $0.4942 and $0.5701, with the asset hovering just above the 10-day moving average of $0.5335, suggesting a potential consolidation phase.\par \par \uc2 Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 On the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  front, if MATIC manages to break and sustain above the immediate resistance at $0.6072, it may target the next resistance level at $0.6831, edging closer to its 200-day moving average of $0.7491.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, on the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  side, if selling pressure intensifies and the token breaches the $0.4554 support level, it could descend towards the deeper support at $0.3796, reflecting a more significant downturn in its trajectory.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): The Blockchain's Quest for Decentralization and Profitability\par \par \uc2 Amidst the dynamic crypto ecosystem, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has been a key player with recent developments that have caught the attention of both the community and critics alike. \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , the founder of Cardano, recently hosted a livestream providing updates about the platform, highlighting its advancements and future outlook.\par \par \uc2 Hoskinson's mention of the CIP:1694 upgrade was particularly noteworthy. This upgrade is geared towards transforming the governance mechanism in Cardano, transitioning it into a tricameral decision-making body. This aims to address some of the criticisms Cardano has received in the past regarding its centralized decision-making, which has been predominantly in the hands of its Genesis key holders.\par \par \uc2 However, not all reactions were positive. A user on X \u8211\'20\'13 previously known as \uc2 Twitter\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 criticized the update, suggesting that it indicated a lack of confidence in the Cardano project by its founder. Hoskinson responded quickly to this user's criticism, clarifying the context of his remarks and defending the tricameral system as a push toward greater decentralization. According to Hoskinson, the new system will make Cardano's blockchain more robust, secure, and decentralized.\par \par \uc2 Despite these strategic updates, a recurring concern amongst the Cardano community revolves around the timeline of significant developments on the blockchain. Addressing this, Hoskinson has continually reassured members that the platform is on track with its objectives.\par \par \uc2 From a technical standpoint, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is currently trading in the range of $0.2409 to $0.2630. With the 200-day moving average sitting at $0.3148, the token seems to be trading below its long-term average, suggesting a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. At $0.2526, the 10-day moving average indicates a slightly positive short-term sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Should \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  break past its immediate resistance at $0.2721, and subsequently, the $0.2942 mark, this could pave the way for a more pronounced \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend. Surpassing these resistance levels might instill renewed confidence among investors and potentially lead to a testing of the 200-day moving average.\par \par \uc2 On the flip side, if \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  retraces and breaches its support level at $0.2279, we could witness a deeper correction. Especially with the second support level being at the higher range of $0.2630, which is unusual, it suggests that any downward movement could be sharp and significant.\par \par \uc2 Looking into on-chain distribution of Cardano holdings, it reveals that a mere 7.02% is held by whales, while a significant 92.98% is owned by other entities, with retail investors commanding a notable 23B of the asset as of October 12th, 2023. Furthermore, investors hold a substantial 8.16B, whereas the whale concentration sits at 2.94B. Thus, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) exhibits a decentralized ownership distribution, hinting at a reduced risk of price manipulation by major holders and potentially indicating a broader community trust in the asset.\par \par \uc2 Source: IntoTheBlock\par \par \uc2 In conclusion, while Cardano is making strategic moves to fortify its governance and decentralization mechanisms, its market performance is teetering on pivotal levels. Whether it ascends bullishly or descends bearishly might largely depend on external market sentiments and the broader crypto market direction.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP): The Underlying Waves of the Financial System\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2 's XRP, popular for cross-border payments, has once again captured the cryptocurrency community's attention. A significant whale activity, wherein massive amounts of XRP were transferred to two exchanges, has led to rampant speculations, especially amidst the backdrop of the ongoing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/10/ripple-xrp-price-prediction-tradecurve-markets-surges-200-as-apecoin-forms-a-bullish-pattern"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP lawsuit}}}\uc2  and the recent price decline of the cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 Crypto tracking service Whale Alert reported that close to 64 million XRP tokens have been poured into EU-based \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  and Latin American exchange Bitso.\par \par \uc2 Given the recent dip in XRP's price, these transactions, if intended for selling, could imply whales potentially selling their holdings at a loss. However, considering \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 's reputation as one of \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s On-Demand Liquidity (ODL) platforms, these transfers might be aimed at ensuring adequate XRP liquidity for ODL operations.\par \par \uc2 On a brighter note, XRP's adoption seems to be on an upward trajectory. \uc2 Banco de M\u233\'00\'E9xico\uc2  recently unveiled its intentions to adopt \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s xRapid system, leveraging XRP as a bridging asset for transfers between USD and MXN. This move underscores XRP's escalating allure and hints at its probable widespread acceptance by leading global financial establishments.\par \par \uc2 XRP's current price is hovering between $0.4668 and $0.5561. If XRP can surge past its first resistance at $0.5972 and then break the $0.6865 barrier, it could indicate a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend. The adoption by \uc2 Banco de M\u233\'00\'E9xico\uc2  and the potential for ODL-driven demand on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  could act as catalysts for a positive price movement. Furthermore, XRP's price remains relatively close to its 200-day moving average of $0.5288, suggesting that with positive momentum, reclaiming this level is feasible.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, if XRP fails to maintain its current support and breaks below $0.4186, it could head towards its next support at $0.3293. The 10-day Moving Average at $0.5074 will be a key level to monitor, as consistently trading below this could be a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  indicator. StealthEX, as mentioned above, has compiled a more detailed XRP price prediction that takes a longer-term view.\par \par \uc2 In conclusion, while recent whale activity and market dynamics have caused short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  for XRP, its long-term potential, highlighted by growing institutional adoption, remains a significant point of interest for investors.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT): Navigating Through Decentralization and Organizational Transformations\par \par \uc2 Parity Technologies, a core player in the blockchain sphere, has taken a strategic turn by emphasizing decentralization in the Polkadot network. This move dispels the swirling rumors of the company laying off about 300 of its workforce. The Web3 Foundation, responsible for the Polkadot blockchain protocol, has earmarked a significant budget, amounting to $22.08 million and 5 million DOTs for the entirety of 2024. This initiative stems from the desire to strengthen the Polkadot Treasury's community-driven funding structure. The overall aim is to back projects that resonate with Polkadot's future vision. Contrary to popular conjecture, Parity Technologies has rebuffed allegations of massive layoffs during a gathering in Mallorca. The firm underscores that any workforce changes will align with its decentralized trajectory and will involve multiple ecosystem-funded entities.\par \par \uc2 The Web3 Foundation, birthed in Switzerland by Dr. Gavin Wood, Ethereum's co-founder, and former CTO, has been a proponent of decentralized web software applications. This recent effort promises to amplify the Polkadot Treasury's community-led funding mechanism, emphasizing backing ventures that could sculpt Polkadot's roadmap.\par \par \uc2 With the recent announcements from Parity Technologies and the Web3 Foundation, the Polkadot ecosystem appears poised for significant development, guided by a decentralized vision. This development brings a renewed interest in DOT, as investors are eager to understand its future trajectory in the market.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) has recently been trading within a tight price range of $3.89 to $4.33, indicating a potential consolidation phase before a breakout. The 10-day moving average stands at $3.87, aligning perfectly with the lower end of the current trading range, reinforcing it as a solid base of support.\par \par \uc2 Should DOT maintain its momentum and find buying strength, breaking past the immediate resistance level at $4.56 could pave the way for a more significant upward movement. A clear break above this resistance might instigate a rally towards the next major resistance at $5.00, which is just below the 200-day moving average of $5.05. A breach of the 200-day MA could further validate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment and signify a longer-term trend reversal.\par \par \uc2 Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 On the flip side, if Polkadot fails to rally past its immediate resistance at $4.56, it could witness selling pressure pushing it down towards its primary support at $3.69. A breakdown below this level might lead to further declines, targeting the next support at $3.25. With the 10-day moving average currently at the same level as the lower boundary of the trading range, any consistent trading below this average can be perceived as a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signal. Furthermore, the 200-day moving average at $5.05 serves as a looming overhead resistance, reminding investors of the broader downtrend. If the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum intensifies and both support levels are breached, DOT might find itself in a more prolonged downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot's emphasis on decentralized governance and the robust backing from the Web3 Foundation suggest a promising path forward. Yet, the crypto landscape remains volatile, and DOT is no exception. Investors should approach with a blend of optimism, grounded in research and awareness of the broader market tendencies.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 In the shifting sands of the global financial landscape, cryptocurrencies remain central to discussions of \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , innovation, and macroeconomic movements. \uc2 Gary Gensler\uc2 's cautious approach to crypto \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , juxtaposed against the backdrop of unexpected inflationary upticks and potential interest rate revisions, underscores the delicacies of this rapidly-evolving sector. As Bitcoin prepares for possible halvings and ETF endorsements, attention must also be given to its altcoin counterparts. Chainlink's venture into tokenized assets, Polygon's hardfork journey, Cardano's pursuit of decentralization, \uc2 Ripple\uc2 's lawsuit-laden path, and now, Polkadot's focus on decentralization, all highlight the multifaceted nature of the crypto domain. With Polkadot, in particular, making substantial moves to dispel workforce rumors and bolster its treasury, the emphasis on decentralized structures becomes all the more apparent. As investors, keeping a vigilant eye on these developments, analyzing the technical price points, and understanding the broader narratives will be key. The coming months promise intrigue, uncertainty, and undoubtedly, opportunity.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231014ejae000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/13: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,707 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 October 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bulls seem content to watch Bitcoin price trade in its multimonth range, and altcoins are likely to mirror BTC\u8217\'20\'19s price action.\par \par \uc2 A trending move in an asset class attracts traders, while a dull price action drives investors to the sidelines. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has largely been stuck in a range for the past several months, which could be one of the reasons for the drop in spot volumes. \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  reported on Oct. 11 that \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-trading-volume-declines"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spot trading volume plunged 52%}}}\uc2  in Q3 2023 compared to Q3 2022.\par \par \uc2 While the short-term remains uncertain, traders need to be watchful because long consolidations are generally followed by an explosive price action. The only problem is that it is difficult to predict the direction of breakout with certainty. Considering that the bulls have not allowed Bitcoin to dip back below $25,000 in the past few months, it increases the likelihood of an upside breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/9e1d030b-0b40-44a1-b136-aef40cc4de3a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Investing legend Paul Tudor Jones said in a recent interview on CNBC that he is not \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the equities markets as he believes that an escalation in the Israel\u8211\'20\'13\uc2 Hamas\uc2  conflict may bring about a risk-off sentiment. If that happens, it will be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/inflation-and-war-impact-markets-paul-tudor-jones-says-i-love-bitcoin-and-gold"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  for gold and Bitcoin}}}\uc2 , Jones added.\par \par \uc2 Wil bears sink Bitcoin below the immediate support and could that cause a further? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin sliced through the 20-day exponential moving average ($27,148) on Oct. 11, but the bears could not tug the price below the 50-day simple moving average ($26,634).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/047f5dca-3aa2-4b69-8080-0e68b13ee9f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the 50-day SMA on Oct. 11 and Oct. 12, but they are struggling to start a rebound. This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 The bears will next attempt to sink the price below the 50-day SMA and come out on top. If this level gives way, the BTC/USDT pair could retest the strong support at $26,000. This level is likely to witness aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 A rally above the 20-day EMA will be the first indication of strength. The pair could then climb to the stiff overhead resistance at $28,143. This is an important level to watch out for because a close above it could signal the start of a short-term up-move.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) dipped to the critical support at $1,531 on Oct. 12, but a minor positive is that the bulls successfully held this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/66f5f824-5fec-4b3f-b24e-e2f6b9d99170.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI is showing signs of a positive divergence, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. The bulls will try to push the price to the moving averages, where the bears are again likely to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA ($1,606), it will suggest that bears remain in command. The ETH/USDT pair could then crumble below $1,531 and start its descent to $1,368.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the fall, they will have to kick the price above the moving averages. The pair may then climb to $1,746, where the bulls may again face strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) fell to the strong support at $203 but the long tail on the candlestick shows that the bulls are protecting the level with force.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/21fe99ca-7d0c-4598-a1bf-48cb8b8781a2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to quickly thrust the price above the moving averages and the downtrend line to indicate that the bears may be losing their grip. The BNB/USDT pair could then start an up-move to $235 and later to $250.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will indicate that every minor rise is being sold. A break below the $203 support will complete a descending triangle pattern, which could start a downward move to $183.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) fell below the uptrend line on Oct. 11, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure is reducing. The drop suggests that the price will continue to oscillate between $0.41 and $0.56 for a while longer.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/dc9329bb-f06e-4723-b079-14b816beaa30.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is support at $0.46, but if it cracks, the XRP/USDT pair may tumble to the important level at $0.41. The bulls are expected to buy this dip aggressively, which could keep the range-bound action intact.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the moving averages will be the first sign of strength. The buyers will then make one more attempt to drive the price to the overhead resistance at $0.56. A break and close above this level will indicate the start of a new potential uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($21.72) on Oct. 12, indicating that the bears are maintaining their pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/e85f07b8-8c8e-4cd8-bfbf-f3bc434ab7a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image