es. \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  reported on Oct. 11 that \uc2 Coinbase\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-trading-volume-declines"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spot trading volume plunged 52%}}}\uc2  in Q3 2023 compared to Q3 2022.\par \par \uc2 While the short-term remains uncertain, traders need to be watchful because long consolidations are generally followed by an explosive price action. The only problem is that it is difficult to predict the direction of breakout with certainty. Considering that the bulls have not allowed Bitcoin to dip back below $25,000 in the past few months, it increases the likelihood of an upside breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/9e1d030b-0b40-44a1-b136-aef40cc4de3a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Investing legend Paul Tudor Jones said in a recent interview on CNBC that he is not \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the equities markets as he believes that an escalation in the Israel\u8211\'20\'13\uc2 Hamas\uc2  conflict may bring about a risk-off sentiment. If that happens, it will be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/inflation-and-war-impact-markets-paul-tudor-jones-says-i-love-bitcoin-and-gold"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  for gold and Bitcoin}}}\uc2 , Jones added.\par \par \uc2 Wil bears sink Bitcoin below the immediate support and could that cause a further? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin sliced through the 20-day exponential moving average ($27,148) on Oct. 11 but the bears could not tug the price below the 50-day simple moving average ($26,634).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERL