 level, the DOGE/USDT pair may consolidate between $0.055 and $0.06 for some time.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near the oversold zone indicate that bears have the upper hand. If bulls want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly propel the price above the moving averages. That could start a recovery to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-stuck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price stuck?}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has been in a corrective phase for the past few days. Profit booking by the traders pulled the price below the 50-day SMA ($1.98) on Oct. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/e06a3e59-e10e-49ba-933e-5cfea0878ca1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to reclaim the level and push the price back above the moving averages over the next few days. If they manage to do that, it will indicate that the break below the 50-day SMA may have been a bear trap. That could open the doors for a possible rise to $2.31.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the TON/USDT pair turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned negative and every relief rally is being sold into. That will increase the risk of a fall to $1.60.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) continued its decline in the past few days and reached near the target objective at $3.50 on Oct. 12. This level is likely to act as a solid support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/7f9ed33e-8690-4da1-87ab-382a7c541787.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOTUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 On the way up, the 20-day EMA ($3.95) is the key level to keep an eye on. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will signal that traders are selling on relief rallies. That could enhance the prospects of a drop below $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if bulls drive and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the markets have rejected the lower levels. That may trap the aggressive bears, resulting in a short squeeze toward the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) continues to weaken toward the critical support at $0.49, indicating that the bulls are not risking a buy at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/6ef03b7d-a4f2-4aea-b2ce-36ead05a0f6c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 In a range, traders generally buy near the support and sell close to the resistance. In this case, the bulls are likely to buy the dips to $0.49 with vigor. If the price turns up from this level with strength, the MATIC/USDT pair may reach the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from the moving averages, it will increase the likelihood of a break below $0.49. If that happens, the pair could plunge to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a rally above the moving averages will signal that the range-bound action may extend for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/44e5acb9-38bb-45c7-b18a-83ddad7ebf6b.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231013ejad000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
