\par\par \b \uc2 Everlodge (ELDG) Price Increases 90%, While Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) and Dogecoin (DOGE) Hit Rough Waters\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 624 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 October 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Falls After Neutral Rating\par \par \uc2 * Elon Musk Hints at Upcoming X Update, Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Declines\par \par \uc2 * Kick Your Way to a Slice of Luxury Property with Everlodge (ELDG)\par \par \uc2 * Find out more about the Everlodge (ELDG) Presale\par \par \uc2 Crypto prices have been volatile lately, and many popular coins have lost value. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Dogecoin (DOGE) are no different.\par \par \uc2 But there is one coin that is doing well: Everlodge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pr.everlodge.io/cryptodaily1110"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Join the Everlodge presale and win a luxury holiday to the Maldives}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Falls After Neutral Rating\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) received a neutral rating from InvestorsObserver on Monday. The rating comes as Cardano's price has been declining in recent months.\par \par \uc2 A neutral rating indicates that Cardano is not a strong buy or sell at present. Cardano is fairly valued, and there is not enough evidence to support a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  or \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  thesis.\par \par \uc2 Moreover, a neutral rating may hurt Cardano's price in the short term. Furthermore, Cardano'sprice remains low. As of today, Cardano is trading at $0.25. Furthermore, Cardano has fallen 92.08% below its all-time high of $3.10, reached in September 2021.\par \par \uc2 Elon Musk Hints at Upcoming X Update, Dogecoin (DOGE) Price Declines\par \par \uc2 Elon Musk, CEO and owner of X, has hinted at an upcoming update during a casual chat with a prominent member of the Dogecoin (DOGE) team.\par \par \uc2 Moreover, Musk's hint came in response to a suggestion from the Dogecoin designer to retire the familiar birdhouse icon currently used to represent the "home" feature on X. Musk simply replied, "We will."\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, this statement has led to speculation that X may be integrating Dogecoin in its upcoming update. However, there has yet to be an official confirmation.\par \par \uc2 Despite the lack of confirmation, the price of Dogecoin has fallen by 2.34% in the past 7 days. Moreover, Dogecoin has plummeted by 0.80% in the last 24 hours. The current price of Dogecoin is $0.06. Dogecoin is 91.74% below its all-time high 0f $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Kick Your Way to a Slice of Luxury Property with Everlodge (ELDG)\par \par \uc2 Did you know that the global luxury real estate market exceeds a valuation of over $3.6 trillion?\par \par \uc2 Everlodge is shaking up the real estate world with its innovative co-ownership model, powered by NFTs. For the first time, anyone can own a piece of luxury property, starting at just $100.\par \par \uc2 Imagine owning a share of a sprawling villa in Tuscany, a ski chalet in the Alps, or a beachfront condo in Hawaii. With Everlodge, it's possible.\par \par \uc2 Everlodge will select premium properties, digitize them, and transform them into NFTs. Furthermore, these NFTs will be divided into fragments, making them affordable for everyone.\par \par \uc2 For example, a $5 million villa could be divided into 50,000 fragments, each priced at $100. As the market value of the property increases, so does the value of each fragment.\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, the platform\u8217\'20\'19s ecosystem is powered by the ELDG token, which will grant holders a variety of perks. Furthermore, these perks will include trading discounts, reduced maintenance charges, and passive revenue through staking.\par \par \uc2 The project is currently selling ELDG tokens for $0.018. This is a great chance for early investors to make a lot of money as the platform grows, and the tokens become more valuable.\par \par \uc2 Find out more about the Everlodge (ELDG) Presale\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.everlodge.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.everlodge.io/}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/everlodge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/everlodge}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231011ejab000ru\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/11: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,707 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 October 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins correct as this week's US economic reports show inflation making a small comeback.\par \par \uc2 Buyers are finding it difficult to maintain Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price above $27,000. The selling increased after the September {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-2-week-low-us-inflation-btc-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 producer price index rose 0.5% for the month}}}\uc2  versus expectations for a 0.3% increase. This shows that the inflation pressures are unlikely to ease in a hurry for the United States economy.\par \par \uc2 The uncertain near-term environment has shifted analysts\u8217\'20\'19 focus to November and the upcoming halving event expected in April 2024. Crypto analyst Miles Deutscher cited a chart from CryptoCon and said that if history repeats itself, then {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-btc-price-analysts-november-halving-bull-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin may turn up by November 21}}}\uc2  and start its journey higher to the next halving.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/5a05b486-a176-436c-86f3-51f73b422fa9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Going further ahead to 2026, BitMEX founder \uc2 Arthur Hayes\uc2  is even more \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . While speaking as a guest on Impact Theory with Tom Bilyeu, Hayes said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-hit-750-k-to-1-m-2026-arthur-hayes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price could reach $750,000 to $1 million}}}\uc2  by 2026. Hayes argues that incessant money printing by the \uc2 U.S. government\uc2  to avoid a financial crisis will trigger a massive bull market in several asset classes.\par \par \uc2 Several analysts are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  about the long-term but the near-term remains uncertain due to various headwinds. Could Bitcoin and altcoins stage a recovery or will they continue moving lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 After finding support at the 20-day exponential moving average ($27,227) for the past two days, Bitcoin broke below the level on Oct. 11. This shows that the bears are trying to seize control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/17b4e1ce-fe6a-4290-a417-d1c62feb4548.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The next support to watch on the downside is the 50-day simple moving average ($26,615). If this level cracks, it will suggest that the traders are rushing to exit. The BTC/USDT pair could then slump to $26,000 and eventually retest the support at $24,800.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, the bulls will attempt to propel the price above the 20-day EMA. That could open the doors for a potential rally to $28,143.\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) just below the midpoint suggest a possible range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been finding buyers near the $1,531 support for the past two days, which is a positive sign. This suggests that the price will continue to swing between $1,531 and $1,746 for some more time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/4721937b-dbc5-40c5-b0a2-06abac89e327.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The positive divergence on the ETH/USDT pair suggests that the selling pressure may be reducing near $1,531. This may start a relief rally, which could reach the 20-day EMA ($1,619). If the price turns down from this level, the bears will make another attempt to yank the pair below $1,531 and start a downward move to $1,368.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a rise above the moving averages will suggest strong accumulation at lower levels. The pair may then attempt a rally to $1,746. The bulls may find it difficult to break above this level but if they do that, the pair could climb to $1,961.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) fell below the uptrend line on Oct. 9 but bounced off the strong support at $203. This indicates that the price is range-bound between $203 and $220.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/78077037-b145-4433-9bb7-909d58bf90ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Oct. 10 candlestick indicates that the bears are selling the rallies to the moving averages. The bears again redoubled their efforts to strengthen their position by dragging the price below $203.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to begin on a break below $203 or on a rally above $220. If the $203 support gives way, the BNB/USDT pair may crash to $183. On the contrary, a rise above $220 could open the doors for a potential rally to $235 and thereafter to $250.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers could not build upon the breakout above the symmetrical triangle and overcome the barrier at $0.56. This shows that XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/67bcea06-5a7b-4b50-b3d5-cfaddd3d7cd9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price turned down and broke below the moving averages on Oct. 9. This was the first indication that the bulls have given up. The selling picked up further on Oct. 11 and the bears pulled the XRP/USDT pair below the uptrend line. This suggests that the pair may extend its stay between $0.41 and $0.56 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the first support is at $0.46 and after that at $0.41. Contrarily, attempts to start a recovery are likely to face selling at the moving averages and then at $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is one of the stronger major cryptocurrencies as it is trading above the immediate support at the 20-day EMA ($21.79).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/41f551c4-8be2-4df1-9ee0-aa5b9845efa7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair will attempt to form a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverted head and shoulders pattern. This reversal setup will complete on a break and close above the neckline. The target objective of this setup is $32.81 but its efficacy reduces slightly as it has formed inside a consolidation.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to start a strong rebound off the 20-day EMA soon, the bears will be strengthened. They will then try to tug the price to the 50-day SMA ($20.44). If this level gives way, the next stop may be $18.50 and later $17.33.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears dragged Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) back below the moving averages on Oct. 9, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/c6f186c7-50f4-46d8-a2f7-66ab1b0a511c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could retest $0.24, which is an important support to keep an eye on. The positive divergence on the RSI suggests that the bulls are likely to protect the $0.24 level with vigor. They will then have to drive the price above the moving averages to signal further strength.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break and close below $0.24 will indicate the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The pair may first skid to $0.22 and eventually to $0.20.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) plunged and closed below the $0.06 support on Oct. 9, indicating that the bears are in charge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/7c359386-8829-4a67-b274-586515eee3d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Oct. 9 candlestick shows that the bulls are aggressively defending the support at $0.055. If buyers want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly push the price back above the breakdown level of $0.06 and then extend the recovery over the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 If they fail to do that, the bears will continue to put pressure on the $0.055 support. If this level cracks, the DOGE/USDT pair could retest the pivotal support near $0.05. This level is again expected to attract solid buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jp-morgan-debuts-tokenization-platform-tcn-blackrock-key-client-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 JPMorgan debuts tokenization platform, BlackRock among key clients: Report}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to sustain Toncoin (TON) above the 20-day EMA ($2.06) on Oct. 7, indicating that the bears are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/5227aeb2-89bb-4d86-9b45-ae576887e4cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have managed to keep the TON/USDT pair above the 50-day SMA ($1.96). The buyers will next try to clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the TON/USDT pair could rise to $2.18 and subsequently to $2.32.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to sink and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA. If they succeed, the pair could start a downward move toward $1.60.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears made their move on Oct. 9 and yanked Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the vital support at $3.91. The bulls tried to push the price back above the breakdown level on Oct. 10 but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/f65ee941-fc71-4ac4-aae2-9e0f2215a81c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOTUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Selling resumed on Oct. 11 and the bears are trying to sink the price toward the next target objective at $3.50. Although the downsloping moving averages indicate that bears remain in command, the positive divergence on the RSI offers a small ray of hope for the bulls that a reversal is possible.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above $3.91. That may trap the aggressive bears, resulting in a short squeeze. The DOT/USDT pair will then attempt a rally to the 50-day SMA ($4.16).\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) turned down and broke below the moving averages on Oct. 9, indicating that the $0.49 to $0.60 range remains intact.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/90409873-2813-4f21-9bff-bca0099c2a33.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Losing the 20-day EMA ($0.53) support is a negative sign and it puts the onus on the bulls to defend the crucial support at $0.49. If the price rebounds off this level, it will indicate that the bulls remain buyers on dips. That could keep the MATIC/USDT pair stuck inside the range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 This neutral view will invalidate in the near term if the price continues lower and plummets below $0.49. The pair will then indicate the start of the next leg of the downtrend toward $0.45.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/480e947a-7054-4f9c-9301-39576c84e2cf.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231011ejab000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
