\par\par \b \uc2 Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ), Ripple (XRP), and Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ): The Future Fortunes or Upcoming Catastrophe?\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 1,241 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 October 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price & Sentiment\par \par \uc2 * Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 * Ripple (XRP) Price & Sentiment\par \par \uc2 * Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 * Solana (SOL) Price & Sentiment\par \par \uc2 * Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The crypto market's landscape is like a roller-coaster ride, brimming with sharp turns influenced by world affairs. From the agonizing scenes between Gaza and Israel to the Russia-Ukraine conflict showcasing the humanitarian potential of cryptos, the dynamics are ever-changing. And while the world sways between crises, investors have directed their compasses towards war-related stocks and oil price speculations.\par \par \uc2 With oil prices surging amidst the backdrop of global tensions, the crypto sector experienced its mini-whirlwind with approximately {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/community/articles/651ef3c21040a65b01a89d1c/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $730 million}}}\uc2  worth of Bitcoin and Ethereum options bidding adieu just last Friday. Yet, many traders seem optimistic about October, leaning towards call options. While these turbulences may seem to be passing, another one may be just around the corner.\par \par \uc2 Source: Messari.io\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Ripple (XRP), and Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) are gaining considerable attention, with XRP constituting $26.84 billion or 59.87% of total crypto market cap, SOL $9.16 billion or 20.42%, and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  $8.84 billion or 19.71% as of this writing. Let's take a closer look at how these cryptos\u8217\'20\'19 prices could change.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 When Ethereum's co-founder, \uc2 Vitalik Buterin\uc2 , hinted at staking and protocol tweaks to amp up decentralization, he probably didn't expect Cardano's founder, \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , and the Cardano community to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/IOHK_Charles/status/1711110105045807211"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 react}}}\uc2  so vociferously. Accusations flew about Ethereum dressing up as Cardano for Halloween, given Cardano's history with liquid staking. While the debate rages on about who's copying whom, it's clear that competition is heating up.\par \par \uc2 Taking a look at \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  technicals, Cardano's prices have seen some fluctuation. With a 52-week high of $0.4595 and a recent high of $0.3750, it's evident that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is trying to find its footing amidst the market turbulence.\par \par \uc2 If the coin maintains just above $0.2560 and begins an upward trend, passing through the first resistance level at $0.2628, it can be viewed as a positive signal. A breach of the 1-month high of $0.2692 and the subsequent resistance at $0.2731 could signal a resumption of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend. Should \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  approach or break past the 13-week high at $0.3750 and challenge the 52-week high at $0.4595, this would suggest substantial \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) starts to trend downwards from its current position and breaches support at $0.2457, this might suggest the onset of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend. If it continues to slide, moving closer to the 1-month low and the 13-week low, both at $0.2369, this will further validate \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiments. A decisive \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  turn would be evident if the price approaches the 52-week low at $0.2357, indicating a potential long-term downtrend.\par \par \uc2 A final note of optimism, Cardano's future is bright with its high potential and scalability, as well as its clear goal of decentralization. However, if Ethereum succeeds in its proposed changes, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  might find itself in a tough spot. An unpredictable market, yes, but isn't that where opportunities hide?\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price & Sentiment\par \par \uc2 Source: Cryptocurrencychart.com\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Deribit's latest move to list XRP options, alongside Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) and Polygon (MATIC), could increase liquidity for these assets. Holding an impressive 85% grip on the global crypto options scene, Deribit's alignment with XRP could offer traders a goldmine of opportunities. Also, Ripple has recently been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/10/ripple-receives-digital-payments-license-in-singapore"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approved}}}\uc2  to operate as a major payments institution in Singapore by the \uc2 Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS)\uc2 . As altcoin traders widen their horizons, is XRP about to experience a monumental shift?\par \par \uc2 Ripple has shown promise recently, with a 13-week high and 52-week high both touching $0.9223. However, recent market fluctuations have seen its price dip to around $0.4969.\par \par \uc2 If XRP maintains its position above the pivot point of $0.5087 and starts an upward movement, breaking through the first resistance level of $0.5228, it can be seen as a positive signal. If it successfully breaches the 2nd resistance level at $0.5428 and continues its momentum beyond the 1-month high of $0.5471, this could lead to a stronger \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend. The ultimate \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign would be if it approaches or surpasses the 13-week and 52-week highs near $0.9223, suggesting a substantial upward momentum.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Price & Sentiment\par \par \uc2 Source: Cryptocurrencychart.com\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if XRP starts to decline and breaches downwards the first support level at $0.4887, it may signal the start of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend. Should it continue its descent past the 1-month low of $0.468261 and further towards the 13-week low at $0.4596, \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiments could be solidified. A significant \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend would be evident if it starts moving closer to the 52-week low of $0.3166, which would be a major cause for concern for holders.\par \par \uc2 While the inclusion of XRP in Deribit offers promising prospects, challenges always lurk in the crypto shadows. The next few months could be pivotal in determining whether XRP can maintain its momentum or face another round of challenges.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/nansen_ai/status/1709916961478672503?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent Nansen report}}}\uc2  on Solana paints a promising picture, pointing to nearly doubled Total Value Locked (TVL) from the start of the year (as of this writing, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/10/solana-witnesses-a-noteworthy-surge-in-total-value-locked"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s TVL}}}\uc2  stands at a commendable $312 million). As a result of past problems, such as network halts, Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) has been through some turbulence. Visa's integration of USDC settlement on Solana has opened up potential avenues of growth. However, the FTX/Alameda uncertainty casts a cloud of doubt.\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s price reflects its ongoing challenges and successes. With a 52-week high of $38.5941 and a $13-week high of 30.5800, \uc2 SOL\uc2  has demonstrated the potential for significant growth.\par \par \uc2 If Solana (SOL) maintains support above the $21.3686 level and starts to move upwards, breaking through the first resistance level of $23.4909, this could lead to increased \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. Successfully breaking the $24.8227 mark may pave the way towards the $25.6132 level, indicating strong \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price & Sentiment\par \par \uc2 Source: Cryptocurrencychart.com\par \par \uc2 Under the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario for \uc2 SOL\uc2 , a break below the initial support level of $21.3686 could cause a downward trend towards the $20.5781 support level. A break below this could see further \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  movement towards $19.2463, suggesting a stronger \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment.\par \par \uc2 While Solana has a lot of positive buzz, the uncertainty surrounding FTX/Alameda\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 SOL\uc2  holdings remains a potential stumbling block.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 While geopolitical strains and market speculations keep traders on their toes, the underlying strength of the discussed cryptocurrencies and the innovations they represent cannot be ignored. Whether you're cheering for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's fierce decentralization spirit, XRP's expansion, or \uc2 SOL\uc2 's resilience, it's evident that these coins are more than just a passing trend. As with any investment, remember to tread wisely, but don't forget to appreciate the transformative power these digital assets hold for our future.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231010ejaa000ru\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,715 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 October 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select major altcoins are attracting buyers on dips, signaling that the sentiment is slowly turning positive.\par \par \uc2 United States 10-year Treasury yields {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/10/03/stock-market-today-live-updates.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 soared}}}\uc2  above 4.8% on Oct. 3, their highest level since 2007. \uc2 DoubleLine Capital\uc2  CEO \uc2 Jeffrey Gundlach\uc2  said in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TruthGundlach/status/1709358346879349122"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post}}}\uc2  on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) that the spread between the 2-year and 10-year Treasury yields has narrowed from 109 basis points a few months ago to 35 basis points. He cautioned that this \u8220\'20\'1Cshould put everyone on recession warning.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Arthur Hayes\uc2 , former CEO of crypto exchange BitMEX, warned in a recent X thread that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bull-market-us-faces-bear-steepener-arthur-hayes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 government will have to print money}}}\uc2  to save the bond market as a faster bear steepener \u8212\'20\'14 a condition where long-term interest rates rise more quickly than short-term rates \u8212\'20\'14 will cause firms to collapse. Some investors believe that this could trigger a cryptocurrency bull market.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/54f7769f-c676-4f1c-a811-e25f3f26f2ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 It also looks like the institutional investors have started to warm up to cryptocurrencies. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 latest \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows Weekly Report {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-solana-ethereum-xrp-drives-digital-asset-inflows-6-weeks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows inflows of $21 million}}}\uc2  into \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products for the first time in six weeks.\par \par \uc2 In this uncertain macro environment, let\u8217\'20\'19s take a look at the charts to determine the next potential move.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rose above $28,143 on Oct. 2 but the long wick on the candlestick shows the bears are aggressively selling at higher levels. The bears tried to build upon their advantage on Oct. 3 but the bulls held their ground at $27,160.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/3b42c54e-438b-4478-a34e-862ab34ab40d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($26,903) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate that bulls have the upper hand. Buyers will once again try to clear the overhead resistance at $28,143.\par \par \uc2 A close above this level will complete a short-term double bottom pattern, which has a target objective of $31,486.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the price once again turns down from the overhead resistance and plummets below the 20-day EMA. That could yank the price to $26,000. The BTC/USDT pair could then continue to consolidate between $24,800 and $28,143 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply from the overhead resistance of $1,746 on Oct. 2, indicating that the bears are fiercely guarding this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/7fa14d20-b95c-4f3e-b4b2-3c9904ae1b1f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1,640) is flattening out and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will again try to overcome the obstacle at $1,746. If they can pull it off, the ETH/USDT pair will complete a double bottom pattern, having a target objective of $1,961.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price continues lower and tumbles below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the $1,531 to $1,746 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) jumped above the $220 resistance on Oct. 2 but the bulls could not sustain the breakout as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/756a4722-a20e-4cc1-bf8b-627fd80e6428.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to maintain the price above the 20-day EMA ($214) is a negative sign. It shows that traders are rushing to the exit. The BNB/USDT pair could next fall to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to push the pair above $220. A close above this resistance could signal the start of an up-move to $235 and thereafter to $250. Instead, if the price breaks below the uptrend line, the pair may decline to the formidable support at $203.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the symmetrical triangle pattern on Sep. 29 and then foiled several attempts by the bears to pull the price back into the triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/4c7b499f-c16c-447c-8b30-20d084daf29a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will next try to surmount the overhead resistance at $0.56. If they are successful, it will signal the start of a new uptrend. The XRP/USDT pair could then start its journey toward the pattern at $0.66.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from $0.56 and dives below the uptrend line, it will suggest that the bulls are booking profits. That could keep the pair range-bound between $0.56 and $0.41 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating inside a large range between $14 and $27.12. The price action of the past few days has resulted in the formation of a potential inverse head and shoulders pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/3ad5e3e8-8fbb-4424-bf58-7feed62a5c1c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although setups formed inside a range tend to be less reliable, still they should not be neglected. If the price turns up and breaks above the neckline, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could attempt a rally to $27.12 and eventually to the pattern target of $32.81.\par \par \uc2 The critical support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($20.95). If the price slides below this level, it will suggest that the bulls have given up. That could open the gates for a possible drop to $17.33.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from $0.27 on Oct. 2 and reached the 20-day EMA ($0.25) on Oct. 4. This is an important level to keep an eye on in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/ce86243a-db73-4cf1-9239-effe041ff275.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will indicate a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. The bulls will then try to shove the price above $0.27 and start an up-move to $0.29 and later to $0.32.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the rally, they will have to drag the price below the 20-day EMA. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then once again descend to the vital support at $0.24. The bulls are likely to protect this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($0.06) on Oct. 2 but could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that bears are selling on every minor relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/6b63767d-1e9f-4140-a7fb-3444d15deb4b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair has reached the formidable support at $0.06. The repeated retest of a support level within a short interval tends to weaken it. If the $0.06 level cracks, the pair may slump to the next major support at $0.055.\par \par \uc2 A minor advantage in favor of the buyers is that the RSI has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. This suggests the bears may be losing their grip. The indicators are not providing clarity about the next move. Hence, it is best to wait for the price to close above the 50-day SMA or plunge below $0.06 to place directional bets.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-27k-btc-price-volatile-us-dollar"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin traders hope $27K holds as BTC price ignores volatile US dollar}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) fell below the 20-day EMA ($2.09) on Sep. 30 and the bears thwarted attempts by the bulls to reclaim the level on Oct. 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/9bac93aa-7cec-4174-aa8f-d5cc1a0c05d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to solidify their position by sinking the price to the 50-day SMA ($1.86). This level may result in a rebound that is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this resistance, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are selling on rallies. That will increase the likelihood of a drop below the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up and surges above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the markets have rejected the lower levels. The TON/USDT pair could then rise to $2.32 where the bears will again try to halt the up-move.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply from the 50-day SMA ($4.24) on Oct. 2 and broke below the 20-day EMA ($4.10) on Oct. 3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/44d28f3e-28d0-4926-8273-de9b4d47457d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOTUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears challenged the important support at $3.91 on Oct. 4 but the long tail on the candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels. The RSI has formed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence, indicating that the sellers may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the DOT/USDT pair may extend its stay inside the $4.33 to $3.91 range for some more time. The bears will have to sink the price below $3.91 to start the next leg of the downtrend to $3.50.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 After witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the moving averages, Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) bounced on Oct. 4, indicating that buyers are trying to take charge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/e188fa88-6174-45f7-bd1b-30e7c3df577c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to build upon the strength and propel the price above the overhead resistance at $0.60. If they manage to do that, it will signal the start of a sustained recovery. The MATIC/USDT pair could then rise to $0.70.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bears are active at higher levels. The pair may then retest the crucial support at $0.49. This level is likely to attract solid buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/7dd9720e-f6c7-4699-b28e-18a2d925f210.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231004eja4000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin traders demand \u8216\'20\'18slow grind\u8217\'20\'19 up after BTC price drops over 4%\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 537 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 October 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin retraces its trip to six-week BTC price highs as sellers win out above $28,500.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) traded moderately higher on Oct. 3 after giving back $1,300 of gains into the daily close.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/fbf91b10-3ec1-4357-934b-f2776557b1f9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls slip at $28,600\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.173325223.503936973.1685953699-1136475544.1627545224"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC price action focusing on $27,500.\par \par \uc2 The pair unwound overnight, descending from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-28-5-k-trader-bitcoin-disbelief"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 six-week highs near $28,600}}}\uc2  to bounce at $27,335 before stabilizing.\par \par \uc2 Despite the risk of the October opening move becoming a form of \u8220\'20\'1Cfakeout,\u8221\'20\'1D market participants kept their cool.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CYesterday\u8217\'20\'19s breakout did not instantly send us to $30k. I consider this a good thing, because those vertical moves often retrace,\u8221\'20\'1D popular trader Jelle {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoJelleNL/status/1709104871176011932"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  in part of an X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) reaction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/13b953f6-5994-4d72-9eaf-0bb3f0891e47.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD annotated chart. Source: Jelle/X\par \par \uc2 Daan Crypto Trades likewise {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/DaanCrypto/status/1708927901842747751"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 argued}}}\uc2  that a \u8220\'20\'1Cslow grind back up to the highs\u8221\'20\'1D would be the best scenario for Bitcoin bulls.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNeed longs to chill out and spot bid to step back in for this to happen. Let\u8217\'20\'19s see if the Asia session is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  again or not,\u8221\'20\'1D he added about trader behavior.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/f28f910c-32fb-4e9a-8e7b-b1159cebcf0d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD annotated chart. Source: Daan Crypto Trades/X\par \par \uc2 Analyzing the conditions around the BTC price reversal, meanwhile, popular trader Skew highlighted spot traders facing selling pressure.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSpot takers did try to push higher around $28.5K & were sold into -> led to the sell off,\u8221\'20\'1D part of the day\u8217\'20\'19s X content {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/52kskew/status/1709025257414365219"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 explained}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBid depth is returning a bit here I think, however overall liquidity still remains pretty wide.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/9b08540e-e738-4611-ac0d-ea7685c7a16b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD chart with trading activity data. Source: Skew/X\par \par \uc2 Previously, Skew had highlighted the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-uptober-up-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased demands on buyers}}}\uc2  in order for the market to pass the range in which it ultimately ran out of steam.\par \par \uc2 BTC price battles the same old range\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1709030612433092638"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Continuing}}}\uc2 , on-chain monitoring resource Material Indicators warned over downside signals on its proprietary trading tools on daily timeframes.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-10-2-spx-dxy-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-sol-ada-doge-ton"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 10/2: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , DOGE, TON}}}\par \par \uc2 While \u8220\'20\'1Cindicating a continuation of the down trend,\u8221\'20\'1D a return past $26,800 would give cause for a rethink, it wrote in accompanying X commentary.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAlso, keep in mind, the exact same range we\u8217\'20\'19ve been trading in for months is still intact until something breaks,\u8221\'20\'1D it concluded.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CUntil BTC prints a lower low on the Weekly chart, don\u8217\'20\'19t rule out the possibility of retesting resistance.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/da7d3ad1-7d00-41b2-8cd4-8f51e82d89aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD chart with up and down signals. Source: Material Indicators/X\par \par \uc2 Previously, popular trader and analyst Rekt Capital had suggested that Bitcoin could even head beyond $29,000 before continuing lower in its current range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://mint.cointelegraph.com/?url=https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-slow-grind-up-btc-price-drops-over-4&utm_source=cointelegraph_com&utm_medium=appendix&utm_campaign=articles"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Collect this article as an NFT}}}\uc2  to preserve this moment in history and show your support for independent journalism in the crypto space.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/7b831b02-1a1e-49f3-9735-16938989a203.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231003eja30002y\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/2: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,743 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 October 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are moving, but the strong rally in the U.S. dollar index could put brakes on the rally.\par \par \uc2 The United States legislators in the House and Senate came to a temporary agreement on Sep. 30 and averted a government shutdown for 45 days. This news could have acted as a catalyst for Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) sharp rally on Oct. 1. Additionally, the historically strong performance of Bitcoin in October could have boosted sentiment further.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. stock markets are also in a sweet spot in October. Data from the Stock Trader\u8217\'20\'19s Almanac shows that the S&P 500 Index (SPX) has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/09/28/stock-market-today-live-updates.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 risen}}}\uc2  by an average of 0.9% in October, between 1950 and 2021. However, it does not mean that the bulls can be carefree because the stock market weathered one of its worst declines in the Black Monday crash in October 1987.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/b551b09e-b50b-406d-80be-ae5e07eefffb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While a short-term up-move is possible in the cryptocurrency markets, it is unlikely to start a runaway rally. Higher levels are likely to witness profit-booking as the skyrocketing U.S. dollar index (DXY) could keep the bulls on the edge of their seats.\par \par \uc2 What are the important overhead resistance levels in Bitcoin and altcoins that may attract sellers? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index plunged below the formidable support at 4,325 on Sep. 22. That completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern, indicating the start of a downward move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/377ef6b4-c640-4f66-8c46-8fc5460637cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Usually, the price turns around and retests the breakdown level, which in this case is 4,325. That happened on Sep. 29. The neckline of the setup is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below 4,238, it will indicate that bears are in control. That could accelerate selling and the index may dive to the pattern target of 4,043.\par \par \uc2 Any recovery attempt is likely to face selling at 4,325 and then at the 20-day exponential moving average ($4,370). A break above this resistance will be the first sign of strength. The index could then ascend to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index has witnessed a scintillating run in the past several days. The bulls propelled the price above the overhead resistance of 106 on Sep. 26, indicating the start of a new uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/154bf32c-2d44-4232-be74-901f4c676318.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers tried to pull the price back below the breakout level of 106 on Sep. 29 but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels. The bulls will try to flip the 106 level into support. If they are successful, the index could rally to 108.\par \par \uc2 The bears are unlikely to surrender easily. They will try to drag the price back below 106 and then the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, it will trap the aggressive bulls. The index may then descend to the 50-day simple moving average ($103).\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin surged above the immediate resistance of $27,500 on Oct. 1 and then stretched the rally above $28,143 on Oct. 2. The ease with which $28,143 was conquered shows that more is likely to come.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/08e4768a-e8da-467b-a300-689b48837377.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price to $31,000 where they are likely to encounter solid resistance from the bears. If the price turns down sharply from this level, it will suggest that the BTC/USDT pair remains stuck inside the large range between $31,000 and $24,800.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is $28,143 and then the 20-day EMA ($26,862). If the price slips back below $28,143, it may trap the aggressive bulls. That could then pull the price to the 20-day EMA. Sellers will have to yank the price below this level if they want to seize control.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) pierced the 50-day SMA ($1,652) on Sep. 29 and followed that up with another sharp rally on Oct. 1. That pushed the price to the overhead resistance at $1,746.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/dcf88480-f602-4a68-9252-d4acde23847c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1,644) has turned up and the relative strength index (RSI) is above the 64 level, indicating that the bulls are in command. That enhances the prospects of a rally above $1,746. If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair will complete a double bottom pattern. This setup has a target objective of $1,959.\par \par \uc2 Sellers will make every effort to halt the recovery at $1,746. They will have to drag the price back below the moving averages to weaken the positive momentum. The pair may then extend its stay inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 50-day SMA ($216) on Sep. 29 and 30 but found support at the 20-day EMA ($214). This suggests a positive sentiment where dips are being purchased.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/ee1ea45f-cf1c-4ae3-93ee-112f3d9e9627.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have the edge. A break and close above $220 will suggest the start of a new uptrend. The BNB/USDT pair could first rally to $235 and subsequently to $250.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $220, the bears will again attempt to tug the pair below the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it will indicate that the consolidation may extend for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose above the symmetrical triangle pattern on Sep. 29 and the bulls held the retest of the breakout level on Sep. 30. This suggests that bulls are back in the game.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/5ef88cf6-70ff-4885-a21b-d645b648e5f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will next try to drive the price to the overhead resistance at $0.56. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a rally above it could indicate the start of a new uptrend toward the pattern target of $0.64.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from $0.56, it will suggest that the bears have not given up and they continue to sell on rallies. That could restrict the XRP/USDT pair inside the range between $0.41 and $0.56 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) blasted above the $22.30 overhead resistance on Oct. 1, indicating that the bulls are on a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/5dc77057-3cc1-4cd4-a5f4-804fb35aab1f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sharp up-move has pushed the RSI into the overbought space, suggesting that the rally may soon face resistance. The bears may attempt to stall the recovery at $25.50 and then again at $27.12. If the price turns down from this level, it will signal that the $14 to $27.12 range remains intact.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($20.50). Sellers will have to yank the SOL/USDT pair back below this level to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  tempo.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-28-5-k-trader-bitcoin-disbelief"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price knocks on $28.5K as trader says Bitcoin 'reeks of disbelief'}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) soared above the downtrend line and the 50-day SMA ($0.25) on Oct. 1, invalidating the developing \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/d9c87fde-ff30-4b4d-92e5-d059208d1d38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Generally, the failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup is a positive sign as bulls who have been waiting on the sidelines jump in to buy. However, before that, the price may turn down and retest the breakout level.\par \par \uc2 If the level holds, it will signal that the bulls have flipped the downtrend line into support. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then start an up-move to $0.29 and thereafter to $0.32.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and re-enters the triangle, it will indicate that the markets have rejected the higher levels. The pair may then retest the important support at $0.24.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($0.06) on Sep. 29 and reached the 50-day SMA ($0.06) on Oct. 1. This shows that the bulls are trying to start an up-move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/75a0720d-7a18-4792-b736-ba23d2903e50.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattish but the RSI has jumped into the positive zone, indicating that the momentum is turning positive. A close above the 50-day SMA will open the gates for a possible rally to $0.07. This level may act as a minor hurdle but if crossed, the DOGE/USDT pair is likely to climb to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to prevent the rally, they will have to quickly tug the price back below the 20-day EMA. The pair may then retest the crucial support at $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin\u8217\'20\'19s (TON) relief rally fizzled out at $2.31 on Sep. 28, indicating that the bears are selling at higher levels. The price turned down but the bulls held the $2.07 support on Oct. 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/a2d8198d-51bc-4278-8dda-8b5fd0b9bb5d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3ATONUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears renewed their selling on Oct. 2 and pulled the price below the vital support at $2.07. If the price sustains below this level, the selling could intensify and the TON/USDT pair risks tumbling down to the 50-day SMA ($1.84).\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to drive the price above $2.31 to open the doors for a possible retest of the overhead resistance at $2.59. This level may again attract aggressive selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/250b4ea2-cbd5-4a82-9b53-03e9ae83fc11.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231002eja2000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Why is the crypto market up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Kyle White \par \uc2 611 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 October 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins go on a tear as \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  sees an uptick at the start of October.\par \par \uc2 The crypto market is up today, with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and numerous altcoins rallying to start the month of October. Crypto and equities markets responded positively to the United States\u8217\'20\'19 temporary aversion to a government shutdown, bringing the total crypto market cap up $3.7 billion to $1.1 trillion on Oct. 2.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/d4629446-3503-460b-9fdf-03086306fa88.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market 1-day price action. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s examine three of the major factors influencing today\u8217\'20\'19s crypto market rally.\par \par \uc2 Uptober is off to a solid start\par \par \uc2 October has historically been celebrated as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-uptober-up-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CUptober\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  due to the positive returns in the crypto market. Bitcoin and crypto market prices rallied 5% to over $28,500.\par \par \uc2 The seasonality of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s returns in October has remained positive, only failing to achieve gains three times in the past. With such a strong history, October is statistically one of the best months for Bitcoin price gains.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/532c9418-2635-4758-8158-e67e2d0c3aff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin returns by month. Source: Look Into Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 A strong October is much needed after the third quarter of 2023 saw {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/700-m-loss-crypto-hacks-exploits-scams-q3-certik"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $700 million in losses}}}\uc2  resulting from a variety of hacks.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/dao-hyped-voting-decentralization/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Are DAOs overhyped and unworkable? Lessons from the front lines}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto liquidations rule the day\par \par \uc2 The crypto market rally started on Oct. 1 and fueled a wave of short position liquidations across the market, totaling over $92 million in 24 hours. Bitcoin short liquidations led the way, with the largest single liquidation of $8.39 million in one transaction on the \uc2 Huobi\uc2  exchange. In total, $51.5 million in Bitcoin shorts were liquidated in 24 hours.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/670f5ccf-e493-42a2-acde-ade6d4d1ebe0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total crypto liquidations in 1-day. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Despite the short-seller losing streak, 50.5% of the futures market remains short. With the ratio still skewed short, a potential opportunity for a short squeeze could happen and lead to further price upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/f5e2bd7b-4ed3-4dad-9bad-387a82312c5b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin short vs. long ratio. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Macro factors could benefit the crypto market\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 U.S. government{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/industry-leaders-policymakers-government-shutdown"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 averting a shutdown}}}\uc2  on Sept. 30 may have helped the initial Oct. 1 crypto price pump, which quickly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-ethereum-price-pump-uptober-millions-short-liquidation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wiped out $70 million}}}\uc2  in shorts.\par \par \uc2 Despite the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  refusing to approve a Bitcoin exchange-traded fund (ETF) and its continued war on the crypto market, large institutions remain interested in the space.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-28-5-k-trader-bitcoin-disbelief"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price knocks on $28.5K as trader says Bitcoin \u8216\'20\'18reeks of disbelief\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par \uc2 Such interest led \uc2 VanEck\uc2  and Bitwise to both launch Ether ETFs on Oct. 2. The Bitwise ETF will launch on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitwise-announces-ethereum-etf-launch-on-october-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chicago Mercantile Exchange}}}\uc2 , while the VankEck Ether ETF will launch on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/van-eck-ethereum-strategy-etf-launches-cboe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Chicago Board Options Exchange}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin and altcoins still have overhanging risk events that could impact the price, the growing institutional interest is improving sentiment across the market. The Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-this-week-fear-26k-key-5-things"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fear & Greed Index}}}\uc2  highlights the improved sentiment, noting an 11-point increase over the last month.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-10/a4aecffa-42b0-4ac0-8b0f-91f740122606.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Fear & Greed Index. Source: Alternative.me\par \par \uc2 Overall, crypto markets are likely to continue to experience price \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . While the positive start to October is providing a nice short-term bump in crypto prices, the market\u8217\'20\'19s reaction to any new enforcement actions or an economic recession will be the true determinant of the direction the market chooses to take.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/a633230d-3f9a-4749-8bab-017c4b9435a0.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231002eja2000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/29: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,694 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is holding $26,000 and confident traders are beginning to take on a bit of risk by buying altcoins. Is the market reversing its trend?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to trade above $27,000 in a positive sign. In the past few days, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price held above $26,000 in adverse conditions as the U.S. Dollar Index rose sharply and the S&P 500 index was plunging. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The decision by the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-delays-spot-bitcoin-etfs-blackrock-bitwise-valkyrie-invesco"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 delay the applications}}}\uc2  for multiple spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) ahead of schedule also did not dent prices. This indicates that the market participants are taking a longer-term view of Bitcoin. Bloomberg ETF analyst James Seyffart believes that the regulator took an early decision because of the risk of a \uc2 U.S. government\uc2  shutdown on Oct. 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/02362af4-fc81-4f9e-868d-2615510483af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s resilience over the past few days seems to have boosted trader\u8217\'20\'19s sentiment. That helped start a recovery in most major altcoins, which are trying to climb above their respective resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin extend its up-move in the near term and will that start a revival in the crypto space? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 After struggling for several days, the bulls finally propelled Bitcoin above the moving averages on Sept. 28. The bulls are currently trying to thwart attempts by the bears to yank the price back below the 20-day exponential moving average ($26,534).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/8792095e-a1be-4b8c-8a62-1c07015e75ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the positive territory, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside. There is a minor resistance at $27,500, but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair could then rally to the overhead resistance at $28,143. This level is again likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the $26,000 level is important to watch out for. If this level gives way, the advantage will tilt in favor of the bears. The pair may then nosedive to the formidable support at $24,800.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) climbed and closed above the 20-day EMA ($1,622) on Sept. 28, indicating that the selling pressure is reducing. The buyers continued their purchase and cleared the hurdle at the 50-day simple moving average ($1,660) on Sept. 29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/47d2b880-b7ea-4986-9ac1-b20b1ae3dda0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to drive the price to the overhead resistance of $1,746. This is an important level to keep an eye on because if buyers overcome this barrier, the ETH/USDT pair will complete a double bottom pattern. This reversal setup has a target objective of $1,961.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from $1,746, it will indicate that the bears remain sellers on rallies. The price could then dip to the 20-day EMA. If the price rebounds off this support, it will enhance the prospects of a rally above $1,746. The bears will be back in the game if they drag the price back below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside the $220 to $203 range for the past few days. The bulls are trying to nudge the price to the overhead resistance at $220.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/dde04001-26da-4639-837c-6250ba738698.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($213) is flat but the RSI has risen into positive territory, indicating that the momentum is turning in favor of the bulls. If the $220 resistance is surmounted, the BNB/USDT pair could surge to $235.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply from $220, it will indicate that the range-bound action may continue for a while longer. The next leg of the downtrend will begin after bears tug the price below $203.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.50) on Sept. 28 and followed that up with a move above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on Sept. 29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/b95cdf21-c4e8-4c0a-b44d-2e11a216c6c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the triangle, it will signal that the uncertainty has resolved in favor of the buyers. The XRP/USDT pair could then rally to the overhead resistance at $0.56. This is an important resistance to watch out for because a break above it will clear the path for a potential rally to the pattern target of $0.64.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and reenters the triangle, it will indicate that markets have rejected the higher levels. The bears will then try to gain the edge by pulling the price below the uptrend line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to sustain Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.25) on Sept. 29, which shows that the bears are losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/9ea63362-603d-4718-9443-927434f96864.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the downtrend line will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. Generally, the failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern results in a sharp up-move as the sellers rush to exit their shorts and the bulls waiting on the sidelines start buying. That could propel the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to $0.29 and subsequently to $0.32.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to regain control, they will have to defend the downtrend line and pull the price below $0.24. The next support on the downside is at $0.22.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) range has shrunk in the past few days, increasing the prospect of a range expansion within the next few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/7a511907-ce33-42ed-820b-16f6e761188a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.06) is flattening out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA with force, it will signal the start of a recovery. The DOGE/USDT pair could first rise to $0.07 and thereafter to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they must quickly drag the price below $0.06. If they do that, the pair may plunge to the next critical support at $0.055.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck inside the large range between $27.12 and $14 for the past several days. Trading inside a range can be random and volatile as bulls typically buy at the support and sell near the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/862dd913-9320-4316-8e04-20609f66c131.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to start a relief rally, which has reached the 50-day SMA ($20.44). This is an important level to watch out for because a break above it will suggest that the bulls are back in the game. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could then rise to $22.30.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA, it will indicate that the bears are active at higher levels. Sellers will have to tug the price below $18.50 to open the doors for a retest of $17.33.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-ethereum-eth-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Ether (ETH) price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($2.13) on Sept. 27, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/873a80c2-e686-4374-a0b5-2417dcbc4159.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Sept. 27 and 28 candlestick shows that the bears are selling at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $2.28. However, a positive sign in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to slip below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to shove the price above the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $2.40 to open the doors for a retest of the stiff overhead resistance at $2.59. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and plummets below $2.07.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sink Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the $3.91 support indicates that the range-bound action remains intact.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/2082caba-1158-49d4-9080-6973f71c7dd8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to drive the price above the 20-day EMA ($4.10) and challenge the overhead resistance at the 50-day SMA ($4.32). If this level is cleared, the DOT/USDT pair could surge to the downtrend line. The bulls will have to overcome this barrier to signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is $3.91. A break below this level will suggest the resumption of the downtrend toward $3.58.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) turned up from $0.50 on Sept. 28 indicating solid buying at lower levels. The price has reached the 20-day EMA ($0.52), which is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/1810be4f-0156-47dc-ae6c-484feb57c946.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The positive divergence on the RSI indicates that the selling pressure is reducing. That enhances the prospects of a break above the moving averages. The MATIC/USDT pair could then retest the overhead resistance at $0.60. The bears are expected to protect this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to maintain their control, they will have to yank the price below the strong support at $0.49. If this support gives way, the pair may drop to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/388816f3-9cba-4f26-b440-36e2c8bb72da.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230930ej9t00005\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/29: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,705 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is holding $26,000 and confident traders are beginning to take on a bit of risk by buying altcoins. Is the market reversing its trend?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to trade above $27,000 which is a positive sign. In the past few days, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price held up above $26,000 in adverse conditions when the United States dollar index (DXY) was rising sharply and the S&P 500 index (SPX) was plunging. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The decision by the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-delays-spot-bitcoin-etfs-blackrock-bitwise-valkyrie-invesco"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 delay the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund}}}\uc2  (ETFs) ahead of schedule also did not dent prices. This indicates that the market participants are taking a longer-term view on Bitcoin. Bloomberg ETF analyst James Seyffart believes that an early decision was taken by the regulator as there is a risk of a \uc2 U.S. government\uc2  shutdown on Oct. 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/02362af4-fc81-4f9e-868d-2615510483af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s resilience over the past few days seems to have boosted trader\u8217\'20\'19s sentiment. That helped start a recovery in most major altcoins, which are trying to climb above their respective resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin extend its up-move in the near term and will that start a revival in the crypto space? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 After struggling for several days, the bulls finally propelled Bitcoin above the moving averages on Sep. 28. The bulls are currently trying to thwart attempts by the bears to yank the price back below the 20-day exponential moving average ($26,534).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/8792095e-a1be-4b8c-8a62-1c07015e75ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the positive territory, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside. There is a minor resistance at $27,500 but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair could then rally to the overhead resistance at $28,143. This level is again likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the $26,000 level is an important level to watch out for. If this level gives way, the advantage will tilt in favor of the bears. The pair may then nosedive to the formidable support at $24,800.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) climbed and closed above the 20-day EMA ($1,622) on Sep. 28, indicating that the selling pressure is reducing. The buyers continued their purchase and cleared the hurdle at the 50-day simple moving average ($1,660) on Sep. 29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/47d2b880-b7ea-4986-9ac1-b20b1ae3dda0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to drive the price to the overhead resistance of $1,746. This is an important level to keep an eye on because if buyers overcome this barrier, the ETH/USDT pair will complete a double bottom pattern. This reversal setup has a target objective of $1,961.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from $1,746, it will indicate that the bears remain sellers on rallies. The price could then dip to the 20-day EMA. If the price rebounds off this support, it will enhance the prospects of a rally above $1,746. The bears will be back in the game if they drag the price back below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside the $220 to $203 range for the past few days. The bulls are trying to nudge the price to the overhead resistance at $220.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/dde04001-26da-4639-837c-6250ba738698.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($213) is flat but the RSI has risen into positive territory, indicating that the momentum is turning in favor of the bulls. If the $220 resistance is surmounted, the BNB/USDT pair could surge to $235.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply from $220, it will indicate that the range-bound action may continue for a while longer. The next leg of the downtrend will begin after bears tug the price below $203.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.50) on Sep. 28 and followed that up with a move above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on Sep. 29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/b95cdf21-c4e8-4c0a-b44d-2e11a216c6c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the triangle, it will signal that the uncertainty has resolved in favor of the buyers. The XRP/USDT pair could then rally to the overhead resistance at $0.56. This is an important resistance to watch out for because a break above it will clear the path for a potential rally to the pattern target of $0.64.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and re-enters the triangle, it will indicate that markets have rejected the higher levels. The bears will then try to gain the edge by pulling the price below the uptrend line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to sustain Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.25) on Sep. 29, which shows that the bears are losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/9ea63362-603d-4718-9443-927434f96864.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the downtrend line will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. Generally, the failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern results in a sharp up-move as the sellers rush to exit their shorts and the bulls waiting on the sidelines start buying. That could propel the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to $0.29 and subsequently to $0.32.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to regain control, they will have to defend the downtrend line and pull the price below $0.24. The next support on the downside is at $0.22.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) range has shrunk in the past few days, increasing the prospect of a range expansion within the next few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/7a511907-ce33-42ed-820b-16f6e761188a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.06) is flattening out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA with force, it will signal the start of a recovery. The DOGE/USDT pair could first rise to $0.07 and thereafter to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to quickly drag the price below $0.06. If they do that, the pair may plunge to the next critical support at $0.055.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck inside the large range between $27.12 and $14 for the past several days. Trading inside a range can be random and volatile as bulls typically buy at the support and sell near the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/862dd913-9320-4316-8e04-20609f66c131.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to start a relief rally, which has reached the 50-day SMA ($20.44). This is an important level to watch out for because a break above it will suggest that the bulls are back in the game. The SOL/USDT pair could then rise to $22.30.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA, it will indicate that the bears are active at higher levels. Sellers will have to tug the price below $18.50 to open the doors for a retest of $17.33.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-ethereum-eth-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Ether (ETH) price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($2.13) on Sep. 27, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/873a80c2-e686-4374-a0b5-2417dcbc4159.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Sep. 27 and 28 candlestick shows that the bears are selling at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $2.28. However, a positive sign in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to slip below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to shove the price above the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $2.40 to open the doors for a retest of the stiff overhead resistance at $2.59. This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and plummets below $2.07.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sink Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the $3.91 support indicates that the range-bound action remains intact.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/2082caba-1158-49d4-9080-6973f71c7dd8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOTUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to drive the price above the 20-day EMA ($4.10) and challenge the overhead resistance at the 50-day SMA ($4.32). If this level is cleared, the DOT/USDT pair could surge to the downtrend line. The bulls will have to overcome this barrier to signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is $3.91. A break below this level will suggest the resumption of the downtrend toward $3.58.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) turned up from $0.50 on Sep. 28 indicating solid buying at lower levels. The price has reached the 20-day EMA ($0.52), which is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/1810be4f-0156-47dc-ae6c-484feb57c946.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The positive divergence on the RSI indicates that the selling pressure is reducing. That enhances the prospects of a break above the moving averages. The MATIC/USDT pair could then retest the overhead resistance at $0.60. The bears are expected to protect this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to maintain their control, they will have to yank the price below the strong support at $0.49. If this support gives way, the pair may drop to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/388816f3-9cba-4f26-b440-36e2c8bb72da.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230929ej9t000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/27: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,663 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The strength in the U.S. dollar has failed to drag Bitcoin and select major altcoins lower, indicating that the selling may be limited.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) managed to stay above the $26,000 level even as the S&P 500 tumbled to a three-month low and the US dollar index (DXY) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-26k-us-dollar-strength-10-month-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rose to a new year-to-date high}}}\uc2 . This is a mildly positive sign as it shows a lack of aggressive selling at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin remains stuck inside a range and the directionless price action has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-exchange-volume-5-year-lows-fed-btc-hodling"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 kept the traders on the sidelines}}}\uc2 . Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s daily spot exchange transactions topped 600,000 in March but dwindled down to 8,000-15,000 last week, according to new research from on-chain analytics platform CryptoQuant. Low liquidity could lead to volatile moves in either direction, hence traders should be careful and wait for confirmations rather than taking positions on every intraday breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/b7d24735-0cf5-4d7f-adbb-49cf62ca3217.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The near-term price action remains uncertain but that has not deterred the long-term bulls from adding Bitcoin to their portfolio. \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  co-founder and executive chairman \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  announced on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-buys-5-4k-bitcoin-for-147million"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 firm had acquired 5,445 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  at an average price of $27,053 per Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and select altcoins start a short-term up-move? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the 20-day exponential moving average ($26,436). The bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA on Sep. 27 but could not clear the 50-day simple moving average ($26,757).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/e2515c3c-2f50-4dea-9f7c-21671341c280.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This indicates that the bears have not given up and are selling the rallies to the 50-day SMA. The bears will have to pull the price below $25,990 to clear the path for a potential fall to $24,800. This level is likely to attract solid buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 50-day SMA. The BTC/USDT pair may then rise to $27,500 and subsequently to the overhead resistance at $28,143. The bears are expected to defend this level with all their might.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is trying to start a recovery. The price rose above the 20-day EMA ($1,614) on Sep. 27 but the bulls could not hold on to the intraday rally. This shows that the higher levels continue to attract sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/64e4b473-303e-4da2-94cb-114a535738bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) favors the buyers. If they retain the price above the 20-day EMA, the ETH/USDT pair could first rise to the 50-day SMA ($1,668) and thereafter attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $1,746.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price remains below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are in command. The sellers will then try to yank the price below the important support at $1,531. If that happens, the pair may crash to $1,368.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) remains below the breakdown level of $220 but a positive sign is that the bulls have not allowed the price to slip below $203.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/713fe897-a567-4d9b-b2f5-e4ad3510204d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($213) is flattening out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This equilibrium will tilt in favor of the bulls if they kick the price above $220. The BNB/USDT pair could then ascend to $235.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price continues lower and breaks below $203, it will signal that the bears have asserted their supremacy. The pair may then start the next leg of the downtrend to the strong support at $183.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to thrust XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.50) on Sep. 25 but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/c8d41b30-497b-47d0-9f61-4f41a70e7280.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to gain the upper hand by dragging the price below the uptrend line. If they are successful, the XRP/USDT pair may descend to $0.46 and then to $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up and breaks above the resistance line, it will indicate that bulls are trying to seize control. The pair may then climb to the overhead resistance at $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the vital support at $0.24 on Sep. 25 but the bulls are struggling to push the price above the 20-day EMA. This may result in more selling.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/b7124748-ae58-47eb-af1e-9524c5201188.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The $0.24 level is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. If the $0.24 support gives way, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. The pair may then start a downward move to $0.22 and subsequently to the pattern target of $0.19.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up and breaks above the downtrend line, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The pair may then start an up-move to $0.29.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the $0.06 support on Sep. 26 but the long tail on the candlestick shows buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/5d3669d1-da09-47a7-99c9-596a0032e42d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the gradually downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.06) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears remain in command. Sellers will make another attempt to sink and sustain the price below $0.06. If they can pull it off, the DOGE/USDT pair may plummet to the next significant support at $0.055.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bulls are on a comeback. The pair could first rally to $0.07 and thereafter dash toward $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to propel Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($19.42) in the past few days shows that the bears are aggressively protecting the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/cc15f17e-25a6-4114-af5f-9c1c9ddf14fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has turned down from the 20-day EMA and the bears will try to build upon their advantage by pulling the SOL/USDT pair below the nearest support at $18.50. If this level cracks, the selling could pick up and the next stop is likely to be $17.33.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price bounces off $18.50, it will suggest buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to shove the price above the moving averages. If they do that, the pair may jump to $22.30.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-30k-october-analyst-btc-climbs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price to $30K in October, says analyst as BTC price climbs 2%}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has dropped to the 20-day EMA ($2.11) which is an important level to keep an eye on. In an uptrend, buyers generally buy the dips to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/43910ac3-d6e1-4146-b580-78a0cfc33de7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Here too, the bulls purchased the fall to the 20-day EMA on Sep. 27 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears are selling at higher levels. If buyers maintain the price above the 20-day EMA, the TON/USDT pair will attempt a rally to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $2.40.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, sellers are likely to have other plans. They will try to yank the price below $2.07 and extend the correction to the next major support at the 50-day SMA ($1.76).\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has remained stuck below the 20-day EMA ($4.10) for the past several days, suggesting that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/180df26a-7e24-4682-ac9d-2dd040cd439e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOTUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI is showing signs of forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence but the buyers will have to clear the overhead hurdle at $4.22 to reduce the selling pressure. If that does not happen, the risk of a further fall remains.\par \par \uc2 If the DOT/USDT pair continues lower and skids below the immediate support at $3.91, it will indicate the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The next support on the downside is at $3.58.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the critical support at $0.51 on Sep 25 but the bulls could not push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.53).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/a7728ae6-46b6-4e34-aa84-6fe4d6a5931b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will try to sink the price below the Sep. 11 intraday low of $0.49. A collapse of this support will indicate the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 A minor ray of hope for the bulls is that the RSI is forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. Buyers will have to drive and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to signal the start of a sustained recovery. The MATIC/USDT pair could then rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.56).\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/7208c633-9694-493a-9680-ecc29b9ffb57.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230927ej9r000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
