\par\par \b \uc2 Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) is Still Down as Solana (SOL) Gains Momentum: Everlodge (ELDG) Continues to Have an Upper Hand\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 681 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 September 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Content\par \par \uc2 * Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Suffers Due to Selling Pressure\par \par \uc2 * Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) Looks to Strengthen its Position\par \par \uc2 * Less Than a Week for Everlodge (ELDG) Token\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 Price Rise\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 * Find out more about the Everlodge (ELDG) Presale\par \par \uc2 The crypto community breathes a sigh of relief as the market recovers. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) struggles even as Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) turns green. Everlodge is confident of its \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  position during the presale.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.everlodge.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Join the Everlodge presale and win a luxury holiday to the Maldives}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Suffers Due to Selling Pressure\par \par \uc2 Data shows high selling pressure is affecting Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) price. Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s token stayed well below the $0.28 mark for an entire month. Furthermore, Cardano fell to $0.2379 last week before gaining a slight upward movement.\par \par \uc2 Cardano is at $0.2507, at press time, registering a 7.20% loss for the month. Fortunately, the weekly graph is green, and shows a gain of 1.50%. With Bitcoin (BTC) recovering, most cryptocurrencies have started to push upward. While Cardano is no exception, the token is still in a weaker position.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s TVL (total locked value) has grown in the first half of 2023, but declined since July. According to on-site data, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) recorded a 30% decline in TVL since July due to decreased network activity. Unsurprisingly, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s prediction remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Cardano can turn the tide by crossing $0.40. This can be possible if Bitcoin breaks through the $31,000 mark soon.\par \par \uc2 Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) Looks to Strengthen its Position\par \par \uc2 Like other cryptocurrencies, Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) is also in the recovery mode. The price crossed $20 twice this week, though Solana is trading at $19.89 at press time. There\u8217\'20\'19s been a slight increase of 0.26% in the market cap. Moreover, Solana is now among the top ten performers in the crypto market.\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s recovery is remarkable, considering the price fell to $17.55 last week. This short-term gain has boosted the community\u8217\'20\'19s hope, while analysts are calculating to measure the potential long-term growth for the token.\par \par \uc2 In other news, Eclipse mainnet introduced Ethereum SMV L2. SVM is Solana Virtual Machine, which Eclipse considers the right choice for its environment. Additionally, Eclipse feels Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) would boost the speed of the project, and make it more scalable. It\u8217\'20\'19s rather amusing that Solana intended to replace Ethereum, but the two will be working together. However, Solana has a prominent role in the project, which could boost its price momentum.\par \par \uc2 Less Than a Week for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://everlodge.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Everlodge}}}\uc2  (ELDG) Token\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 Price Rise\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Everlodge is a property marketplace on the blockchain for users to co-own vacation homes, luxury hotels, resorts, and villas. The platform will digitize, and mint vacation properties into NFT. These NFTs will be fractionalized into smaller ones for users to purchase them for lesser amounts.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, Everlodge will offer memberships and discounts to facilitate co-ownership of vacation properties for as little as $100. Moreover, statistics show global luxury vacation home rentals will grow by 13.1% from 2021 to 2031. Investors can diversify their portfolios by co-owning vacation properties on the blockchain.\par \par \uc2 The ELDG token is priced at $0.018, in Stage 3 of the presale. Analysts predict the price will grow by 280% in the coming days. The token has a strong \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend, and is ready to register another hike in less than a week. Furthermore, the platform\u8217\'20\'19s ecosystem offers many rewards, deals, etc. Users can also stake their native tokens to get short-term loans.\par \par \uc2 Join the presale to get a 20% bonus, and be eligible to win a luxury holiday to the Maldives.\par \par \uc2 Find out more about the Everlodge (ELDG) Presale\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.everlodge.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.everlodge.io/}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/everlodge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/everlodge}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020230926ej9q000xd\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/25: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,695 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin risks a fall to its strong support near $25,000, which could cause a sell-off in select altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) weakness on Sept. 24 shows that the bears remain in control. Sellers are trying to pull the price below $26,000, but the bulls are likely to defend the level with vigor. Buyers are trying to achieve a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-govt-shutdown-looms-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 positive monthly close for Bitcoin in September}}}\uc2  for the first time since 2016.\par \par \uc2 If they can pull it off, it will be a major sentiment booster, as October generally favors the buyers. According to CoinGlass data, Bitcoin has seen a negative monthly close in October only on two occasions, in 2014 and 2018. However, Bitcoin bulls will find it difficult to maintain the momentum if macroeconomic headwinds persist.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/23e29adb-f998-4c77-af4d-9233b366fc16.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another risk to the cryptocurrency recovery may come from the strength of the greenback, which has risen for 10 straight weeks, its longest winning streak since 2014. The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) has also formed a golden cross, indicating further potential upside in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Will the U.S. dollar extend its gains or witness a short-term correction? Can Bitcoin bulls hold off the bear pressure in the last week of September? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index turned down sharply from the downtrend line and broke below the moving averages on Sept. 15. This started a downward move, which has reached the crucial support at 4,325.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/130b1eff-0843-48f3-92e4-b7e815d01626.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) (4,422) has started to turn down, and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the oversold territory, indicating that bears have the edge. If the price maintains below 4,325, the index will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders (H&S) pattern. This negative setup has a target objective of 4,043.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the fall, they will have to quickly drive the price above the 20-day EMA. That could attract further buying, and the bulls will then attempt to kick the price above the downtrend line. If they manage to do that, the index has a good chance of retesting the local high at 4,607.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index bounced off the 20-day EMA (104.85) on Sept. 20, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/008d177a-5033-4289-802f-ecfe150ec1e3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The up-move is likely to hit a wall at 106. This is the key level to keep an eye on in the near term. If the price turns down from this resistance but bounces off the 20-day EMA, it will enhance the prospects of a rally above 106. The next resistance on the upside is at 108.\par \par \uc2 Sellers will have to yank the price back below the 20-day EMA if they want to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. The index could then drop to 104.40 and later to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) (103.35).\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty from the inside-day candlestick pattern on Sept. 22 and 23 resolved to the downside on Sept. 24. This suggests that the bears have asserted their supremacy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/090aef31-c88f-450e-8cc0-b79005491b55.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will try to strengthen their position further by pulling the price to the solid support at $24,800. This remains the key level to watch out for in the near term, as the bulls are expected to defend it with all their might. If the $24,800 support gives way, the BTC/USDT pair could start a downward move to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bulls. If they want to start a meaningful recovery, they will have to push and sustain the price above the moving averages. That will open the doors for a retest of the overhead resistance at $28,143.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually slipping toward the pivotal level at $1,531, suggesting a lack of buying support from the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/36c118f3-8d3c-47d7-9b02-22eb1590feaa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the downsloping moving averages indicate an advantage to sellers, the RSI is showing signs of forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. This suggests that the selling pressure could be reducing. This increases the likelihood of a bounce off $1,531.\par \par \uc2 If bulls shove the price above the 20-day EMA ($1,616), it will signal a range-bound action between $1,531 and $1,746 for a few days. This view will invalidate if bears sink and sustain the ETH/USDT pair below $1,531. The pair could then plummet to $1,368.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been swinging between $220 and $203 for the past few days. In a range, traders generally buy near the support and sell close to the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/82bdc1bc-bbc4-4529-afcf-28b248e3c973.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down, indicating an advantage to bears, but the RSI is trying to form a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. This suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. Buyers are likely to defend the $203 level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises from the current level or bounces off $203, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for some more time. Sellers will need to tug the price below the critical support at $203 to take charge. The BNB/USDT pair could then plunge to $183.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 After staying above the 20-day EMA ($0.50) for a few days, XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) tumbled below the level on Sept. 24. This suggests that the bears have gained the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/b87738d1-cc6b-45b6-b3ff-e505f99984b2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 XRP price could fall to the uptrend line, which is expected to act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off the uptrend line, the bulls will again try to shove the price above the 20-day EMA. If they do that, it will signal aggressive buying at lower levels. The pair may then climb to the 50-day SMA ($0.53).\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the uptrend line fails to hold, XRP price could first slump to $0.46 and thereafter to the formidable support at $0.41. This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dropped to the critical support at $0.24 on Sept. 25, indicating that the bears have maintained their pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/2a464d0f-3cb9-46d4-8c00-36eed1b8ab1c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that the RSI is forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. The bulls will have to quickly shove the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair above the downtrend line to reduce the risk of a breakdown below $0.24. If they can pull it off, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle will be rendered invalid, which could boost the price to $0.29.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if bears drag \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price below $0.24, it will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That could start a downward move toward $0.22 and subsequently to the pattern target of $0.19.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-much-is-bitcoin-worth-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How much is Bitcoin worth today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is stuck inside a tight range between $0.06 and the 20-day EMA ($0.06). Typically, a \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  squeeze is followed by an expansion in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/71f47801-dc8d-4697-aed6-fdea767c76fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up off the current level, the bulls will again try to clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to $0.07 and later sprint to $0.08. The bears are expected to sell near this level.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the range resolves to the downside with a break below $0.06, it will indicate that bears have seized control. DOGE price may then nosedive to the next major support at $0.055.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) turned down sharply from the overhead resistance at $2.59 on Sept. 20 and continued lower, indicating that the bulls are booking profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/8109e4d4-c699-4682-9835-14de6c5c1168.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is at the 20-day EMA ($2.11). If the price rebounds off this level with strength, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to push the price to $2.59.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price skids below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls are losing their grip. The TON/USDT pair could first dip to the psychological level of $2 and later to the 50-day SMA ($1.72). A deeper correction is likely to delay the next leg of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been clinging to the 20-day EMA ($19.53) for the past few days, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/c5f9b7b7-35d8-424c-8e58-dbfdb27057f3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint indicate a balance between supply and demand. On the upside, the bulls will have to thrust the price above the 50-day SMA ($20.80) to signal the start of a recovery to $22.30.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the bears are back in command. The SOL/USDT pair could then retest the important support at $17.33. If this level snaps, the pair may collapse to $14.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/9ec40e5a-dcb9-4ec6-8be4-65837b9dca08.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230925ej9p000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/25: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,689 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 