 downtrend line and broke below the moving averages on Sep. 15. This started a downward move, which has reached the crucial support at 4,325.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/130b1eff-0843-48f3-92e4-b7e815d01626.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (4,422) has started to turn down and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the oversold territory, indicating that bears have the edge. If the price maintains below 4,325, the index will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders (H&S) pattern. This negative setup has a target objective of 4,043.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the fall, they will have to quickly drive the price above the 20-day EMA. That could attract further buying and the bulls will then attempt to kick the price above the downtrend line. If they manage to do that, the index has a good chance of retesting the local high at 4,607.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index bounced off the 20-day EMA (104.85) on Sep. 20, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/008d177a-5033-4289-802f-ecfe150ec1e3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The up-move is likely to hit a wall at 106. This is the key level to keep an eye on in the near term. If the price turns down from this resistance but bounces off the 20-day EMA, it will enhance the prospects of a rally above 106. The next resistance on the upside is at 108.\par \par \uc2 Sellers will have to yank the price back below the 20-day EMA if they want to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. The index could then drop to 104.40 and later to the 50-day simple moving average (103.35).\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty from the inside-day candlestick pattern on Sep. 22 and 23 resolved to the downside on Sep. 24. This suggests that the bears have asserted their supremacy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/090aef31-c88f-450e-8cc0-b79005491b55.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sellers will try to strengthen their position further by pulling the price to the solid support at $24,800. This remains the key level to watch out for in the near term as the bulls are expected to defend it with all their might. If the $24,800 support gives way, the BTC/USDT pair could start a downward move to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bulls. If they want to start a meaningful recovery, they will have to push and sustain the price above the moving averages. That will open the doors for a retest of the overhead resistance at $28,143.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually slipping toward the pivotal level at $1,531, suggesting a lack of buying support from the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/36c118f3-8d3c-47d7-9b02-22eb1590feaa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the downsloping moving averages indicate advantage to sellers, the RSI is showing signs of forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. This suggests that the selling pressure could be reducing. This increases the likelihood of a bounce off $1,531.\par \par \uc2 If bulls shove the price above the 20-day EMA ($1,616), it will signal a range-bound action between $1,531 and $1,746 for a few days. This view will invalidate if bears sink and sustain the ETH/USDT pair below $1,531. The pair could then plummet to $1,368.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been swinging between $220 and $203 for the past few days. In a range, traders generally buy near the support and sell close to the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/82bdc1bc-bbc4-4529-afcf-28b248e3c973.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down, indicating advantage to bears but the RSI is trying to form a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. This suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. Buyers are likely to defend the $203 level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises from the current level or bounces off $203, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for some more time. Sellers will need to tug the price below the critical support at $203 to take charge. The BNB/USDT pair could then plunge to $183.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 After staying above the 20-day EMA ($0.50) for a few days, XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) tumbled below the level on Sep. 24. This suggests that the bears have gained the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/b87738d1-cc6b-45b6-b3ff-e505f99984b2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP price could fall to the uptrend line, which is expected to act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off the uptrend line, the bulls will again try to shove the price above the 20-day EMA. If they do that, it will signal aggressive buying at lower levels. The pair may then climb to the 50-day SMA ($0.53).\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the uptrend line fails to hold, XRP price could first slump to $0.46 and thereafter to the formidable support at $0.41. This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dropped to the critical support at $0.24 on Sep. 25, indicating that the bears have maintained their pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/2a464d0f-3cb9-46d4-8c00-36eed1b8ab1c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that the RSI is forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. The bulls will have to quickly shove the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair above the downtrend line to reduce the risk of a breakdown below $0.24. If they can pull it off, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle will be rendered invalid and that could boost the price to $0.29.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if bears drag \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price below $0.24, it will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That could start a downward move toward $0.22 and subsequently to the pattern target of $0.19.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-much-is-bitcoin-worth-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How much is Bitcoin worth today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is stuck inside a tight range between $0.06 and the 20-day EMA ($0.06). Typically, a \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  squeeze is followed by an expansion in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  but it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/71f47801-dc8d-4697-aed6-fdea767c76fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up off the current level, the bulls will again try to clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to $0.07 and later sprint to $0.08. The bears are expected to sell near this level.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the range resolves to the downside with a break below $0.06, it will indicate that bears have seized control. DOGE price may then nosedive to the next major support at $0.055.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) turned down sharply from the overhead resistance at $2.59 on Sep. 20 and continued lower, indicating that the bulls are booking profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/8109e4d4-c699-4682-9835-14de6c5c1168.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is at the 20-day EMA ($2.11). If the price rebounds off this level with strength, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to push the price to $2.59.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price skids below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls are losing their grip. The TON/USDT pair could first dip to the psychological level of $2 and later to the 50-day SMA ($1.72). A deeper correction is likely to delay the next leg of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been clinging to the 20-day EMA ($19.53) for the past few days, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/c5f9b7b7-35d8-424c-8e58-dbfdb27057f3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint indicate a balance between supply and demand. On the upside, the bulls will have to thrust the price above the 50-day SMA ($20.80) to signal the start of a recovery to $22.30.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the bears are back in command. The SOL/USDT pair could then retest the important support at $17.33. If this level snaps, the pair may collapse to $14.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/9ec40e5a-dcb9-4ec6-8be4-65837b9dca08.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230925ej9p000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/22: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,686 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and the major altcoins are attracting buyers at lower levels, suggesting that the sentiment could be turning positive.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Federal Reserve{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-27k-fed-holds-interest-rates-fomc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 did not hike interest rates}}}\uc2  in its meeting on Sept. 20 but hinted that rates could remain higher for longer. At the post-meeting press conference, Fed Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/09/20/live-updates-fed-decision-september-2023.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cautioned}}}\uc2  that \u8220\'20\'1Cthe process of getting inflation sustainably down to 2% has a long way to go.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 This possible scenario may have triggered the sell-off in the United States equities markets and also in the cryptocurrency space. Risk assets typically tend to underperform in a high-interest-rate environment.\par \par \uc2 While the S&P 500 is down more than 2% and the Nasdaq about 3% this week, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has remained flat.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/643d2f4f-6faa-4a08-8625-b0421f37e9e7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Altcoins have been unable to hold on to their intra-week gains due to a risk-off sentiment. Still, an encouraging sign is that Bitcoin and the major altcoins have largely managed to stay above their crucial support levels. The price action over the next few days is critical as it is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 Will bears seize the initiative and drag Bitcoin and the major altcoins lower, or could buyers regroup and push prices higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading between the moving averages for the past few days. This tight-range trading indicates indecision between the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/9a0133ef-828a-484b-91c5-a9277a662a9b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers are attempting to keep the BTC/USDT pair above the 20-day exponential moving average ($26,520). If the price rises from the current level, the bulls will again try to overcome the barrier at the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($27,050). If they are successful, the pair could surge to the next resistance at $28,143.\par \par \uc2 In contrast, if the price plummets below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA), it will suggest that the bears are back in command. That will increase the possibility of a retest of the pivotal support at $24,800.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($1,628) on Sept. 20, indicating that the bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/f8f92b72-334a-475d-af78-cd2d0d836174.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to solidify their position further by pulling the price below the vital support at $1,530. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could start a downward move toward the next major support at $1,368.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off $1,530, it will suggest that lower levels are attracting buyers. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above $1,670. That will clear the path for a potential rally to $1,745.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $220 on Sept. 18 and broke below the 20-day EMA ($214) on Sept. 20. This suggests that the price may consolidate between $203 and $220 for a while longer.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/5dbed45b-571b-41b1-b71e-d2d3ff442cb7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the bears will make one more attempt to tug the BNB/USDT pair below the crucial support at $203. If they succeed, it will indicate the resumption of the downtrend. The next support on the downside is at $183.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to clear the hurdle at the 50-day SMA ($222) to signal a comeback. The pair could first rally to $235 and subsequently attempt an up-move to $250. This level is expected to attract sellers.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($0.51) on Sept. 19, but the bulls are struggling to sustain the recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/8fdeaf2a-496c-4a2f-b9f6-ef71efe950e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has again dropped to the 20-day EMA, which is an important support to keep an eye on. If the price turns up from the current level, it will suggest a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. The bulls will then again attempt to kick the price above the overhead zone between the 50-day SMA ($0.53) and $0.56.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the 20-day EMA gives way, the pair could fall to the uptrend line. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The price action of Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) over the past few days has formed a descending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close below $0.24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/787ec3f2-c48c-48e7-8f7c-6f7a02c826db.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually downsloping moving averages suggest an advantage to bears, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) indicates that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be slowing down. Buyers will have to quickly shove the price above the downtrend line to prevent a breakdown. If they do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair will be well-positioned for a relief rally to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below $0.24, it will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup and set the stage for a fall to $0.22 and eventually to the pattern target of $0.19.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.06) on Sept. 21, indicating that the bears are aggressively defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/3e6dc402-471f-463b-8674-9e53bce6f6a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bears have not been able to strengthen their position by yanking the price below the formidable support at $0.06. This suggests that the bulls are buying on dips. The DOGE/USDT pair may swing between $0.06 and the 20-day EMA for some more time.\par \par \uc2 If bulls kick the price above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate the start of a sustained recovery to the 50-day SMA ($0.07) and then to $0.08. On the downside, if the $0.06 level cracks, the pair risks a potential decline to $0.055.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($19.57) on Sept. 18, but the bulls could not push the price to the 50-day SMA ($21.01). This suggests that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/28dc7c1a-84c9-496d-8b8b-4c37b5edd72e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. If the sellers sustain the price below the 20-day EMA, the SOL/USDT pair could slump to $18.50 and thereafter to the next support at $17.33.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-all-time-high-argentina-hyperinflation-outpaces-gains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin blasts past its 2021 all-time high in Argentina, but hyperinflation outpaces gains}}}\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price sustains above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That could increase the possibility of a retest of the overhead resistance zone between the 50-day SMA and $22.30.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin\u8217\'20\'19s (TON) failure to rise above $2.59 on Sept. 19 and 20 may have tempted short-term traders to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/c582889f-c6fe-466c-acab-6395dc51a4e4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The immediate support on the downside is at $2.25. If this level is violated, the TON/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($2.08). If bulls want to retain the positive sentiment, they must defend this level. A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA could keep the pair stuck inside the large range between $2.07 and $2.59.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price snaps back from $2.25. If that happens, it will suggest that traders are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy. That will increase the likelihood of a break above $2.59. The pair may then jump to $2.90.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are fiercely guarding the breakdown level of $4.22 in Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ), indicating that every minor relief rally is being sold into.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/db17532c-ce8f-462e-ac22-8b8ce80d9804.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that the bears have the upper hand. If the price continues lower and skids below $3.90, it will suggest the start of the next leg of the downtrend toward $3.58.\par \par \uc2 A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that the RSI is showing early signs of forming a positive divergence. This suggests that the selling pressure could be reducing. A break and close above $4.22 will open the doors for a possible rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) closed above the 20-day EMA ($0.54) on Sept. 19, but the bulls failed to build upon the momentum. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/e56a9cb6-e267-444c-b98a-a4199b6f23b0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA on Sept. 21. The sellers will try to sink the pair below the strong support at $0.49. If they manage to do that, the MATIC/USDT pair could resume its downtrend. The next support on the downside is $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds of the $0.50 support with strength, it will suggest that lower levels are attracting buyers. The bulls will have to propel and sustain the price above $0.55 to signal the start of a stronger recovery.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/608e272c-47ab-4097-aadc-4436f6f80b75.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230922ej9m000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,647 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The crypto markets could witness increased \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s rate decision but it is unlikely to start a trending move.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) recovery is facing selling above $27,000, indicating near-term nervousness due to the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s meeting on Sept. 20. However, long-term investors are unfazed, and they have continued to accumulate. Glassnode data shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoiners-stacking-inactive-btc-supply-hits-all-time-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s inactive supply has been at all-time highs}}}\uc2  since July.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  temperament is not reflected in institutional activity, however. Investors have cut down on their cryptocurrency exposure and are sitting on the sidelines, awaiting more clarity on the regulatory and macroeconomic front. Asset manager \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  reported that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-fund-outflows-reach-nearly-half-billion-dollars-over-9-weeks-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outflows from exchange-traded products hit $455 million}}}\uc2  over the past nine weeks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/ab9fefbb-2ea3-49fd-a3b7-71dd374a41fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, analysts remain divided about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s near-term price action. Bollinger Bands creator \uc2 John Bollinger\uc2  speculated in an X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) post that Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bollinger-bands-btc-price-27k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 could start an up-move}}}\uc2  but added that it was \u8220\'20\'1Ctoo early to answer.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  could increase after Fed Chair Jerome Powell\u8217\'20\'19s press conference, but traders should be careful not to get sucked into a bull or a bear trap. It is better to wait on the sidelines and enter after the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  subsides and a directional move begins.\par \par \uc2 What are the important levels to watch for on Bitcoin and the major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is facing stiff resistance at the 50-day simple moving average ($27,154), indicating that the bears are trying to halt the recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/3cb26a7b-9486-46bc-ad26-478fdeb98352.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($26,499) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate that bulls are in control. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will enhance the prospects of a rally above the 50-day SMA. If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could climb to $28,143.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-binance-sec-legal-battle-bullish"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price eyes $28K as Binance legal battle spurs \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  momentum}}}\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bears remain active at higher levels. A break and close below $26,000 may accelerate selling and sink the pair toward the crucial support at $24,800.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been maintaining above the breakdown level of $1,626 for the past few days, but the bulls have failed to build up on this strength.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/a85a3027-4c1c-41fd-a5b9-d8c6a62509e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Sept. 18 and 19 candlestick shows selling by the bears at higher levels. The flattish 20-day EMA ($1,637) and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a balance between buyers and sellers.\par \par \uc2 A rally above $1,680 could tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls. The ETH/USDT pair could then rally to $1,745. On the contrary, a slide below $1,600 will suggest that bears have not yet given up. That could pull the pair to $1,530.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to shove BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $220 on Sept. 18 and 19, but the bears defended the level successfully.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/5d8a64fb-1c82-4b85-aff7-e412ebbece2c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to slide back below the 20-day EMA ($215). This suggests that the bulls are buying the minor dips as they expect the up-move to extend further.\par \par \uc2 If buyers clear the zone between $220 and the 50-day SMA ($223), the BNB/USDT pair could start a rally toward $235.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to tug the price back below the 20-day EMA. That could keep the price stuck inside the $203 to $220 range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose and closed above the 20-day EMA ($0.50) on Sept. 19, indicating that the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/90914cb6-f06d-4382-9105-08fae1756989.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price stays above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support. That will open the gates for a potential rise to the overhead resistance at $0.56, where the bears will likely make their stand.\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days is showing signs of forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close above $0.56. Buyers will have to keep the XRP price above the uptrend line to safeguard the setup.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been trying to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.25) for the past few days, but the bears have not relented.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/41e1ebb2-652b-4dc6-a2a8-4177f3ac8642.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. If buyers sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price will attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $0.28.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down sharply from the current level, it will signal that the bears are selling on relief rallies. A break and close below the $0.24 support will indicate the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The next support on the downside is at $0.22.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($0.06) for the past few days, indicating that the bears are defending the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/c6560d8d-f010-411f-b930-425a78b68b44.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A small positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to slip below $0.06. This suggests that the bulls are trying to clear the overhead hurdle. If the 20-day EMA gives way, the DOGE/USDT pair could climb to $0.07 and later to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from the current level, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then aim to yank the price below $0.06 and challenge the critical support at $0.055.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 After struggling to rise above the 20-day EMA ($19.55) for a few days, Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) finally overcame the obstacle on Sept. 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/d9189351-2f0e-4e6f-b0fe-0e4631bcce96.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out, and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating that the bears may be losing their grip. Buyers will try to push the price to the 50-day SMA ($21.14) and subsequently to the overhead resistance at $22.30. This level is likely to attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the near term if the SOL/USDT pair turns down and plummets below $18.50. The pair could then retest the strong support at $17.33.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) is currently in a strong uptrend. The bulls are trying to strengthen their position further by pushing the price above $2.59, but the bears have held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/45ef8c11-9409-4047-9e32-343ffd0e4c36.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the up-move is facing selling near $2.59, the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears. This suggests that the traders are holding on to their positions as they anticipate another leg higher. Above $2.59, the TON/USDT pair could reach $2.90 and eventually $3.28.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages indicate an advantage to buyers, but the overbought level on the RSI warns of a possible correction or consolidation in the short term. The first support for the TON price on the downside is $2.25, and the next level to watch out for is $2.07.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to propel Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the breakdown level of $4.22, indicating that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/96d061f5-d2e5-4483-8e7c-7f2cb9e454be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by sinking the price below the immediate support at $4. If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair risks a slide to the crucial support at $3.90. A break and close below this level may start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the $4.22\u8211\'20\'134.33 resistance zone, it could lead to short covering. The pair can first reach the 50-day SMA ($4.50) and thereafter climb to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) rose and closed above the 20-day EMA ($0.54) on Sep. 19, indicating that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/4557aec9-2d2f-4352-a454-61a3828000d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Still, the 20-day EMA is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. If the bulls maintain the price above the 20-day EMA, the MATIC/USDT pair could climb to the overhead resistance at $0.60 and then to $0.65.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the bears pull the price back below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that higher levels continue to attract selling. The bears will then try to build upon their advantage by pulling the price below $0.49.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/4da5e94f-167f-4fee-a9a9-0875d31c594d.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230921ej9k00030\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,643 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The crypto markets could witness increased \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s rate decision but it is unlikely to start a trending move.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) recovery is facing selling above $27,000, indicating near-term nervousness due to the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s meeting on Sep. 20. However, long-term investors are unfazed and they have continued to accumulate. Glassnode data shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoiners-stacking-inactive-btc-supply-hits-all-time-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s inactive supply has been at all-time highs}}}\uc2  since July.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  temperament is not reflected in institutional activity, however. Investors have cut down on their cryptocurrency exposure and are sitting on the sidelines awaiting more clarity on the regulatory and macroeconomic front. Asset manager \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  reported that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-fund-outflows-reach-nearly-half-billion-dollars-over-9-weeks-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outflows from exchange-traded products hit $455 million}}}\uc2  over the past nine weeks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/ab9fefbb-2ea3-49fd-a3b7-71dd374a41fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, analysts remain divided about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s near-term price action. Bollinger Bands creator \uc2 John Bollinger\uc2  speculated in a X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) post that Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bollinger-bands-btc-price-27k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 could start an up-move}}}\uc2  but added that it was \u8220\'20\'1Ctoo early to answer.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  could increase after Fed Chair Jerome Powell\u8217\'20\'19s press conference but traders should be careful not to get sucked into a bull or a bear trap. It is better to wait on the sidelines and enter after the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  subsides and a directional move begins.\par \par \uc2 What are the important levels to watch for on Bitcoin and the major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is facing stiff resistance at the 50-day simple moving average ($27,154) indicating that the bears are trying to halt the recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/3cb26a7b-9486-46bc-ad26-478fdeb98352.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average ($26,499) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate that bulls are in control. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will enhance the prospects of a rally above the 50-day SMA. If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could climb to $28,143.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-binance-sec-legal-battle-bullish"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price eyes $28K as Binance legal battle spurs \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  momentum}}}\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bears remain active at higher levels. A break and close below $26,000 may accelerate selling and sink the pair toward the crucial support at $24,800.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been maintaining above the breakdown level of $1,626 for the past few days but the bulls have failed to build up on this strength.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/a85a3027-4c1c-41fd-a5b9-d8c6a62509e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the Sep. 18 and 19 candlestick shows selling by the bears at higher levels. The flattish 20-day EMA ($1,637) and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a balance between buyers and sellers.\par \par \uc2 A rally above $1,680 could tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls. The ETH/USDT pair could then rally to $1,745. On the contrary, a slide below $1,600 will suggest that bears have not yet given up. That could pull the pair to $1,530.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to shove BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $220 on Sep. 18 and 19 but the bears defended the level successfully.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/5d8a64fb-1c82-4b85-aff7-e412ebbece2c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to slide back below the 20-day EMA ($215). This suggests that the bulls are buying the minor dips as they expect the up-move to extend further.\par \par \uc2 If buyers clear the zone between $220 and the 50-day SMA ($223), the BNB/USDT pair could start a rally toward $235.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to tug the price back below the 20-day EMA. That could keep the price stuck inside the $203 to $220 range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose and closed above the 20-day EMA ($0.50) on Sep. 19, indicating that the bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/90914cb6-f06d-4382-9105-08fae1756989.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price stays above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support. That will open the gates for a potential rise to the overhead resistance at $0.56 where the bears will likely make their stand.\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days is showing signs of forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close above $0.56. Buyers will have to keep XRP price above the uptrend line to safeguard the setup.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been trying to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.25) for the past few days but the bears have not relented.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/41e1ebb2-652b-4dc6-a2a8-4177f3ac8642.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. If buyers sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price will attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $0.28.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down sharply from the current level, it will signal that the bears are selling on relief rallies. A break and close below the $0.24 support will indicate the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The next support on the downside is at $0.22.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($0.06) for the past few days, indicating that the bears are defending the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/c6560d8d-f010-411f-b930-425a78b68b44.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A small positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to slip below $0.06. This suggests that the bulls are trying to clear the overhead hurdle. If the 20-day EMA gives way, the DOGE/USDT pair could climb to $0.07 and later to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from the current level, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then aim to yank the price below $0.06 and challenge the critical support at $0.055.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 After struggling to rise above the 20-day EMA ($19.55) for a few days, Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) finally overcame the obstacle on Sep. 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/d9189351-2f0e-4e6f-b0fe-0e4631bcce96.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating that the bears may be losing their grip. Buyers will try to push the price to the 50-day SMA ($21.14) and subsequently to the overhead resistance at $22.30. This level is likely to attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the SOL/USDT pair turns down and plummets below $18.50. The pair could then retest the strong support at $17.33.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) is currently in a strong uptrend. The bulls are trying to strengthen their position further by pushing the price above $2.59 but the bears have held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/45ef8c11-9409-4047-9e32-343ffd0e4c36.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the up-move is facing selling near $2.59, the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears. This suggests that the traders are holding on to their positions as they anticipate another leg higher. Above $2.59, the TON/USDT pair could reach $2.90 and eventually $3.28.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages indicate advantage to buyers but the overbought level on the RSI warns of a possible correction or consolidation in the short term. The first support for TON price on the downside is $2.25 and the next level to watch out for is $2.07.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to propel Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the breakdown level of $4.22, indicating that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/96d061f5-d2e5-4483-8e7c-7f2cb9e454be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOTUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by sinking the price below the immediate support at $4. If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair risks a slide to the crucial support at $3.90. A break and close below this level may start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the $4.22-4.33 resistance zone, it could lead to short covering. The pair can first reach the 50-day SMA ($4.50) and thereafter climb to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) rose and closed above the 20-day EMA ($0.54) on Sep. 19, indicating that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/4557aec9-2d2f-4352-a454-61a3828000d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Still, the 20-day EMA is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. If the bulls maintain the price above the 20-day EMA, the MATIC/USDT pair could climb to the overhead resistance at $0.60 and then to $0.65.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the bears pull the price back below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that higher levels continue to attract selling. The bears will then try to build upon their advantage by pulling the price below $0.49.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/4da5e94f-167f-4fee-a9a9-0875d31c594d.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230920ej9k000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 exchange traded products\par \b \uc2 Crypto fund outflows reach nearly half a billion over 9 weeks \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 CoinShares\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Tom Blackstone \par \uc2 378 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Roughly $455 million in capital flowed out of crypto ETPs over the past nine weeks.\par \par \uc2 Outflows from crypto exchange-traded products (ETPs) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blog.coinshares.com/volume-149-digital-asset-fund-flows-weekly-report-52c42c5fa2d4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reached}}}\uc2  $455 million over the previous nine weeks, according to a report from asset manager \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 . Outflows from ETPs generally indicate negative sentiment toward cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyse the latest dynamics in \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products. Here is our {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/FundFlows?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #FundFlows}}}\uc2  with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/jbutterfill?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @jbutterfill}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Last week, outflows totalled US$54m.\par \par \uc2 There have been outflows for 8 out of the last 9 weeks that aggregate to US$455m.\par \par \uc2 1/4 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/23TRrTuN3L"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/23TRrTuN3L}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  (@CoinSharesCo) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CoinSharesCo/status/1703786003356426305?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 18, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto exchange-traded products are designed to track crypto prices. When shares of these funds fall below their target prices, they sell off cryptocurrencies, causing outflows.\par \par \uc2 The week leading up to Sept. 18 saw outflows of $54 million \u8212\'20\'14 capping off nine weeks in which only a single week saw inflows. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) saw the biggest drawdown from all exchange-traded products and was responsible for 85% of all outflows from these funds. Last week, over $45 million worth of Bitcoin was sold into the market by ETPs.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) funds were also not spared in the deluge of selling. They saw outflows of approximately $5 million last week.\par \par \uc2 Despite these outflows, a few ETPs representing altcoins did well last week. Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) ETPs saw net inflows of $700,000, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) gained $430,000 and XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) added $130,000.\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  also provided data about the regional origin of crypto ETP outflows. The United States was responsible for 77% of the outflows, with Germany, Canada and Sweden also having caused a sizable percentage of the outflows.\par \par \uc2 Crypto ETPs offer an easier way for investors with traditional financial accounts to invest in digital assets. However, the issuance of a spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund has faced numerous regulatory and legal barriers in the United States. In March, the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-disapproves-vaneck-spot-btc-trust-product-commissioners-see-double-standard"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 denied VanEck\u8217\'20\'19s proposal}}}\uc2  for a \uc2 Bitcoin Trust\uc2 . On Aug. 11, a U.S. federal appeals court ruled that the SEC {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-wins-sec-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 had been \u8220\'20\'1Carbitrary and capricious\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  in denying a Bitcoin ETP proposal from Grayscale.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/48539a32-5d2e-4fda-bb2a-19fe2d13bf8a.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230918ej9i000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/18: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, SOL\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,661 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls are likely to take a shot at the overhead resistance, but the bears are unlikely to give up easily.\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sink Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price below $25,000 support ignited buying interest last week. The positive momentum picked up further at the start of the new week, and buyers are trying to sustain Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price above $27,000.\par \par \uc2 Market participants seem to be buoyant on expectations that the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  will not hike rates again this year. The \uc2 CME\uc2  FedWatch Tool {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cmegroup.com/markets/interest-rates/cme-fedwatch-tool.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows}}}\uc2  a 58% probability that the Fed funds rate will remain at the current level even in the December meeting.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/712832e1-7b71-4f84-864c-bdfbb1990b5c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 That could be one of the reasons why the strength in the United States Dollar Index (DXY) has not adversely impacted the price of Bitcoin. However, traders need to be careful, as the last 10 days in September are known to favor the bears. According to the Carson Group, the S&P 500 Index (SPX) has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/09/17/stock-futures-are-little-changed-as-wall-street-awaits-fed-meeting-live-updates.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 positive}}}\uc2  on average only for two days between Sept. 20 and 30 since 1950.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and select altcoins extend their recovery further, or will bears pull the price lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index broke above the moving averages on Sept. 14, but the bulls could not keep up the momentum and clear the overhead hurdle at the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/7795aff3-1f95-4645-8e42-93c878cdfc00.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears sold aggressively at the downtrend line and pulled the price back below the moving averages on Sept. 15. Sellers will try to further strengthen their position by pulling the price below the next support.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to gain the upper hand, they will have to quickly drive the price above the downtrend line. There is a minor resistance at 4,542, but if this level is crossed, the index could sprint toward 4,607.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index has continued to grind higher in the past few days, but it is likely to face stiff resistance at 106.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/9f434aa6-3f28-4d17-9a66-6ca95dc9a515.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers do not allow the price to dip below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) at 104, it will enhance the prospects of a rally above 106. If that happens, the index could pick up momentum and soar to 108.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down sharply from 106, it will suggest that bears are defending this level aggressively. A drop below the 20-day EMA could sink the price to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of 102. That could keep the price stuck between 101 and 106 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has maintained above the 20-day EMA ($26,394) since Sept. 14, indicating that the bulls have flipped the level into support. Buyers are trying to strengthen their position further by pushing the price above the 50-day SMA ($27,255).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/2060e11f-9c59-4896-8cff-3a6519307db2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are expected to pose a strong challenge in the zone between the 50-day SMA and the overhead resistance at $28,143. If the price turns down sharply from this zone, it will indicate that the BTC/USDT pair may stay range-bound between $24,800 and $28,143 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bulls drive the price above $28,143, it will clear the path for $30,000 and $31,000 as the next targets.\par \par \uc2 Overall, time is running out for the bears. If they want to regain control, they will have to quickly yank the price back below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 After struggling near the 20-day EMA ($1,639) for the past few days, the bulls succeeded in pushing Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance on Sept. 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/cf869dc7-e39b-45ec-98f7-bd0c42659817.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the midpoint, indicating that the bulls are on a comeback. If buyers sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the ETH/USDT pair could first rise to the 50-day SMA ($1,712) and thereafter to $1,750. A break above this level will signal a short-term double bottom. The pattern target of this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup is $1,959.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to tug the price back below the 20-day EMA and trap the aggressive bulls. A break below $1,600 could start a downward move toward presumably strong support at $1,531.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($215) on Sept. 17, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening. The price could next reach the 50-day SMA ($224).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/1eebbedf-4e98-4622-b644-75a89cb9e4c4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to offer stiff resistance in the zone between the 50-day SMA and $235. If the price turns down from this zone, it will signal that the BNB/USDT pair could remain range-bound between $200 and $235 for a while. The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint also suggest a consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair could again retest the vital support near $200. The repeated retest of a support level within a short interval tends to weaken it. If this level cracks, the pair may tumble to $183.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) recovery is facing selling near the 20-day EMA ($0.50), but the bulls have not given up and are trying to push the price above the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/bcc92d7d-2606-4c89-80f8-d77bfd63f287.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USDT pair could attempt a rally to $0.56. This level could prove to be a difficult barrier for the bulls to overcome.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the bears are fiercely protecting the 20-day EMA. There is a minor support at the uptrend line but if this level cracks, the pair risks sliding to $0.45 and eventually to $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) continues to be squeezed between the 20-day EMA ($0.25) and the critical support at $0.24. This tight-range trading is unlikely to continue for long, and a breakout may be around the corner.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/623f05f3-ab18-4303-b3e8-b514fca3bd61.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The positive divergence on the RSI suggests that the selling pressure is reducing. If the uncertainty resolves to the upside, it will pave the way for a possible rally to the overhead resistance at $0.28.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price plummets below $0.24, it will signal that the bears have asserted their supremacy. That could signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then slump to $0.22.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-27-4-k-bitcoin-open-interest-grayscale-peak"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price hits $27.4K as Bitcoin open interest matches Grayscale peak}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between the 20-day EMA ($0.06) and the horizontal support at $0.06 for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/8ee247f1-c935-410d-b1df-39b3666868ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Generally, a squeeze in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is followed by a range expansion. If the DOGE/USDT pair soars and closes above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls are attempting a comeback. The pair could then rally to $0.07. Buyers will have to overcome this roadblock to start an up move to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the price turns down and dives below the $0.06 support. That could pull the price down to the next support at $0.055. The bulls are expected to guard this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Toncoin\u8217\'20\'19s (TON) Sept. 16 and 17 candlesticks shows that traders are booking profits near the overhead resistance at $2.59.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/1584c806-a762-4a31-8a3c-830ced62dfc8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The overbought level on the RSI suggests a possible correction or range formation in the near term. However, the bulls have not given up and are again trying to propel the TON price above $2.59. If they can pull it off, TON/USDT could pick up momentum and skyrocket to $3.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch for on the downside is $2.25. If this level gives way, the pair could start a deeper correction to the next support at $2.07.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 After trading near the 20-day EMA ($19.47) for the past few days, Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke above the resistance on Sept. 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/d2e9d8f8-456c-4330-9282-ed86f31bfac4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating that the bears may be losing their grip. Buyers will try to cement their position further by pushing the price to the overhead resistance at $22.30. This level is likely to attract sellers.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to hold the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are selling at higher levels. The first support on the downside is $18.50, and if this level is violated, SOL risks descending toward the next major support at $17.33.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/e69a5a41-6b91-4395-a0e3-92921eb7f4f4.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230918ej9i000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/15: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,613 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select major altcoins may remain under pressure in the near term, indicating that the bears have not yet given up.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been stuck inside a large range since April, indicating indecision about the next directional move. Efforts by the bears to sink the price below the support of the range were thwarted by the bulls on Sept. 11. However, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is not out of the woods yet.\par \par \uc2 Jamie Coutts, a chartered market technician and crypto market analyst at Bloomberg Intelligence, told Cointelegraph that if the tightening cycle extends, followed by \u8220\'20\'1Can uptick in unemployment and more stress in the banking sector, then {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-cycles-changing-bloomberg-analyst-jamie-coutts-explains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 there could be a bit more pain}}}\uc2  for risk assets like Bitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/1b6ea6f7-2960-4d13-8f4f-80270fa9908a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency traders have also remained cautious. A \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  report shows that the cryptocurrency industry witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitfinex-crypto-market-lost-55-billion-august"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 capital outflows of $55 billion in August}}}\uc2 . The drop in liquidity has caused isolated events to \u8220\'20\'1Chave a bigger impact on market movements,\u8221\'20\'1D the report added.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin turn down and retest its pivotal support? Could Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s weakness trigger further selling in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke and closed above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $26,228 on Sept. 14, indicating that the downside momentum is weakening.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/c9f13e7b-be3e-4e41-a41d-3fa40c418906.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the midpoint, signaling that the BTC/USDT pair may stay range-bound between $24,800 and $28,143 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly pull the price back below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that higher levels are being sold into. That could result in a retest of the strong support at $24,800.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the $1,550 support on Sept. 11, but the bears could not build upon this strength. This suggests solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/35c78a32-f07b-4454-888a-d5b887d5741b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls thereafter started a recovery, which has reached the 20-day EMA ($1,638). This level is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. A break and close above the 20-day EMA could trap several aggressive bears, resulting in a short squeeze. That could propel the price to $1,745.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears remain in command. The sellers will then make another attempt to sink the ETH/USDT pair below $1,550 and resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the psychological support near $200 on Sept. 12, indicating that the bulls are active at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/a575e7fb-e7be-4a16-89bf-37b57e46ac87.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The recovery has reached the 20-day EMA ($215), which is an important level to watch out for. If the BNB/USDT pair turns lower from the current level, it will indicate that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on relief rallies. That will increase the risk of a breakdown below $200.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, the RSI is forming a positive divergence, indicating that selling pressure could be falling. A rise above the 20-day EMA could open the doors for a retest of the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) at $225.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $0.41 and $0.56 for the past several days. The price has recovered to the 20-day EMA ($0.50), which is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/88039d3d-0ff9-42f6-b591-7f692addbf28.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the selling pressure is reducing. That could start a sustained recovery toward the overhead resistance at $0.56. This level may again act as a roadblock.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.56, it will indicate that the range-bound action may continue for some more time. The next trending move is likely to begin after bulls push the price above $0.56 or bears sink the XRP/USDT pair below $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The strong selling in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) pulled the price to $0.24 on Sept. 11, but the bears could not break the crucial support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/038634f2-bf62-44f0-aadb-64e8023f9293.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rebound off $0.24 on Sept. 12 reached the 20-day EMA ($0.26) on Sept. 15. This level is likely to witness a tussle between the buyers and sellers. If the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that every minor rise is being sold. That could increase the risk of a drop to $0.22.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers shove the price above the 20-day EMA, it will signal the start of a stronger recovery to $0.28.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade between the 20-day EMA ($0.06) and the solid support at $0.06. This tight-range trading is unlikely to continue for long, and a breakout may happen soon.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/3eee8fb6-4e0e-40c3-94c3-ead3d20d5f32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sellers may be losing their grip. That could start a relief rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.07), where the bears are expected to intensify selling.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, it will enhance the prospects of a break below $0.06. If this support breaks down, the DOGE/USDT pair may plummet to $0.055.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been swinging between $14 and $27.12 for the past several months. The price has reached the 20-day EMA ($19.51), where the bears are likely to pose a stiff challenge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/41e31ecf-3037-4dd3-a13a-e5a67d0514d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could reach the overhead resistance at $22.30. This level may again act as a strong hurdle, but if bulls overcome it, the pair could climb to $27.12.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will signal that demand dries up at higher levels. The bears will then try to resume the downtrend and yank the price to the vital support at $14.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/japan-allows-start-ups-raise-funds-crypto-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Japan to allow startups to raise funds by issuing crypto instead of stocks: Report}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) snapped back from the 20-day EMA ($1.75) on Sept. 12, indicating that the bulls are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/6e623123-ea35-4980-bc36-53291934bfb9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price reached the first resistance at $1.98 on Sept. 13, where the bears are trying to halt the up move. A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that they have not ceded ground to the bears. This suggests that the bulls are in no hurry to book profits as they anticipate the up move to continue.\par \par \uc2 If the $1.98 level is taken out, the TON/USDT pair could reach $2.07. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break above it could propel the pair to $2.40. On the downside, a slide below the 20-day EMA could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot's DOT ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the breakdown level of $4.22 for the past few days, which is a negative sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/667345fa-9ce3-4506-a2ef-e67713b40ebc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to start a relief rally, but that is likely to face strong selling at $4.22. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest that bears remain in control. The sellers will then try to sink the DOT/USDT pair below $3.90. If they succeed, the pair could collapse to $3.44.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the decline, they will have to push and sustain the price above $4.22. If they do that, it will suggest that the markets have rejected the breakdown. The pair may then attempt a rally to the 50-day SMA ($4.61).\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the critical support at $0.51 on Sept. 11, but the bears could not maintain the selling pressure. That started a rebound, which is nearing the 20-day EMA ($0.54).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/8df0b1ee-d5ce-4e39-9c3b-a92710952ec3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will attempt to stall the recovery at the 20-day EMA and tug the price below $0.50. If they manage to do that, it will signal the resumption of the downtrend. The MATIC/USDT pair could then slump to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Although the downsloping moving averages indicate advantage to bears, the positive divergence on the RSI suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be slowing down. If buyers clear the obstacle at the 20-day EMA, the pair may climb to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/a725bc16-742e-4cc5-a934-ec3a0f3064a6.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230915ej9f000e7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/15: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,606 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select major altcoins may remain under pressure in the near term, indicating that the bears have not yet given up.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck inside a large range since April, indicating indecision about the next directional move. Efforts by the bears to sink the price below the support of the range were thwarted by the bulls on Sep. 11. However, Bitcoin is not out of the woods yet.\par \par \uc2 Jamie Coutts, a chartered market technician and crypto market analyst at Bloomberg Intelligence, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-cycles-changing-bloomberg-analyst-jamie-coutts-explains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 while speaking to Cointelegraph}}}\uc2  said that if the tightening cycle extends, followed by \u8220\'20\'1Can uptick in unemployment and more stress in the banking sector, then there could be a bit more pain for risk assets like Bitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/1b6ea6f7-2960-4d13-8f4f-80270fa9908a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency traders have also remained cautious. A \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  report shows that the cryptocurrency industry witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitfinex-crypto-market-lost-55-billion-august"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 capital outflows of $55 billion in August}}}\uc2 . The drop in liquidity has caused isolated events to \u8220\'20\'1Chave a bigger impact on market movements,\u8221\'20\'1D the report added.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin turn down and retest its pivotal support? Could Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s weakness trigger further selling in altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke and closed above the 20-day exponential moving average ($26,228) on Sep. 14, indicating that the downside momentum is weakening.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/c9f13e7b-be3e-4e41-a41d-3fa40c418906.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the midpoint, signaling that the BTC/USDT pair may stay range-bound between $24,800 and $28,143 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly pull the price back below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that higher levels are being sold into. That could result in a retest of the strong support at $24,800.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the $1,550 support on Sep. 11 but the bears could not build upon this strength. This suggests solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/35c78a32-f07b-4454-888a-d5b887d5741b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls thereafter started a recovery, which has reached the 20-day EMA ($1,638). This level is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. A break and close above the 20-day EMA could trap several aggressive bears, resulting in a short squeeze. That could propel the price to $1,745.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears remain in command. The sellers will then make another attempt to sink the ETH/USDT pair below $1,550 and resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the psychological support near $200 on Sep. 12, indicating that the bulls are active at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/a575e7fb-e7be-4a16-89bf-37b57e46ac87.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The recovery has reached the 20-day EMA ($215), which is an important level to watch out for. If the BNB/USDT pair turns lower from the current level, it will indicate that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on relief rallies. That will increase the risk of a breakdown below $200.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, the RSI is forming a positive divergence, indicating that the selling pressure could be reducing. A rise above the 20-day EMA could open the doors for a retest of the 50-day SMA ($225).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $0.41 and $0.56 for the past several days. The price has recovered to the 20-day EMA ($0.50), which is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/88039d3d-0ff9-42f6-b591-7f692addbf28.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the selling pressure is reducing. That could start a sustained recovery toward the overhead resistance at $0.56. This level may again act as a roadblock.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.56, it will indicate that the range-bound action may continue for some more time. The next trending move is likely to begin after bulls push the price above $0.56 or bears sink the XRP/USDT pair below $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The strong selling in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) pulled the price to $0.24 on Sep. 11 but the bears could not break the crucial support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/038634f2-bf62-44f0-aadb-64e8023f9293.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rebound off $0.24 on Sep. 12 reached the 20-day EMA ($0.26) on Sep. 15. This level is likely to witness a tussle between the buyers and sellers. If the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that every minor rise is being sold into. That could increase the risk of a drop to $0.22.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers shove the price above the 20-day EMA, it will signal the start of a stronger recovery to $0.28.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade between the 20-day EMA ($0.06) and the solid support at $0.06. This tight-range trading is unlikely to continue for long and a breakout may happen soon.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/3eee8fb6-4e0e-40c3-94c3-ead3d20d5f32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sellers may be losing their grip. That could start a relief rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.07) where the bears are expected to intensify selling.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, it will enhance the prospects of a break below $0.06. If this support breaks down, the DOGE/USDT pair may plummet to $0.055.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been swinging between $14 and $27.12 for the past several months. The price has reached the 20-day EMA ($19.51) where the bears are likely to pose a stiff challenge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/41e31ecf-3037-4dd3-a13a-e5a67d0514d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could reach the overhead resistance at $22.30. This level may again act as a strong hurdle but if bulls overcome it, the pair could climb to $27.12.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will signal that demand dries up at higher levels. The bears will then try to resume the downtrend and yank the price to the vital support at $14.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/japan-allows-start-ups-raise-funds-crypto-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Japan to allow startups to raise funds by issuing crypto instead of stocks: Report}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) snapped back from the 20-day EMA ($1.75) on Sep. 12, indicating that the bulls are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/6e623123-ea35-4980-bc36-53291934bfb9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price reached the first resistance at $1.98 on Sep. 13 where the bears are trying to halt the up-move. A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that they have not ceded ground to the bears. This suggests that the bulls are in no hurry to book profits as they anticipate the up-move to continue.\par \par \uc2 If the $1.98 level is taken out, the TON/USDT pair coul