\par\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin continues slide - Altcoins worse\b0\par\par\uc2 Laurie Dunn \par \uc2 516 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 September 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin finishes the week under $26,000, continuing to bleed out slowly. Altcoins are faring much worse, losing more than $65 billion in market cap over the previous 10 weeks.\par \par \uc2 A difficult financial outlook\par \par \uc2 The global financial scene is not a good one for crypto. Liquidity is being sucked out of markets generally, with the U.S. and its Federal Reserve being one of the major culprits. Even with the recent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/08/grayscale-wins-against-sec-bitcoin-pumps"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 good news of court victories by crypto companies over the SEC}}}\uc2 , it seems that a loosening of monetary policy is what crypto needs the most right now.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has followed a sideways trajectory since mid August in a pattern that looks rather like a heart monitor, with many blips up and down, and just one spike to the upside on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/09/grayscale-tells-sec-its-time-for-a-bitcoin-spot-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Grayscale}}}\uc2  news and then a fairly rapid retrace soon afterwards.\par \par \uc2 All in all, bitcoin at least does appear to be holding, although a next step down to the strong support at $24,300 could potentially be a subsequent move. The 50 week moving average also offers support at this level.\par \par \uc2 Perhaps something else to bear in mind for the bitcoin price over these next few weeks is that there isn\u8217\'20\'19t a spot ETF yet. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/09/bitcoin-price-depressed-institutions-want-cheaper-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Institutions will want to buy in cheap}}}\uc2 , and so a good move to the downside before the ETF is potentially approved in October would be welcome.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum\par \par \uc2 Ethereum is still losing ground to its ETH/BTC pairing, although it does appear to still be in an upward trend since January 2020, so a bounce soon could possibly be on the cards given that it has returned to this trendline once more.\par \par \uc2 As far as its dollar pair goes Ethereum is actually looking rather \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in spite of losing nearly 22% over the last 10 weeks. The ETH price is in an extremely juicy looking ascending triangle, which it has largely been in since May 2022.\par \par \uc2 However, this triangle could play out as far as into June of 2024, although it might be expected to break earlier than this. Like BTC, ETH has once more hit the bottom of its Stochastic RSI indicator, and given that nearly all previous RSI bottoms have led to subsequent decent upside gains, it might be expected to happen again.\par \par \uc2 Solana\par \par \uc2 Where BTC and ETH have bled slowly, the altcoins have fared much worse. Solana, the large-cap layer 1 competitor to Ethereum, has been hammered over recent weeks. Since a rally top in early June SOL has decreased almost 50%. The next good support level can be found at $14.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\par \par \uc2 Another top layer 1 is Cardano. The fall might have taken longer than Solana\u8217\'20\'19s, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  token is now at the critical support level of $0.24, a loss of nearly 46% since the last rally high. A price of just under $0.16 awaits below this.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020230911ej9b000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/8: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,752 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price is expected to range trade for the short term, but traders appear to be uncertain about the price action of most altcoins.\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to shake Bitcoin from its slumber on Sept. 7, but the rally was short-lived. This suggests a lack of clarity between the bulls and the bears about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) next directional move. Analyst CryptoCon said on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) that Bitcoin could remain in a \u8220\'20\'1Cmid cycle lull\u8221\'20\'1D until the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-all-time-high-2025-btc-price-idea"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 start of the next bull run}}}\uc2  in November 2024.\par \par \uc2 Along similar lines, ARK Invest said in a report that cryptocurrencies {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/persistent-macro-headwinds-could-delay-bitcoin-bull-market-ark-invest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 could continue to face headwinds}}}\uc2  in the remainder of 2023 due to several macroeconomic issues, such as interest rates, gross domestic product estimates, unemployment and inflation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/22c08fb6-49a2-4ae4-bda1-9cd120574280.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Sept.In comparison, the bulls will be closely following the decision of the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  on the various Bitcoin spot exchange-traded fund (ETF) applications. In addition to that, the race for a spot Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) ETF also began officially on Sep. 6 with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-ethereum-etf-race-begins-vaneck-ark-21-shares-filing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filings from VanEck and ARK Invest}}}\uc2 . Bloomberg ETF analyst James Seyffart expects more \uc2 Ether ETF\uc2  filings to happen in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s range-bound action increase the selling pressure on altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin reached the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $26,419 on Sept. 7, but the bulls could not overcome this obstacle. This suggests that the bears are fiercely guarding the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/1ae6f7cf-ed26-4cce-aa91-c457e566290a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the failure of the bears to challenge the crucial support at $24,800 suggests that selling dries up at lower levels. The relative strength index (RSI) is trying to form a positive divergence, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. That clears the path for a sustained recovery toward $28,143.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the $24,800 support crumbles, the BTC/USDT pair could start a downtrend. There is minor support at $24,000, but it may not arrest the decline. The pair could eventually reach pivotal support at $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether continues to trade inside a narrow range between the 20-day EMA ($1,668) and the formidable support at $1,626.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/399b88ea-d43a-458b-82ee-2a22cb221104.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA increases the risk of a breakdown. Below $1,626, the ETH/USDT pair could retest the Aug. 17 intraday low of $1,550. Buyers may purchase the dip to this level with vigor because if the support cracks, the pair could plunge to $1,368.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bulls. If they want to prevent the collapse, they will have to first drive the price above the 20-day EMA and thereafter attempt a rally to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $1,762. That could increase the likelihood of the pair being range-bound between $2,000 and $1,626 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the breakdown level of $220 on Sept. 6, but the bears did not relent. This indicates that the sellers are trying to flip the $220 level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/dd96ad05-bf1c-4dde-bcd1-3bae927706c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is minor support at $211, but if bears pull the price below it, the BNB/USDT pair could reach the psychological level of $200. This level is likely to attract solid buying by the bulls. If the price rebounds off this support, it will indicate that the pair may consolidate between $200 and $220 for a while.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $220, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. That could launch a recovery toward the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) dip below $0.50 on Sept. 6, but the failure to start a strong rebound indicates a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/e65b4329-4a07-476a-8652-00a9687c8f28.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position further by yanking the price below $0.50. If they can pull it off, the XRP/USDT pair could nosedive to the next major support at $0.41. This fall is likely to be swift, as there is no major support between $0.50 and $0.41.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price once again turns up from the current level, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to flip $0.50 into support. A break above the 20-day EMA will indicate that the pair is likely to oscillate between $0.50 and $0.56 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Sept. 6 and again on Sept. 7, which shows indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/c5896d7a-2238-4970-ac29-32eb8546a07f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.26) and the RSI in the negative territory enhance the prospects of a downside breakdown. If the price skids below $0.25, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $0.24.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bears have repeatedly halted the advance near the 20-day EMA; hence, this becomes an important level to watch out for. If bulls force the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could reach the overhead resistance at $0.28.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to shove Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.06) on Sept. 6, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/e2526c3c-6128-43ee-a995-39fc220cddd6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price remains stuck between the 20-day EMA and the horizontal support at $0.06. When the price trades inside a range, it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout, but the downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI near 40 signal an edge to the bears. Below $0.06, the DOGE/USDT pair could descend to $0.055.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if bulls kick and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest the start of a stronger recovery to $0.07 and eventually to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually correcting inside the large range between $14 and $27.12. The bears have been selling the relief rallies to the 20-day EMA ($20.53), indicating that the sentiment remains negative.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/990e3918-b4b1-40ee-bffd-cdb4a2150e0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The repeated failure of the bulls to thrust the price above the 20-day EMA suggests that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If bears tug the price below the immediate support at $19, the SOL/USDT pair could slump to $18 and subsequently to $16.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to have other plans. They will try to push the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair may reach the overhead resistance at $22.30. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break above it could clear the path for a potential rally to $26.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) attempted a rebound on Sept. 6, but the long wick on the Sept. 7 candlestick shows that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/a5563c61-cc84-4132-af35-ba94aa596c3d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1.68) remains the key level to keep an eye on in the short term. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to drive the TON/USDT pair above the overhead resistance at $2.07.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price slips below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the traders are aggressively booking profits. The first stop on the downside is at the breakout level of $1.53 and then the 50-day SMA ($1.44).\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the strong support at $4.22 on Sept. 6, but they could not sustain the lower levels as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. This shows buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/1696999d-294f-44df-a98c-09da9ba47852.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls could not maintain the momentum and push the price to the 20-day EMA ($4.41). This shows that every minor rally is being sold into. The bears have pulled the price back to the important support at $4.22. If this support crumbles, the DOT/USDT pair could fall to the psychological support at $4.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to make a comeback, they will have to propel the price above the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the pair is likely to climb to the downtrend line. This is the key level to keep an eye on because a break above it could signal that the downtrend is ending.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to propel Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.56) for the past three days, but the bears held their ground. This suggests that traders are selling on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/ba3ca2ce-043d-49da-9ff6-2c1d2aa60f11.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price below the immediate support at $0.53. If they manage to do that, the MATIC/USDT pair could plummet to the vital support at $0.50. The bulls are expected to protect this level with vigor because a break below it may open the gates for a further fall to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure is reducing. That could start a recovery to $0.64, where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/e7b4ab4a-6666-4465-8bf7-cac2a94c0e68.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230908ej98000e4\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,677 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins struggle to find new \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum, but data hints that traders are content to buy dips to lower support levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $25,333 and $26,156 since Sept. 1. Typically, a \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  squeeze is followed by an expansion in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty.\par \par \uc2 CoinGlass data shows that Bitcoin has fallen for six consecutive years in September. This historic data could keep the bulls at bay in the near term and embolden the bears. Additionally, the U.S. Dollar Index (DXY), which has an inverse correlation with Bitcoin, has risen sharply in the past few weeks. Both these suggest that Bitcoin could remain under pressure in the short term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/a84ebb38-3062-4e12-b61e-fd1ceee29cc2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 It is not all gloom and doom for the crypto bulls because lower levels are likely to attract buyers. The prospect of one or more Bitcoin spot exchange-traded fund applications receiving approvals may limit the downside. Several analysts believe this {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etf-approval-underestimated-crypto-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 event to be hugely \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  for Bitcoin}}}\uc2 . Any positive news in this regard may prop prices higher.\par \par \uc2 From a macro perspective, it looks like there may be near-term weakness, but lower levels are likely to be purchased. What are the important support levels to watch out for? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading below $26,000 for the past two days, and the bears are trying to tug the price toward the vital support at $24,800.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/0fa675a0-975a-4e30-9937-7919e35c0b7a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages indicate an advantage to sellers, but the developing positive divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be weakening.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to drive and sustain the price above $26,833 to start a relief rally to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($28,048). Such a move will suggest that the price may remain stuck inside the large range between $24,800 and $31,000.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to sink the price below the $24,800\u8211\'20\'13$24,000 support zone. If they manage to do that, the selling could accelerate, and the BTC/USDT pair may plunge to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) Sept. 4 and 5 candlestick shows that the bulls are buying the dips below the immediate support at $1,626. However, there is no follow-up buying at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/8fab579e-0cc8-46f6-bfec-de8c9564dd68.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This means that the bears are selling on rallies near $1,650. This narrow-range trading is unlikely to continue for long. If the price plummets and maintains below $1,600, it will indicate that bears have seized control. There is minor support at $1,550, but if it crumbles, the ETH/USDT pair could nosedive to $1,368.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bears are expected to fiercely defend the zone between $1,650 and the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($1,674). If buyers overcome this barrier, the pair could soar to the 50-day SMA ($1,772).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the important level of $220 for the past few days, but the bears have failed to capitalize on this opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/b7f7d270-04a2-407f-9f48-fec91970358e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels. That could keep the BNB/USDT pair stuck between $220 and $200 for some time. A tight consolidation below the breakdown level increases the possibility of a further slide. If the $200 support cracks, the pair could resume its downtrend. The next major support on the downside is $183.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to launch a comeback, they will have to kick the price above $220. That will indicate solid buying at lower levels. The pair may then attempt a rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been clinging to the $0.50 support for the past few days. The failure to start a strong rebound off it increases the likelihood of a downside breakdown.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/0e2b465a-7f18-4a01-9848-d8b857d6ccf8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $0.50 will indicate that the XRP/USDT pair may extend its stay inside the $0.56\u8211\'20\'13$0.41 range for a few more days. There is no major support between $0.50 and $0.41, so the fall may be swift.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA ($0.52). If that happens, the pair may climb to $0.56, which is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a tight range for the past few days. This suggests that the bulls and the bears are playing it safe and not waging large bets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/bfd9309c-13fe-4a18-83e2-ac7ee643f761.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have a slight edge. If the price breaks below $0.25, the bears will try to sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to $0.24.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($0.26) will be the first sign of strength. That will pave the way for a rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.28). Buyers will have to clear this hurdle to start a sustained recovery.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) reached the 20-day EMA ($0.06) on Sept. 6, indicating that the bulls are attempting to start a relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/53c8bc16-ba9d-4f3d-96ff-8e55ea7a59d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are unlikely to give up easily and will mount a strong defense at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down sharply, the bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the DOGE/USDT pair below $0.06. If they succeed, the pair may extend its decline to the next support at $0.055.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that the selling pressure is reducing. That may start a rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.07) and later to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 SOL\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) recovery attempt is facing strong selling at the downtrend line. This indicates that the bears are defending this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/d15fdd9d-ae25-428a-856e-7fc88ffd988d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price skids below $19, the SOL/USDT pair could resume its downtrend. The first support on the downside is $18, and the next is $16. Buyers are expected to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 The first indication of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($20.69). That could start a stronger recovery to the 50-day SMA ($22.70). This level may again act as a roadblock, but if bulls clear it, the pair could attempt a rally to $25.42.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-will-hit-22k-soon"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s why Bitcoin will hit $22K soon}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The sharp rise in Toncoin (TON) pushed the RSI into the overbought territory, indicating that the rally had run up ahead of itself. That typically leads to a correction or consolidation, and that is what happened.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/5ace0bb2-451c-4dcd-86eb-78f0c2ae086c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Profit-booking by the bears has pulled the price toward the 20-day EMA ($1.64). This remains the key support to watch out for. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. That could propel the price to $2.07. If this level gives way, the rally could stretch to $2.38.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the 20-day EMA cracks, it will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. The TON/USDT pair may then slump to $1.53 and later to the 50-day SMA ($1.42).\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers are struggling to start a strong rebound in Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ), indicating that the bears have kept up the pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/43d2b6b8-675d-4038-9581-1c4c3d298815.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near the oversold zone increase the likelihood of a downward breakdown. If the $4.22 level gives way, the DOT/USDT pair could skid to the next major support at $4.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level, the bears will try to halt the recovery at the 20-day EMA ($4.44) and again at the downtrend line. Buyers will have to clear this barrier to indicate a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) reached the 20-day EMA ($0.57) on Sept. 5, but the bulls could not clear this hurdle. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/cf50f568-50c0-456c-a332-9b333dc00ddd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price to the crucial support at $0.50. This remains the key level to watch out for in the near term because a break below it will resume the downtrend. The MATIC/USDT pair then risks a further slide to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downside, they will have to quickly push the price above the 20-day EMA. That could start a stronger recovery to the overhead resistance at $0.60 and then $0.64. This level is again likely to witness solid selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/cba06ce6-6b6b-443d-b782-9b652723be8d.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230906ej96000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,731 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Crypto bulls were unable to sustain this week\u8217\'20\'19s rally, and the retrace to the range lows could be a sign that markets are returning to their record-low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  phase.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  has increased over the past few days. The price soared on Aug. 29 after Grayscale scored a victory over the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC). However, the euphoria was short-lived, as the price gave back all the recent gains on the news that the SEC {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-grayscale-gains-wiped-with-sec-spot-etf-delays"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 delayed the decision}}}\uc2  on all seven spot Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded fund (ETF) applications.\par \par \uc2 News related to Bitcoin ETFs has been the major trigger for the markets in the past few days. Bloomberg ETF analysts remain upbeat over the possibility of the ETFs being approved by the regulator in 2023. In an Aug. 30 post on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ), \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  senior ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etf-chance-raised-after-grayscale-victory-bloomberg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bumped up the approval possibility}}}\uc2  of a spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  from 65% to 75%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/f329711b-3335-4e7a-9e78-ed2b1ef9d0fe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 In the near term, the bulls face an uphill battle, as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-down-september-etf-approvals-october-analysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September has traditionally favored the bears}}}\uc2 . According to CoinGlass data, Bitcoin has seen negative returns in September for the past six years. Will the trend continue in 2023?\par \par \uc2 The weakness in Bitcoin is affecting several major altcoins, which have dropped close to their strong support levels. Will the decline extend further, or is it time for a bounce to happen? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to defend the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $26,947 on Aug. 31. That started a sell-off, which pulled Bitcoin below the breakout level of $26,833.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/0dd04025-4207-4108-83de-c011170e39df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days shows that the BTC/USDT pair has been oscillating inside the large range between $24,800 and $31,000. Typically, traders buy the dips to the support of the range and sell near the resistance. The same is expected from the bulls at $24,800.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to seize control, they will have to sink and sustain the price below $24,800. If that happens, the pair may extend the fall to $19,500. There is a minor support at $24,000, but that may not hold for long.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the strong support at $1,626 fizzled out at $1,745 on Aug. 29. This indicates that bears remain active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/57d49a86-36da-4fb8-9c38-f2e485ce3229.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to build upon their advantage by pulling the price below the $1,626 to $1,550 support zone. If they are successful, it will signal the start of a new downtrend. The ETH/USDT pair could then nosedive to the next formidable support at $1,368.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price sharply rebounds off the current level, it will indicate that the bulls are fiercely defending the support. That could drive the price to the 20-day EMA ($1,702) and subsequently to $1,745, which may act as a resistance.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) recovery halted at the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $234 on Aug. 29, and the bears yanked the price below the important support at $220 on Aug. 31.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/ec56eda6-0907-46de-a304-81281578c4ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are sloping down and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand. The bears will try to sink the price to the psychological support at $200. If this level collapses, the BNB/USDT pair could reach the next major support at $183.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to start a relief rally, they will have to push the price back above the 20-day EMA ($222). The pair could then climb to the 50-day SMA and later to the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) Aug. 31 candlestick shows that the bulls are trying to protect the support at $0.50. However, the price action on Sep. 1 shows that the bears are keeping up the pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/37a49962-072f-46c5-a470-7d8c83e3920c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price plunges below $0.50, it will suggest that bears are back in control. That could start a downward move to the formidable support at $0.41. The bulls are likely to defend this level with vigor. A bounce off the support could keep the XRP/USDT pair range-bound between $0.41 and $0.56 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.50, it will suggest that the pair may attempt a rally to $0.56. The bulls will have to overcome this roadblock to start a new up move to $0.63 and thereafter to $0.73.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $0.24 and $0.28 for the past several days. The bulls kicked the price above the range on Aug. 29 but could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/fdbeb60a-e2f7-4a52-98c3-73903ea51442.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 That may have tempted the short-term bulls to bail out of their positions. The selling picked up further, and the price slipped below the uptrend line on Aug. 31. The bears will next try to sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below the vital support at $0.24.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.24, the pair may continue to consolidate inside the range for a while longer. On the contrary, if the price dips below $0.24, it will signal the start of a down move to $0.22 and eventually to $0.20.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to start a recovery in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), indicating that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/a1ff29c2-05cb-4650-8bd3-19cdc2b3c787.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair could dip to the solid support at $0.06. Buyers are expected to defend this level with all their might because a break below it may resume the downtrend. The pair could first skid to $0.055 and then to the final support near $0.05.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $0.06, it will signal that the bulls are buying the dips to this level. The bulls will then again try to overcome the obstacle at the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair may surge to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) returned from the 20-day EMA ($21.37) on Aug. 30, which shows that bears remain in command. The price has reached the vital support at $19.35.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/4ac156d0-f9d9-4556-831e-94eb694ef9fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the $19.35 support gives way, the selling could intensify and the SOL/USDT pair may slide to $18.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bulls. If they want to start a recovery, they will have to quickly shove the price above the overhead resistance at $22.30. If they do that, the pair may soar toward $26. The 50-day SMA ($23.42) may act as a hurdle, but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-rsi-showdown-btc-price-new-2-week-low"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin lines up RSI showdown as BTC price slips toward new 2-week low}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) is in a strong uptrend. The bears tried to stall the rally near $1.77, but the bulls did not give up much ground. That shows that the bulls are in no hurry to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/1624ce53-a906-415f-9470-07848f2cb37b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buying resumed on Sep. 1, and the TON/USDT pair reached the pattern target of $1.91. If buyers scale this level, the upmove may continue and the pair may skyrocket to $2.38. This level may witness profit-booking by the traders.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down and breaks below $1.66. Such a move will suggest aggressive selling at higher levels. That could then sink the pair to the breakout level of $1.53.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($4.56) on Aug. 30, indicating that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/930a4215-8694-4930-83de-47e27f723244.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up further on Aug. 31, and the DOT/USDT pair dropped to the vital support at $4.22. This level is likely to witness a battle between the bulls and the bears. If the price plummets below $4.22, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend to $4.\par \par \uc2 Buyers have their task cut out. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly drive and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could surge to the overhead resistance at $5.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) failure to maintain above the 20-day EMA ($0.58) on Aug. 29 may have attracted profit-booking from short-term traders. The bulls tried to push the price back above the 20-day EMA on Aug. 30 and 31, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/1c964aee-c637-4bf8-b54a-aa1b7a6d78f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below the immediate support at $0.53. If they can pull it off, the MATIC/USDT pair may slump to the crucial support at $0.51.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level, it is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA and again at the 50-day SMA ($0.66). On the other hand, a break below $0.51 could resume the downtrend. The next support is at $0.45.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/ace35fea-62a2-453d-a6b0-3034e9de0dfb.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230901ej91000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,724 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 September 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Crypto bulls were unable to sustain this week\u8217\'20\'19s rally and the retrace to the range lows could be a sign that markets are returning to their record-low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  phase.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  has increased over the past few days. The price soared on Aug. 29 after Grayscale scored a victory over the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC). However, the euphoria was short-lived as the price gave back all the recent gains on the news that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-grayscale-gains-wiped-with-sec-spot-etf-delays"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC delayed the decision on all seven}}}\uc2  spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund applications.\par \par \uc2 News related to Bitcoin ETFs has been the major trigger for the markets in the past few days. Bloomberg ETF analysts remain upbeat over the possibility of the ETFs being approved by the regulator in 2023. In an Aug. 30 post of X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ), \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  senior ETF analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etf-chance-raised-after-grayscale-victory-bloomberg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bumped up the approval possibility}}}\uc2  of a spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  from 65% to 75%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/f329711b-3335-4e7a-9e78-ed2b1ef9d0fe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 In the near term, the bulls face an uphill battle as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-down-september-etf-approvals-october-analysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September has traditionally favored the bears}}}\uc2 . According to CoinGlass data, Bitcoin has seen negative returns in September for the past six consecutive years. Will the trend continue in 2023?\par \par \uc2 The weakness in Bitcoin is affecting several major altcoins, which have dropped close to their strong support levels. Will the decline extend further or is it time for a bounce to happen? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to defend the 20-day exponential moving average ($26,947) on Aug. 31. That started a sell-off which pulled Bitcoin below the breakout level of $26,833.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/0dd04025-4207-4108-83de-c011170e39df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days shows that the BTC/USDT pair has been oscillating inside the large range between $24,800 and $31,000. Typically, traders buy the dips to the support of the range and sell near the resistance. The same is expected from the bulls at $24,800.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to seize control, they will have to sink and sustain the price below $24,800. If that happens, the pair may extend the fall to $19,500. There is a minor support at $24,000 but that may not hold for long.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the strong support at $1,626 fizzled out at $1,745 on Aug. 29. This indicates that bears remain active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/57d49a86-36da-4fb8-9c38-f2e485ce3229.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to build upon their advantage by pulling the price below the $1,626 to $1,550 support zone. If they are successful, it will signal the start of a new downtrend. The ETH/USDT pair could then nosedive to the next formidable support at $1,368.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price sharply rebounds off the current level, it will indicate that the bulls are fiercely defending the support. That could drive the price to the 20-day EMA ($1,702) and subsequently to $1,745 which may act as a resistance.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) recovery halted at the 50-day SMA ($234) on Aug. 29 and the bears yanked the price below the important support at $220 on Aug. 31.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/ec56eda6-0907-46de-a304-81281578c4ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand. The bears will try to sink the price to the psychological support at $200. If this level collapses, the BNB/USDT pair could reach the next major support at $183.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to start a relief rally, they will have to push the price back above the 20-day EMA ($222). The pair could then climb to the 50-day SMA and later to the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) Aug. 31 candlestick shows that the bulls are trying to protect the support at $0.50. However, the price action on Sep. 1 shows that the bears are keeping up the pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/37a49962-072f-46c5-a470-7d8c83e3920c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price plunges below $0.50, it will suggest that bears are back in control. That could start a downward move to the formidable support at $0.41. The bulls are likely to defend this level with vigor. A bounce off the support could keep the XRP/USDT pair range-bound between $0.41 and $0.56 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.50, it will suggest that the pair may attempt a rally to $0.56. The bulls will have to overcome this roadblock to start a new up-move to $0.63 and thereafter to $0.73.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $0.28 and $0.24 for the past several days. The bulls kicked the price above the range on Aug. 29 but could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/fdbeb60a-e2f7-4a52-98c3-73903ea51442.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 That may have tempted the short-term bulls to bail out of their positions. The selling picked up further and the price slipped below the uptrend line on Aug. 31. The bears will next try to sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below the vital support at $0.24.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.24, the pair may continue to consolidate inside the range for a while longer. On the contrary, if the price dips below $0.24, it will signal the start of a down move to $0.22 and eventually to $0.20.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to start a recovery in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), indicating that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/a1ff29c2-05cb-4650-8bd3-19cdc2b3c787.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair could dip to the solid support at $0.06. Buyers are expected to defend this level with all their might because a break below it may resume the downtrend. The pair could first skid to $0.055 and then to the final support near $0.05.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $0.06, it will signal that the bulls are buying the dips to this level. The bulls will then again try to overcome the obstacle at the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair may surge to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) returned from the 20-day EMA ($21.37) on Aug. 30, which shows that bears remain in command. The price has reached the vital support at $19.35.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/4ac156d0-f9d9-4556-831e-94eb694ef9fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative zone indicating that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the $19.35 support gives way, the selling could intensify and the SOL/USDT pair may slide to $18.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bulls. If they want to start a recovery, they will have to quickly shove the price above the overhead resistance at $22.30. If they do that, the pair may soar toward $26. The 50-day SMA ($23.42) may act as a hurdle but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-rsi-showdown-btc-price-new-2-week-low"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin lines up RSI showdown as BTC price slips toward new 2-week low}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) is in a strong uptrend. The bears tried to stall the rally near $1.77 but the bulls did not give up much ground. That shows that the bulls are in no hurry to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/1624ce53-a906-415f-9470-07848f2cb37b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buying resumed on Sep. 1 and the TON/USDT pair has reached the pattern target of $1.91. If buyers scale this level, the up-move may continue and the pair may skyrocket to $2.38. This level may witness profit-booking by the traders.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down and breaks below $1.66. Such a move will suggest aggressive selling at higher levels. That could then sink the pair to the breakout level of $1.53.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($4.56) on Aug. 30, indicating that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/930a4215-8694-4930-83de-47e27f723244.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOTUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up further on Aug. 31 and the DOT/USDT pair dropped to the vital support at $4.22. This level is likely to witness a battle between the bulls and the bears. If the price plummets below $4.22, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend to $4.\par \par \uc2 Buyers have their tasks cut out. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly drive and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could surge to the overhead resistance at $5.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) failure to maintain above the 20-day EMA ($0.58) on Aug. 29 may have attracted profit-booking from short-term traders. The bulls tried to push the price back above the 20-day EMA on Aug. 30 and 31 but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/1c964aee-c637-4bf8-b54a-aa1b7a6d78f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below the immediate support at $0.53. If they can pull it off, the MATIC/USDT pair may slump to the crucial support at $0.51.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level, it is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA and again at the 50-day SMA ($0.66). On the other hand, a break below $0.51 could resume the downtrend. The next support is at $0.45.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-09/ace35fea-62a2-453d-a6b0-3034e9de0dfb.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230901ej91000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shpp