\par\par \b \uc2 BlockFi Requests Permission to Convert Assets into Stablecoins\b0\par\par\uc2 Vince Dioquino \par \uc2 511 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 August 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 In {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://restructuring.ra.kroll.com/blockfi/ExternalCall-DownloadPDF?id1=MjQ2OTIwNw==&id2=0&cid=0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a filing}}}\uc2  to the United States Bankruptcy Court, District of New Jersey, BlockFi has requested for authorization to convert what it calls \u8220\'20\'1Ctrade only\u8221\'20\'1D assets to stablecoins.\par \par \uc2 BlockFi has named Algorand (ALGO), Bitcoin Cash (BCH), and Dogecoin (DOGE), as trade only assets that \u8220\'20\'1Care not currently available for withdrawal for practical reasons associated with the attributes of the digital coins, including that \uc2 BitGo\uc2  does not have the ability to facilitate the process required to transmit blockchain transactions for these Trade Only Assets with the current integrations to BlockFi.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Technical Considerations\par \par \uc2 BitGo\uc2  is a \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  trust company that specializes in providing institutional-grade custody, security, and financial services for digital assets. This move marks another step towards the recovery of users\u8217\'20\'19 funds after the crypto lending firm {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2022/11/crypto-lender-blockfi-files-for-chapter-11-bankruptcy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 filed for bankruptcy}}}\uc2  November last year.\par \par \uc2 These \u8220\'20\'1Ctrade only\u8221\'20\'1D assets, BlockFi clarified, only constitutes about 0.5% of all digital assets in their U.S. wallets. Other digital assets such as Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), or Filecoin (FIL) are held separately by BlockFi and are not covered by the request. On its end, BlockFi insists that these trade only assets have to be converted into stablecoins first before users can withdraw them.\par \par \uc2 This request has been part of BlockFi\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/08/blockfi-restructure-plan-nears-completion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 restructuring plan}}}\uc2  which, right from the start, has been directed towards recouping funds from other failed businesses such as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2022/09/alameda-research-to-pay-back-200-m-to-bankrupt-voyager"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alameda Research}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/08/ftx-exchange-might-relaunch-ftt-jumps-in-value"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FTX}}}\uc2 , and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/02/3ac-collapse-costs-dcg-1b-dollars"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Three Arrows Capital}}}\uc2  among others. The process has not been easy with BlockFi being engaged in a back-and-forth of sorts with the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/08/blockfi-pushes-back-on-ftx-and-three-arrows-capital-repayment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 aforementioned companies}}}\uc2 . The latter have criticized the fairness of BlockFi\u8217\'20\'19s restructuring plan with its potential to absolve BlockFi and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/08/blockfi-ceo-disregarded-warnings-about-ftx-ignored-risk-team"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 its management}}}\uc2  from responsibility.\par \par \uc2 Next Steps, Possible Alternatives\par \par \uc2 At the very least, steps are being made to actually return users\u8217\'20\'19 funds to them and those affected should look forward to what BlockFi plans to do with the remaining assets and how it would return them to its users. Apart from the criticisms on BlockFi\u8217\'20\'19s restructuring plan however, one potential slippery slope would be defining what a \u8220\'20\'1Ctrade only\u8221\'20\'1D asset is and what it encompasses. The filing did not obstinately specify what a \u8220\'20\'1Ctrade only\u8221\'20\'1D asset is, and instead relied on its ad hoc use in the document.\par \par \uc2 One could see this problem manifest in what are called \u8220\'20\'1Cwrapped\u8221\'20\'1D tokens (like Wrapped Ether or WETH), which cannot really be construed as \u8220\'20\'1Cassets\u8221\'20\'1D. A wrapped token is backed by another cryptocurrency, usually native to a different blockchain such as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/07/vitalik-reveals-ethereum-upgrade-on-account-abstraction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum}}}\uc2 . Wrapping allows interoperability between different blockchains. A wrapped token\u8212\'20\'14say 0.5 ETH\u8212\'20\'14technically does not exist, in the same way as 0.5 ETH does. There can be a sort of \u8220\'20\'1Cgray zone\u8221\'20\'1D with these types of tokens, and (in this instance) BlockFi should clearly define what these are and their subsequent plans of action in in their upcoming filings.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020230831ej8v000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , TON, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,691 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s inability to maintain its recent \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be a sign that the rally was just a euphoria-driven event.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin led the cryptocurrency markets higher on Aug. 29 following {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-wins-sec-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s victory in the lawsuit}}}\uc2  against the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 . However, the rally could not be sustained, as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-community-jubilant-over-grayscale-sec-decision-uncertainty-remains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 analysts cautioned that the victory}}}\uc2  did not guarantee the approval of a spot Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded fund.\par \par \uc2 Still, the victory may prove to be \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for Grayscale. Glassnode analysts said in an X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) post on Aug. 30 that the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC) could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gbtc-bitcoin-discount-2024-share-price-gains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 return to a premium next year}}}\uc2 . It is important to note that GBTC has been trading at a discount to the spot Bitcoin price for the past two and a half years.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/9f388648-b352-4cb5-b94b-7bb2527cf320.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 In the short term, even though the S&P 500 Index is on a path of recovery and the U.S. Dollar Index has turned down in the near term, the crypto markets are not able to sustain the higher levels. This shows that traders have maintained their focus on crypto-specific news.\par \par \uc2 Could bulls defend the support levels in Bitcoin and altcoins? Will that lead to a stronger recovery soon? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s range resolved to the upside with a sharp breakout on Aug. 29. This move indicates that the price is likely to oscillate inside the large range between $24,800 and $31,000 for a few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/445ff3ef-e252-407e-985e-869c8bbbf86e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $27,168 is flattening out and the relative strength index (RSI) is just below the midpoint, indicating that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to defend the breakout level of $26,833. If they succeed, it will signal that the bulls have flipped the level into support. The BTC/USDT pair may first rise to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $28,689 and thereafter attempt a rally to $31,000.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to trap the aggressive bulls, they will have to pull the price below $26,833. If they do that, it will indicate that the bears are selling on every recovery attempt. The pair could then retest the strong support at $24,800.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) once again rebounded off the crucial support at $1,626 on Aug. 28, indicating that the bulls are buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/874f7439-d7b8-404a-9334-17a764117a3a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The momentum picked up on Aug. 29, and the bulls propelled the price above the 20-day EMA ($1,716). This suggests that the ETH/USDT pair could swing between $1,626 and $1,816 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 The price turned back below the 20-day EMA on Aug. 30, signaling that bears have not yet given up. If the price maintains below the 20-day EMA, the pair could tumble to $1,626. Contrarily, if the price turns up and climbs back above the 20-day EMA, the pair may reach the overhead resistance at $1,816.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 After tight range trading near $220 for a few days, BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) surged higher on Aug. 29. The relief rally is facing resistance at the 50-day SMA ($235) as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/ea22f8fb-1bad-4979-92d2-77f5b7ec678c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($224) is flattening out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating that the downward selling pressure is reducing. If the price turns up from the current level, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to the resistance line. This level may again attract aggressive selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, if the price slides below $220, it will indicate that the bears remain in control. The pair could then slump to the Aug. 22 intraday low of $203.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $0.50 and $0.56 for the past few days. This suggests that the bulls are buying near the support and the bears are selling close to the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/4ae65077-f609-4371-8422-0d79ae9b2e40.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.55) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that the bears have the upper hand. Sellers will try to sink the price below the strong support at $0.50. If they manage to do that, the XRP/USDT pair may plummet to $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $0.50, the pair may extend its stay inside the tight range for some more time. Buyers will have to shove and sustain the price above $0.56 to signal the start of a sustained recovery. The pair may then rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.64).\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above $0.28 on Aug. 29, but they could not sustain the higher levels. That kept the price below the resistance at $0.28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/48c149ce-4b51-44db-833e-7243ea41dcdd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This shows that the price remains stuck inside the range between $0.24 and $0.28. The next support is at the uptrend line. If the price rebounds off this level with strength, it will suggest that every minor dip is being purchased. That will enhance the prospects of a rally above $0.28. Above this level, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could soar to $0.32.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price dives below the uptrend line, it will signal that the bears are trying to make a comeback. The pair could then skid to the vital support at $0.24.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) reached the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on Aug. 29, but the bulls are struggling to sustain the price above it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/989950b6-6570-45f5-9631-b3539cd33319.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from the current level, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. The DOGE/USDT pair may then consolidate between the 20-day EMA and the support at $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the pair does not give up much ground from the current level, it will suggest that the bulls are maintaining their buying pressure. That could open the gates for a potential rally to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) recovery hit a roadblock at the 20-day EMA ($21.77) on Aug. 29, indicating that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/ef16c115-a596-4a63-9281-f2f6c2577eb3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will once again try to tug the price to $19.35. If this level cracks, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could start a downward move to $18 and then to $16.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to have other plans. They will try to build upon the recovery by pushing the price above the overhead resistance at $22.30. If they can pull it off, the pair may rise to the 50-day SMA ($23.59). If the price turns down from this level, the pair may remain range-bound between the 50-day SMA and $19.35 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-dogecoin-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Dogecoin price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) soared above the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern at $1.53 on Aug. 29. This signals a potential trend change.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/65ad0881-6ffa-416c-b280-af0ac83e95d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Typically, after a breakout, the price turns down and retests the breakout level. If the price bounces off $1.53, it will suggest that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That could start an up move toward the pattern target of $1.91. If this resistance is scaled, the TON/USDT pair could reach $2.07.\par \par \uc2 If the bears want to prevent the rally, they will have to quickly sink the price back below $1.53. Such a move could trap the aggressive bulls, resulting in a long liquidation. The pair may then slump to $1.25.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 20-day EMA ($4.64) on Aug. 29, but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/442bfbcb-9472-4c72-bfe0-4d2a0a330218.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA on Aug. 30. This indicates that the bears have not given up and are viewing the recoveries as a selling opportunity. The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory signal possible range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below $4.50, the DOT/USDT pair may swing between the 20-day EMA and $4.22 for some time. On the other hand, a break and close above the 20-day EMA could propel the pair to the overhead resistance at $5.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) is facing stiff resistance in the zone between $0.60 and $0.65 as seen from the long wick on the Aug. 29 candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/15e2afaa-5baa-41f7-af96-20a0eedf3ef4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down on Aug. 30, suggesting that the MATIC/USDT pair could consolidate in a large range between $0.51 and $0.65 for a while. The price action inside the range is likely to remain random and volatile.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to seize control, they will have to drag the price below $0.51. That could resume the downtrend with the next support at $0.45. On the upside, a break and close above the 50-day SMA ($0.67) could signal that the bulls are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/4de3eb02-dd05-43fe-84c3-8555ada6293d.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230830ej8u000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/28: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,635 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bears are losing momentum, opening the door to a price reversal, but historical data also shows BTC performing poorly in September.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is down about 11% in August, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/september-crash-5-things-bitcoin-btc-price-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 just shy of the 13.88% fall}}}\uc2  seen in the corresponding month in 2022, according to CoinGlass data. The picture does not look very bright for September, either. History shows that every year since 2017, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has declined in September.\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg Intelligence senior macro strategist \uc2 Mike McGlone{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-on-the-weekend"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 is even more \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  on Bitcoin. While speaking to Kitco News, McGlone warned that in case of a \u8220\'20\'1Cglobal economic reset,\u8221\'20\'1D Bitcoin could nosedive to as low as $10,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/e846d631-0bd0-4fc8-a219-9f9e21c1f2b1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Although analysts have been giving both \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  targets, it is better to wait for the price to break out of the range before taking large bets. Typically, after a low-\b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  period, the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  picks up, but it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty.\par \par \uc2 Do Bitcoin and the major altcoins show signs of a potential breakout? What are the important levels to watch out for? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) turned down from the moving averages on Aug. 24, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/b0f43d02-df5a-465b-bf94-d94fcd65f59a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 After the recovery on Aug. 25, the bulls maintained their buying pressure and pushed the index back to the moving averages. If buyers overcome this roadblock, the index could rally to the overhead resistance zone between 4,607 and 4,650. This zone is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price once again turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are fiercely defending the level. The pair may then slide to the pivotal support at 4,325. If this level breaks down, the index will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. That could start a correction toward the pattern target of 4,043.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls propelled the U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) above the downtrend line on Aug. 22, signaling that the correction may be over in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/6dd87522-3dac-47c8-ba68-a2ef59b58321.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull the price back below the level on Aug. 23, but the bulls held their ground. This suggests that the bulls successfully flipped the downtrend line into support.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will next attempt to push the price to 106. The rising 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) at 103 and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought territory indicate an advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly pull the price back below the downtrend line. If they do that, the index may slide to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of 102.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls and the bears are not taking large bets as Bitcoin continues to trade inside the range between $24,800 and $26,833.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/55baa58c-b7ba-4570-8402-22bfc9d75911.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the oversold zone indicate that bears are in command. However, sellers may find it difficult to resume the downward move because the bulls are likely to defend the $24,800 level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support, it will suggest that the BTC/USDT pair may continue its consolidation for some more time. On the upside, a rally above $26,833 will be the first sign of strength. That could push the price to the 50-day SMA ($28,806) and later to $30,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break and close below the $24,800 support could start the next leg of the downtrend to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the crucial support at $1,626, indicating that the bears have kept up the selling pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/38aa988b-3eb5-4b25-9568-3f47118c43b4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to start a strong rebound increases the risk of a break below $1,626. If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair could plummet to $1,550. This level may attract solid buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from this level but turns down from $1,626, it will signal that bears have flipped the level into resistance. That may start a downtrend toward $1,368. The bulls will have to kick the price above the 20-day EMA ($1,716) to signal a comeback.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) pullback is facing selling at the breakdown level of $220, indicating that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/5b5af80f-dc48-47cd-aadc-b12501b1429d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not given up much ground from $220. This suggests that buyers are keeping up the pressure. The bulls will have to overcome the barrier at the 20-day EMA ($223) to start a relief rally to the resistance line. This level may again witness strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is $213. If this level breaks down, the BNB/USDT pair could plunge to psychological support at $200. A break below this level may extend the decline to the next major support at $183.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) to the overhead resistance at $0.56 suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/809f6573-5051-4c96-bb4b-99f13cc8482a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The weak bounce off $0.50 may attract aggressive selling by the bears. If the $0.50 support gives way, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the crucial support at $0.41. This level could witness strong buying by the bulls. If the price rebounds off this support, it will suggest that the pair may oscillate between $0.41 and $0.56 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up and breaks above $0.56, it will suggest the start of a sustained recovery. The pair may then climb to the 50-day SMA ($0.64).\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been swinging inside the narrow range between $0.24 and $0.28 for the past few days. This suggests that the bulls are buying near the support and bears are selling at the resistance level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/05261cd4-4313-4ed8-8ab2-22423f3029da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the overhead resistance at $0.28, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could start a rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.29). This level may act as an obstacle, but if overcome, the pair could shoot to $0.34.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to defend the overhead resistance and tug the price to the support of the range at $0.24. If this level breaks down, the pair may slump to $0.22 and eventually to $0.20.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-support-levels-btc-price-taps-26"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin traders pinpoint support levels as BTC price taps $26.2K}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the strong support at $0.06 and the 20-day EMA ($0.07) for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/f6bb2eb1-9821-4326-bc28-5f53ead056ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating that the bears have the edge. Sellers will try to sink the price below $0.06 and further strengthen their position.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bulls. If they want to start a recovery, they will have to quickly drive the price above the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.07) and thereafter jump to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually drifting lower, indicating that the bears are pouncing on every minor relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/6c8eed8a-a7f3-4b0e-91e2-84939861f1cb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair could drop to the Aug. 22 intraday low of $19.35. If this level caves in, the selling could intensify and the pair may dive to $18 and eventually to the next major support at $15.60.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up and breaks above $22.30, it will indicate solid buying at lower levels. The pair may first rise to the 50-day SMA ($23.61) and thereafter to the strong resistance at $26.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to shove Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at the 20-day EMA ($4.64), but they are likely to encounter stiff resistance from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/fe386b57-81d8-4e69-abf8-bee603cdbf60.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. That could increase the likelihood of a retest of the crucial support at $4.22. If this support crumbles, the DOT/USDT pair may collapse to $4 and later to $3.88.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest the start of a stronger relief rally to the breakdown level of $5. This level could attract selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/c5d8faa1-63bf-4d5c-94f9-27038bb1fef3.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230828ej8s000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, MATIC, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,673 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bears tightened their grip on the crypto market after comments from the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  pointed toward another year of interest rate hikes.\par \par \uc2 Federal Reserve Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  spoke on Aug. 25, and in his Jackson Hole speech, he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/08/24/stock-futures-are-little-changed-as-investors-await-powells-jackson-hole-speech-live-updates.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cautioned}}}\uc2  that inflation remains too high and that the central bank remains open to raising rates further if needed. The remarks by Powell strengthen the narrative that interest rates are likely to remain higher for longer.\par \par \uc2 However, a positive sign is that after a brief sell-off, the United States equities markets recovered from their intraday lows. With the event having passed without any major price movement, traders are back to guessing as to what could move the markets next.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/036d7c4f-b88b-4959-957e-cbf017364a38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Pantera Capital believes that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price action will continue to follow its previous halving cycles. If that happens, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-btc-price-148k-july-2025-pantera-capital"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could rise to $35,000 by April 2024}}}\uc2 , when the next halving is expected to occur. After that, Bitcoin could rally sharply and climb to $148,000.\par \par \uc2 Will bears maintain their selling pressure and pull the price below the respective supports in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin once again turned down from the overhead resistance at $26,833 on Aug. 23, indicating that the bears continue to sell on rallies. That has kept the price stuck inside the range between $26,833 and $24,800.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/232d4217-4d81-476f-9a03-5b17a283243a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A tight consolidation near the support of a range is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign, as it shows a lack of aggressive buying by the bulls. The downsloping 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) at $27,463 and the relative strength index (RSI) in the oversold territory indicate that bears are in command.\par \par \uc2 If the price plummets below $24,800, it could hit the stops of several traders. That may trigger long liquidations, which could plunge the BTC/USDT pair to the pivotal support at $20,000.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a close above the 20-day EMA. That could open the doors for a possible rally to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) at $29,055.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls nudged Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $1,700 on Aug. 23 but could not sustain the higher levels. This shows that the bears are guarding the $1,700 level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/16c777ef-260e-4ec6-9c46-7a984d5aab45.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the oversold territory indicate that the bears remain in control. Sellers will try to yank the price below the $1,626 to $1,550 zone. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could start a downward move toward $1,368.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bulls are likely to have other plans. They will fiercely defend the support zone and try to propel the price above the 20-day EMA ($1,737). If they succeed, it will suggest that the pair may oscillate inside the large range between $1,626 and $2,000 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) recovery hit a roadblock at the breakdown level of $220. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/7337507d-cdb3-4fe4-ad4b-408ea398be32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to the psychological support at $200. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the BNB/USDT pair could plummet to the next major support at $183.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the decline, they will have to quickly push the price back above the 20-day EMA ($225). That could start a rally to the resistance line. This level may again attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounce off the $0.50 support could not even reach the overhead resistance at $0.56, indicating that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/d08a54f0-bb3f-4798-bd0f-0cb697ff5598.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below the $0.50 support. If they manage to do that, the XRP/USDT pair could start a downhill slide toward the next major support at $0.41. Buyers are expected to aggressively buy the dips to this level.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to drive the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.56) to indicate that the bears may be losing their grip. That could start a relief rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.63).\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the $0.24 support in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) but are struggling to overcome the obstacle at $0.28. This suggests that the bears are selling on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/8d684e07-8acc-425b-b811-c7ce6b2e27ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price to the support of the range at $0.24. A strong bounce off this level will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may extend its stay inside the $0.24 to $0.28 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 If bears tug the price below $0.24, it will signal the resumption of the downtrend. The pair may first descend to $0.22 and thereafter to $0.20. Alternatively, a break and close above the range could start a recovery to $0.32.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) once again turned down from the breakdown level of $22.30 on Aug. 24, suggesting that the bears have flipped the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/661ae44e-e4c6-4db9-90e1-78c410118d8a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will try to build upon their strength by yanking the price below the immediate support at $19.35. If they can pull it off, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could first slump to $18 and subsequently to $16. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($22.33) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have the edge.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly kick the price above the overhead resistance at $22.30. The pair may then rise to the 50-day SMA ($23.67).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) Aug. 23 candlestick shows that the bears have not given up and they continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/b2d4a800-0bcd-4b50-99e0-dbc6879f88c0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price skids below the critical support at $0.06, it will suggest that the bears remain in command. The DOGE/USDT pair could then dip to the intraday low of $0.055 made on Aug. 17. If this level crumbles, the pair may retest the long-term support near $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rebounds off $0.06, it will suggest solid buying at lower levels. The pair may then rise to the 20-day EMA ($0.07). Buyers will have to overcome this barrier to signal the start of a rally to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-xrp-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is XRP price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a tight range between $4.22 and $4.56 for the past few days. This shows that the bulls successfully defended the support at $4.22 but failed to break above the resistance at $4.56.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/d4864f1c-1b3d-45a2-a2c9-b0efb22ed4f6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not given up much ground from the overhead resistance. That enhances the prospects of a break above it. The DOT/USDT pair could first rise to the 20-day EMA ($4.68) and eventually rally to the breakdown level of $5. This level is likely to witness strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the bulls will have to defend the $4.22 level with all their might because if this support cracks, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend to $4.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually drifting lower toward the vital support at $0.51, indicating that the bears have kept up the pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/332ec56f-def6-485b-8974-8120b042e54f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the RSI is in the oversold territory, the bulls have failed to start a rebound. This indicates a lack of demand at the current levels. If the $0.51 level gives way, the selling could intensify and the MATIC/USDT pair could dive to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 The critical resistance to watch out for on the upside is $0.60. If buyers clear this roadblock, the recovery could reach the 50-day SMA ($0.68). There is a minor resistance at $0.64, but that is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has been trying to form a base for the past few days. That has resulted in the formation of an inverse head-and-shoulders pattern, which will complete on a break above $1.53.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/cf1e9042-1098-4b24-a426-f29eb9bc935d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1.35) has started to turn up and the RSI is in positive territory, indicating that the bulls are on a comeback. If buyers shove the price above $1.53, the TON/USDT pair could pick up momentum and start a new up move toward the pattern target of $1.91.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level, it will indicate that the bears are not willing to relent. That could first pull the price to the moving averages, and if this support breaks, the next stop could be $1.25.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/680506fd-48db-4e42-8a94-c29643ea10ab.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230825ej8p000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, MATIC, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,674 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The bounce off strong support levels in Bitcoin and select altcoins suggests that the bulls have not given up and that a relief rally is likely.\par \par \uc2 When the markets are trending, traders should be active if they want to earn money. On the other hand, in a ranging market, it is better to wait on the sidelines with patience, or else traders may lose money due to choppy random moves in either direction.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) sideways price action since the sharp fall on Aug. 17 shows that the bulls and the bears are unsure about the next directional move. Therefore, it is better to wait for the breakout to happen before waging large bets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/86449c13-5c26-46f6-8a7e-d01a879b2aac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 In the short term, institutional traders also seem to be taking a cautious approach. A \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  report showed an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dwindling-optimism-for-bitcoin-etf-approval-to-blame-as-weekly-crypto-outflows-hit-55m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outflow of $55 million}}}\uc2  from \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products for the week of Sept. 13.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support and resistance levels that need to be crossed for a trending move to start in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s Aug. 22 candlestick is a positive sign, as it shows that the bulls are fiercely trying to protect the support at $24,800.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/0c8a98d2-2e17-4a57-b6c5-b498d8c455a9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls will remain under pressure until they clear the overheard hurdle at $26,833 and then the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) at $27,777. If both these resistances are overcome, it will indicate that the BTC/USDT pair may extend its stay inside the $24,800 to $31,000 range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Although the downsloping 20-day EMA indicates an advantage to bears, the oversold levels on the relative strength index (RSI) point to a possible recovery in the near term.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below $24,800 to further strengthen their hold. That could open the doors for a potential drop to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) once again dipped below the strong support at $1,626, but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/74f5285c-58f8-4936-bf25-59ed858f9138.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The onus is on the bulls to drive the price above the overhead resistance of $1,700. If they do that, the ETH/USDT pair could reach the 20-day EMA ($1,756). This remains the key level to watch out for in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level, the bears will again try to yank the pair below the $1,626 to $1,550 support zone. If they succeed, the index could start a downward move toward $1,368.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a break above the 20-day EMA will enhance the prospects of the pair remaining inside the $2,000 to $1,626 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the psychological support at $200 on Aug. 17, indicating that the bulls are trying to arrest the decline at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/f9ca90b3-4e91-4ee4-b6b7-eff18e7789f6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The recovery could reach the 20-day EMA ($227), which is again likely to act as a formidable hurdle. If the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, the bears will make another attempt to sink the BNB/USDT pair below $200. If they manage to do that, the pair could slide to $183.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The pair may then rise to the resistance line, which is an important level for the bears to defend.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $0.56, but a minor positive is that the bulls have not allowed the price to skid below $0.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/022cac98-7966-43b2-80d7-c5b0d01a0510.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair may consolidate between $0.50 and $0.56 for some time. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.58) and the RSI near the oversold territory indicate an advantage to bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below $0.50, the pair could start its descent toward the next major support at $0.41. That could indicate arange-bound action between $0.41 and $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if buyers thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls are on a comeback. The pair may then rise to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $0.63.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) Aug. 22 candlestick shows strong demand at lower levels. The price is currently stuck inside the range between $0.24 and $0.28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/c6610f25-5dc8-45c7-b391-5111029e7ce8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price plummets below $0.24, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could start the next leg of the downtrend. The pair could first slump to $0.22 and thereafter to the psychological support at $0.20. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.28) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could be invalidated in the near term if buyers propel the price above $0.28. If they do that, the pair may start a relief rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.29) and thereafter to $0.32.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the immediate support at $20 on Aug. 22, but the bulls purchased the dip, indicating demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/04a43ce8-e853-4498-b592-04a0294deef5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($22.64) if they want to salvage the situation. Above this level, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and attempt a rally to $26. The 50-day SMA ($23.60) could act as a barrier, but it is likely to be crossed.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bears have not given up. That will increase the likelihood of a break below $19.35. If that happens, the pair may drop to $18 and eventually to $16.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the support at $0.06 on Aug. 21 and 22, indicating that the bulls are buying the dips to this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/481535a3-1706-451e-bfbf-7a77f88cc0d9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to start a relief rally that could reach the 20-day EMA ($0.07). Sellers are likely to protect this level with vigor. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest that the DOGE/USDT pair may remain stuck between the 20-day EMA and $0.06 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to kick the price above the moving averages to start a rally to the next major resistance above $0.08. On the downside, a break and close below $0.06 could signal the start of a downward move to $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/latest-bitcoin-price-correction-reveals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what the latest Bitcoin price correction reveals}}}\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to tug Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the vital support at $4.22, but the bulls held their ground as seen from the long tail on the Aug. 22 candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/9527c804-640e-4f9b-b0f8-bd3101796b84.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($4.73) is turning down and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that bears hold the edge. If buyers want to signal a comeback, they will have to propel the price above the overhead zone between $4.56 and the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to sell on minor rallies and pull the price below $4.22. If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair could start the next leg of the downtrend. The next support is at $4.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) snapped back from $0.53 on Aug. 22, indicating that the bulls are trying to keep the price above the crucial support at $0.51.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/26ff93a8-b244-4f60-9729-b17f7fc0ae56.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls have their task cut out because they are likely to face strong selling at $0.60. If the price turns down from this resistance, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. That may keep the MATIC/USDT pair stuck inside the $0.51 to $0.60 range for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $0.50 will signal the resumption of the downtrend. The pair could then tumble to $0.45 and later to $0.42. On the contrary, a rally above $0.60 could set up a rally to $0.65 and then to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu price analysis\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) fell below the 50-day SMA ($0.0000084) on Aug. 20, but the bulls did not allow the price to retest the important support at $0.0000072.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/1a07ea47-1fd6-4c09-900d-d554c4d2eb35.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The solid bounce on Aug. 22 shows strong buying at lower levels. The bulls will next attempt a rally above the moving averages. If they can pull it off, the SHIB/USDT pair may pick up momentum and soar toward $0.000011.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears remain in control. The pair could then collapse to the strong support at $0.0000072 and subsequently to $0.0000064.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/685a4cc1-bb91-4016-87e1-5ae0af0d75d1.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230823ej8n000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/21: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,678 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The shallow bounce in Bitcoin and select altcoins suggests a lack of aggressive buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 After its sharp fall on Aug. 17, Bitcoin remained stuck inside a tight range over the weekend. This suggests indecision between the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par \uc2 After the latest fall, about 88% of Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) held by short-term holders (STHs), those owning Bitcoin for 155 days or less, has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-speculators-underwater-btc-bags-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plunged into loss}}}\uc2 , according to Glassnode\u8217\'20\'19s weekly newsletter, \u8220\'20\'1CThe Week On-Chain.\u8221\'20\'1D Glassnode warns that the STH cohort is \u8220\'20\'1Cincreasingly price sensitive.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In comparison, the long-term holders have neither panicked nor gone on a shopping spree during the current fall.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/0c7bcc96-1449-4c53-ad5e-52ba8924d313.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Traders are likely to keep a close watch on Federal Reserve Chairman Jerome Powell\u8217\'20\'19s speech at the annual Jackson Hole Economic Symposium on Aug. 25. If Powell does not spring a negative surprise, then the event may turn out to be \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for risky assets. History suggests that U.S. stocks generally rise in the week after Jackson Hole.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support and resistance levels to watch for in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) is correcting in an uptrend. Typically pullbacks are a buying opportunity in an uptrend, but it is prudent to wait for the correction to end before resuming the purchases.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/2765d87a-4a28-4056-8783-268a3e5cf72c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the breakout level of 4,307, which is an important level to keep an eye on. The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the relative strength index (RSI) is in negative territory, indicating that bears are trying to seize control.\par \par \uc2 A bounce off the current level is again likely to face selling at the moving averages. If the price turns down from the moving averages, the index will be at risk of forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a rally above the moving averages will indicate that the corrective phase may be over.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) recovered to the downtrend line, where the bears are posing a strong challenge. However, the index has not lost ground, indicating that the bulls have kept up the buying pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/5d8d9867-e4e0-4771-abb5-ca9418c33d85.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the index above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The index could then resume its recovery and reach the stiff overhead resistance at 106. This level is again likely to attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are the important support to watch out for on the downside. The bears will have to sink the price below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) at 102 to signal a comeback. That could open the doors for a retest of the strong support near 101.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been consolidating inside a large range between $24,800 and $31,000 for the past several weeks. Inside a range, traders buy the dips to the support and sell near the overhead resistance. In between, trading may be random and volatile.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/d12a3b6a-b025-4426-b535-aa95165c5a07.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have turned down and the RSI is in the oversold territory, indicating that bears are firmly in control. Sellers will try to build upon their advantage by yanking the price below $24,800, but the bulls are unlikely to give up easily.\par \par \uc2 The buyers will try to start a recovery from the support, which is likely to pick up momentum above $26,833. The BTC/USDT pair may then rise to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) at $28,098, signaling that the range-bound action remains intact.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounce is struggling to rise above $1,700, indicating that the bears have not given up and are selling on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/e9b02290-fd8c-4de6-aa89-fe951a408b54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A shallow bounce usually indicates a lack of urgency among the bulls to buy. That increases the risk of a breakdown below the support. If the price turns down and slips below $1,626, it will suggest that bears remain in command. The ETH/USDT pair may then retest the intraday low of $1,550 made on Aug. 17.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $1,700, it will suggest the start of a stronger recovery. The first stop may be the 20-day EMA ($1,777), but if this level is crossed, the pair may reach the 50-day SMA ($1,852).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) tumbled below the vital support at $220 on Aug. 17, and the bears have managed to defend the level since then. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the $220 level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/59d245bd-9976-4f01-93ce-2e391985aeb7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price crashed below the immediate support at $212 on Aug. 21, indicating the resumption of the downtrend. The BNB/USDT pair could first plummet to the pattern target of $196 and eventually to the next major support at $183.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bulls. If they want to salvage the situation, they will have to quickly drive and sustain the price above $220. The pair could then rise to the 20-day EMA ($230), which may again act as a stiff barrier.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the strong support at $0.41 on Aug. 17 and reached the overhead resistance at $0.56 on Aug. 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/2b778ffc-cfa0-40a6-b10e-3235b1776763.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to stall the relief rally near $0.56, indicating that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on every minor rise. If the price turns down and skids below $0.48, it will suggest that the XRP/USDT pair may swing between $0.41 and $0.56 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.59) and the RSI near the oversold zone signal that bears have the edge. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. That will indicate that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure may be reducing.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) snapped back from the crucial support at $0.24 on Aug. 17, but the relief rally is facing downward pressure at the overhead resistance near $0.28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/fd0529c6-ce66-4f7a-be4c-58292c95fa98.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.28) and the RSI in the negative area suggest that bears have the upper hand. If the price slips below $0.26, it will indicate that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may oscillate inside the tight range between $0.24 and $0.28 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Generally, a tight consolidation near a strong support level is a negative sign, and it may result in a breakdown. If the $0.24 support gives way, the pair may plunge to $0.22 and then to $0.20. If buyers want to prevent the decline, they will have to quickly thrust the price above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-limits-withdrawals-in-europe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Binance limits withdrawals in Europe, cites payment processor issues}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have managed to keep Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the essential support at $0.06 for the past few days, but they have failed to start a strong bounce.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/80cab0ee-3e3b-42ab-9010-3d6b3cbf927f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The shallow bounce suggests a negative sentiment where the bulls are not buying aggressively. This may have encouraged the bears to seize control, and they have pulled the price to the strong support at $0.06.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below $0.06, the DOGE/USDT pair could nosedive toward the next solid support near $0.05. Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level, it will indicate that lower levels are attracting buyers. The pair may then climb to the moving averages. A break above the 50-day SMA ($0.07) could start a sustained recovery.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bulls are facing stiff resistance from the bears near the overhead resistance at $22.30. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the $22.30 level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/36249e8d-9ce0-4f02-87fe-7d621f74695d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that bears have the edge. The SOL/USDT pair could retest the support at $20. If this level gives way, the pair may start a deeper correction to $18 and subsequently to $15.60.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls want to make a comeback, they will have to kick the price above the moving averages. It is going to be a tough ask, but if they manage to do it, the pair may rally to the overhead resistance zone between $26 and $27.12.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Aug. 19 and 20, indicating that the buying pressure has been reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/230f2da0-7570-4aab-a405-5e1e5b66b5a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below $4.36, it will suggest that bears are trying to gain the upper hand. The DOT/USDT pair could then retest the pivotal support at $4.22. If this level caves in, the selling may accelerate and the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up and breaks above $4.56, it will suggest that bulls are making a comeback. The pair could then rally to the 20-day EMA ($4.79), which is again likely to behave as a roadblock.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/b9aa2266-fb78-4a06-a295-3e4dda3b7052.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230821ej8l000e4\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/21: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,673 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The shallow bounce in Bitcoin and select altcoins suggests a lack of aggressive buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 After the sharp fall on Aug. 17, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) remained stuck inside a tight range over the weekend. This suggests indecision between the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par \uc2 After the latest fall, about 88% of Bitcoin held by Short-term Holders (STHs), owning Bitcoin for 155 days or less, has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-speculators-underwater-btc-bags-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plunged into loss}}}\uc2 , according to Glassnode\u8217\'20\'19s weekly newsletter, \u8220\'20\'1CThe Week On-Chain.\u8221\'20\'1D Glassnode warns that the STH cohort is \u8220\'20\'1Cincreasingly price sensitive.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In comparison, the long-term holders have neither panicked nor gone on a shopping spree during the current fall.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/0c7bcc96-1449-4c53-ad5e-52ba8924d313.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Traders are likely to keep a close watch on the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  Chairman Jerome Powell\u8217\'20\'19s speech at the annual Jackson Hole Economic Symposium on Aug. 25. If Powell does not spring a negative surprise, then the event may turn out to be \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for risky assets. History suggests that U.S. stocks generally rise in the week after Jackson Hole.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support and resistance levels to watch for in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) is correcting in an uptrend. Typically pullbacks are a buying opportunity in an uptrend but it is prudent to wait for the correction to end before resuming the purchases.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/2765d87a-4a28-4056-8783-268a3e5cf72c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the breakout level of 4,307, which is an important level to keep an eye on. The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative territory, indicating that bears are trying to seize control.\par \par \uc2 A bounce off the current level is again likely to face selling at the moving averages. If the price turns down from the moving averages, the index will be at risk of forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a rally above the moving average will indicate that the corrective phase may be over.\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index (DXY) recovered to the downtrend line where the bears are posing a strong challenge. However, the index has not lost ground, indicating that the bulls have kept up the buying pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/5d8d9867-e4e0-4771-abb5-ca9418c33d85.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the index above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The index could then resume its recovery and reach the stiff overhead resistance at 106. This level is again likely to attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are the important support to watch out for on the downside. The bears will have to sink the price below the 50-day simple moving average (102) to signal a comeback. That could open the doors for a retest of the strong support near 101.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been consolidating inside a large range between $24,800 and $31,000 for the past several weeks. Inside a range, traders buy the dips to the support and sell near the overhead resistance. In between, trading may be random and volatile.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/d12a3b6a-b025-4426-b535-aa95165c5a07.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have turned down and the RSI is in the oversold territory, indicating that bears are firmly in control. Sellers will try to build upon their advantage by yanking the price below $24,800 but the bulls are unlikely to give up easily.\par \par \uc2 The buyers will try to start a recovery from the support, which is likely to pick up momentum above $26,833. The BTC/USDT pair may then rise to the 20-day EMA ($28,098), signaling that the range-bound action remains intact.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounce is struggling to rise above $1,700, indicating that the bears have not given up and are selling on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/e9b02290-fd8c-4de6-aa89-fe951a408b54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A shallow bounce usually indicates a lack of urgency among the bulls to buy. That increases the risk of a breakdown below the support. If the price turns down and slips below $1,626, it will suggest that bears remain in command. The ETH/USDT pair may then retest the intraday low of $1,550 made on Aug. 17.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $1,700, it will suggest the start of a stronger recovery. The first stop may be the 20-day EMA ($1,777) but if this level is crossed, the pair may reach the 50-day SMA ($1,852).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) tumbled below the vital support at $220 on Aug. 17 and the bears have managed to defend the level since then. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the $220 level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.coi