o price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) snapped back from the crucial support at $0.24 on Aug. 17 but the relief rally is facing resistance at the overhead resistance near $0.28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/fd0529c6-ce66-4f7a-be4c-58292c95fa98.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.28) and the RSI in the negative area suggest that bears have the upper hand. If the price slips below $0.26, it will indicate that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may oscillate inside the tight range between $0.28 and $0.24 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Generally, a tight consolidation near a strong support is a negative sign and it may result in a breakdown. If the $0.24 support gives way, the pair may plunge to $0.22 and then to $0.20. If buyers want to prevent the decline, they will have to quickly thrust the price above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-limits-withdrawals-in-europe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Binance limits withdrawals in Europe, cites payment processor issues}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have managed to keep Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the essential support at $0.06 for the past few days but they have failed to start a strong bounce.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/80cab0ee-3e3b-42ab-9010-3d6b3cbf927f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The shallow bounce suggests a negative sentiment where the bulls are not buying aggressively. This may have encouraged the bears to seize control and they have pulled the price to the strong support at $0.06.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below $0.06, the DOGE/USDT pair could nosedive toward the next solid support near $0.05. Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level, it will indicate that lower levels are attracting buyers. The pair may then climb to the moving averages. A break above the 50-day SMA ($0.07) could start a sustained recovery.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bulls are facing stiff resistance from the bears near the overhead resistance at $22.30. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the $22.30 level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/36249e8d-9ce0-4f02-87fe-7d621f74695d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the negative zone, indicating that bears have the edge. The SOL/USDT pair could retest the support at $20. If this level gives way, the pair may start a deeper correction to $18 and subsequently to $15.60.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls want to make a comeback, they will have to kick the price above the moving averages. It is going to be a tough ask but if they manage to do it, the pair may rally to the overhead resistance zone between $26 and $27.12.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Aug. 19 and 20, indicating that the buying pressure has been reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/230f2da0-7570-4aab-a405-5e1e5b66b5a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below $4.36, it will suggest that bears are trying to gain the upper hand. The DOT/USDT pair could then retest the pivotal support at $4.22. If this level caves in, the selling may accelerate and the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up and breaks above $4.56, it will suggest that bulls are making a comeback. The pair could then rally to the 20-day EMA ($4.79), which is again likely to behave as a roadblock.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/b9aa2266-fb78-4a06-a295-3e4dda3b7052.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230821ej8l000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, MATIC, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,663 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  expansion chose the downside, and charts suggest that the sell-off is not over.\par \par \uc2 A tight range usually resolves with a range breakout, and that is what happened in Bitcoin on Aug. 17. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) fell sharply, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-ether-price-slump-crypto-bloodbath-1-b-liquidations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 resulting in $1 billion in liquidations}}}\uc2  for derivatives traders, the biggest amount since the \uc2 FTX\uc2  collapse in 2022.\par \par \uc2 It is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-did-bitcoin-price-suddenly-drop-analysts-explain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 difficult to pinpoint any specific reason}}}\uc2  for the sell-off, but analysts believe that the confusion arising from the alleged write-down of \uc2 SpaceX\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s $373 million i Bitcoin holdings may have been one of the potential triggers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/14776017-136c-4fcd-a627-146952f23791.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Whatever the reason, the decline has started. The next major question troubling investors is how low could Bitcoin fall. Several analysts have turned \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and expect {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-low-can-the-bitcoin-price-go"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to continue its downtrend}}}\uc2  in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin continue to drop, dragging the rest of the cryptocurrency market with it? What are the important support levels to keep an eye on? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s narrow range resolved to the downside on Aug. 17, triggering a long liquidation, which pulled the price to $25,166.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/80b986ff-b476-495c-a57e-4ecfe5e9f20e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are expected to defend the $24,800 level with vigor. The oversold level on the relative strength index (RSI) suggests that the BTC/USDT pair may witness a pullback or a consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $24,800 with strength, it could reach the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $28,786. This is an important level to keep an eye on. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. That could increase the likelihood of a break below $24,800. If that happens, the pair may nosedive to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. That will point to a possible consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down and broke below the immediate support at $1,816 on Aug. 16, indicating that the bears are in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/3d7194bd-7df6-4bce-8d45-b61c64c3a7c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling momentum picked up on Aug. 17, and the ETH/USDT pair plummeted below the critical support at $1,626. Buyers bought the dip but are struggling to build upon the rebound. This indicates a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 The sharp fall has sent the RSI into the oversold territory, indicating that the selling may have been overdone in the near term. The pair may witness a consolidation or a short-term recovery in the next few days. That could keep the pair stuck inside the large range between $1,626 and $2,000.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the price turns down and plunges below the support at $1,550. That could open the doors for a possible decline to $1,368.39.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the symmetrical triangle pattern on Aug. 16, indicating that the bears overpowered the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/979f7117-a5cf-43a8-a713-39bd44fca350.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up on Aug. 17, and the BNB/USDT pair plunged below the decisive support at $220. If the bulls fail to push the price back above $220, the bears will attempt to sink the pair to the pattern target of $196 and then to $183.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if buyers drive the price back above $220, a recovery to the 20-day EMA ($236) is possible. A break above this level will suggest that the breakdown below $220 may have been a bear trap. That could keep the pair stuck inside the $220 to $265 range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) tumbled below the breakout level of $0.56 on Aug. 17, indicating continued selling pressure from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/2ce4760b-e7b5-4506-a1e3-3f331f5deea2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The fall in the XRP/USDT pair completed a 100% retracement of the entire rally that happened on July 13. However, a minor positive is that the bulls purchased the dip near the strong support zone of $0.45 to $0.41.\par \par \uc2 The recovery is likely to hit a roadblock at $0.56 and again at the 20-day EMA ($0.61). If the price turns down from this overhead zone, it will signal that bears are selling on rallies. That may put the $0.41 support at risk of breaking down.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dropped below the descending channel pattern on Aug. 17, indicating that the selling has accelerated.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/eb9ba43d-1d50-4763-b2b3-4c404f8ed2f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully protected the crucial support at $0.24, indicating strong buying at lower levels. Buyers will try to push the price back into the channel. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair will attempt to rally to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 The rise may not be easy because the bulls are likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA ($0.28). If the price turns down from this level, the pair may again retest the strong support at $0.24. A break below this level will signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke below the moving averages on Aug. 16 and the horizontal support at $22.30 on Aug. 17. This suggests that the price may oscillate inside the large range between $14 and $27.12 for some time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/f746c55d-baf9-41d8-a097-c6726251d5cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to start a recovery, which is likely to face resistance at the moving averages. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA ($23.53), the possibility of a fall to $18 and eventually to $14 increases.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers drive the price above the moving averages, it will suggest that the break below $22.30 may have been a bear trap. That could propel the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair toward the $26 to $27.12 overhead zone.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the support line of the ascending channel pattern on Aug. 15. That may have hit stops on the long positions and attracted selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/fe9a32e5-8fba-4bb3-935a-629e651e1ce3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair closed below the breakout level of $0.07 on Aug. 16, signaling that the bears are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The selling continued on Aug. 17, and the bears yanked the price below the essential support at $0.06. A minor saving grace for the bulls was the strong buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The price rose back above $0.06, and the bulls will attempt to push the price toward the overhead resistance of $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Sellers are likely to have other plans. They will try to sink and sustain the price below $0.06. If they do that, the pair may plummet toward $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-spacex-bitcoin-write-down-bitcoiners-elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SpaceX Bitcoin write-down sparks confusion, Bitcoiners quiz Elon Musk}}}\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The tight range trading in Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) expanded to the downside on Aug. 15. That started a decline, which nearly reached the critical support at $4.22 on Aug. 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/8fe3a41d-a80d-451a-b261-6b6ac3f3444d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to fiercely defend the $4.22 support, but the recovery is likely to face strong selling at the 20-day EMA ($4.91). If the price turns down from this level, the bears are expected to attack the $4.22 support once again. If this level cracks, the DOT/USDT pair may start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA but rebounds off $4.22, it will suggest that the pair may consolidate for a few days. The bulls will gain momentum after the price rises above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) break below the $0.65 support attracted aggressive selling, which tugged the price below the next strong support at $0.60 on Aug. 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/6d030125-5b66-4bf3-a742-b19407e9c186.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls bought the dip near $0.50, indicating strong demand at lower levels. However, buyers may face selling at $0.60 and again at the 20-day EMA ($0.66). If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the MATIC/USDT pair may retest the vital support at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 If this support gives way, the pair could slip to $0.45 and then to $0.42. On the upside, the bulls will have to kick the price above the moving averages to indicate that the downtrend could be ending.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) went into a tailspin after breaking below the support at $81 on Aug. 15. The price crumbled to $56 on Aug. 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/ed310f01-916b-4ca3-beaa-c91f5d049a29.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sharp descent of the past few days has sent the RSI into oversold territory. This suggests that a minor recovery or consolidation is likely in the near term. The relief rally could face selling in the zone between the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $70 and the 61.8% retracement level of $74.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the LTC/USDT pair could form a range for a few days. A break and close below the pivotal level of $56 could extend the decline to $50.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/f08f6c30-42d5-4068-90aa-c67992844fcc.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230818ej8i000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, MATIC, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,659 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2