lt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling momentum picked up on Aug. 17 and the ETH/USDT pair plummeted below the critical support at $1,626. Buyers bought the dip but are struggling to build upon the rebound. This indicates a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 The sharp fall has sent the RSI into the oversold territory, indicating that the selling may have been overdone in the near term. The pair may witness a consolidation or a short-term recovery in the next few days. That could keep the pair stuck inside the large range between $2,000 and $1,626.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the price turns down and plunges below the support at $1,550. That could open the doors for a possible decline to $1,368.39.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the symmetrical triangle pattern on Aug. 16, indicating that the bears overpowered the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/979f7117-a5cf-43a8-a713-39bd44fca350.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up on Aug. 17 and the BNB/USDT pair plunged below the decisive support at $220. If the bulls fail to push the price back above $220, the bears will attempt to sink the pair to the pattern target of $196 and then to $183.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if buyers drive the price back above $220, a recovery to the 20-day EMA ($236) is possible. A break above this level will suggest that the breakdown below $220 may have been a bear trap. That could keep the pair stuck inside the $265 to $220 range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) tumbled below the breakout level of $0.56 on Aug. 17, indicating continued selling pressure from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/2ce4760b-e7b5-4506-a1e3-3f331f5deea2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The fall in the XRP/USDT pair completed a 100% retracement of the entire rally that happened on July 13. However, a minor positive is that the bulls purchased the dip near the strong support zone of $0.45 to $0.41.\par \par \uc2 The recovery is likely to hit a roadblock at $0.56 and again at the 20-day EMA ($0.61). If the price turns down from this overhead zone, it will signal that bears are selling on rallies. That may put the $0.41 support at risk of breaking down.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dropped below the descending channel pattern on Aug. 17, indicating that the selling has accelerated.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/eb9ba43d-1d50-4763-b2b3-4c404f8ed2f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully protected the crucial support at $0.24 indicating strong buying at lower levels. Buyers will try to push the price back into the channel. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair will attempt to rally to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 The rise may not be easy because the bulls are likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA ($0.28). If the price turns down from this level, the pair may again retest the strong support at $0.24. A break below this level will signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke below the moving averages on Aug. 16 and the horizontal support at $22.30 on Aug. 17. This suggests that the price may oscillate inside the large range between $27.12 and $14 for some time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/f746c55d-baf9-41d8-a097-c6726251d5cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to start a recovery, which is likely to face resistance at the moving averages. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA ($23.53), the possibility of a fall to $18 and eventually to $14 increases.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers drive the price above the moving averages, it will suggest that the break below $22.30 may have been a bear trap. That could propel the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair toward the $26 to $27.12 overhead zone.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the support line of the ascending channel pattern on Aug. 15. That may have hit stops on the long positions and attracted selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/fe9a32e5-8fba-4bb3-935a-629e651e1ce3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair closed below the breakout level of $0.07 on Aug. 16, signaling that the bears are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The selling continued on Aug. 17 and the bears yanked the price below the essential support at $0.06. A minor saving grace for the bulls was the strong buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The price rose back above $0.06 and the bulls will attempt to push the price toward the overhead resistance of $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Sellers are likely to have other plans. They will try to sink and sustain the price below $0.06. If they do that, the pair may plummet toward $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-spacex-bitcoin-write-down-bitcoiners-elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SpaceX Bitcoin write-down sparks confusion, Bitcoiners quiz Elon Musk}}}\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The tight range trading in Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) expanded to the downside on Aug. 15. That started a decline, which reached near the critical support at $4.22 on Aug. 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/8fe3a41d-a80d-451a-b261-6b6ac3f3444d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOTUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to fiercely defend the $4.22 support but the recovery is likely to face strong selling at the 20-day EMA ($4.91). If the price turns down from this level, the bears are expected to attack the $4.22 support once again. If this level cracks, the DOT/USDT pair may start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA but rebounds off $4.22, it will suggest that the pair may consolidate for a few days. The bulls will gain momentum after the price rises above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) break below the $0.65 support attracted aggressive selling, which tugged the price below the next strong support at $0.60 on Aug. 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/6d030125-5b66-4bf3-a742-b19407e9c186.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls bought the dip near $0.50, indicating strong demand at lower levels. However, buyers may face selling at $0.60 and again at the 20-day EMA ($0.66). If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the MATIC/USDT pair may retest the vital support at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 If this support gives way, the pair could slip to $0.45 and then to $0.42. On the upside, the bulls will have to kick the price above the moving averages, to indicate that the downtrend could be ending.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) went into a tailspin after breaking below the support at $81 on Aug. 15. The price crumbled to $56 on Aug. 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/ed310f01-916b-4ca3-beaa-c91f5d049a29.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sharp descent of the past few days has sent the RSI into oversold territory. This suggests that a minor recovery or consolidation is likely in the near term. The relief rally could face selling in the zone between the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $70 and the 61.8% retracement level of $74.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the LTC/USDT pair could form a range for a few days. A break and close below the pivotal level of $56 could extend the decline to $50.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/f08f6c30-42d5-4068-90aa-c67992844fcc.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230818ej8i000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 BitExchange enables XRP options trading, no need for ownership\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Amaka Nwaokocha \par \uc2 383 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BitExchange adds XRP options to its platform, offering trading without owning the cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 BitExchange has introduced XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  )-linked options on its cryptocurrency derivatives platform. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blog.bit.com/bit-unveils-xrp-options-trading-in-response-to-soaring-interest-in-the-xrp-market/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 According}}}\uc2  to an Aug. 17 statement from the exchange, the initiative will allow users to engage in XRP options trading without the need for cryptocurrency ownership.\par \par \uc2 Profit and loss settlement will occur in United States dollars, with OrBit Markets responsible for order book liquidity, the exchange said, adding that the latest addition adds to its offerings, including Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Toncoin (TON) and Milady (LADYS).\par \par \uc2 Options represent derivative agreements that bestow the buyer with the privilege to purchase or vend the underlying asset at a predetermined price on or before a specified date. Call options grant the buying right, while put options offer the selling right.\par \par \uc2 Typically, traders utilize options for hedging purposes, lessening \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  or \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  risks, or generating supplementary earnings by \u8220\'20\'1Cwriting\u8221\'20\'1D options alongside their spot market holdings.\par \par \uc2 Justin Buitendam, BitExchange\u8217\'20\'19s global head of institutional sales, said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re excited to be among the early platforms offering XRP options trading to institutional and retail traders, providing both long and short options trading opportunities.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 With a current market capitalization of $30.88 billion, XRP ranks as the fifth-largest cryptocurrency globally. Like other {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/learn/what-is-an-altcoin-a-beginners-guide-to-cryptocurrencies-beyond-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 alternative cryptocurrencies}}}\uc2 , XRP exhibits higher \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  than Bitcoin and Ether.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-labs-oppose-sec-request-file-appeal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple Labs bites back against SEC's request to file appeal}}}\par \par \uc2 BitExchange\u8217\'20\'19s choice to introduce XRP options follows a recent ruling partially in favor of \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 which issues the XRP token \u8212\'20\'14 in its ongoing battle against the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC). The judge {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-wins-case-against-sec-as-judge-rules-xrp-is-not-a-security#:~:text=According%20to%20documents%20filed%20on,sales%20on%20digital%20asset%20exchanges."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ruled that XRP is not considered a security}}}\uc2  when traded on centralized exchanges but could be classified as one when directly sold to institutions.\par \par \uc2 After the ruling, numerous {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-crypto-exchanges-second-chance-xrp-listings-after-court-ruling#:~:text=Jul%2013%2C%202023-,US%20crypto%20exchanges%20give%20XRP%20listings%20a%202nd%20chance%20after,including%20Gemini%20may%20follow%20suit."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 exchanges relisted XRP}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-crypto-exchanges-second-chance-xrp-listings-after-court-ruling#:~:text=Jul%2013%2C%202023-,US%20crypto%20exchanges%20give%20XRP%20listings%20a%202nd%20chance%20after,including%20Gemini%20may%20follow%20suit."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-crypto-exchanges-second-chance-xrp-listings-after-court-ruling#:~:text=Jul%2013%2C%202023-,US%20crypto%20exchanges%20give%20XRP%20listings%20a%202nd%20chance%20after,including%20Gemini%20may%20follow%20suit.}}}\uc2 . In a more recent development, the SEC has sought {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-seek-interlocutory-appeal-ripple-case"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 permission to challenge the court\u8217\'20\'19s decision}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/deposit-risk-crypto-exchanges-money/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Deposit risk: What do crypto exchanges really do with your money?}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/608b9a98-f0d1-42c4-9d5f-2952052498e3.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230817ej8h0008l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , MATIC, LTC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,707 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bears stepped in to apply more pressure on the crypto market, as most altcoins and Bitcoin registered a loss for the day.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin continues to trade inside a narrow range with no clear signs of a breakout from it. Trading platform QCP Capital said in its latest market update that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) may remain quiet for a few more weeks before {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-34k-reach-bitcoin-support-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 making its move in September}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Delphi Digital co-founder Kevin Kelly believes that the cryptocurrency markets are in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/delphi-digital-cofounder-signals-new-crypto-bull-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 early stages of a new bull cycle}}}\uc2 . Based on a study of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s four-year cycle patterns, Kelly expects Bitcoin to hit a new all-time high by the fourth quarter of 2024 and a new cycle peak by Q4 2025.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/07b4be5e-91af-4a7b-942b-3015156ab6ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Similarly, Bitcoin investor and author Jesse Myers also maintains a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view for the long term, but he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-prediction-100k-2024-bitcoin-halving"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 does not expect Bitcoin to reach $100,000}}}\uc2  before the next halving. Myers believes that the market will take 12-18 months after the halving to price in the effects.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and the major altcoins remain range-bound in the near term, or is a breakout on the horizon? What are the important levels to watch out for? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rose above the 20-day exponential moving average EMA of $29,383 on Aug. 14, but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/c1428eff-dcd7-4dd3-a53a-4f7a1ea32944.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair remains below the 20-day EMA, and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative territory. This suggests a minor advantage to the bears. The pair could slide to the important support at $28,585.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level with strength and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the pair may continue to oscillate between $28,585 and $30,350 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 The bears will come out on top if they sink and sustain the price below $28,585. That could start a decline toward $26,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure to propel Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($1,847) in the past few days may have attracted selling. That has pulled the price to the critical short-term support at $1,816.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/5e9a051b-c68a-4b24-8fdf-bd51865e0e17.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down gradually, and the RSI is in negative territory. This suggests that bears have the upper hand. If the price skids and sustains below $1,816, the selling could intensify further and the ETH/USDT pair may drop to $1,700.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bulls. If they want to salvage the situation, they will have to quickly drive the price above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $1,875. If they do that, the pair may start its journey toward $1,930 and then $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down and plunged below the support line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on Aug. 15. This shows that the uncertainty between the bulls and the bears resolved to the downside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/b037c4ae-0adb-4763-bb8e-e7263ec13acc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the triangle, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the vital support at $220. This level is likely to attract aggressive buying by the bulls. If the price rebounds off this level and rises above the moving averages, it will indicate that the pair may continue to swing between $265 and $220 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price continues lower and breaks below the $220 support, it will indicate the resumption of the downtrend. The pair may then slump to the pattern target of $196.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the 50-day SMA ($0.62) on Aug. 15, signaling that the bears remain in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/a6ce3f1d-8cd9-454e-9f7b-1d7d5b7abddf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair could descend to the breakout level of $0.56. This remains the key level for the bulls to defend because if this support gives way, the selling could pick up and the pair may dive to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rebounds off $0.56, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support. Buyers will have to overcome the barrier at the moving averages to start a stronger recovery to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears yanked Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the support line of the ascending channel pattern on Aug. 15, which tilted the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/368532ed-23df-4d49-8a31-fbcf5a2fe642.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to guard the breakout level of $0.07. If the price rebounds off this level, the DOGE/USDT pair may climb to the 20-day EMA ($0.07) and later to the downtrend line. If the price turns down from this resistance, it will increase the likelihood of a drop below $0.07. If that happens, the pair could nosedive to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent a collapse, they will have to quickly push the price back above the downtrend line. If they succeed, the pair may rally to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) continues to fall inside a descending channel pattern. This shows that the bears remain firmly in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/50c152cb-5239-4ec0-8f52-c564544ea534.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair has reached the support line of the channel. If this support gives way, the pair could tumble to $0.26 and subsequently to $0.24. The bulls are expected to guard this level with all their might because if this support crumbles, the pair could resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the channel. That may open the doors for a relief rally to $0.34.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down and slipped below the 20-day EMA ($23.99) on Aug. 15. The bears are trying to build upon this by sustaining the price below the 50-day SMA ($23.20).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/1b0cb4e8-7556-472a-b874-a845f133d9d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could skid to the vital support at $22.30. If the price bounces off this level, the pair may face strong selling at the moving averages. If the price turns down from the moving averages, it will enhance the prospects of a fall below $22.30. The pair may then tumble to $18.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the $26 to $22.30 range remains intact. The pair could then gradually climb to the overhead resistance at $26. A break and close above this level will suggest that the bulls are on a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-litecoin-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Litecoin\u8217\'20\'19s price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 The repeated failure of the bulls to propel Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.68) may have intensified selling. That pulled the price below the support near $0.65 on Aug 15. The next support to look for on the downside is $0.60.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/ef599221-d89f-4e75-a5e9-8e19256ed4e1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI is nearing the oversold levels, indicating that the selling may have been overdone in the near term. Buyers will try to start a rebound that could reach $0.65 and then the 50-day SMA ($0.70).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will signal that bears have the upper hand. That could increase the likelihood of a drop below $0.60. The pair may then nosedive toward $0.50.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls want to make a comeback, they will have to kick and sustain the price above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) tumbled and closed below the strong support at $81.36 on Aug. 15, indicating that the bears are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/11d89132-a90f-4b95-bcfd-75040b91f2da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI is in the oversold territory, indicating that a consolidation or a bounce may be around the corner. The bulls may try to defend the uptrend line. If the price snaps back from this level, it could face selling at $81.36 and then again at the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If the LTC/USDT pair turns down from the overhead obstacle, it will indicate that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. That will increase the possibility of a drop to $70.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the downtrend line. That could clear the path for a possible rally to the 50-day SMA ($91.70).\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to achieve a strong bounce off the $5 support in Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) may have attracted selling by the bears. That tugged the price below the support on Aug. 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/dc61365b-0a5e-440d-ba12-9b0a7ef18438.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip below the next support at $4.74, but they are struggling to sustain the recovery. This suggests that the bears continue to sell on every minor relief rally. If the price continues lower and dips below $4.60, it will suggest that the DOT/USDT pair is in a firm bear grip. That could result in a decline to $4.22.\par \par \uc2 Buyers are likely to fiercely defend the zone between $4.22 and $4.37. On the upside, the bulls will have to thrust the price above the 50-day SMA ($5.16) to signal a comeback. The pair could then surge to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/5ede84aa-36d1-4a90-b00c-59e0fc65b194.JPG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230816ej8g000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/14: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,738 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index and Bitcoin are trying to start a recovery, indicating that lower levels continue to attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been stuck inside a tight range in August. Glassnode lead on-chain analyst Checkmate highlighted that the spread between the upper and lower Bollinger Bands for Bitcoin has shrunk to 2.9%, its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-breakout-august-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 third-tightest ever}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Typically, periods of low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  are followed by a range expansion. The longer the time spent inside a range, the stronger the eventual breakout from it. The only problem is that it is difficult to time the breakout with certainty. Therefore, traders should be watchful. Otherwise, they may miss out on the opportunity to ride the next trending move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/ff1f2cd0-3929-4e7b-9805-241f677106bf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 One reason that risk assets may be weighed down is the strength of the U.S. Dollar Index (DXY), which has risen for four consecutive weeks.\par \par \uc2 In contrast, United States equities markets entered a corrective phase in the past few days. The S&P 500 Index (SPX) and the Nasdaq Composite have both {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/08/13/stock-market-today-live-updates.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pulled back}}}\uc2  for the past two weeks, indicating profit-booking by short-term traders.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support and resistance levels to watch for in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index dipped below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of 4,497 on Aug. 3, and since then, the bears thwarted several attempts by the bulls to push the price back above this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/c26bcca4-abba-491c-945b-ac0b54adaeab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price bounced off the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of 4,443 on Aug. 14, indicating that the bulls are guarding this level with all their might. Buyers will try to keep up the momentum and shove the price back above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the index could start its journey to 4,607 and subsequently to 4,650.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to seize control, they will have to protect the 20-day EMA and tug the price below the 50-day SMA. That could start a deeper correction to 4,300 and later to 4,200.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index held support at the 20-day EMA ($102) on Aug. 4 and again on Aug. 10, indicating a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/d0f39951-73df-4f6d-92cf-941d3ce7db49.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The index has reached the downtrend line, which is likely to act as a formidable resistance. If the price turns down from the downtrend line but rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the trend remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . That will enhance the prospects of a rally above the downtrend line. The index could then soar toward the overhead resistance at 106.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price tumbles below the 20-day EMA. There is minor support at 101.74, but if this level gives way, the index could drop to 100.82.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin slipped below the 20-day EMA ($29,458) on Aug. 13, but the bears could not build upon this advantage and sink the price to the critical support at $28,585. This suggests a lack of aggressive selling at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/ad1cbbd2-21e7-4028-9d4b-f7c88accdd7b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint indicate a balance between buyers and sellers. This suggests that the BTC/USDT pair could continue to consolidate inside the range between $28,585 and $30,350 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to begin after the price escapes this range. If the price turns down and plunges below the $28,585 support, it could start a descent to $26,000. Conversely, a rally above $30,350 could enhance the prospects of a rally to the overhead resistance zone between $31,500 and $32,400.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been clinging to the 20-day EMA ($1,853) for the past few days, indicating that the bulls have maintained their buying pressure but the bears have held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/58ea722e-5e2e-4442-84bd-4aa2949eac0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating that the selling pressure could be reducing. If bulls thrust the price above the moving averages, the ETH/USDT pair may rally to $1,930 and then to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to maintain their control, they will have to defend the moving averages. If the price turns down from the 50-day SMA ($1,877), the pair could skid to the strong support at $1,816. This is an important level for the bulls to watch out for because a break below it may sink the pair to $1,700.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the moving averages for the past three days, but the bears have not been able to sink the price to the support line of the symmetrical triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/cc2c09bf-9fe0-4280-8221-c711e9e1851d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price does not break above or below the triangle within the next few days, then it will invalidate the pattern. The flattish moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint signal that the dull price action may continue for some more time.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the triangle will be the first sign that the uncertainty has resolved in favor of the bulls. The BNB/USDT pair could then rally to the overhead resistance at $265.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break and close below the triangle could sink the pair to the crucial support at $220.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been swinging between the moving averages for the past few days, indicating buying near the 50-day SMA ($0.62) and selling at the 20-day EMA ($0.65).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/ee01d27f-1026-48e6-bb42-dce1bd9dadb6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although buyers have held the 50-day SMA, the downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have the edge. A shallow bounce off the current level will increase the prospects of a drop below the 50-day SMA. If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair may slump to $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price climbs above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate solid buying at lower levels. The pair may then move up to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been correcting inside a descending channel pattern for the past few days. This suggests a lack of aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/fb12c20e-5505-485d-be44-1c0f4aed819a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the resistance line of the channel. That could open the doors for a possible rally to $0.34. If this level is scaled, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may retest the July 14 intraday high at $0.38.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to sell the rallies to the resistance line of the channel. If the price turns down from this level, it will signal that the pair may continue to descend inside the channel. The important support to watch on the downside is $0.26.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-new-volatility-btc-price-4-day-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin teases new \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  as BTC price taps 4-day high near $29.6K}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery was rejected at the downtrend line on Aug. 13, indicating that the bears are fiercely defending this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/77b2d07a-95e0-451f-9e7e-0917bbab3962.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the support line of the ascending channel, which is an important level to keep an eye on. If the price plummets below the support line, the DOGE/USDT pair could tumble to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the downtrend line, it will signal that the bulls remain buyers at lower levels. The pair could first rise to $0.08 and later to the resistance line of the channel at $0.09.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is trading inside the range between $22.30 on the downside and $26 on the upside. A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that the price is trading above the 20-day EMA ($24.09).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/19793b2d-e539-4df3-9ca3-38e4297885f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the current bounce sustains, the bulls will try to drive the SOL/USDT pair above the overhead resistance at $26. If they succeed, the pair could pick up momentum and climb to $29.12 and later to $32.13.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from $26, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the range for a few more days. The bears will have to yank the price below $22.30 to come out on top.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are finding it difficult to push Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.69), but a positive sign is that they have not ceded ground to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/deb08bca-a251-4e2b-ad6c-2f863c924ac3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are flattening out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This balance could tilt in favor of the bulls if they propel the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.70). The MATIC/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA, it will signal that bears are active at higher levels. That may keep the pair stuck inside a range for a few days. The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the support near $0.65 to gain the upper hand. The pair could then slide to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/67441e2a-1098-44f7-9c0f-7f8d48ff956c.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230814ej8e000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/11: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , MATIC, LTC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,655 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most altcoins are waiting for a major price catalyst, and charts suggest the market will be sideways for a bit longer.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin continues to frustrate investors with its tight-range consolidation, giving no clue about the possible direction of a breakout. Typically, the longer the range, the stronger the eventual breakout from it. Therefore, traders should be on their toes to latch on to the breakout when it happens.\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they are holding on to a large part of the gains seen in 2023. That indicates a lack of urgency among the bulls to book profits, as they anticipate the uptrend to resume.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/2862e5c6-de6e-4f49-a115-16efed7c2718.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  senior exchange-traded fund (ETF) analyst \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2  highlighted that 15 of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-spot-push-us-trading-volumes-crypto-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 best-performing equity ETFs}}}\uc2  in 2023 have been crypto-related, with exposure to crypto and blockchain.\par \par \uc2 Do Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and the select altcoins show any signs of a potential breakout from their respective ranges? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Bitcoin above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $29,960 on Aug. 8 and 9 but could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that the bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/cde645b8-67e8-40d9-8a7c-474da7a8f542.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The range in the BTC/USDT pair has shrunk further, with the price swinging between $28,585 and $30,350. Both moving averages have flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the midpoint, suggesting that the consolidation may continue for some more time.\par \par \uc2 When the price is stuck in a range, it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout. However, traders should be ready for the start of a trending move soon.\par \par \uc2 If the price plunges below $28,585, the pair may descend to $26,000 and then to $24,800. Conversely, a break and close above $30,350 could propel the pair to $32,400. This is likely to be the final hurdle before the pair reaches $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 50-day SMA ($1,879) and the horizontal support at $1,816 for the past few days. This suggests uncertainty between the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/3d7d3b38-5678-4fdb-80b6-29ab8cc3ad26.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) at $1,855 and the RSI just below the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. The sellers will have to tug the price below $1,816 to gain control. That could start a sell-off, which may pull the ETH/USDT pair to $1,700 and then to the vital support at $1,626.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up and breaks above the 50-day SMA, it could open the gates for a rally to the psychological resistance at $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The failure to push BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the resistance line of the triangle may have attracted selling. That has pulled the price below the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/d9a7df05-c4b1-4c25-8e07-f3f7a4ccd76c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair could drop to the support line of the triangle. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a slide below it may start the next leg of the downward move to $220. The bulls are likely to buy the dip at this level.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support line, the pair may spend some more time inside the triangle. Buyers will have to shove the price above the resistance line to clear the path for a potential rally to $265.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.65) on Aug. 9, indicating that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/06e45031-e1f5-43d8-9b53-321ae876d371.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is the 50-day SMA ($0.61). If this level cracks, the selling could intensify and the XRP/USDT pair could plummet to the breakout level of $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price bounces off the 50-day SMA. If that happens, the pair may spend some more time oscillating between the moving averages. A break and close above $0.67 will be the first sign of strength. That could open the doors for a possible rally to $0.73.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the ascending channel pattern, but the bulls are finding it difficult to overcome the barrier at the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/87fec9d9-18ce-4111-9ad4-468bf18bb185.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price dips below the 20-day EMA ($0.07), the support line of the channel will come under threat. The repeated retest of a support level within a short interval tends to weaken it. If the bears yank the price below the channel, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the breakout level of $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns up from the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the likelihood of a rally above the downtrend line increases. That could start an up move to $0.08 and then to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) recovery attempt hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($0.30), which suggests that the bears have not yet given up and are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/fd966116-28ec-4e09-8417-c803b76315bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the buyers kick the price above the downtrend line, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $0.32 and then to $0.34.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below $0.28, it will suggest that bears have the upper hand. The pair could then slump to $0.26 and eventually to the vital support at $0.24. The bulls are expected to guard this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the 20-day EMA ($23.87) for the past three days, indicating that the price is stuck between $26 and $22.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/a62765f5-acd7-4380-a2c8-5e3601cfea91.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The important level to watch on the upside is $26. If the price turns down from this resistance, it will indicate that the range-bound action remains intact. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may pick up if buyers clear the overhead hurdle at $26. If they do that, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could first rise to $29 and thereafter retest the local high at $32.13 made on July 14.\par \par \uc2 The level to be wary of on the downside is $22.30. If this support cracks, it will suggest that the bulls may be rushing to the exit. That may start a fall to $18.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-trader-btc-price-zone-bulls-hold-29-k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin trader reveals \u8216\'20\'18important\u8217\'20\'19 BTC price zone as bulls hold $29.3K}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to thrust Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($0.70) in the past two days, but a positive sign is that they have not given up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/2905d618-8678-4c83-b47c-665ca3a14dd6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the short-term bulls are holding on to their positions as they anticipate the relief rally to continue. If the 50-day SMA is surmounted, the MATIC/USDT pair could start a rally to $0.80 and then to $0.90.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply from the current level, the pair may retest the strong support at $0.64. If this level gives way, the pair may start a decline to the next support at $0.60.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) is struggling to start a bounce off the strong support at $81.36, suggesting a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/b09fa6f8-e359-4475-84d2-06c42abe88c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($86.90) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears are in command. If the LTC/USDT pair skids and sustains below $81.36, it will signal the resumption of the downtrend. The next support on the downside is $76 and then $72.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, the first important resistance to watch on the upside is the 20-day EMA. If buyers propel the price above $87.37, it will suggest the start of a stronger recovery to $96.46. This level may again attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the $5 level for the past few days. Attempts by the bulls to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($5.08) on Aug. 9 were met with stiff opposition from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/3c3ba730-19d0-4020-9be0-e2e777929dc3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping down gradually and the RSI has been in the negative territory, indicating that the bears have a slight edge. If the price slips and closes below $4.83, the DOT/USDT pair could start its downward journey toward $4.60.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the moving averages, it will signal a comeback by the bulls. The pair could then move up to $5.33 and eventually to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/3b5eb6e6-8e8a-4a55-9014-03586687f16a.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230811ej8b000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
