\par\par \b \uc2 Ethereum and Cardano TVL Explodes per Reports, Can Pomerdoge Catch Up?\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 562 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 August 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 TVL or the total value of digital assets locked in a decentralized finance (DeFi) platform is often used as a metric to judge the growth of a network. A recent report shows that Ethereum (ETH) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) TVL have seen an upsurge. A new project, Pomerdoge (POMD), has shown potential, but can it keep up in the highly competitive cryptocurrency world?\par \par \uc2 Click Here To Find Out More About The Pomerdoge (POMD) Presale\par \par \uc2 Ethereum and Cardano TVL Explodes\par \par \uc2 The TVL metric is often used to judge the growth of a DeFi network. Recent reports from Messari have shown that the TVL of Ethereum (ETH) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has been on the rise despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crypto market.\par \par \uc2 According to Messari, the TVL of Cardano has increased by 198.6% year-to-date (YTD). Cardano now has more than $175 million locked in its DeFi ecosystem. The increase in TVL has helped Cardano move from the 34th position to the 21st in overall TVL across all blockchains.\par \par \uc2 Messari links the growth of Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s DeFi ecosystem to the launch of stablecoins, improved programming languages, and new wallets. On the other hand, Ethereum still dominates the DeFispace as the leading network. At the time of this writing, Ethereum has more than $23.5 billion in TVL.\par \par \uc2 The explosive growth of Cardano and Ethereum is considered impressive due to the recent \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  in crypto prices. With the prices of Ethereum and Cardano forecasted to recover by the end of 2023, the TVL locked in their respective chains could increase further.\par \par \uc2 Can Pomerdoge (POMD) Catch Up in the DeFi Space?\par \par \uc2 In the already competitive DeFi space, a new project, Pomerdoge (POMD), is launching to public acclaim from market experts. There are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  predictions for Pomerdoge because it is creating a unique niche for itself. Pomerdoge would be the first project to combine the fanfare of crypto meme coins with the fast-growing play-to-earn sector.\par \par \uc2 Pomerdoge is building an enthralling game where players can earn rewards and alsocommunicate via a social infrastructure. With unique, eccentric avatars called Pomerdoge, players will enter competitions in the eye-catching world of Pomerdoges. In-game products and NFTs can be sold for real money in the Pomerplace, the ecosystem's marketplace.\par \par \uc2 The platform is growing at an impressive rate as players have great opportunities to earn. Players can enter weekly contests and giveaways for a chance to win up to $100,000 in weekly giveaways. Experts have predicted that Pomerdoge will compete with the biggest names in DeFias it perfectly fuses entertainment and financial opportunity.\par \par \uc2 As a result, many analysts have predicted that Pomerdoge will become one of the P2E games and stage one of the largest rallies before the end of the year. Early forecasts estimate a 4,000% price gain for the Pomerdoge utility coin by December. Investors have a wonderful opportunity to join the Pomerdoge ecosystem before its massive rally, which is now trading at $0.007.\par \par \uc2 Find out more about the Pomerdoge (POMD) Presale Today:\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pomerdoge.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://pomerdoge.com/}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram Community: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/pomerdoge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/pomerdoge}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020230811ej8b000jj\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , MATIC, LTC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,672 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins rallied to overhead resistance levels, leading traders to inquire whether the current period of record-low \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is coming to an end.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rebound off $28,701 on Aug. 7 shows that lower levels continue to attract buyers. The recovery has kept the price stuck inside the range as traders await the start of a new trending move. A recent report by ARK Invest says that \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  dropped to a 6-year low during July.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Traders who expected a strong move in either direction have been disappointed by the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-bitcoin-price-trade-wait-october"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ongoing range-bound action in August}}}\uc2 . If history repeats itself, then August and September may turn out to be washout months, as their average moves have been 0.73% and -5.01%, respectively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/d5aef8bd-f32a-4cba-9682-e7406f6e05bf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Although the short-term is uncertain, the long-term continues to look attractive. \uc2 Galaxy Digital\uc2  CEO \uc2 Mike Novogratz\uc2 , citing sources at \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  and Invesco, said that the first spot Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded fund in the United States may be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-insiders-bitcoin-etf-within-six-months-galaxy-novogratz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approved by the Securities and Exchange Commission}}}\uc2  in four to six months.\par \par \uc2 Such a move is expected to be hugely positive for the crypto space. In the meantime, important resistance levels continue to impact Bitcoin and altcoins. Could bulls overcome the roadblock? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s strong relief rally from the $28,861 support shows that the bulls have not yet given up and they continue to view the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/7c2218f5-6da5-4e59-bcf8-8d4acea5cd05.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair rose above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $29,455 on Aug. 8, and the bulls are trying to build upon the momentum by pushing the price above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $29,981. If they manage to do that, the pair could pick up momentum and soar toward the overhead resistance zone between $31,804 and $32,400.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and skids below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears continue to sell on rallies. That could keep the pair stuck inside a tight range between $28,500 and $30,500 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers purchased the dip below the $1,816 support in Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) on Aug. 7 and followed that up with another strong move on Aug. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/b0eebbd0-b3d3-46aa-a3e9-349270c1154e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are facing resistance at the 50-day SMA ($1,881), but a minor positive is that they are trying to hold the 20-day EMA. The flattening 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint suggest that the bears are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive the price above the 50-day SMA, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to $1,930 and eventually to the psychologically important level of $2,000. The bulls will have to surmount this level to start the next leg of the up move.\par \par \uc2 The advantage could tilt in favor of the bears if they yank the price below the crucial short-term support at $1,800.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the moving averages and reached the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on Aug. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/67b672ad-0aad-44f0-88a2-a6d2c4eab64a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to defend the resistance line, but if bulls do not allow the price to slide back below the moving averages, it will increase the possibility of an upside breakout. The BNB/USDT pair could first climb to $265 and then make a dash to the pattern target of $288.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and skids below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the triangle for some more time. A break below the triangle could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears. The pair could then decline to $220\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) reversed direction from the 50-day SMA ($0.60) on Aug. 7 and reached the 20-day EMA ($0.66) on Aug. 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/7db49840-8a1c-4ddd-b64d-997b60455092.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. That will enhance the prospects of a fall to the breakout level of $0.56.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls are attempting a comeback. The XRP/USDT pair could then rise to $0.73, which may prove to be a tough hurdle to cross.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) snapped back from the support line of the ascending channel on Aug. 7, indicating that bulls continue to buy on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/b4c60535-611a-454c-984e-01eb92723442.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers propelled the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.07), clearing the path for a possible rally to $0.08. This level may prove to be a difficult obstacle, but if the bulls surpass it, the DOGE/USDT pair could reach the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and plunges below the channel. That could sink the pair to $0.07. This is an important level to keep an eye on because if it cracks, the pair may slump to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned up from $0.28 on Aug. 7, indicating buying at lower levels. The price has reached the moving averages, which are just below the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/8ff6ed91-6505-468b-9e07-13a24302ad51.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to guard the downtrend line with vigor. If the price turns down from this level, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could retest the support at $0.28. A break and close below this level could pull the pair to $0.26 and then to $0.24.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls clear the overhead hurdle, the pair could rally to $0.34. This level may again prove to be a barrier, but if bulls overcome it, the pair could reach the overhead resistance at $0.38.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully held the support at $22.30, indicating demand at lower levels. Buyers shoved Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($23.71) on Aug. 8, signaling a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/9abe52ca-90a7-4c47-81a0-a1ef0d4b23f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate a minor advantage to the bulls. The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $25.68 and then to the stiff overhead resistance of $27.12. Sellers may pose a strong challenge at this level.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest that the pair may consolidate between $27.12 and $22.30 for some time. The bears will gain the upper hand if they tug the price below $22.30.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-shiba-inu-price-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Shiba Inu price up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the strong support at $0.64 and reached the moving averages, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/c57034a2-dabc-4287-a79c-3cf1d0583638.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the moving averages, the MATIC/USDT pair could once again drop to $0.64. A bounce off this level could keep the pair range-bound between $0.64 and the moving averages for some time. The flattish moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint also suggest range-bound action.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls drive the price above the moving averages, it will suggest the start of a stronger recovery to $0.74 and then to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sink \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) below the support at $81.36 on Aug. 7, but the long tail on the candlestick shows strong demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/c8d7baf1-41bb-464f-bda5-a66b2abd010d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to start a recovery, which is likely to face strong selling near the 20-day EMA ($87). If the price turns down from this level, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then make one more attempt to sink the LTC/USDT pair below $81.36.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to make a comeback, they will have to kick the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it could open the doors for a possible rise to the 50-day SMA ($92) and later to $96.46.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $5 and $5.65 for many days. Efforts to push the price above and below the range have been unsuccessful, indicating that bulls are buying the dips and bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/f6505963-53a4-4e42-98b1-76d87c4f98a1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push the price above the moving averages but are facing stiff resistance from the bears. If the price turns down from the moving averages, it will increase the likelihood of a break below $4.83. If that happens, the DOT/USDT pair could descend to $4.60.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls propel the price above the moving averages, it will suggest that the range remains intact. The pair could rise to $5.33 and subsequently to the overhead resistance at $5.64.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/9f5acce2-fa44-40af-9d5f-e1e5b655f71a.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230809ej89000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/7: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,624 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is threatening to start a new down move in the near term, and if that happens, several altcoins may follow suit.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading near the $29,000 level for the past few days. This suggests a lack of strong demand at higher levels, but the only solace for the bulls is that they have managed to sustain the price above the immediate support.\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty about the next directional move may have tempted short-term traders to book profits. \uc2 CoinShares{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blog.coinshares.com/volume-143-digital-asset-fund-flows-weekly-report-6d46f78754c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  in its latest weekly report that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) investment products witnessed $111 million in outflows, the largest weekly outflows since March.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/5606ae36-52a5-4dcc-912e-6ad505aac783.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 While the short-term price action remains uninspiring, crypto bulls remain confident that Bitcoin will rally before its next halving in 2024. \uc2 Blockstream\uc2  CEO \uc2 Adam Back\uc2  said in a conversation on X (previously known as \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/adam-back-bitcoin-price-bet-all-time-high-halving"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin will hit $100,000}}}\uc2  by the end of March.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin extend its decline in the near term, or will it turn up? Will the altcoins outperform Bitcoin over the next few days? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of 4,511. Sellers pulled the price below the 20-day EMA on Aug. 2, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/f8bfe36f-ee0f-4e00-9bce-56cec50c585c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA on Aug. 4, but the bears aggressively sold the rally. This suggests that the bears are pouncing on relief rallies. The index could decline to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of 4,414, which could act as strong support.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that lower levels continue to attract buyers. The index may then swing between the 50-day SMA and 4,650 for some time.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed the U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) above the 50-day SMA (102) on Aug. 2, but they could not build upon this strength.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/bf08ccfc-a83f-492b-84ed-fab40d3c9485.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price back below the 50-day SMA on Aug. 4. A minor positive is that the bulls have kept the price above the 20-day EMA (101). If buyers drive the price above the 50-day SMA, the index could retest the downtrend line. This remains the key level to watch on the upside because a break above it could open the doors for a rally to 106.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to gain the upper hand, they will have to sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA. The index could then slide to the strong support at 100.82.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price is getting squeezed between the 20-day EMA ($29,387) and the horizontal support at $28,861. This low-\b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  period is likely to be followed by an expansion in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/033973e2-8b2d-4320-923b-470c2e0c1355.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price plunges and sustains below $28,861, it will suggest that the uncertainty has resolved in favor of the bears. The BTC/USDT pair could then start a decline to $26,000 and eventually to $24,800.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up and breaks above the 50-day SMA ($29,893), it will suggest that the bulls have overpowered the bears. That could start a rally to the overhead resistance zone between $31,500 and $32,400.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls managed to keep Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the immediate support at $1,816 for the past few days, but they are struggling to start a strong recovery. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/9cf8de60-639c-4228-af3b-fcce7fa733a1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($1,856) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have the upper hand. If the price slips and sustains below $1,816, the ETH/USDT pair could slump $1,700 and then to the crucial support at $1,626.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly kick the price above the 50-day SMA ($1,877). If they do that, the pair could start its northward march toward the overhead resistance at $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The price action inside a symmetrical triangle pattern is usually random and volatile. BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating inside the triangle with no clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/76be53f1-6d9a-4d4a-aa5a-d4d6e35ecac9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Typically, the symmetrical triangle behaves as a continuation pattern, but in some cases, it can also start a reversal.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises above the triangle, it will suggest that the bulls have the upper hand. The BNB/USDT pair could then rise to the overhead resistance at $265. If this level is cleared, the pair may surge to $288.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price tumbles below the triangle. The pair may then descend to $220. If this support cracks, the pair may fall to the pattern target of $194.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) continued its correction and dipped below the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.64 on Aug. 4. This indicates that the bulls are losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/d52efaac-99d0-4bc3-b10b-5d603edd33b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the 50-day SMA ($0.60), which is an important level to watch out for. If the price bounces off the current level, the XRP/USDT pair may reach the 20-day EMA ($0.67), which could again act as a major obstacle.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will indicate that bears are in command. The pair could then slide to the breakout level of $0.56 and even risk a fall to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers failed to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) back above the uptrend line in the past few days, indicating that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/96d04991-feb9-4d37-a1f8-db28415e8f2b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears yanked the price below the support near $0.29, signaling the resumption of the pullback. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could plummet to the next support at $0.26 and eventually to the crucial level at $0.24.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns up and rises above the 20-day EMA ($0.30). That could indicate solid buying at lower levels. The pair may then attempt a rally to $0.32 and later to $0.34.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-spot-selling-btc-price-dips-below-28-7k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin faces 'endless spot selling' as BTC price dips below $28.7K}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been correcting inside an ascending channel pattern for the past few days. Generally, in an ascending channel, traders buy near the support of the channel and sell near the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/d7aa2ab8-f7f2-48f6-9cf0-ea0db2074717.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the support line, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then attempt to push the price to $0.08 and thereafter to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price dives below the channel, it will suggest that the bears are back in the game. There is strong support at the breakout level of $0.07, but if this level gives way, the pair may drop to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to drive Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($23.58), while the bears are attempting to sink the price below the $22.30 support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/dffc1ece-dffe-4235-a44b-7578446dc57d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price climbs and sustains above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the SOL/USDT pair may remain range-bound between $22.30 and $27.12 for a while longer. Buyers will have to overcome the barrier at $27.12 to seize control.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and breaks below the 50-day SMA ($21.81), it will signal that bears are trying to flip the 20-day EMA into resistance. That could start a deeper correction to $18.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) pullback has reached the first strong support at $0.64. Buyers have held this level but have failed to propel the price above the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/b9302a6c-0340-4e62-a850-f89fb4d23e13.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.69) is turning down gradually and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the price skids below $0.64, the MATIC/USDT pair could reach $0.60.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the decline, they will have to quickly thrust the price above the moving averages. That could start a recovery, which may first hit $0.80 and subsequently $0.90.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/df1e4825-4496-4a20-88e6-63b0dfdd1ec6.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230807ej87000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 21e6 Capital AG\par \b \uc2 BTC hodlers outperformed crypto funds by 69% in H1: 21e6 Capital\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Quarmby \par \uc2 533 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A report from 21e6 Capital AG highlighted that the negative sentiment around crypto at the start of 2023 provided a \u8220\'20\'1Ctough environment\u8221\'20\'1D for funds.\par \par \uc2 The classic buy and hold, or hodl, approach to Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) outperformed most crypto funds by 68.8% in the first half (H1) of 2023.\par \par \uc2 According to data from Switzerland-based investment adviser 21e6 Capital AG, on average, crypto funds generated returns of 15.2% in the first half of 2023, but BTC saw gains of around 84%.\par \par \uc2 Crypto funds on average generated 15.2% return in the first half of 2023 lol {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/vb8pwYfiX9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/vb8pwYfiX9}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Alex Kr\u252\'00\'FCger (@krugermacro) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/krugermacro/status/1687642407578517504?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 5, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 In the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://assets.21e6.io/blog/half-year-review-2023"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2 , 21e6 Capital AG\u8217\'20\'19s head of marketing, Maximilian Bruckner, outlined that crypto funds have been \u8220\'20\'1Cfrequently able to significantly outperform Bitcoin in previous bull runs.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bruckner attributed much of the underwhelming performance of crypto funds in 2023 to the challenging market conditions and the significant amount of cash they had on hand in late 2022.\par \par \uc2 Following the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-releases-restructuring-plan-offshore-exchange-reboot-planned"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 implosion of FTX}}}\uc2  and other crypto projects in 2022, the report suggested that many crypto funds opted to take risk off the table and develop cash buffers, therefore missing out on a significant BTC price rally in H1 of 2023.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CFunds with large cash positions will underperform Bitcoin in a bull market, unless the funds\u8217\'20\'19 assets perform significantly better than Bitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDue to the general sentiment left behind by the end of 2022, many funds had larger-than-normal cash positions. Furthermore, most major altcoins also underperformed Bitcoin \u8211\'20\'13 a tough environment for funds,\u8221\'20\'1D the report adds.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/671ec965-3482-43b5-b13c-f3709014b553.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Directional fund strategy comparison H1 2023. Source: 21e6 Capital AG\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, BTC is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-8-4-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-doge-ada-sol-matic-ltc-dot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 priced at roughly $29,000}}}\uc2 , and it continues to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-stuck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 struggle to hold above}}}\uc2  the $30,000 level, which has only been briefly surpassed on a couple of occasions in 2023.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-8-4-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-doge-ada-sol-matic-ltc-dot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SOL, MATIC, LTC, DOT}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite this, current prices mark a 75% price gain for the asset since Jan. 1, as per CoinGecko data.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAll crypto fund strategies achieved positive results this year. But relative to Bitcoin, they underperformed, especially those with significant exposure to altcoins, to futures, or those strongly dependent on momentum signals.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CGoing forward, we are keeping a close eye on which exchanges will establish themselves as leading futures providers. Furthermore, the level of the funding rates in crypto futures markets and the ability of quantitative funds to capture trends will be areas of focus when we observe the markets,\u8221\'20\'1D the report adds.\par \par \uc2 Ultimately the report highlighted that \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  has slightly improved over H1 2023, suggesting that some funds may soon start piling in more cash into the crypto sector.\par \par \uc2 However, it did note that current data relating to inflows and outflows indicate that a \u8220\'20\'1Cfull recovery of sentiment\u8221\'20\'1D has not yet taken place.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/11383645-0723-4055-938c-6ab337996a18.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Non-direction crypto fund strategy comparison H1 2023. Source: 21e6 Capital AG\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/elegant-and-ass-backward-jameson-lopps-first-impression-of-bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Elegant and ass-backward\u8217\'20\'19: Jameson Lopp\u8217\'20\'19s first impression of Bitcoin}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/8fe09870-62ea-4c7e-98a3-c169caa103f2.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230805ej850002v\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 21e6 Capital AG\par \b \uc2 BTC hodlers outperformed crypto funds by 69% in H1: 21e6 Capital\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Brian Quarmby \par \uc2 557 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 21e6 Capital AG\u8217\'20\'19s report highlighted that the negative sentiment around crypto at the start of the year, provided a \u8220\'20\'1Ctough environment\u8221\'20\'1D for funds in H1 2023.\par \par \uc2 The classic buy and hold, or HODL approach to Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) outperformed the majority of crypto funds by 68.8% in the first half (H1) of 2023.\par \par \uc2 According to data from Switzerland-based investment adviser 21e6 Capital AG, on average, crypto funds generated returns of 15.2% in the first half of 2023 (Jan.1 to June 30) , compared to the roughly 84% price gain BTC saw in the same period.\par \par \uc2 Crypto funds on average generated 15.2% return in the first half of 2023 lol {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/vb8pwYfiX9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/vb8pwYfiX9}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Alex Kr\u252\'00\'FCger (@krugermacro) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/krugermacro/status/1687642407578517504?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 5, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Emphasizing the significance of such via an Aug. 2 half-year {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://assets.21e6.io/blog/half-year-review-2023"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2 , 21e6 Capital AG\u8217\'20\'19s head of marketing Maximilian Bruckner outlined that crypto funds have been \u8220\'20\'1Cfrequently able to significantly outperform Bitcoin in previous bull runs.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bruckner attributed much of the underwhelming performance of crypto funds in 2023 to the challenging market conditions and significant amount of cash they had on hand in late 2022.\par \par \uc2 Following the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-releases-restructuring-plan-offshore-exchange-reboot-planned"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 implosion of FTX}}}\uc2  and many other crypto projects last year, the report suggested that many crypto funds opted to take risk off the table and develop cash buffers, therefore missing out on a significant BTC price rally in H1 2023.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CFunds with large cash positions will underperform Bitcoin in a bull market, unless the funds\u8217\'20\'19 assets perform significantly better than Bitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDue to the general sentiment left behind by the end of 2022, many funds had larger-than-normal cash positions. Furthermore, most major altcoins also underperformed Bitcoin \u8211\'20\'13 a tough environment for funds,\u8221\'20\'1D the report adds.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/671ec965-3482-43b5-b13c-f3709014b553.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Directional Fund strategy comparison H1 2023. Source: 21e6 Capital AG.\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, BTC is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-8-4-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-doge-ada-sol-matic-ltc-dot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 priced at roughly $29,000}}}\uc2  as it continues to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-stuck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 struggle to hold above}}}\uc2  the $30,000 region, which has only been briefly surpassed on a couple of occasions this year.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-8-4-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-doge-ada-sol-matic-ltc-dot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SOL, MATIC, LTC, DOT}}}\par \par \uc2 Despite this, current prices mark a 75% price gain for the asset since Jan. 1, as per CoinGecko data.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAll crypto fund strategies achieved positive results this year. But relative to Bitcoin, they underperformed, especially those with significant exposure to altcoins, to futures, or those strongly dependent on momentum signals.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CGoing forward, we are keeping a close eye on which exchanges will establish themselves as leading futures providers. Furthermore, the level of the funding rates in crypto futures markets and the ability of quantitative funds to capture trends will be areas of focus when we observe the markets,\u8221\'20\'1D the report adds.\par \par \uc2 Ultimately the report highlighted that \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  has slightly improved over H1 2023, suggesting that some funds may soon start piling in more cash into the crypto sector.\par \par \uc2 However, it did note that current data relating to inflows and outflows indicate that a \u8220\'20\'1Cfull recovery of sentiment\u8221\'20\'1D has not yet taken place.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/11383645-0723-4055-938c-6ab337996a18.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Non-direction crypto fund strategy comparison H1 2023. Source: 21e6 Capital AG.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/elegant-and-ass-backward-jameson-lopps-first-impression-of-bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Elegant and ass-backward\u8217\'20\'19: Jameson Lopp\u8217\'20\'19s first impression of Bitcoin}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/8fe09870-62ea-4c7e-98a3-c169caa103f2.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230805ej8500001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Revolut\uc2  to suspend cryptocurrency services in US\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Helen Partz \par \uc2 381 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Crypto-friendly trading neobank \uc2 Revolut\uc2  is wrapping up its crypto services in the United States amid ongoing regulatory uncertainty.\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency-friendly trading neobank \uc2 Revolut\uc2  is wrapping up its crypto services in the United States amid ongoing regulatory uncertainty.\par \par \uc2 Soon after announcing a partial delisting of certain digital assets from its platform, \uc2 Revolut\uc2  took a decision to suspend all crypto services for U.S. users, the firm said in a statement to Cointelegraph on Aug. 4.\par \par \uc2 Together with its U.S. banking partner, \uc2 Revolut\uc2  will work to suspend access to crypto through its platform starting Sept. 2. The firm will then completely shut down crypto services on Oct. 3, a spokesperson for the online bank said, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe access to cryptocurrencies through \uc2 Revolut\uc2  will be fully disabled and US customers will no longer be able to buy, sell, or hold any cryptocurrencies.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Revolut\uc2  representative emphasized that the decision to leave the U.S. market will impact \u8220\'20\'1Cjust 1%\u8221\'20\'1D of the company\u8217\'20\'19s global crypto customers. The representative also stressed that \uc2 Revolut\uc2  will continue to operate its non-crypto business in the United States.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis decision has not been taken lightly, and we understand the disappointment this may cause,\u8221\'20\'1D the spokesperson noted.\par \par \uc2 Crypto customers in the U.S. will soon find all relevant information regarding the suspension in the email communication from \uc2 Revolut\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1COur dedicated support team is available to address any concerns and questions our U.S. crypto customers may have via our in-app chat,\u8221\'20\'1D the statement added.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-pauses-staking-services-following-regulators-orders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase pauses staking services in four US states following regulators\u8217\'20\'19 orders}}}\par \par \uc2 As previously reported, Revolut US announced the delisting of cryptocurrencies including Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://matic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) and Solana's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) in late June. The company was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/revolut-us-to-delist-ada-matic-and-sol-in-september"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 planning to proceed with delistings}}}\uc2  in September. As of late July, \uc2 Revolut\uc2  supported a total of roughly 30 cryptocurrencies in the United States.\par \par \uc2 Some major crypto services have also been struggling to continue servicing their customers in the United States recently. Crypto.com, a major global crypto exchange, announced the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-com-suspends-us-institutional-exchange-service"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suspension of services to institutional clients in the U.S.}}}\uc2  in mid-June.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/crypto-regulation-sec-chair-gary-gensler-final-say/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto \b  \highlight22regulation\b0 \highlight22  \u8212\'20\'14 Does SEC Chair Gary Gensler have the final say?}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/c07bf0c5-30ac-400d-8164-4ab862c0ec29.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230804ej84000e8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, MATIC, LTC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,677 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Data suggests that Bitcoin and select altcoins are expected to remain range-bound in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin continues to frustrate traders who have been predicting a breakout on either side, but {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-29k-bitcoin-rsi-analysis-trader"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investors should keep a close watch}}}\uc2  because the longer the time spent inside the range, the stronger the eventual breakout from it.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-293-data-resilient-us-jobs-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July jobs report released on Aug. 4}}}\uc2  was a mixed bag. Hence, it could not shake Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) from its range. The report showed the addition of 187,000 jobs, fewer than the 200,000 expected by economists. But average hourly wages remained strong, showing an increase of 0.4% for the month against expectations of a 0.3% rise.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/cf45ba92-d2d6-4d1f-ae91-5cda7719a58b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Although the price remains stuck inside a range, analysts are putting out \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  projections for the second half of the year. A recent report from Matrixport projected a target of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-miners-btc-price-98k-halving"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $45,000 by the end of this year}}}\uc2  and $125,000 by the end of 2024.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s long-term story remains intact, but traders should keep a close eye on any possible shocks from regulators, as that could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-risks-binance-fears-bitcoin-bulls"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cause a knee-jerk reaction}}}\uc2  to the downside. What are the important support and resistance levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price is getting squeezed between the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $29,523 and the horizontal support at $28,861.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/c76eb5f9-c391-4262-a170-0e154fb31c46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative zone indicate that bears have a slight edge. If the price plummets and sustains below $28,861, the BTC/USDT pair may collapse to $27,500 and then to $26,000.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price bounces off $28,861, it will indicate that the bulls are protecting this level with all their might. A break and close above $30,000 will signal a comeback by the bulls. The pair may then climb to the overhead resistance zone between $31,804 and $32,400.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) slumped below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $1,871 on Aug. 2, which suggests that the bears are trying to gain the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/42265286-ea0b-4ab3-9fe6-b84862efdbc1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to arrest the decline near the strong support at $1,816, but the failure to achieve a solid rebound suggests a lack of aggressive buying near the level. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($1,867) and the RSI just below the midpoint indicate that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the price skids below $1,816, the ETH/USDT pair may plunge to $1,698. This negative view will invalidate in the near term if bulls push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. In that case, the pair may swing between $1,816 and $2,000 for some time.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on Aug. 2, indicating that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/48d1a641-d97e-4782-8cbf-46ca16640409.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This equilibrium will tilt in favor of the bulls if the price catapults above the triangle. The BNB/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $265, where the bears may again pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the triangle, it will signal that bears are on a roll. The pair could then retest the crucial support at $220. If this level gives way, the pair may start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) tumbled below the 20-day EMA ($0.68) on Aug. 2 and followed that up with another slide on Aug. 3. That sent the price tumbling below the strong support at $0.67.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/3026e4ff-80b2-4310-9273-ec6d782daacf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to protect the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.64 because if this level breaks down, the XRP/USDT pair may collapse to the breakout level of $0.56. The 50-day SMA ($0.59) could act as temporary support, but it is likely to be broken.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the bulls push the price back above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest solid demand at lower levels. That will increase the likelihood of the pair remaining inside the $0.67 to $0.85 range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down and broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on Aug. 2, indicating that higher levels are attracting sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/e1f53d9e-aa7b-40d5-ba05-fcf196391b4f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push the price back above the 20-day EMA on Aug. 4. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to the downtrend line. This level is likely to attract selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price reverses direction from the downtrend line, it will signal that the trend is turning negative and the relief rallies are being sold. The bears will then again try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA and challenge the breakout level at $0.07.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break and close above the downtrend line will suggest the start of a strong up move toward $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.30) on Aug. 2 and the 50-day SMA ($0.30) on Aug. 3. This suggests that the bears are trying to seize control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/cbc83cb6-133c-4b49-894b-f14ef97978f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the uptrend line, the selling may pick up and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could plunge to $0.26 and then to the vital support at $0.24. The buyers are expected to guard this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls want to make a comeback, they will have to quickly drive the price above the moving averages and the overhead resistance at $0.32. The pair could then travel to $0.34 and eventually to $0.38.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the strong support at $22.30 on Aug. 4, indicating that the bulls continue to protect this level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/1d8a36bf-c880-4934-974b-9d2e64183bc2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rises above the 20-day EMA ($23.84), it will suggest that the SOL/USDT pair could march toward $25.68 and subsequently to $27.12. This remains the key resistance to watch for on the upside because a break above it will signal a potential new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to sell the recovery to the 20-day EMA and sink the pair below the support zone between $22.30 and the 50-day SMA ($21.38). If they manage to do that, the pair may tumble to $18.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/germany-is-dragging-europe-economy-down-great-for-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Germany is dragging Europe\u8217\'20\'19s economy down \u8212\'20\'14 and that\u8217\'20\'19s great for crypto}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been sliding since hitting the local high of $0.89 on July 13, which shows a lack of buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/f5981e17-80e8-4208-882a-684c144d3d8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The MATIC/USDT pair has reached the support near $0.65, where the bulls are likely to mount a strong defense. If the price rebounds off the support and climbs above the moving averages, it will clear the path for a possible rise to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price skids below $0.65, it will indicate that bears remain in command. The pair could next slump to the support at $0.60. This level may again attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) range resolved to the downside on Aug. 2, and that was followed by another fall on Aug. 3, which completed a 100% retracement of the rally that started from $82.91 on July 29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/35f02643-b60c-4fe8-98f9-cd949a2d1b26.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to protect the support at $81.36, but the bears are unlikely to give up their advantage easily. If the price breaks below $81.36, the selling could intensify and the LTC/USDT pair may plummet to $76.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level, the pair may reach the overhead resistance at $87.37. A break above this level will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between $81.36 and $96.46 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $5 and $5.65 for the past several days. The price has reached the support of the range, which may witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/63838e19-2dbe-4d0c-9257-cee94c4bba7e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($5.17) has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating a minor advantage to the bears. If the price slides and sustains below $5, it may start a deeper pullback to $4.74 and then to $4.60.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price rebounds off the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the range remains intact. The DOT/USDT pair could then rise to $5.33 and thereafter to the overhead resistance at $5.64.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/43395301-ee77-4a22-b96f-e708896525f8.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230804ej84000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Revolut\uc2  to suspend cryptocurrency services in US\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Helen Partz \par \uc2 384 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Crypto-friendly trading neobank \uc2 Revolut\uc2  is wrapping its crypto services in the United States amid the ongoing regulatory uncertainty.\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency-friendly trading neobank \uc2 Revolut\uc2  is wrapping up its crypto services in the United States amid the ongoing regulatory uncertainty.\par \par \uc2 Soon after announcing a partial delisting of certain digital assets from its platform, \uc2 Revolut\uc2  took a decision to suspend all crypto services for U.S. users, the firm said in a statement to Cointelegraph on Aug. 4.\par \par \uc2 Together with its U.S. banking partner, \uc2 Revolut\uc2  will be working to suspend access to crypto through its platform starting from Sept. 2, 2023. The firm then will completely shut down crypto services on \uc2 Revolut\uc2  on Oct. 3, a spokesperson for the online bank said, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe access to cryptocurrencies through \uc2 Revolut\uc2  will be fully disabled and US customers will no longer be able to buy, sell, or hold any cryptocurrencies.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Revolut\uc2  representative emphasized that the decision to leave the U.S. market will impact \u8220\'20\'1Cjust 1%\u8221\'20\'1D of the company\u8217\'20\'19s global crypto customers. The representative also stressed that \uc2 Revolut\uc2  will continue to operate its non-crypto business in the United States.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis decision has not been taken lightly, and we understand the disappointment this may cause,\u8221\'20\'1D the spokesperson for \uc2 Revolut\uc2  noted.\par \par \uc2 Crypto customers in the U.S. will soon find all relevant information regarding the suspension in the email communication they received from \uc2 Revolut\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1COur dedicated support team is available to address any concerns and questions our U.S. crypto customers may have via our in-app chat,\u8221\'20\'1D the statement added.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-pauses-staking-services-following-regulators-orders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase pauses staking services in four US states following regulators\u8217\'20\'19 orders}}}\par \par \uc2 As previously reported, Revolut US announced delisting of cryptocurrencies like Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://matic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) and Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) in late June. The company was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/revolut-us-to-delist-ada-matic-and-sol-in-september"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 planning to proceed with delistings}}}\uc2  in September. As of late July, \uc2 Revolut\uc2  supported a total of roughly 30 cryptocurrencies in the United States.\par \par \uc2 Some major crypto services have also been struggling to continue servicing their customers in the United States recently. Crypto.com, a major global crypto exchange, announced the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-com-suspends-us-institutional-exchange-service"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suspension of services to institutional clients in the U.S.}}}\uc2  in mid-June.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/crypto-regulation-sec-chair-gary-gensler-final-say/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto \b  \highlight22regulation\b0 \highlight22  \u8212\'20\'14 Does SEC Chair Gary Gensler have the final say?}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/c07bf0c5-30ac-400d-8164-4ab862c0ec29.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230804ej840005n\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, DOGE,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , MATIC, LTC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,733 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 August 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins could retest their strong support levels, but the real worry is whether or not buyers will step in.\par \par \uc2 Ratings agency \uc2 Fitch{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/08/02/us-debt-downgrade-sinks-global-markets-but-economists-are-not-concerned.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 downgraded}}}\uc2  the United States\u8217\'20\'19 long-term credit rating from AAA to AA+ on Aug. 1, and this move dented the risk-on sentiment. The U.S. equities markets witnessed profit-booking on Aug. 2, and the cryptocurrency market\u8217\'20\'19s recovery stalled in its tracks.\par \par \uc2 However, after the knee-jerk reaction, the markets may settle down. The cryptocurrency markets are likely to keep their focus on the news and events surrounding the Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) spot exchange-traded fund (ETF) applications. Bloomberg ETF analysts \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2  and James Seyffart said in a statement that the possibility of an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etf-approval-chances-65"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETF application getting greenlighted has surged}}}\uc2  from 1% a couple of months ago to 65%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/d1bf44e8-665f-4cb8-9a49-403d721a6b31.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 The recent developments in the crypto sector have rejuvenated the Bitcoin bulls. Software development firm \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 , founded by \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2 , is planning to raise up to $750 million via a stock sale, with the aim to use the funds for working capital and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-bitcoin-purchase-plans-750m-stock-sale"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to buy more Bitcoin}}}\uc2 . The firm already holds 152,800 Bitcoin worth about $4.5 billion at current prices.\par \par \uc2 Will buyers defend the immediate support levels in Bitcoin and altcoins, or could the bears overpower the bulls? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  picked up on Aug. 1. The bears pulled the price below the immediate support at $28,861, but the long tail on the candlestick shows aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/7ffb7c4b-1520-4868-aa44-439edabbedb6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls propelled the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $29,596, but they are struggling to clear the hurdle at $30,000. This shows that the bears are not willing to give up and are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the relative strength index (RSI) is just below the midpoint, indicating a range formation in the near term. The boundaries of the range could be $30,050 on the upside and $28,585 on the downside.\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive the price above this narrow range, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance zone between $31,000 and $32,400. On the downside, a crack below $28,585 may start a downward move to $27,500 and then to $26,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The tight-range trading in Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) resolved to the downside on Aug. 1, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/61f6c167-d174-4994-ace2-95847e722ab7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A positive sign in favor of the bears is that they did not allow the price to rise above the 20-day EMA ($1,873). The bears are trying to strengthen their position by sustaining the price below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $1,864.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to $1,813. A break and close below this level could sink the pair to $1,700 and then $1,626.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the short-term decline, they will have to overcome the hurdle at the 20-day EMA. That could start an up move to the psychological resistance at $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  picked up on Aug. 1, but the bulls could not push the price above the resistance line of the triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/78e71160-11f2-4eac-ac13-fa40e01ea037.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will increase the likelihood of a break above the triangle. If that happens, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to $265.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price skids below the moving averages, the pair could drop to the support line of the triangle. If this support crumbles, the pair may retest the vital support at $220.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the support at $0.67 on Aug. 1, but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that the bears are selling on every minor relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/925af4b4-76a8-4c4b-a933-673908109af8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to again pull the price to the support at $0.67. The repeated retest of a support level within a short interval tends to weaken it. If the $0.67 level gives way, the XRP/USDT pair could plummet to the breakout level of $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price once again rebounds off $0.67 with strength, it will indicate that the bulls are fiercely defending the level. That could push the price to the immediate resistance at $0.75. A break above this level could open the doors for a possible rally to $0.85.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) snapped back from the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on Aug. 1, indicating that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/5875a8a2-e552-4d33-8edf-6c2a1ed41d03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls could not propel the price above the overhead resistance near $0.08. The bears used this opportunity and have again pulled the price to the 20-day EMA. If this support cracks, it will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. The DOGE/USDT pair could then slump to the breakout level of $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price once again rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the sentiment remains positive and the bulls are buying the dips. That could enhance the prospects of a break above the overhead resistance. The pair may then rise to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) below the immediate support at $0.30 on Aug. 1, but the bulls bought the dip to the 50-day SMA ($0.29).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/67ab40a3-b074-4126-8f6f-01ef1e80c4b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will need to thrust the price above the $0.33 to $0.34 resistance zone to indicate a comeback. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rally to $0.38, where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price continues lower and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that the bears have seized control. The pair could then slide to $0.26 and eventually to $0.24.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) snapped back from the strong support at $22.30 on Aug. 1, but the bulls could not push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($24.02).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/5c8a95a1-1c49-49f5-b842-99edc32b1e23.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This is a negative sign and shows that the bears are selling on every minor rise. Sellers will again try to sink the price below the support zone between $22.30 and the 50-day SMA ($21.05). If they can pull it off, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could start a deeper correction toward $18 and then $16.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price once again bounces off $22.30, it will indicate that the bulls are guarding this level with vigor. The pair may first recover to $25.68 and thereafter retest the crucial resistance at $27.12.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-stuck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price stuck?}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually pulling down lower. The bears tugged the price below the 50-day SMA ($0.69) on July 31, but the bulls pushed the price back above the level on Aug. 1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/1bdd03ec-1db7-4e8f-898e-d078d106e59e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.72) and the RSI below 44 indicate that bears have a slight advantage. If the price turns down and breaks below $0.65, the selling could pick up and the MATIC/USDT pair may decline to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA. That could open the gates for a possible rally to $0.80. This level may prove to be a stiff barrier, but if bulls overcome it, the pair could reach $0.90.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the strong support at $87 on Aug. 1. This shows that the price remains stuck inside the range between $87 and $97.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/5625ae0a-3add-45a4-9c85-65b7529da3eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($92) remains flat and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This equilibrium will shift in favor of the bears if they sink the price below $87. The LTC/USDT pair could then drop to $81 and later to $75.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from $87, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the range for a few more days. The bulls will have to drive the price above $97 to start an up move to $106.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to resolve the uncertainty in Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) in their favor on Aug. 1, but the bulls thwarted their attempt.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/9bc300ad-dcf0-43eb-a8ec-29312a2e7e60.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bears is that they did not allow the bulls to kick the price above the 20-day EMA ($5.21). This suggests that higher levels continue to attract selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is the 50-day SMA. If the price sustains below this level, the selling could intensify and the DOT/USDT pair may slump to $4.74 and then to $4.65.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, a rise above the 20-day EMA may enhance the prospects of a rally to the overhead resistance at $5.64.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-08/a3c81a7e-8f2b-4add-ad33-431309b66c70.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230802ej82000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/31: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,729 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price continues to falter, but traders are hopeful that a \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  spike will trigger a trend reversal.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index continued its march toward its all-time high with a 3% gain in July. Signs of receding inflationary pressures and expectations of an end to the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s tightening cycle are the factors that boosted risk-on sentiment.\par \par \uc2 However, this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  mood did not benefit Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) as it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-monthly-close-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 largely remained range-bound in July}}}\uc2  and is on track to end the month with a loss of more than 3%. The biggest question troubling traders is when will Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s range break and in which direction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/b0ddd27c-c0db-4f46-8183-000e54c5606c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Typically, the longer the time spent inside the range, the greater the force needed for the breakout. Once the price escapes the range, the next trending move is likely to be strong. The only problem is that it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty. Hence, it is better to wait for the price to sustain above or below the range before taking large bets.\par \par \uc2 With Bitcoin trading inside a range, could the action shift to altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) has been in an uptrend. The bears tried to pull the price back below the breakout level of 4,513 on July 27, but the bulls held their ground. This suggests that buyers are trying to flip the 4,513 level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/42176d4f-3d5e-46ee-8a67-24c7549978fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages indicate that bulls are in control, but the negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be slowing down.\par \par \uc2 The up move is likely to face strong selling at 4,650. If the price turns down from this level but rebounds off the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of 4,509, it will suggest that the uptrend remains intact.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-day EMA. That could open the gates for a potential drop to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of 4,371.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to yank the U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) below the 100.82 support on July 27, but the bulls fiercely defended the level. That started strong buying, which pushed the price above the 20-day EMA (101.46).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/c5387691-2909-420d-b8a2-7633f9e3689b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will next try to extend the recovery to the 50-day SMA (102.51) and later to the downtrend line. This remains the key level to keep an eye on because a break above it could indicate that the bears are losing their grip. The index may then rise to the stiff overhead resistance at 106.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the bears will have to sink and sustain the price below 100.82 to establish their supremacy. The index could then slide to 99.57. A break below this support could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dropped below the 50-day SMA ($29,442) on July 30, indicating that the bears are trying to take control. However, the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows buying near the horizontal support at $28,861.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/bdf8dae3-cba7-4a19-bf44-59b76d7224d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($29,624) and the RSI below 44 suggest that bears have a slight edge. Any attempt to start a relief rally could face selling at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down from this resistance and breaks below $28,861, it could start a decline to $27,500 and then to $26,000.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the fall, they will have to thrust the price above the 20-day EMA. The BTC/USDT pair could first rise to $29,500 and then to the $31,500 to $32,400 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the moving averages for the past few days, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/545beb4c-0ed4-44c8-a3d2-cef99993bb4d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Generally, tight ranges are followed by a range breakout that starts the next leg of the trending move. If the price plunges below the 50-day SMA ($1,859), it will indicate that bears have overpowered the bulls. That may start a downward move toward $1,700.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up and closes above the 20-day EMA, it will signal the start of a short-term up move. The ETH/USDT pair could first rise to $1,929 and thereafter attempt a rally to the psychological resistance at $2,000.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating inside a large range between $0.67 and $0.85. Although the bulls successfully defended the support, they have failed to start a strong recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/e8ca04cb-c657-49eb-bc3d-72f175dfab01.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day EMA ($0.69) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the bulls have a slight edge. If buyers overcome the barrier at $0.75, the XRP/USDT pair may start a relief rally to the resistance at $0.85.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and dives below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that every minor rise is being sold. The pair could then retest the support at $0.69. If this support crumbles, the pair may extend the decline to the breakout level of $0.56.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/bf2e8732-aba7-4827-aaca-761daa2c06ad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price sustains above the moving averages, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to the resistance line. A break and close above the triangle could propel the price to $265.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are trying to pull the pair to the support line. If this support cracks, the pair may plunge to $220.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($0.31) on July 28, but the recovery lacks momentum. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/dd694496-645f-4302-a819-0a6947a8591f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price skids back below the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could consolidate inside a tight range between $0.30 and $0.32 for some time. Buyers will have to kick the price above $0.32 to start an up move to $0.34 and subsequently to $0.38.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price continues lower and plummets below the 50-day SMA ($0.29), it may trap several aggressive bulls. That may start a rush to the exit, resulting in a deeper correction to $0.28 and then to $0.26.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-volume-lowest-early-2021-25k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin volume hits lowest since early 2021 amid fear $25K may return}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is facing selling just above the $0.08 level, but a minor positive is that the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears. This suggests that the buyers expect another leg higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/a9111e53-209e-47ab-8fa4-36dfbf7a2218.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.07) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the bulls have the upper hand. If the price turns up from the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to drive the DOGE/USDT pair above the overhead resistance. If they succeed, the pair may start its northward march to $0.10 and eventually to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair may then slide to the breakout level at $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is trying to find support at the 20-day EMA ($24.14), but the bulls are struggling to sustain the rebound. This suggests that the bears have not given up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/cc9eccbf-5197-4da1-a309-63fd7d47c4bf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price cracks and maintains below the 20-day EMA, the SOL/USDT pair may slide to $22.30. This remains the key short-term support to watch out for. If the price rebounds off this level, the pair may consolidate between $22.30 and $27.12 for some time. The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint also suggest a range formation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $27.12 will signal that bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair may then rally to $32.13. On the downside, a break below $22.30 could pull the pair to the 50-day SMA ($20.71).\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($92) on July 29, but they could not clear the hurdle at $97.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/b50747df-0679-4884-b0f1-5f06376c3e66.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint indicate the possibility of a range formation. Buyers purchased the dip on July 30, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick, but they failed to build upon the strength on July 31. This suggests that bears are aggressively defending the $97 level.\par \par \uc2 If the price tumbles below the 50-day SMA ($91), the LTC/USDT pair could descend to $87. A strong bounce off this level may keep the pair range-bound for a few days. Buyers will have to propel the price above $97 to open the doors for a rally to $106.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/e56dcdc6-2ff8-46e4-a9f9-c556f72f7ad9.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230731ej7v000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/31: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, SOL, LTC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,725 \uc2 words\par \uc2 31 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price continues to falter, but traders are hopeful that a \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  spike will trigger a trend reversal.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) continued its march toward its all-time high with a 3% gain in July. Signs of receding inflationary pressures and expectations of an end to the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s tightening cycle are the factors that boosted risk-on sentiment.\par \par \uc2 However, this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  mood did not benefit Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) as it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-monthly-close-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 largely remained range-bound in July}}}\uc2  and is on track to end the month with a loss of more than 3%. The biggest question troubling traders is when will Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s range break and in which direction.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/b0ddd27c-c0db-4f46-8183-000e54c5606c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Typically, the longer the time spent inside the range, the greater the force needed for the breakout. Once the price escapes the range, the next trending move is likely to be strong. The only problem is that it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty. Hence, it is better to wait for the price to sustain above or below the range before taking large bets.\par \par \uc2 With Bitcoin trading inside a range, could the action shift to altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index has been in an uptrend. The bears tried to pull the price back below the breakout level of 4,513 on July 27 but the bulls held their ground. This suggests that buyers are trying to flip the 4,513 level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/42176d4f-3d5e-46ee-8a67-24c7549978fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages indicate that bulls are in control but the negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be slowing down.\par \par \uc2 The up-move is likely to face strong selling at 4,650. If the price turns down from this level but rebounds off the 20-day exponential moving average (4,509), it will suggest that the uptrend remains intact.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-day EMA. That could open the gates for a potential drop to the 50-day simple moving average (4,371).\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to yank the U.S. dollar index (DXY) below the 100.82 support on July 27 but the bulls fiercely defended the level. That started strong buying, which pushed the price above the 20-day EMA (101.46).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/c5387691-2909-420d-b8a2-7633f9e3689b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will next try to extend the recovery to the 50-day SMA (102.51) and later to the downtrend line. This remains the key level to keep an eye on because a break above it could indicate that the bears are losing their grip. The index may then rise to the stiff overhead resistance at 106.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the bears will have to sink and sustain the price below 100.82 to establish their supremacy. The index could then slide to 99.57. A break below this support could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dropped below the 50-day SMA ($29,442) on July 30, indicating that the bears are trying to take control. However, the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows buying near the horizontal support at $28,861.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/bdf8dae3-cba7-4a19-bf44-59b76d7224d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABT