fended the support, they have failed to start a strong recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/e8ca04cb-c657-49eb-bc3d-72f175dfab01.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day EMA ($0.69) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the bulls have a slight edge. If buyers overcome the barrier at $0.75, the XRP/USDT pair may start a relief rally to the resistance at $0.85.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and dives below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that every minor rise is being sold into. The pair could then retest the support at $0.69. If this support crumbles, the pair may extend the decline to the breakout level of $0.56.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/bf2e8732-aba7-4827-aaca-761daa2c06ad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price sustains above the moving averages, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to the resistance line. A break and close above the triangle could propel the price to $265.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are trying to pull the pair to the support line. If this support cracks, the pair may plunge to $220.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($0.31) on July 28 but the recovery lacks momentum. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/dd694496-645f-4302-a819-0a6947a8591f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price skids back below the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could consolidate inside a tight range between $0.30 and $0.32 for some time. Buyers will have to kick the price above $0.32 to start an up-move to $0.34 and subsequently to $0.38.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price continues lower and plummets below the 50-day SMA ($0.29), it may trap several aggressive bulls. That may start a rush to the exit, resulting in a deeper correction to $0.28 and then to $0.26.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-volume-lowest-early-2021-25k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin volume hits lowest since early 2021 amid fear $25K may return}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is facing selling just above the $0.08 level but a minor positive is that the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears. This suggests that the buyers expect another leg higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/a9111e53-209e-47ab-8fa4-36dfbf7a2218.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.07) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the bulls have the upper hand. If the price turns up from the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to drive the DOGE/USDT pair above the overhead resistance. If they succeed, the pair may start its northward march to $0.10 and eventually to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair may then slide to the breakout level at $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is trying to find support at the 20-day EMA ($24.14) but the bulls are struggling to sustain the rebound. This suggests that the bears have not given up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/cc9eccbf-5197-4da1-a309-63fd7d47c4bf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price cracks and maintains below the 20-day EMA, the SOL/USDT pair may slide to $22.30. This remains the key short-term support to watch out for. If the price rebounds off this level, the pair may consolidate between $22.30 and $27.12 for some time. The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint also suggest a range formation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $27.12 will signal that bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair may then rally to $32.13. On the downside, a break below $22.30 could pull the pair to the 50-day SMA ($20.71).\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($92) on July 29 but they could not clear the hurdle at $97.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/b50747df-0679-4884-b0f1-5f06376c3e66.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AMATICUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint indicate the possibility of a range formation. Buyers purchased the dip on July 30 as seen from the long tail on the candlestick but they failed to build upon the strength on July 31. This suggests that bears are aggressively defending the $97 level.\par \par \uc2 If the price tumbles below the 50-day SMA ($91), the LTC/USDT pair could descend to $87. A strong bounce off this level may keep the pair range-bound for a few days. Buyers will have to propel the price above $97 to open the doors for a rally to $106.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/e56dcdc6-2ff8-46e4-a9f9-c556f72f7ad9.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230731ej7v000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Columns\par \b \uc2 Journeys: Herv\u233\'00\'E9 Larren on Bitcoin, Apes and the psychology of \u8216\'20\'18blue-chip\u8217\'20\'19 NFTs\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Elias Ahonen \par \uc2 2,020 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Herv\u233\'00\'E9 Larren\u8217\'20\'19s crypto journey has taken him from luxury goods to Bitcoin mining and back full circle to the world of \u8220\'20\'1Cblue-chip\u8221\'20\'1D NFTs.\par \par \uc2 During a period of hyperinflation in 2013, my Venezuelan mother asked me to send money to Caracas, the countrys capital, Herv Larren recalls. However, bank transfers were not possible between the two countries.\par \par \uc2 Busy with work in New York, he told a friend that he planned to fly to Caracas carrying cash for his mother and return the same day. Why dont you just send Bitcoin? his friend asked, which quickly led to a change of plans as Larren made his first Bitcoin transfer.\par \par \uc2 My first crypto transaction, in 2013, was to wire Bitcoin from the U.S. to Venezuela. Due to the economic collapse, there was no functioning banking system between these two countries.\par \par \uc2 Switching from a career with luxury goods company LVMH Mot Hennessy Louis Vuitton, Larren co-founded a large-scale crypto mining operation and worked with Grayscale to bring crypto assets to old-school investors. He later became a key adviser to ApeCoin and the first person to bid a million dollars for a nonfungible token.\par \par \uc2 From old to new\par \par \uc2 We were reporting to \uc2 Nicolas Sarkozy\uc2 , and he was coming to our meetings, Larren recalls of his time as the head of a high school student council in Neuilly-sur-Seine, the wealthiest old-money suburb of Paris, where he grew up.\par \par \uc2 Sarkozy served as the local mayor for 20 years before becoming the president of France. Larrens mother from Venezuela was a TV host and the first Latina model signed by the LOreal cosmetics brand. His French father imported wine to Canada, where a third of the population is French-speaking.\par \par \uc2 In the late 90s, Larren began undergraduate business studies at Montreals Concordia University. In 2019, Concordia {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.concordia.ca/cunews/offices/vpaer/aar/2019/50-under-50/the-blockchain-maven.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 labeled}}}\uc2  him The Blockchain Maven as part of a 50 Under 50 alumni distinction. Upon graduation, he got a job at Mot Hennessys New York office, where he worked on brand development of the firms Hennessy cognac brand in the United States.\par \par \uc2 Larren worked on his MBA at \uc2 Columbia University\uc2  part time while at \uc2 LVMH\uc2 , graduating in 2010 and entering the venture capital world with Peak Ventures, which was involved in tech companies including \uc2 Twitter\uc2 . It was Larrens first experience in the technology sector, which he describes as very different from the old-world, intergenerational luxury goods industry.\par \par \uc2 Larren quickly moved to accept Bitcoin at an e-commerce business he was involved with, a company that helped charities raise money by partnering with celebrities. In 2015, he formed crypto mining firm Global Crypto Ventures, which grew into an operation of nearly 3,000 machines composed primarily of Bitmain Antminer S9 miners in Las Vegas and Texas, where the cost of infrastructure and electricity was cheaper.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/image3-780x1024.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Larren at his mining facility. (Herv Larren)\par \par \uc2 Grayscale Digital Large Cap Fund\par \par \uc2 While speaking at the 2017 World Technology Forum in New York, Larren met \uc2 Digital Currency Group\uc2  CEO \uc2 Barry Silbert\uc2 , who was talking right after him about the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2 , through which retail investors could get exposure to Bitcoin through their brokerage. He was also working on a new investment vehicle called \uc2 Grayscale Digital Large Cap Fund\uc2  (GDLC), which represented a weighted portfolio of cryptocurrencies, including Ether, MATIC, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \uc2 SOL\uc2 , in addition to Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 As a publicly traded investment instrument, it would require approval by the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 . One relevant matter would be to ensure that the fund could buy its digital assets from a trusted source, preferably from within the United States. Larrens mining firm was an ideal source, and having a ready buyer for mining proceeds made business smoother.\par \par \uc2 This opportunity represented Larrens first foray into crypto beyond Bitcoin, and it attracted me to a new space.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://servedbyadbutler.com/go2/;ID=169476;size=728x90;setID=601214;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fcointelegraph.com%2Fmagazine%2Fwp-json%2Fwp%2Fv2%2Fposts%3F_embed%26per_page%3D100%26doing_wp_cron%3D1690472402.1911869049072265625000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://servedbyadbutler.com/go2/;ID=169476;size=300x250;setID=601213;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fcointelegraph.com%2Fmagazine%2Fwp-json%2Fwp%2Fv2%2Fposts%3F_embed%26per_page%3D100%26doing_wp_cron%3D1690472402.1911869049072265625000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Working with the SEC was no easy task, Larren recalls. It was a nerve-racking process. Though the company was very confident about getting approval, there was a lot of uncertainty because no such investment trust had been approved previously.\par \par \uc2 However, the GDLC was approved, expanding the potential pool of crypto investors. Though many in the industry continue to preach the not your keys, not your coins mantra, Larren argues that just as with stocks, owning Bitcoin and other crypto assets through a financial instrument instead of on an exchange or cold-storage device is preferable for most of the public.\par \par \uc2 There is less risk of being hacked or losing access to keys, and regulated funds must meet stringent security policies and often carry insurance. He also notes that they are easier to manage on a portfolio basis, particularly regarding taxation and being more straightforward for accountants to understand.\par \par \uc2 Will BlackRocks \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  be approved?\par \par \uc2 These advantages make it easy to see why heavyweights of the financial industry see an opportunity in offering Bitcoin investment vehicles accessible to retail investors. One of these is \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 , which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-larry-fink-crypto-will-transcend-international-currencies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recently applied to launch}}}\uc2  a Bitcoin spot exchange-traded fund in the United States.\par \par \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  offers the credibility to convince the SEC that the Bitcoin market can be operated safely and has much to offer investors, Larren says optimistically. He expects that with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-spot-bitcoin-etf-new-sec-filings-wisdomtree-invesco"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BlackRocks track record}}}\uc2  of 575 approved ETFs versus one denial, it will soon come online, with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/monochrome-filing-spot-bitcoin-etf-asx-australia"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 similar products expected}}}\uc2  in other markets.\par \par \uc2 I think it would lead to an automatic rise in Bitcoins price. I think many people are on the sidelines waiting for clarity, and thats a step in Bitcoins institutional adoption.\par \par \uc2 For a very long time, Grayscale had a premium on its shares compared with the price of Bitcoin, Larren notes, explaining that the security, certainty and convenience meant that more conservative investors were historically willing to pay more per BTC. BlackRocks ETF is unlikely to hold a large premium, which would serve to make the market more efficient.\par \par \uc2 All roads in Decentraland lead to Beeple\par \par \uc2 Larren first heard about the metaverse through Decentralands initial coin offering in August 2017. They were selling 90,000 pieces of NFT land in the metaverse, he recalls, adding that he felt a proximity to the projects Argentine founders due to South Americas shared currency issues. My first NFT purchase was actually buying my name in the metaverse, he says, recalling how he spent 100 MANA to name his avatar.\par \par \uc2 He was also given a piece of land on which to build the Airvey art gallery, where Larren placed various NFTs for sale. When Christies announced it would auction Beeples Everydays piece in its first-ever NFT auction in March 2021 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/nft-artist-beeples-mammoth-5040-day-artwork/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a story previously covered by Magazine}}}\uc2  the auction house contacted the Airvey gallery to invite bids.\par \par \uc2 I wanted to be the first person in the world who bid seven figures on an NFT.\par \par \uc2 Well that escalated quickly was Beeples only comment when Larrens bid for $1 million came through, representing the first volley in a bidding battle that would see an anonymous buyer later revealed as Vignesh Sundaresan, also known as Metakovan, beat Tron founder \uc2 Justin Sun\uc2  with a record-setting bid of $69 million.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/image1-637x1024.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Beeple posted his reaction to the $1 million bid on \uc2 Instagram\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Bored Apes design ApeCoin\par \par \uc2 With a newfound passion for NFTs, Larren joined Horizen Labs in 2021, months before the firm began discussions with Yuga Labs, a small company where four founders were working on an NFT project involving monkeys.\par \par \uc2 Yuga contracted Horizen Labs to create ApeCoin, a large allocation of which was distributed to holders of Yugas NFT collections including Bored Ape Yacht Club, Mutant Ape Yacht Club and Bored Ape Kennel Club via massive airdrop.\par \par \uc2 We did everything from the white paper, tokenomics, to listing on exchanges. In less than 20 minutes, it became an $8 billion project, Larren says, referring to the tokens undiluted market cap, now about $2 billion. In addition to the launch, Larren notes that Horizen Labs designed the tokens staking mechanism, which will see 100 million tokens distributed to the community over three years.\par \par \uc2 As Gucci and \uc2 TAG Heuer{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/swiss-luxury-watchmaker-tag-heuer-introduces-nft-enabled-smartwatch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 began accepting ApeCoin}}}\uc2  as a form of payment, Larrens luxury contacts came calling back.\par \par \uc2 I spent a week with Chanels team at a castle in the English countryside, educating them on all aspects of Web3, including MetaMask and NFT drops. Larren observes that as he moved from the most successful physical goods company, \uc2 LVMH\uc2 , to the most successful digital goods company, Yuga Labs, the thought process was the same.\par \par \uc2 Read also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/crypto-regulation-sec-chair-gary-gensler-final-say/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features Crypto \b  \highlight22regulation\b0 \highlight22 : Does SEC Chair Gary Gensler have the final say?}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/crypto-token-airdrops-build-communities-or-problems/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features Airdrops: Building communities or building problems?}}}\par \par \uc2 He describes metaverse real estate and PFPs, which include Yugas famous monkey pictures, as fitting into a broad category of consumer NFTs that are purchased by individuals in a way not dissimilar to luxury goods. Indeed, he notes that many of \uc2 LVMH\uc2  founder Bernard Arnaults children heirs of the worlds second-richest man are actively {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.highsnobiety.com/p/tag-heuer-tiffany-co-nft-lvmh-arnault/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dabbling}}}\uc2  in them.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/image6-1024x768.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Larren overlooking the Horizen Labs office floor in Milan. (Elias Ahonen)\par \par \uc2 People want to feel that they are part of an exclusive community with like-minded individuals, he explains, relating the concept sold in luxury boutiques and exclusive events the world over. In the case of Yugas NFTs, he argues that there is value for many people in being members of a group that shares similar cultural references, whether it being digital or at concerts, referring to events like ApeFest, the next of which will take place in Hong Kong in November.\par \par \uc2 Can an ape JPG really be a blue-chip NFT?\par \par \uc2 NFTs that gain mass appeal as recognizable status symbols are often labeled as blue chip among the NFT community, a nod to a term typically referring to reliable stocks and originally derived from poker, where blue chips are traditionally the most valuable.\par \par \uc2 Its a brand-building element as recognition of industry and buyers. Supply is far less than demand, and there is a strong fan and collector base. In traditional art, Picasso and Jean-Michel Basquiat are blue chips, he explains, noting that Bored Apes and CryptoPunks hold such a position within the PFP hierarchy.\par \par \uc2 The price is a result of the value that has been created. When you go to a Louis Vuitton store, the price is nowhere to be seen.\par \par \uc2 Holding a BAYC can make sense because you can stake it to earn tokens, and it can act as a financial instrument because you can borrow against it, he notes, naturally enough, considering his company designed the staking mechanism.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/image5-1024x461.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Larren poses in Milan with images of NFTs, including a Bored Ape and an Otherside land plot. (Elias Ahonen)\par \par \uc2 There are blue chips in other categories as well, such as metaverse land, he adds, cautioning that its value, like traditional real estate, will depend on the income generated with it.\par \par \uc2 This is because, in his opinion, people will not remain interested in vast spaces of empty metaverse land but rather in spaces that are built up and useful, like his art gallery. Traditional real estate involves buildings the same will be true of metaverse land.\par \par \uc2 Where might we look for the next crop of blue chips?\par \par \uc2 Im now passionate about building on top of Bitcoin with BRC-20s and Ordinals, Larren explains, hinting that something big is in the works. For him, the coming metaverse is a place and time when your digital life is more important than your physical life and where digital image matters more than physical image. In this new environment, he believes that the Bitcoin chain, with its newfound {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/bitcoin-miami-2023-shitcoins-for-bitcoin/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 capability to host NFTs}}}\uc2 , will hold a key position as a central pillar.\par \par \uc2 In Web3, you need to anticipate how consumer taste will evolve and what the market will want in the next six months.\par \par \uc2 Subscribe The most engaging reads in blockchain. Delivered once a week.\par \par \uc2 Email address\par \par \uc2 SUBSCRIBE\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/reading-copy.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Subscribe to Magazine by Cointelegraph Newsletter.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/magazine-Journeys-Herve-Larren-scaled.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230727ej7r0008h\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/26: BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, LTC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,664 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price appears to be gearing up for a volatile move.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke below the support of its narrow range on July 24, but the bears have not been able to capitalize on it and start a sharp downward move. This is a positive sign, as it shows a lack of aggressive selling at lower levels. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price back above $31,000 to trap the aggressive bears.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to pick up following the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s policy decision on July 26 and the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-28k-plunge-btc-price-new-volatility"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 subsequent commentary by Fed Chair Jerome Powell}}}\uc2 . Rather than the knee-jerk reaction to the event, it will be of interest to note where Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price settles down.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/94bcd502-a600-490a-8186-1113ffd7c432.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 When the price enters and remains inside a range for an extended period, the breakout from it usually ends up with a strong trending move. It is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty. Hence, it is best to wait for the price to escape the range before initiating large bets.\par \par \uc2 Traders need to be careful because sometimes the first breakout tends to be a fake move. What are the important levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and the altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have protected the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $29,134 for the past two days, but they have failed to start a strong rebound. This indicates that the bears are keeping up the pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/62a5179e-c234-4d46-8515-55da6670feea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/9u60DeOy/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.tradingview.com/x/9u60DeOy/}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $29,840 and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the 50-day SMA gives way, the BTC/USDT pair may tumble to $27,500 and then to $26,000.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the decline, they will have to quickly kick the price above the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the pair may rise to the overhead resistance zone between $31,000 and $32,400. This zone may act as a major barrier, but if bulls overcome it, the pair may resume its uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to guard the 50-day SMA ($1,853) in Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), but they are struggling to achieve a strong rebound off it. This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/4412006c-34a9-41c8-a6fb-64eaa0bb7ae9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/nqmyl32U/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USDT}}}\uc2  daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the 50-day SMA support cracks, the ETH/USDT pair may start a downward move to $1,700 and subsequently to $1,626. Such a move will indicate that the pair may remain stuck inside the large range between $1,626 and $2,000 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break above the 20-day EMA ($1,883). That may clear the path for a possible rally to $2,000. The bulls will have to overcome this obstacle to indicate the start of a new up move.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($0.67) on July 25, but the bulls could not build upon this strength. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/b0ec09b9-ef78-4ddf-8d9c-53b3c6a9277f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/SnwrgzgY/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP/USDT}}}\uc2  daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA and seize control. If they can pull it off, the XRP/USDT pair may plummet to the breakout level of $0.56. Such a deep fall may delay the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price bounces off the 20-day EMA and rises above $0.75, it will suggest that bulls are buying the dips. The pair could then swing between the 20-day EMA and $0.86 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is trading inside a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating uncertainty among the bulls and the bears about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/05e7f180-cd06-454b-9264-f6e0c39f1390.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/FWInTxTy/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB/USDT}}}\uc2  daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to buy the dips to the support line. If the price rises from this level and breaks above the moving averages, it will suggest that the BNB/USDT pair may continue its stay inside the triangle.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price dips below the triangle, it will suggest that the bears have overpowered the bulls. The pair could then drop to the critical support at $220. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it may start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) skidded below the 20-day EMA ($0.30) on July 24 and reached the strong support at $0.30. The bulls are defending this level but have failed to achieve a strong bounce off it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/62df5c5f-8ea4-4b0a-89a9-2cbf4a5a147b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/7CKtOpuQ/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 /USDT}}}\uc2  daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position further by yanking the price below the uptrend line. If they succeed in doing that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could start a deeper pullback to $0.27 and then to $0.26.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from $0.30 or the uptrend line, it will suggest that lower levels continue to attract buyers. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above $0.32. That could start a recovery to $0.34, where the bears may again pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($23.80) on July 24 and reached close to the horizontal support at $22.30 on July 25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/ebb4dc66-d8f9-42aa-a6a9-896eb7b72677.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/VwmbLUnD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL/USDT}}}\uc2  daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip and pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA on July 26. This suggests that the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair may oscillate between $22.30 and $27.12 for a few days. The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory also point to a possible consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to begin after the bulls thrust the price above $27.12 or the bears sink the pair below $22.30.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned up from $0.07 on July 23, indicating that the bulls have flipped the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/fde5d0d3-5db2-416b-8fbd-0ef9da04efa3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/pLBHXuFo/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE/USDT}}}\uc2  daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The up move picked up momentum on July 25 and reached the first target objective near $0.08. This level may attract sellers, but if the bulls do not give up much ground, the DOGE/USDT pair may soar to $0.10 and then to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the up move, they will have to quickly pull the price back below the breakout level of $0.07. Such a move will suggest that the recent breakout may have been a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/eos-foundation-to-sue-blockone-on-failure-to-honor-one-billion-commitment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EOS Foundation to sue Block.one on failure to honor $1B commitment}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) plunged and closed below the uptrend line on July 25. The bulls are attempting to arrest the pullback at the 50-day SMA ($0.69).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/4471478c-0024-4aa7-9dc6-b7e7971bd6d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/cdps8iQW/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC/USDT}}}\uc2  daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and closes above the 20-day EMA ($0.73), it will suggest solid buying at lower levels. The MATIC/USDT pair may then rise to $0.80. This level may again act as a stiff hurdle, but if bulls clear it, the pair could reach $0.90.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are selling on relief rallies. That will increase the possibility of a break below the 50-day SMA. The pair may then start a deeper correction toward $0.60.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($92) on July 24 and plunged below the 50-day SMA ($90). The bulls are trying to push the price back above the 50-day SMA, but the bears have held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/b57b65d2-4af6-4044-b17c-b06f82b220d8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/9nnJsk5D/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC/USDT}}}\uc2  daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that the bears are in charge. If the price turns down and breaks below $87, the LTC/USDT pair may resume its descent toward $81. This level may attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to signal a comeback. The pair may first rise to $96 and thereafter attempt a rally to the overhead resistance of $106.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between the 50-day SMA ($5.04) and the overhead resistance of $5.64 for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/33c03476-6068-49bd-9be8-a6069857dda2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/x/Feu2asae/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT/USDT}}}\uc2  daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 After failing to sustain above the resistance of the range on July 21, the DOT/USDT pair slipped back to the support on July 24. The bulls successfully held the 50-day SMA but are struggling to propel the price above the 20-day EMA ($5.25).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the likelihood of a break below the 50-day SMA increases. That could sink the pair to $4.74 and next to $4.65. Alternatively, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair may extend its consolidation for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/89519a5f-2d12-4a95-bd45-1d472270bbc8.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230726ej7q000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Robinhood\par \b \uc2 Crypto-friendly \uc2 Robinhood\uc2  inches closer to UK with local CEO appointment\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Helen Partz \par \uc2 412 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Robinhood\uc2  has appointed a former \uc2 Barclays\uc2  executive as the new CEO of its United Kingdom entity, according to data from the \uc2 Financial Conduct Authority\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency-friendly trading platform \uc2 Robinhood\uc2  is moving forward with plans to launch services in the United Kingdom with a new major local appointment.\par \par \uc2 Robinhood\uc2  has appointed former \uc2 Barclays\uc2  executive Jordan Sinclair as the new CEO of its United Kingdom entity, according to data from the \uc2 Financial Conduct Authority\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 FCA\uc2 , Sinclair was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://register.fca.org.uk/s/individual?id=0034G00003AOT9yQAH"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approved}}}\uc2  by the authority to perform the CEO role at \uc2 Robinhood\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s U.K. arm on July 18.\par \par \uc2 Prior to joining \uc2 Robinhood\uc2 , Sinclair was a managing director at the European fintech firm Freetrade for 13 months, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.linkedin.com/in/jordan-sinclair-36827142/?originalSubdomain=uk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to his \uc2 LinkedIn\uc2  profile. He also worked as a director of group strategy at the financial firm \uc2 Barclays\uc2  and a corporate banker at \uc2 Wells Fargo\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The latest hiring comes in line with \uc2 Robinhood\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s long-running plans to launch a platform in the United Kingdom. \uc2 Robinhood\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s U.K. expansion has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/robinhood-postpones-uk-launch-indefinitely-freezes-global-expansion-plans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rumored since at least early 2019}}}\uc2  but has been delayed multiple times. In April 2022, \uc2 Robinhood\uc2  renewed its expansion plans by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/robinhood-acquires-british-crypto-firm-ziglu-to-push-expansion-plans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 acquiring the British crypto firm Ziglu}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Local reports in mid-July {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.telegraph.co.uk/business/2023/07/17/controversial-share-trading-app-robinhood-plots-uk-launch/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suggested}}}\uc2  that \uc2 Robinhood\uc2  had started the process of hiring key executives for its U.K. business. The firm reportedly expects to launch its service in the U.K. by the end of 2023.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-applies-for-crypto-license-united-kingdom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple applies for crypto license in the United Kingdom}}}\par \par \uc2 Robinhood\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s entrance to the U.K. comes amid United States regulators continuing to scrutinize major cryptocurrency firms. The \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  is currently pursuing multiple cases related to crypto firms in the country, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-vs-sec-court-dates-confirmed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 including against companies like Coinbase}}}\uc2 , \uc2 Ripple\uc2 , Binance.US and others.\par \par \uc2 As a major crypto platform in the United States, \uc2 Robinhood\uc2  has also faced action by the SEC. In February, \uc2 Robinhood Markets{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/robinhood-subpoenaed-by-sec-over-crypto-listings-and-custody"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 received an investigative subpoena}}}\uc2  from the SEC over its \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  business\u8217\'20\'19 crypto listings, custody and platform operations. In June, \uc2 Robinhood\uc2  announced {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/robinhood-will-end-support-for-3-tokens-named-in-sec-lawsuits"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plans to cease support for}}}\uc2  coins like Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) and Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) after the SEC labeled them unregistered securities.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://mint.cointelegraph.com/?url=https://cointelegraph.com/news/robinhood-appoints-local-ceo-appointment&utm_source=cointelegraph_com&utm_medium=appendix&utm_campaign=articles"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Collect this article as an NFT}}}\uc2  to preserve this moment in history and show your support for independent journalism in the crypto space.\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/tokenizing-music-royalties-nfts-taylor-swift-3lau-nas-the-weeknd/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tokenizing music royalties as NFTs could help the next Taylor Swift}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/7d966230-7a1a-45ac-8236-1b2a337ce3a8.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230725ej7p0008h\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/24: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,801 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s break below the current range increases the risk of a deeper correction, which could pull the entire crypto market lower.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin plunged to $29,000 on July 24, signaling that bears are trying to seize control. It looks like the failure to hold on to the higher levels may have tempted short-term bulls to book profits and aggressive bears to initiate short positions.\par \par \uc2 Although the near term looks \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , long-term investors remain unfazed, and they continue to hold on to their positions. Glassnode data shows that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) long-term holder supply {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-mining-difficulty-drop-2023-5-things-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 made a new high}}}\uc2  of 14.52 million Bitcoin, \u8220\'20\'1Cequivalent to 75% of the circulating supply.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/c7075941-fb40-4fea-8516-6d8540092ee4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 While the cryptocurrency markets have turned soft in the near term, the United States equities markets remain on strong footing. The Dow Jones Industrial Average has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2023/07/23/stock-market-today-live-updates.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 risen}}}\uc2  for 10 straight days, its longest streak since 2017. However, things could change this week with a slew of key earnings reports and the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s policy decision on July 26. The latter could also impact the U.S. Dollar Index (DXY), which is on a recovery path.\par \par \uc2 Could lower levels attract buyers in Bitcoin and select altcoins? Will the strength in the U.S. equities markets limit the downside in the cryptocurrency markets? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) turned down from 4,578 on July 19, but a positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground. This suggests that the buyers are not dumping their positions as they anticipate the uptrend to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/5f147db1-3b02-4893-8fd7-234ae84ec980.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of 4,471 and the relative strength index (RSI) in the overbought territory suggest that bulls are in command. If the price turns up from 4,513 or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that lower levels continue to attract buyers.\par \par \uc2 That will enhance the prospects of a break above 4,578. The index could then rally to 4,650 and eventually to 4,800.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated if the price dives below the 20-day EMA. That could open the doors for a fall to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of 4,336.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index turned up sharply on July 18 and rose back above the breakdown level of 100.82 on July 20. This suggests that the breakdown below 100.82 may have been a bear trap.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/b801bb91-991a-4bbb-b1ca-7f14ae0a3a36.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the 20-day EMA, which is an important level to watch out for. If the price turns down sharply from it and plunges below 99.57, the downtrend may resume. The index may then crash to 97.50.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are back in the game. The index may then climb to the 50-day SMA (102.66) and subsequently to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls again pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($29,957) on July 23, but the long wick on the candlestick shows strong selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/3b8a93fb-afb9-49b7-8ad7-92c8cd402c54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling intensified on July 24, and the price plunged below the strong support at $29,500 that had held for the past several days. The BTC/USDT pair has descended to the 50-day SMA ($29,021), which is a crucial level to keep an eye on.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the break may have been a bear trap. The pair may then rally to $31,000.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price continues lower and plunges below the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that the bulls have given up. The pair may then slump to $27,500 and later to $26,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($1,852) on July 23, and the bulls tried to propel the price above the 20-day EMA ($1,888), but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/f36b9584-d27d-4d1d-afea-27155e956070.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could start a deeper correction toward $1,700. Such a fall will indicate that the pair may remain stuck inside the $1,626 to $2,000 range for a while longer. The price action inside the range is likely to be random and volatile.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest solid buying at lower levels. That may open the gates for a possible rally to $2,000. The next trending move is likely to begin on a break above $2,000 or below $1,626.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 After failing to sustain above $0.83 on July 19 and 20, XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has turned down toward the 20-day EMA ($0.67).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/198357cb-3d09-4c52-bdd9-861dbd9c5f45.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to keep the uptrend intact, they will have to protect the 20-day EMA with vigor. If the price rebounds off this level with strength, the XRP/USDT pair may form a range in the near term.\par \par \uc2 The boundaries of the range could be $0.66 on the downside and $0.86 on the upside. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the overhead resistance of $0.86.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are rushing to the exit. That could attract further selling, and the pair may collapse to the breakout level of $0.56.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to propel BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($243) in the past few days. That attracted heavy selling by the bears, who are trying to sink the price below the support of the symmetrical triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/cbeb80e9-6531-4b03-9a6b-9cb5f8e43209.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will suggest that the uncertainty between the bulls and the bears has resolved in favor of the sellers.\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair could then drop to the critical support at $220. This level is likely to attract aggressive buying by the bulls. If the price rebounds off $220 with strength, it will suggest that the pair may remain range bound for a while.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price bounces off the support line of the triangle. In that case, the pair may extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days. Buyers will have to shove the price above the triangle to signal a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the 20-day EMA ($0.31).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/8d63fef2-caba-43bc-a957-3dc9d010a8e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the buyers or the sellers. This uncertainty will tilt in favor of the bears if the price slumps below $0.30. That could sink the price to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers drive the price above $0.33, it will suggest that bulls are back in the game. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rise to the July 14 intraday high of $0.38. The bears are likely to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whale-exchange-inflow-1-year-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin whale exchange inflow share hits 1-year high \u8212\'20\'14 over 40%}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) back below the breakout level of $0.07 on July 22, but the bulls held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/e2690ac3-c6ab-4c85-92af-d072d6f67877.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.07) has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside. There is a minor resistance at $0.08, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 If buyers do not allow the price to skid below the 20-day EMA, the likelihood of a rally to $0.10 increases. This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price declines and sustains below $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) continues to witness profit booking by short-term traders. That pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($23.73) on July 24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/fec89ee5-badf-40a0-8cd8-33358267e160.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to arrest the downward move at $22.30. If the price rebounds off this support, the bulls will again try to clear the overhead hurdle at $27.12. If they can pull it off, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair may retest the July 14 high of $32.13.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price dives below $22.30, it will suggest that the break above $27.12 may have been a bull trap. The pair could then tumble to the 50-day SMA ($19.80). Such a move will suggest that the pair may continue to swing inside the large range between $14 and $27.12 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($0.74) for the past few days. This shows that the bulls are protecting the level, but they have failed to start a recovery. This indicates that the bears are maintaining their pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/4e3a7e2a-fbe8-46c1-b804-261f5866ad03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI has descended below 50, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This equilibrium could tilt in favor of the bears if the price plummets below the 50-day SMA. The MATIC/USDT pair could then slide to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $0.80, it will signal solid buying at lower levels. The pair may then retest the local high at $0.89. A break above this level could indicate the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/b6aaf979-b03a-49cf-b731-a5a91040aa66.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230724ej7o000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Hodler's Digest\par \b \uc2 SEC reviews \uc2 Ripple\uc2  ruling, US bill seeks control over DeFi, and more: Hodler\u8217\'20\'19s Digest, July 16-22\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Editorial Staff \par \uc2 1,641 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The SEC examines the ruling in the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  case, a \uc2 U.S. Senate\uc2  bill seeks to regulate DeFi, and the poor performance of altcoins in the second quarter of 2023.\par \par \uc2 Top Stories This Week\par \par \uc2 Chair Gensler says SEC reaction to \uc2 Ripple\uc2  decision is mixed, still under consideration\par \par \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  Chair \uc2 Gary Gensler{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-chair-gary-gensler-reaction-to-ripple-decision-is-mixed-still-under-consideration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has commented publicly about the recent ruling}}}\uc2  on the agencys suit against \uc2 Ripple\uc2 , saying the SEC is still looking at it and assessing that opinion. Gensler declined to comment further on the case, but said the commission is pleased with the court\u8217\'20\'19s decision stating that XRP was a security when sold to institutional investors, but disappointed with the non-security ruling for retail investors and other XRP distributions. Comments made by the regulator on July 21 in a lawsuit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-hints-at-potential-appeal-to-xrp-ruling-from-ripple-labs-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hinted that it might appeal the decision}}}\uc2 . In the crypto community, however, some {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-appeal-ripple-xrp-case-unlikely-current-confusion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 believe it is unlikely to happen}}}\uc2  as the SEC benefits from the current confusion.\par \par \uc2 Bipartisan bill to regulate DeFi, crypto security risks introduced into \uc2 US Senate\par \par \uc2 A bipartisan bill {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bipartisan-bill-regulate-defi-crypto-security-risks-introduced-us-senate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 was introduced into the U.S. Senate, tightening regulations}}}\uc2  and sanctions requirements for decentralized finance (DeFi). The bill would subject DeFi operations to the same requirements as other financial companies, including centralized crypto trading platforms, casinos, and even pawn shops. The proposal also makes anyone who controls that project liable for the use of the DeFi service by sanctioned persons. The bill also set new requirements for operators of crypto kiosks (or ATMs) to prevent their use in money laundering. Kiosk operators would be required to verify the identities of both counterparties in a transaction.\par \par \uc2 Altcoins bled as Bitcoin gained dominance in Q2: CoinGecko\par \par \uc2 The second quarter of the year {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dominance-in-q2-2023-bled-altcoins-coingecko"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has been a solid one for Bitcoins performance}}}\uc2  as its market dominance gained against altcoins, which bled throughout the period, according to CoinGecko\u8217\'20\'19s industry report. Bitcoin (BTC) and Ether (ETH) continued to build their market share over the past months, while Binance Coin (BNB), XRP (XRP), and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) suffered double-digit losses over the quarter. DeFi tokens were hit particularly hard during the quarter, with Uniswap (UNI), Chainlink (LINK) and Lido (LDO) taking double-digit losses as well. The top five metaverse and play-to-earn tokens by market cap also marked losses up to 40%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://servedbyadbutler.com/go2/;ID=169476;size=728x90;setID=601214;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fcointelegraph.com%2Fmagazine%2Fwp-json%2Fwp%2Fv2%2Fposts%3F_embed%26per_page%3D100"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://servedbyadbutler.com/go2/;ID=169476;size=300x250;setID=601213;referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fcointelegraph.com%2Fmagazine%2Fwp-json%2Fwp%2Fv2%2Fposts%3F_embed%26per_page%3D100"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Multiple spot crypto ETF applications go to Federal Register in step toward SEC approval\par \par \uc2 Applications from several firms for a spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund (ETF) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-crypto-etf-applications-federal-register-sec-approval"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have been published in the Federal Register}}}\uc2 , moving them one step along in the \uc2 U.S. SEC\uc2  process. According to the records, applications from \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 , \uc2 Fidelity\uc2 , Invesco Galaxy, \uc2 VanEck\uc2  and \uc2 WisdomTree\uc2  were officially registered. Publishing the applications gives the SEC a window of opportunity to accept or reject the request, extend the time allowed or open the application for public comment. The SEC has an initial window of 45 days to reach a decision, but the commission has the option of extending the process for up to 240 days until March 2024 for final approval or denial.\par \par \uc2 Robert F. Kennedy Jr. vows to back US dollar with Bitcoin if elected president\par \par \uc2 Democratic presidential candidate Robert F. Kennedy Jr. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/rfk-jr-will-back-us-dollar-with-bitcoin-if-president"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has promised to progressively back the United States dollar with Bitcoin}}}\uc2  if he is elected president. Kennedy said during an event that backing the U.S. dollar with what he called hard currency, including gold, silver, platinum or Bitcoin, could help to re-stabilize the American economy. Kennedy explained the process would be gradual and that, depending on the plans success, hed adjust the amount of backing for the dollar. Additionally, Kennedy declared he would make Bitcoin-to-U.S. dollar conversions exempt from capital gains taxes in an attempt to spur investments in the country.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Mark-Yusko-1024x682.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Winners and Losers\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/WL-july-22-01-1024x826.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 At the end of the week, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is at $29,883, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) at $1,894 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  at $0.78. The total market cap is at $1.2 trillion, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 Among the biggest 100 cryptocurrencies, the top three altcoin gainers of the week are Maker (MKR) at 32.18%, XDC Network (XDC) at 24.19% and Stellar (XLM) at 20.88%.\par \par \uc2 The top three altcoin losers of the week are Rocket Pool (RPL) at -14.95%, GMX (GMX) at -10.93% and Lido DAO (LDO) at -7.90%.\par \par \uc2 For more info on crypto prices, make sure to read {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraphs market analysis}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Read also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/blockchain-projects-making-renewable-energy-reality/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features The blockchain projects making renewable energy a reality}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/toxic-twitter-tribalism-crypto-toxygen/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Features Toxic Twitter Tribalism: The Fuel Powering the Crypto Rocket?}}}\par \par \uc2 Most Memorable Quotations\par \par \uc2 For me, the lack of protection for retail investors underscores the fierce urgency around passing a market structure bill to protect the average American consumer.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-law-exposes-retail-investors-rep-torres"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ritchie Torres}}}\uc2 , New York Representative\par \par \uc2 Japan, Korea, China, all these places are pushing Web3 in a really big way because they see that as an opportunity to break away from basically U.S.-dominant technologies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-web3-animoca-hong-kong-would-not-go-crypto-without-approval-of-china-says-animoca-exec"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Yat Siu}}}\uc2 , co-founder of \uc2 Animoca Brands\par \par \uc2 Backing dollars and U.S. debt obligations with hard assets [gold, silver, platinum or Bitcoin] could help restore strength back to the dollar.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/rfk-jr-will-back-us-dollar-with-bitcoin-if-president"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Robert F. Kennedy Jr.}}}\uc2 , U.S. Democratic presidential candidate\par \par \uc2 Based on Metcalfes law model, fair value for Bitcoin is around $55K. So I think we drift upwards toward that level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-btc-rally-will-lead-speculative-blow-off-top-in-2024-mark-yusko-predicts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mark Yusko}}}\uc2 , chief investment officer at Morgan Creek Capital\par \par \uc2 [The \uc2 Ripple\uc2  ruling] has made our argument more compelling and more urgent, meaning that we cant just rely on enforcement to get the kind of investor protection standards we need.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-court-ruling-regulation-more-compelling-more-urgent-former-cftc-chair"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Timothy Massad}}}\uc2 , former chair of the U.S. Commodity Futures Trading Commission\par \par \uc2 The Commission benefits from the current confusion and losing these issues on appeal would jeopardize its entire enforcement agenda. So Id be surprised if the SEC tried to appeal now.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-appeal-ripple-xrp-case-unlikely-current-confusion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kathryn Haun}}}\uc2 , CEO of Haun Ventures\par \par \uc2 Prediction of the Week\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Bollinger Bands echo move that ended in 40% January gains\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-bollinger-bands-echo-january-gains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin is lining up a burst of \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  that could rival its 40% January gains, on-chain data suggests.\par \par \uc2 BTC price has acted in a tight range for an entire month, using $30,000 as a focal point for sideways behavior, putting both bulls and bears to the test. According to popular analyst Aksel Kibar:\par \par \uc2 Seems like $BTCUSD is exhausting many traders patience, he wrote on July 21, before adding that this is usually the condition you see before strong moves. Not sure about the direction though. I will stick with my well-defined boundaries. I know that increased \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is around the corner. Capture the directional move.\par \par \uc2 According to Bollinger Bands behavior, a classic \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  indicator, this move should come sooner rather than later as it\u8217\'20\'19s printing a telltale sign that the days of rangebound BTC price action are at an end.\par \par \uc2 FUD of the Week\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Timothy-Massad-1024x682.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/california-files-order-against-nexo-interest-account-says-it-s-8th-state-to-take-action"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/california-files-order-against-nexo-interest-account-says-it-s-8th-state-to-take-action}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto memes can be considered financial promotions, says UK watchdog\par \par \uc2 Crypto firms and influencers may need {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-memes-financial-promotion-uk-fca-regulation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to start including disclaimers on crypto memes}}}\uc2  to stay compliant with advertising laws in the United Kingdom. The countrys \uc2 Financial Conduct Authority (FCA) \uc2 released, on July 17, a proposed guidance on social media financial promotions that targets promotional memes and financial influencers or finfluencers. The \uc2 FCA\uc2  considers crypto a high-risk investment. Per the FCAs proposal, crypto can be advertised to retail investors at large, but there are requirements such as including risk warnings and a ban on investment incentives.\par \par \uc2 Hackers compromise Uniswap founders \uc2 Twitter\uc2  account to promote scam\par \par \uc2 Uniswap founder Hayden Adams Twitter account {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/hackers-compromise-uniswap-founder-twitter-account-promote-scam"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 was compromised on July 20}}}\uc2 . His account released a tweet to its more than 254,000 followers falsely claiming that the platforms Permit2 contract had been affected by an unknown exploit and users tokens were at risk, encouraging them to click on a malicious link. The Web3 Security Alerts channel on Telegram detected the scam attempt and reported that Adams had also been blocked from his accounts with MetaMask and Coinbase Wallet.\par \par \uc2 Couple behind \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  money laundering scheme reach plea deal with US prosecutors\par \par \uc2 Two people {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/couple-bitfinex-money-laundering-scheme-reach-plea-deal-prosecutors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accused of having laundered billions of dollars worth of Bitcoin}}}\uc2  connected to the 2016 \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  hack have reached a plea agreement with authorities in the United States. The pair had been charged with money laundering conspiracy and conspiracy to defraud the U.S., and they are expected to forfeit digital assets connected to the case. Crypto exchange \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  was hacked in August 2016, with roughly 119,754 Bitcoin stolen.\par \par \uc2 Best Cointelegraph Features\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Yat-Siu-1024x682.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/09/26/5-years-reddits-top-10-cryptos-joe-greene"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/09/26/5-years-reddits-top-10-cryptos-joe-greene}}}\par \par \uc2 Wolf Of All Streets worries about a world where Bitcoin hits $1M: Hall of Flame {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/ai-human-digital-souls-agi-alignment-problem-replika/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/ai-human-digital-souls-agi-alignment-problem-replika/}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wolf-of-all-streets-world-bitcoin-hits-1m-1-million-hall-of-flame/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Former globe-trotting DJ Scott Melker}}}\uc2  The Wolf Of All Streets worries about the circumstances leading to Bitcoin topping $1 million.\par \par \uc2 Tokenizing music royalties as NFTs could help the next Taylor Swift\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/tokenizing-music-royalties-nfts-taylor-swift-3lau-nas-the-weeknd/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Negative experiences in the music biz}}}\uc2  have seen artists like 3lau, Nas and The Weeknd turn to tokenized royalties for a fair deal.\par \par \uc2 Web3 Gamer: Earn Bitcoin in Minecraft, BGAs 50/50 gender split, Oath of Peak hot take {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/ai-eye-is-ai-a-threat-why-ai-advance/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/ai-eye-is-ai-a-threat-why-ai-advance/}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/web3-gamer-earn-bitcoin-minecraft-sega-blockchain-plans/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How to earn Bitcoin in Minecraft}}}\uc2 , Sega is half in/half out of blockchain games, BGA board\u8217\'20\'19s 50/50 gender split, and more Web3 gaming news.\par \par \uc2 Subscribe The most engaging reads in blockchain. Delivered once a week.\par \par \uc2 Email address\par \par \uc2 SUBSCRIBE\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/reading-copy.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Subscribe to Magazine by Cointelegraph Newsletter.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/july-22-scaled.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230722ej7m000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/21: BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, LTC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,706 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Several indicators suggest Bitcoin and altcoins could start a trending move within the next few days.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin continues to test investors\u8217\'20\'19 patience, as it remains stuck inside a tight range. Although the near term is boring, traders need to be on their toes because narrow ranges are generally followed by a sharp increase in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The only problem is that it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty.\par \par \uc2 Glassnode\u8217\'20\'19s latest weekly newsletter highlighted that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) consolidation has shrunk the Bollinger Bands, which are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-bollinger-bands-echo-january-gains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 separated by just 4.2%}}}\uc2 . Citing various on-chain indicators, the authors concluded that investors are unwilling to sell, and in several aspects, it looks similar to \u8220\'20\'1Cperiods like 2016 and 2019-20, characterized by choppy market conditions.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/1de9727e-a368-4a4e-89bc-7f7f44601fcd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s near term may look uncertain, the long term remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Capriole Investments founder Charles Edwards {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-bitcoin-etf-interview-charles-edwards"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said in an interview with Cointelegraph}}}\uc2  that access to \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s exchange-traded fund application could make it \u8220\'20\'1Ceasier for institutions to put Bitcoin on their balance sheet.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin plunge below the support of the range and start a new downward move, dragging several altcoins lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been sustaining below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $30,067 since July 17, which is a negative sign. It shows a lack of aggressive buying at current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/5b8072ea-8ba2-4a8c-ba59-a8efa5b050c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA on July 20, but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels. The bears will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below the crucial support at $29,500.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will indicate that the consolidation has resolved in favor of the bears. The BTC/USDT pair may then skid to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $28,869 and thereafter to $27,500.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up sharply and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may rise to $31,000. A new uptrend could be expected on a break and close above $32,400.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($1,896) for the past few days. This suggests a state of equilibrium between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/f79c62e5-e70e-4b82-a49e-353d4b1b01be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch on the downside is the 50-day SMA ($1,854). If this support breaks down, the ETH/USDT pair may tumble to $1,800 and then to $1,700. Such a move will suggest that the pair may continue to oscillate inside the large range between $1,626 and $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level or the 50-day SMA and rises above $2,000, it will signal that bulls are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair may then soar to $2,141 and eventually to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls propelled XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $0.83 on July 19 and 20, but they could not build upon this strength.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/7349472c-b0b3-4ade-8f85-5473bde4ff04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 That may have tempted short-term bulls to book profits and the aggressive bears to initiate short positions. The bears will try to pull the price toward the support at the 20-day EMA ($0.65).\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, the XRP/USDT pair may continue its range-bound action between $0.65 and $0.85 for some time.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $0.85 could open the doors for a possible retest of $0.94, while a drop below $0.65 could sink the pair to $0.56.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the symmetrical triangle pattern, suggesting indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/378dad4c-2456-4eee-86a5-fc1ef77b35f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The symmetrical triangle typically acts as a continuation pattern, but in some instances, it could also behave as a reversal pattern. The flattish 20-day EMA ($243) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above the triangle, the BNB/USDT pair may rise to the overhead resistance at $265. This is an important resistance to keep an eye on because a break above it will clear the path for a potential rally to $280 and then to $300.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the triangle to seize control. The selling could intensify further if the $220 support gives way.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounce off the 20-day EMA ($0.31) on July 19 fizzled out at $0.33 on July 20. This suggests that bears are selling on relief rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/6536467c-f1fa-4590-b01a-341784f878da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has again returned to the 20-day EMA, which remains the key level to watch out for in the near term. If the price turns up sharply and breaks above $0.34, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may advance to $0.38.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price continues lower and breaks below the moving averages, it will signal that bears are back in the game. The pair could then descend to the uptrend line. This level may attract solid buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to propel Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $27.12 on July 19 and 20, but the bears did not budge. This shows that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/d78042f9-adba-4e16-be13-e2e0b57856a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure to rise above $27.12 may tug the price to the 20-day EMA ($23.55). This level is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. If the price sinks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the short-term momentum has weakened. That could open the doors for a deeper correction to the 50-day SMA ($19.63).\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the decline, they will have to quickly push and sustain the price above $27.12. If they do that, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $29.12 and subsequently to $32.13.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the 20-day EMA ($0.07) in the past few days, indicating that Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is attracting buyers at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/1adcba45-7488-4c6e-8784-6c057480b641.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI above 63 suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers sustain the price above $0.07, it will signal the start of a new up move. The DOGE/USDT pair may jump to $0.08 and later to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to invalidate this positive view, they will have to quickly yank the price below the moving averages. Such a move will suggest that the rally above $0.07 may have been a bull trap. The pair may then slump to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-searches-for-a-fresh-bullish-catalyst-to-trigger-a-move-above-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP price searches for a fresh \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  catalyst to trigger a move above $1}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 20-day EMA ($0.74) on July 20, indicating that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/c7e6a99b-66ed-4c4f-b419-8a7502d4acf2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is moving up and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. If buyers clear the overhead hurdle at $0.80, the MATIC/USDT pair could climb to $0.90. This level may again act as a minor obstacle, but if bulls overcome it, the pair may rise to $1.04.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and plummets below the 50-day SMA ($0.71), it will signal that bears are back in the game. The pair could then slide to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between the moving averages for the past few days, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/1f915d6a-b5d3-42ee-a18f-a26b52bff260.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($94) on July 19 and 20, but the bears held their ground. This shows that the bears are trying to flip the 20-day EMA into resistance. The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the RSI has slipped into negative territory, giving a slight edge to the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and closes below the 50-day SMA ($90), the selling could pick up and the LTC/USDT pair may slump to $80. Alternatively, a break and close above the 20-day EMA could open the doors for a relief rally to $106.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the strong support at $5.15 on July 19 and reached the overhead resistance at $5.64 on July 21, indicating that lower levels continue to attract buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/6fa661a2-00ab-4f7a-a735-149e57096869.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the July 21 candlestick shows that the bears are aggressively selling the rallies to $5.64. This suggests that the DOT/USDT pair could remain stuck between $5.15 and $5.64 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that the RSI has stayed in positive territory and the 20-day EMA ($5.25) is moving up gradually. Buyers need to overcome the barrier at $5.64 to start the next leg of the uptrend toward $7.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/8ea4c57f-1005-4ce8-831b-82f905a2ee01.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230721ej7l000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/19: BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC, LTC, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,675 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are at risk of a further decline if their immediate support levels fail to hold.\par \par \uc2 After failing to sustain above the resistance of its narrow range, Bitcoin fell near a key support level on July 18. The consolidation of the past few days {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-falls-to-29-5k-but-on-chain-data-reflects-investors-growing-interest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seems to be an accumulation phase}}}\uc2 , according to Glassnode\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin Accumulation Trend Score. A similar score was seen during the accumulation phases between November and December and again from March to April.\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data, institutional investors continue to plow funds into \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products, which rose to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-crypto-investment-funds-fourth-straight-week-inflows-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $742 million in the past four weeks}}}\uc2 . Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) continues to attract the lion\u8217\'20\'19s share of the funds, with last week alone accounting for $140 million in inflows.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/4793bb74-55e4-42c7-93c0-4354b32e09a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Morgan Creek Capital chief investment officer and founder Mark Yusko said in an interview with Cointelegraph that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-btc-rally-will-lead-speculative-blow-off-top-in-2024-mark-yusko-predicts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s fair value is $55,000}}}\uc2  and the markets are likely to \u8220\'20\'1Cdrift upwards toward that level.\u8221\'20\'1D Once this level is crossed, Yusko expects speculators to step in, resulting in a blow-off top sometime in 2024.\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels that need to hold in Bitcoin and altcoins to prevent a deeper decline? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin slid below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of $30,124 on July 17 and tested the crucial support of $29,500 on July 18. The long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that lower levels continue to attract buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/678bed97-9f00-410b-b161-e99a81130dae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flat and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If buyers force the price above the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to $31,000 and then to $31,805. Sellers are expected to protect this zone with vigor.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move could begin on a break above $32,400 or a drop below $29,500. If the range breaks below $29,500, the pair may plunge to $27,500 and later to $26,000. On the contrary, if bulls push the price above $32,400, the pair may start a rally toward $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) July 17 and 18 candlestick shows that the bulls are buying the dips to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of $1,853.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/c91c1218-26c4-43c0-ad0c-d9900f88b78b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the ETH/USDT pair could remain stuck between the 50-day SMA and $2,000 for a while longer. A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that the 20-day EMA ($1,898) is sloping up gradually and the RSI is in the positive territory. If buyers catapult the price above $2,000, the pair may start the next leg of the up move to $2,141.\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to yank the price below the 50-day SMA. If they do that, the pair may collapse to $1,700 and eventually to $1,626.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 Generally, a vertical rally is followed by a sharp pullback and a period of consolidation. XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) could be entering one such phase.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/1ce6e7f7-480d-4961-8ff9-022af603a031.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to drive the price above $0.83 and retest the July 13 intraday high of $0.94, but they are likely to encounter stiff resistance from the bears. If the price turns down from $0.83, the XRP/USDT pair could tumble to $0.66.\par \par \uc2 This level may again attract strong buying by the bulls. That could keep the price range-bound between $0.66 and $0.83 for a few days. Contrarily, if bulls propel the price above $0.94, the pair could start a rally to $1.40.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to push and sustain BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($244) in the past two days. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the 20-day EMA into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/869bf9b0-d011-4ff8-b528-ac4df7157af7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position further by pulling the price to the support line of the symmetrical triangle. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it could challenge the vital support at $220.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls shove the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest solid buying at lower levels. The bulls will then make one more attempt to thrust the price above the triangle. If they can pull it off, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to $265.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the breakout level of $0.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/c5cddde3-e1a6-4fb3-88fc-dfb14ad2beae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.30) is sloping up gradually and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that bulls have a slight edge. Buyers will have to kick the price above $0.34 to suggest that the correction may be over. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then ascend to $0.38, where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could be negated if the price turns down and plunges below $0.30. That will clear the path for a possible decline to the uptrend line and then to $0.26.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the candlesticks between July 14 to 17 shows that bears continue to sell on rallies. The price turned down and slipped below the breakout level of $27.12 on July 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/3b0c35dd-dd67-4dbd-b5fb-8502977b5171.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could correct to the 20-day EMA ($23.15), which is an important level to keep an eye on. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to propel the pair above $27.12. If they succeed, the pair may advance to $29.12 and subsequently to $32.13.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are rushing to the exit. The pair could then plummet to the 50-day SMA ($19.44).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $0.07 on July 17 and again on July 19, but the long wick on the candlestick shows strong selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/540ff0a0-f993-475f-8b42-4a124959d300.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls have managed to keep the DOGE/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA ($0.07), but they are struggling to overcome the overhead obstacle. If buyers fail to maintain the price above $0.07, the likelihood of a drop below the 50-day SMA ($0.07) increases.\par \par \uc2 That could keep the pair range-bound between $0.06 and $0.07 for a few more days. If bulls want to start a new up move, they will have to hold the price above $0.07. The pair may then climb to $0.08 and later to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-vs-ripple-huge-win-for-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC vs. Ripple: Huge win for crypto}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.73) on July 17, but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that every relief rally is being sold into.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/5d3f9607-cf04-4cb0-927e-920e6bf4628c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are an important support to keep an eye on. If bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($0.71), the advantage will tilt in favor of the sellers. The MATIC/USDT pair may then slump to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 The first resistance to watch on the upside is $0.80. If bulls drive the price above this level, the pair could retest the $0.89 level. A break and close above this resistance could signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $106 on July 13, indicating that the bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/f3a17758-71bd-4463-a1ef-d8df2dabefef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to arrest the pullback at the 20-day EMA ($94) suggests that the positive momentum has weakened. There is minor support at the 50-day SMA ($90), but if this level gives way, the LTC/USDT pair could dump to $80.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the decline, they will have to push and maintain the price above the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the pair may again retest the overhead resistance zone between $106 and $115.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been swinging between the overhead resistance of $5.64 and the 50-day SMA ($5.03) for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/fd6186b0-614b-427f-8e46-475df4fe7fb0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($5.21) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. If the price sinks below the 50-day SMA, the advantage will tilt in favor of the sellers. The DOT/USDT pair could then slide to $4.74. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the pair may slump to $4.22.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to clear the zone between $5.64 and the downtrend line to gain the upper hand. The pair could then skyrocket to $7.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/44936bb0-a2f9-46bf-8dd3-d6e6e7d6cfee.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230719ej7j000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/17: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, XRP, BNB, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,676 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 July 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin may dip in the near term, and that may stall the recovery in several major altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin remains stuck inside a narrow range, making it difficult to predict the direction of the next possible breakout. The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY), which generally moves in inverse correlation to Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), dropped below 100, but that has failed to propel Bitcoin higher. This suggests that Bitcoin is charting its own course in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, the earnings season from big companies this week may sway equities markets in the United States but may not have the same effect on Bitcoin. It is becoming increasingly difficult to pinpoint the event or the news flow that will cause Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price to escape the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/90ec9d84-eb42-4ace-85c2-34ec956024eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s next directional move has not deterred the whales. CryptoQuant\u8217\'20\'19s contributing analyst SignalQuant highlighted that one on-chain indicator, the unspent transaction outputs, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-traders-30k-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has been rising in 2023}}}\uc2 , similar to the increase seen in 2019. If the indicator continues to rise, it will suggest that Bitcoin has room to run and the low made in late 2022 was a long-term bottom.\par \par \uc2 Could the DXY stage a recovery? Will that limit the upside in Bitcoin and the major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) is in a strong uptrend. The price has reached resistance at 4,513, which may act as a minor hurdle. But if bulls do not give up much ground from the current levels, it will suggest that traders expect the rally to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/b8f9e12d-00c1-432c-b079-02677f753f86.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The developing negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) has been negated, indicating that the bulls remain in command. If buyers thrust and sustain the price above 4,513, the index could resume its uptrend and reach 4,650. This level may again act as a strong barrier.\par \par \uc2 On the way down, the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) of 4,420 is the important support level to watch out for. If this support gives way, it will signal that the bulls may be booking profits. That may sink the price to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) of 4,293.\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index broke below the moving averages on July 7 and continued its downward spiral. The bears yanked the price below the vital support at 100.82 on July 12, completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/c808ccad-b5be-420f-bf6c-7e404f3e9ed9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sharp fall of the past few days has sent the RSI into the oversold territory, indicating that a minor recovery is possible. If the price turns up from the current level, the index could retest the breakdown level of 100.82.\par \par \uc2 This remains the key level to watch for. If the price turns down from this level, it will suggest that the bears have flipped the previous support into resistance. That could start a downtrend, which could reach 97 and then collapse toward the pattern target of 93.64.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the decline, they will have to quickly push and maintain the price above 100.82.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls have defended the 20-day EMA ($30,173) for the past three days, but a negative sign is that they have failed to start a strong bounce off it. This suggests a lack of aggressive demand at current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/b0484bfe-01e1-4b28-a794-8978ab204532.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to flatten out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. That could keep the pair inside the tight range of $29,500 and $31,500 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to shove the price above $32,400 to signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The BTC/USDT pair could then surge toward $40,000. Instead, if the price tumbles below $29,500, the pair may skid to the 50-day SMA ($28,671).\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is trying to maintain above the 20-day EMA ($1,897), suggesting that the lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/202e98e8-61bc-4a4b-8a4c-cafa5e65cdb4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price to the psychological resistance of $2,000. This remains the key level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it will clear the path for a possible rally to the $2,141 to $2,200 zone.\par \par \uc2 The crucial support to watch on the downside is the 50-day SMA ($1,853). If this level cracks, it will suggest that the ETH/USDT pair may remain inside the large range between $1,626 and $2,000 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is finding support in the zone between the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.69 and the 61.8% retracement level of $0.64.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/5e848939-38d3-4db1-a5b4-599a46c205d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to resume the up move, but they may face formidable resistance at $0.83 and again at $0.93. If the price turns down from this zone, the XRP/USDT pair may remain stuck inside a range for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $0.64. If that happens, it will signal an urgency among the bulls to exit their positions. That could sink the pair to the 20-day EMA ($0.58).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 50-day SMA ($253) and reentered the symmetrical triangle pattern on July 14. This shows that the bears are fiercely defending the overhead resistance at $265.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/52c37b48-5168-4cbe-b70e-4179685fbb37.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($244) has flattened out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. The BNB/USDT pair could oscillate inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to propel and maintain the price above the triangle to gain the upper hand. The momentum could pick up after the bulls kick the price above the overhead resistance at $265. Alternatively, a break below the triangle will signal that the bears are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair could resume its downtrend below $220.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on July 15 and 16, which suggests short-term uncertainty about the next directional move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/8a20da7a-34a0-4260-9b48-42d5b43c3329.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Generally, the tightening of the range is followed by a sharp breakout. If buyers thrust the price above $29.12, the SOL/USDT pair could jump to $32.13. A rally above this level could open the doors for a further rise to $38.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and plunges below $26, it will suggest that the advantage has tilted in favor of the bears. The pair could first slide to $24 and thereafter to the 20-day EMA ($22.53).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-full-breakout-not-btc-price-month-30k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin 'full breakout' not here yet as BTC price spends month at $30K}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) pullback has reached near the breakout level of $0.30. Usually, such a deep correction delays the start of the next leg of the up move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/2d0afdac-5cf8-4a69-a876-dc55b0272b73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the moving averages are about to complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have a slight edge. If the price turns up from the current level, buyers will again try to drive the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to the overhead resistance at $0.38.\par \par \uc2 It is unlikely to be an easy path higher for the bulls. The bears will try to stall the recovery at $0.34 and again at $0.36. On the downside, a break and close below $0.30 could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the overhead resistance at $0.07.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/6ae2d331-eb72-4226-9422-7c2f4d28e2f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.07) has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive territory. This suggests that the bulls have a slight edge. The bulls will try to propel the price to $0.08, where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. That could keep the DOGE/USDT pair stuck inside the $0.06 to $0.07 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Usually, the price turns down and retests the breakout from a pattern, and Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) is doing just that. The price could drop to $0.72.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/8a05e50a-9285-42e3-a863-1494e0202087.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.72 with strength, it will suggest buying at lower levels. The bulls will then try to push the price above the overhead resistance of $0.90. If they do that, the MATIC/USDT pair could start the next leg of the up move. The first stop could be the psychological resistance of $1 and subsequently $1.20.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the price continues lower and plummets below the uptrend line. The pair could then slump to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-07/fd8e40d1-0a0f-4e0d-afbc-bd2ffdbd39eb.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020230717ej7h000b5\par }\par \b \uc2 Search Summary\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (ADA) AND ("market 